20:13:18.707 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":18,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet unpleasant day &amp; a gale from the east, with a heavy sea on the bar, snow at heights. Dined with the associated clubs at the George Tavern. A very handsome dinner &amp; nearly two hundred sat down. Looked into the theatre in the evening</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":15,"lock":null}
20:13:18.707 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/15/19
20:13:18.708 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":19,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy day blowing hard from the E to E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships arrived Dined with Mrs Scott</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":16,"lock":null}
20:13:18.708 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
