20:13:18.708 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":19,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy day blowing hard from the E to E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships arrived Dined with Mrs Scott</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":16,"lock":null}
20:13:18.708 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/16/20
20:13:18.708 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":20,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A bitter cold day with frost Wind ESE half a gale &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Two or three ships arrived. Dined at home. Went to the theatre in the evening. Mitchell's benefit &pound;53 in the house</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":17,"lock":null}
