20:13:18.710 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":21,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very heavy gale with sleet, wind SE. Sea on the bar. Dined with Mr J Carr at Mrs Hutchison &amp; spent a pleasant evening. Declined Mrs Mathews Party</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":18,"lock":null}
