20:13:18.715 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":28,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day with showers in the morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning. Called upon the Miss Ildertons at Mr Sibbs, Mrs Dixon, Bell &amp; Hanna Smith came down &amp; lunched. Dined at home. Tea at Mrs Harrys &amp; whist club in the evening. Heard from &amp; wrote to William</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":25,"lock":null}
