20:13:18.718 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":32,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day, rather frosty, wind NW. Dined with Mrs Scott. At the theatre in the evening. Last night of the Company's performance; a very full house</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":29,"lock":null}
