20:13:18.718 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":32,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day, rather frosty, wind NW. Dined with Mrs Scott. At the theatre in the evening. Last night of the Company's performance; a very full house</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":29,"lock":null}
20:13:18.718 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/29/33
20:13:18.718 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":33,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fair day, rather cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. At the assembly in the evening. A very pleasant one, but not numerously attended, about 60 there. Got home at 4 o'clock. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":30,"lock":null}
20:13:18.718 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/29/33
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":33,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fair day, rather cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. At the assembly in the evening. A very pleasant one, but not numerously attended, about 60 there. Got home at 4 o'clock. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":30,"lock":null}
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/3/7
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":7,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Went to Newcastle by coach to see Dixon Dixon for the purpose of having some conversation with him, respecting his promise of assisting me, but it being Millington Colliery pay day, he was so late in returning home I had no opportunity of speaking. I however invited myself to dine &amp; stay all night tomorrow. Got home to dinner at 5 o'clock Fine day &amp; cold. Wind NW</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":4,"lock":null}
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/3/7
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":7,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Went to Newcastle by coach to see Dixon Dixon for the purpose of having some conversation with him, respecting his promise of assisting me, but it being Millington Colliery pay day, he was so late in returning home I had no opportunity of speaking. I however invited myself to dine &amp; stay all night tomorrow. Got home to dinner at 5 o'clock Fine day &amp; cold. Wind NW</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":4,"lock":null}
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/30/34
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":34,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSW. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":31,"lock":null}
20:13:18.719 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.720 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/30/34
20:13:18.720 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":34,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSW. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":31,"lock":null}
20:13:18.720 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/31/35
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":35,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day &amp; mild. Wind SSW to WSW. Engaged in the morning in examining my father's old papers &amp; accounts in search of the Ariel's vouchers and burning such papers as were out of date &amp; useless. Dined at home &amp; at the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":32,"lock":null}
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/31/35
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":35,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day &amp; mild. Wind SSW to WSW. Engaged in the morning in examining my father's old papers &amp; accounts in search of the Ariel's vouchers and burning such papers as were out of date &amp; useless. Dined at home &amp; at the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":32,"lock":null}
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/4/8
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":8,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Again at Newcastle. Saw J Smith Senior &amp; Junior: the old gent: very kind, asked me to dine, &quot;no go&quot; entered upon the subject of the Ariel, showed them W S Brewer's accounts, they seemed to be of our opinion &amp; against any arbitration. Dined with Dixon, had a long conversation about his assisting me. He was extremely kind in his expressions, but said it was out of his power, from his heavy advances to others &amp; having heavy payments to make himself to but that he would consider about it. memo: Its what I expected, not much disappointed. A promise ought to be held sacred. Cold day with rain afternoon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":5,"lock":null}
20:13:18.721 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/4/8
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":8,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Again at Newcastle. Saw J Smith Senior &amp; Junior: the old gent: very kind, asked me to dine, &quot;no go&quot; entered upon the subject of the Ariel, showed them W S Brewer's accounts, they seemed to be of our opinion &amp; against any arbitration. Dined with Dixon, had a long conversation about his assisting me. He was extremely kind in his expressions, but said it was out of his power, from his heavy advances to others &amp; having heavy payments to make himself to but that he would consider about it. memo: Its what I expected, not much disappointed. A promise ought to be held sacred. Cold day with rain afternoon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":5,"lock":null}
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/5/9
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":9,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Returned to Shields from Newcastle by steam. A miserable wet cold &amp; boisterous day. Wind SE. Dined with J Tenley. By my own invitation, to inform him what passed with Dixon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":6,"lock":null}
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/5/9
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":9,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Returned to Shields from Newcastle by steam. A miserable wet cold &amp; boisterous day. Wind SE. Dined with J Tenley. By my own invitation, to inform him what passed with Dixon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":6,"lock":null}
20:13:18.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/6/10
