20:13:18.724 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/9/13
20:13:18.724 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":13,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got captain Hallam to moor the Hope securely by carrying an anchor out astern. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; spent the evening at Mrs Greenhours, met a large party, a regular squeeze; quadrille &amp; broke up at 12 o'clock. It was cold with snow in the evening</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":10,"lock":null}
