20:13:18.730 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/17/310
20:13:18.730 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":310,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2860-image-map-alnwick-tyneside.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n  <figcaption>Map Alnwick and Tyneside</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
