20:13:18.734 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":314,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind N by W. After breakfast went out shooting. Birds very plentiful. Got a great many shots but only killed a brace and a half. Got home at 4 o'clock. Dined at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":297,"lock":null}
