20:13:18.734 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":315,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of beautiful weather &amp; very mild for the season. Wind SW. Out shooting all the morning. Killed a 1 &frac12;  brace of birds. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Culling</span> also out &amp; killed 2 &frac12; braces &amp; a hare.</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":298,"lock":null}
