20:13:18.735 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":317,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather exceedingly fine. Wind SW. Out shooting all this morning. Birds very wild. Did not kill one. Shot a hare. Sent it with 2 &frac12; braces of birds to Mrs Scott, I Tinby &amp; Mr Mark. Tom also out today &amp; killed 1 &frac12; braces. Mr Elliott dined &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":300,"lock":null}
