20:13:18.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":322,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant autumnal day. Wind ESE. Out shooting. Birds wild. Killed nothing</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":305,"lock":null}
