20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":323,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. More like spring than autumn. Out for two hours shooting. Very hot. Birds exceedingly wild. Killed nothing. Tom got home in the evening</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":306,"lock":null}
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/3/295
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":295,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Now &amp; then a shower of rain. Walked into the city. Attended the Coal Exchange. The Hope not to do anything today. Watt called, took a boat to Hungerford. All dined at the Blue Pasts. Lent Watt 20/- Received of WBS &pound;2.16. Balance of Hopes after her 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage.</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":279,"lock":null}
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/3/295
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":295,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Now &amp; then a shower of rain. Walked into the city. Attended the Coal Exchange. The Hope not to do anything today. Watt called, took a boat to Hungerford. All dined at the Blue Pasts. Lent Watt 20/- Received of WBS &pound;2.16. Balance of Hopes after her 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage.</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":279,"lock":null}
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/30/324
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":324,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind north &amp; rather cool. Mrs Dixon, F Smith &amp; F Brown drove down from Brinkburns. After lunch Mrs Dixon &amp; F Brown returned. Received a letter from Mr Vernon &amp; the boys</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":307,"lock":null}
20:13:18.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
