20:13:18.741 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":324,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind north &amp; rather cool. Mrs Dixon, F Smith &amp; F Brown drove down from Brinkburns. After lunch Mrs Dixon &amp; F Brown returned. Received a letter from Mr Vernon &amp; the boys</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":307,"lock":null}
