20:13:18.753 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":345,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW. A few ships went to sea. Engaged all the morning in the office. Wrote to William. Paid Barthewan an advance of &pound;5.5.4. At the whist club in the evening. Paid into Chapman &pound;50 rents on acct of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":328,"lock":null}
20:13:18.753 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/21/346
20:13:18.753 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":346,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW. Several ships got to sea. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Reaerby</span> the painter a draft for &pound;6.7.6 for painting the Hope. Dined with Captain Bunbury at Tynemouth &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Borrowed &pound;50 of <span class=highlight_yellow>exors</span> &amp; placed to Cr<font color=#BFBFBF>edit</font> of private account at Chapman</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":329,"lock":null}
20:13:18.753 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/21/346
20:13:18.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":346,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW. Several ships got to sea. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Reaerby</span> the painter a draft for &pound;6.7.6 for painting the Hope. Dined with Captain Bunbury at Tynemouth &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Borrowed &pound;50 of <span class=highlight_yellow>exors</span> &amp; placed to Cr<font color=#BFBFBF>edit</font> of private account at Chapman</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":329,"lock":null}
20:13:18.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/22/347
