20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":347,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. Took a walk round Cullercoat fields &amp; Tynemouth. Dined at home. Spent the evening with the whist club at Mr Metcalfs</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":330,"lock":null}
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/23/348
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":348,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW &amp; cold. Went to church with Emma in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":331,"lock":null}
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/23/348
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":348,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW &amp; cold. Went to church with Emma in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":331,"lock":null}
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/24/349
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":349,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day, but blowing hard from SSW. On board the Amity. Went over the water to see Mr P Laing respecting Che Harry's account, but did not see him, he being in London. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry. Received a letter from William.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":332,"lock":null}
20:13:18.755 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/24/349
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":349,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day, but blowing hard from SSW. On board the Amity. Went over the water to see Mr P Laing respecting Che Harry's account, but did not see him, he being in London. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry. Received a letter from William.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":332,"lock":null}
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/25/350
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":350,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly pleasant day. Wind W by S. Employed all the morning in unpacking the <span class=highlight_yellow>tenure</span> books we brought from Ireland. Dined at Mr Craiges, a large party.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":333,"lock":null}
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/25/350
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":350,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly pleasant day. Wind W by S. Employed all the morning in unpacking the <span class=highlight_yellow>tenure</span> books we brought from Ireland. Dined at Mr Craiges, a large party.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":333,"lock":null}
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/26/351
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":351,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day. Wind W. Received a letter this morning from William of Frys &amp; Chapmans failure which surprised me much, the consequence was a run upon Chapmans <span class=highlight_yellow>House</span> here, but which I believe ended towards the evening. The bank are otherwise not affected by Frys failure having known for a fortnight it was to happen &amp; consequently preparing for a run, they suffer no losses. At the theatre in the evening. Much amused.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":334,"lock":null}
20:13:18.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/26/351
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":351,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day. Wind W. Received a letter this morning from William of Frys &amp; Chapmans failure which surprised me much, the consequence was a run upon Chapmans <span class=highlight_yellow>House</span> here, but which I believe ended towards the evening. The bank are otherwise not affected by Frys failure having known for a fortnight it was to happen &amp; consequently preparing for a run, they suffer no losses. At the theatre in the evening. Much amused.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":334,"lock":null}
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/27/352
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":352,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind NW to W &amp; WSW towards the evening. Took a walk with Emma &amp; called upon Mrs Paul &amp; Sharp. Wrote to William but forgot to put the letter into the post. At the whist club in the evening. No run upon Chapmans today. All quiet &amp; business going as usual.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":335,"lock":null}
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.757 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/27/352
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":352,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind NW to W &amp; WSW towards the evening. Took a walk with Emma &amp; called upon Mrs Paul &amp; Sharp. Wrote to William but forgot to put the letter into the post. At the whist club in the evening. No run upon Chapmans today. All quiet &amp; business going as usual.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":335,"lock":null}
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/28/353
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":353,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind about West. Attended a meeting of the Commissioners under the new act to appeal against the rate of the House in Dockwray Square &amp; got it reduced from &pound;50 to &pound;45. Took a walk with Emma &amp; showed her the glass exhibition. Received a letter from William. No account of the Hope. Drew upon Chapmans for &pound;5 for self.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":336,"lock":null}
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/28/353
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":353,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind about West. Attended a meeting of the Commissioners under the new act to appeal against the rate of the House in Dockwray Square &amp; got it reduced from &pound;50 to &pound;45. Took a walk with Emma &amp; showed her the glass exhibition. Received a letter from William. No account of the Hope. Drew upon Chapmans for &pound;5 for self.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":336,"lock":null}
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/29/354
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":354,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day. Wind ESE. A few light ships got in. Finished a long letter to William a continuation to that which I forgot to put into the post on Thursday &amp; enclosing Turner's letter from Carlow, sent them off. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at Mr Allens. A very wet afternoon &amp; night.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":337,"lock":null}
20:13:18.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/29/354
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":354,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day. Wind ESE. A few light ships got in. Finished a long letter to William a continuation to that which I forgot to put into the post on Thursday &amp; enclosing Turner's letter from Carlow, sent them off. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at Mr Allens. A very wet afternoon &amp; night.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":337,"lock":null}
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/3/328
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":328,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind, but little in the morning at NW, afterwards changed to SE. Robert Brown left us for Brinkburn. Tom Smith drove him beyond Felton. Went out shooting but had no sport. Birds wild &amp; scent bad.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":311,"lock":null}
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/3/328
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":328,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind, but little in the morning at NW, afterwards changed to SE. Robert Brown left us for Brinkburn. Tom Smith drove him beyond Felton. Went out shooting but had no sport. Birds wild &amp; scent bad.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":311,"lock":null}
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/30/355
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":355,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy &amp; rainy morning with a gale of wind from ESE to E by N. &amp; high sea upon the bar. I went to church in the morning. A continuation of rain &amp; much heavier. Dined with J Tinley. Received a letter from William of the Hope's arrival. Old Mr Metcalf of Tynemouth died very suddenly this morning during church time.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":338,"lock":null}
20:13:18.759 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/30/355
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":355,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy &amp; rainy morning with a gale of wind from ESE to E by N. &amp; high sea upon the bar. I went to church in the morning. A continuation of rain &amp; much heavier. Dined with J Tinley. Received a letter from William of the Hope's arrival. Old Mr Metcalf of Tynemouth died very suddenly this morning during church time.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":338,"lock":null}
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/4/329
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":329,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; thick weather. Wind SE. Walked twice to the colliery. Miss M Watson came up &amp; dined at Togston. Played at whist in the evening</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":312,"lock":null}
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/4/329
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":329,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; thick weather. Wind SE. Walked twice to the colliery. Miss M Watson came up &amp; dined at Togston. Played at whist in the evening</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":312,"lock":null}
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/5/330
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":330,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 6 o'clock am. A fine morning. Wind at SE. Breakfasted &amp; rode to Morepeth with Tom Smith, market &amp; fair day there. Left Morpeth by the Shields coach &amp; got home at 4 o'clock. To dinner. Mrs Scott very well. The Hope arrived this afternoon &amp; fixed for Wellington to be loaded on Tuesday. Received a letter from William, the sale with balance now for &pound;73.18/-</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":313,"lock":null}
20:13:18.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/5/330
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":330,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 6 o'clock am. A fine morning. Wind at SE. Breakfasted &amp; rode to Morepeth with Tom Smith, market &amp; fair day there. Left Morpeth by the Shields coach &amp; got home at 4 o'clock. To dinner. Mrs Scott very well. The Hope arrived this afternoon &amp; fixed for Wellington to be loaded on Tuesday. Received a letter from William, the sale with balance now for &pound;73.18/-</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":313,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/6/331
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/6/331
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/7/332
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/7/332
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/8/333
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/8/333
20:13:18.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
20:13:18.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/9/334
20:13:18.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
20:13:18.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
