20:13:18.783 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/13/48
20:13:18.783 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":48,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly cold weather &amp; frosty. Wind variable between SE &amp; SSW. Dined at home &amp; at a party at Mrs Recds in evening. Sent to William their promissory notes at 12.18 &amp; 24 months to Messrs Lees for &pound;400, 400 &amp; 450 dated  11 feb 1828</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":45,"lock":null}
