20:13:18.785 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/18/53
20:13:18.785 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":53,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day and frosty, Wind WNW. Got the fore rigging over the mast head &amp; the main mast out &amp; found it much decayed both foot and head &amp; fear we shall be obliged to have a new one. Ordered a new bowsprit of Morton &amp; Thompson. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening with N Bird</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":50,"lock":null}
20:13:18.785 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
