20:13:18.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":37,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, Wind WNW &amp; a slight frost. Dined at Mr Reeds, a large party. Received a letter from William with gratifying intelligence that Lees &amp; co had agreed to let me take the Hope upon mortgage the price &pound;1250 to pay all expenses incurred in the last two years making her stand me in about &pound;1350. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":34,"lock":null}
20:13:18.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/20/55
20:13:18.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":55,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. Got the Hope flats finished caulking &amp; blocks stowed. Brought a new mainmast of Miles Forster at &pound;7.10 per load less discount = &pound;20.11. Dined at home. At Mrs Clarks in evening a party</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":52,"lock":null}
20:13:18.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
