20:13:18.788 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":57,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but turned dull towards afternoon &amp; damp wind veered from E by S to S by E. Dined at home. A party at Mrs Stephen's at Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":54,"lock":null}
20:13:18.788 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/23/58
20:13:18.788 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":58,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull and damp morning. Wind SE. Gave Captain Stephenson &pound;10 for Trewitt to pay carpenters wages. Went to Newcastle, dined &amp; stayed all night with Dixon Dixon. During my absence they got the Hopes mainmast and bowsprit in. Paid Lowery broker Newcastle &pound;4.16.6 on account of W &amp; JS</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":55,"lock":null}
