20:13:18.799 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/3/18/82
20:13:18.799 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":82,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SSW. The surveyors of the British &amp; Hope clubs on board They thought we ought to get a new mainstay sail &amp; that we ought also to have a new towline. Bound two boys E Read for 6 years at &pound;45 &amp; G Floss for 3 years at 30. Dined on board &amp; went to a party at W C Wrights in the evening. Paid Gibson butchers &pound;8.7/ &amp; Hall &pound;3.13/- &amp; self cash &pound;5</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":79,"lock":null}
