20:13:18.808 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":70,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day, frosty, with snow showers, Wind NE. A heavy sea upon the bar The surveyor saw the Hope's keel. Paid R Brown &pound;6.5 for trysail etc. Dined at home. Whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":67,"lock":null}
