20:13:18.830 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/4/6/103
20:13:18.830 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":103,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Easter</u>    Another cold day with snow showers. Wind in the morning N by E &amp; changed in the evening to S by E. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon the Aldertones. Dined at home. The steam boat bought by S Cunningham &amp; others arrived, intended to ply between Newcastle &amp; Leith</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":98,"lock":null}
