20:13:18.835 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/10/143
20:13:18.835 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":143,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with fine spring showers. Left Captain Butlers &amp; returned to Carlow. Mr Vernon &amp; I dined at Mr Butlins &amp; met a very pleasant party</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":133,"lock":null}
