20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":143,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with fine spring showers. Left Captain Butlers &amp; returned to Carlow. Mr Vernon &amp; I dined at Mr Butlins &amp; met a very pleasant party</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":133,"lock":null}
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/11/144
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":144,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers day. Went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Free</span> Church in the morning &amp; afterwards walked to Crossleigh with the boys. Dined at the Jamesons</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":134,"lock":null}
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/11/144
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":144,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers day. Went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Free</span> Church in the morning &amp; afterwards walked to Crossleigh with the boys. Dined at the Jamesons</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":134,"lock":null}
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/12/145
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":145,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day engaged all the morning in preparing for the sale. Dined quietly at home, wrote to A Fitzmaurice</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":135,"lock":null}
20:13:18.836 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.838 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/12/145
20:13:18.838 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":145,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day engaged all the morning in preparing for the sale. Dined quietly at home, wrote to A Fitzmaurice</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":135,"lock":null}
20:13:18.838 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/13/146
20:13:18.838 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":146,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful and hot summers day. Received two letters from Mrs &amp; Miss Scott. The sale commenced &amp; good prices said to be obtained. Mr Vernon with his unreal kindness &amp; consideration asked a party to dine with us consisting of the two Careys, E Butler, Fishebourne, O'Connor &amp; Captain Ballesby. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":136,"lock":null}
20:13:18.838 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.839 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/13/146
20:13:18.839 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":146,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful and hot summers day. Received two letters from Mrs &amp; Miss Scott. The sale commenced &amp; good prices said to be obtained. Mr Vernon with his unreal kindness &amp; consideration asked a party to dine with us consisting of the two Careys, E Butler, Fishebourne, O'Connor &amp; Captain Ballesby. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":136,"lock":null}
20:13:18.839 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/14/147
20:13:18.839 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":147,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. The sale still going on. Wrote to Mr I Robert about a chain cable for the Hope. Dined early. John &amp; I took a long walk to fish but had no sport</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":137,"lock":null}
20:13:18.839 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.840 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/14/147
20:13:18.840 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":147,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. The sale still going on. Wrote to Mr I Robert about a chain cable for the Hope. Dined early. John &amp; I took a long walk to fish but had no sport</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":137,"lock":null}
20:13:18.840 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/15/148
20:13:18.840 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":148,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Vernon &amp; I left Carlow by coach. Found it afterwards extremely hot &amp; dusty. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock &amp; dined with Sir C Vernon. Put up at Mackens Hotel</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":138,"lock":null}
20:13:18.840 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/15/148
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":148,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Vernon &amp; I left Carlow by coach. Found it afterwards extremely hot &amp; dusty. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock &amp; dined with Sir C Vernon. Put up at Mackens Hotel</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":138,"lock":null}
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/16/149
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":149,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but turned out exceptionally hot. Called upon Messrs Ryan &amp; Parkinson respecting Nuv<sup>n</sup> Fitzmaurice bond who said they were wise endeavouring to raise money to pay off all his debts. To my great surprise I met Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry who I found had been residing in Dublin for 18 months. Dined at Mackens. Went today to see the Rotunda</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":139,"lock":null}
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/16/149
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":149,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but turned out exceptionally hot. Called upon Messrs Ryan &amp; Parkinson respecting Nuv<sup>n</sup> Fitzmaurice bond who said they were wise endeavouring to raise money to pay off all his debts. To my great surprise I met Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry who I found had been residing in Dublin for 18 months. Dined at Mackens. Went today to see the Rotunda</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":139,"lock":null}
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/17/150
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":150,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Called upon Mr Syms &amp; Mr Grey, respecting the Athy property. But got no information. Mr Syms who was not at home. Went to the catholic association to hear O'Connell &amp; others speak. Was disappointed. Dined with Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry. Young O'Connel dined with us. A heavy fall of rain [<font color=#D9D9D9>in</font>] the evening</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":140,"lock":null}
20:13:18.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/17/150
20:13:18.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":150,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Called upon Mr Syms &amp; Mr Grey, respecting the Athy property. But got no information. Mr Syms who was not at home. Went to the catholic association to hear O'Connell &amp; others speak. Was disappointed. Dined with Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry. Young O'Connel dined with us. A heavy fall of rain [<font color=#D9D9D9>in</font>] the evening</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":140,"lock":null}
20:13:18.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/18/151
20:13:18.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":151,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy damp morning. Wind East. Got up early &amp; went by the steam boat to Kingstown to see Tom Thompson on board the Royal Charlotte Yacht. He was much surprised too when I went on board. I spent the day &amp; dined with him &amp; returned to Dublin by steam in the evening. It turned out a fine afternoon</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":141,"lock":null}
20:13:18.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.843 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/18/151
20:13:18.843 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":151,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy damp morning. Wind East. Got up early &amp; went by the steam boat to Kingstown to see Tom Thompson on board the Royal Charlotte Yacht. He was much surprised too when I went on board. I spent the day &amp; dined with him &amp; returned to Dublin by steam in the evening. It turned out a fine afternoon</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":141,"lock":null}
20:13:18.843 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/19/152
20:13:18.843 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":152,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Mr Vernon &amp; I left Dublin at 9 o'clock &amp; got to Carlow at 4 o'clock. Dined at home at 6 o'clock. Called upon Mr Price who informed me he had got about &pound;150 by the sale of the furniture which is much more than I expected</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":142,"lock":null}
20:13:18.843 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.844 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/19/152
20:13:18.844 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":152,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Mr Vernon &amp; I left Dublin at 9 o'clock &amp; got to Carlow at 4 o'clock. Dined at home at 6 o'clock. Called upon Mr Price who informed me he had got about &pound;150 by the sale of the furniture which is much more than I expected</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":142,"lock":null}
20:13:18.844 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/2/135
20:13:18.844 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":135,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring day with a shower of rain in the morning. Wind SW. Mr Vernon &amp; I walked out to_____ &amp; dined with J Fitzmaurice. The house stands about halfway up the mountain &amp; commands a most extensive &amp; beautiful view of the surrounding country for many miles, bounded by the Wiklow &amp; other mountains, taking in Carlow in north 10 miles or more off &amp; other towns. We spent a very pleasant day. Received from &amp; wrote a letter to William</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":125,"lock":null}
20:13:18.844 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.845 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/2/135
20:13:18.845 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":135,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring day with a shower of rain in the morning. Wind SW. Mr Vernon &amp; I walked out to_____ &amp; dined with J Fitzmaurice. The house stands about halfway up the mountain &amp; commands a most extensive &amp; beautiful view of the surrounding country for many miles, bounded by the Wiklow &amp; other mountains, taking in Carlow in north 10 miles or more off &amp; other towns. We spent a very pleasant day. Received from &amp; wrote a letter to William</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":125,"lock":null}
20:13:18.845 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/20/153
20:13:18.845 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":153,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Called upon Mr Price in the morning, who gave me a list of the goods sold, with the prices &amp; &pound;90 on account. Had some conversation with Mr Walker with regard to administrating etc. Took a short walk with the boys &amp; returned to dinner. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":143,"lock":null}
20:13:18.845 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.846 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/20/153
20:13:18.846 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":153,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Called upon Mr Price in the morning, who gave me a list of the goods sold, with the prices &amp; &pound;90 on account. Had some conversation with Mr Walker with regard to administrating etc. Took a short walk with the boys &amp; returned to dinner. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":143,"lock":null}
20:13:18.846 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/21/154
20:13:18.846 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":154,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant day. Engaged the principle part of the morning with Mr Walker in reading over Bessy's marriage settlements etc. Paid Lamb &pound;51 being the balance with interest of his bill of &pound;100. Wrote to William asking him to act as sole guardian to the children</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":144,"lock":null}
20:13:18.846 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/21/154
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":154,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant day. Engaged the principle part of the morning with Mr Walker in reading over Bessy's marriage settlements etc. Paid Lamb &pound;51 being the balance with interest of his bill of &pound;100. Wrote to William asking him to act as sole guardian to the children</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":144,"lock":null}
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/22/155
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":155,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer day. Engaged writing all morning. Took a walk with Mr Vernon. Returned home to dinner. The two Careys dined with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":145,"lock":null}
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/22/155
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":155,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer day. Engaged writing all morning. Took a walk with Mr Vernon. Returned home to dinner. The two Careys dined with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":145,"lock":null}
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/23/156
20:13:18.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":156,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wrote to Mr Digan about the house in Dublin Street that I could give him no decisive answer. Hired a car &amp; drove up the mountain &amp; saw H Fitzmaurice about the bonds, who promised as soon as he could raise money upon his estates to pay them &amp; that on Sunday sennight he would give me some money on account of the interest, perhaps sooner. Returned to Mr Vernon to dinner</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":146,"lock":null}
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/23/156
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":156,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wrote to Mr Digan about the house in Dublin Street that I could give him no decisive answer. Hired a car &amp; drove up the mountain &amp; saw H Fitzmaurice about the bonds, who promised as soon as he could raise money upon his estates to pay them &amp; that on Sunday sennight he would give me some money on account of the interest, perhaps sooner. Returned to Mr Vernon to dinner</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":146,"lock":null}
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/24/157
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
20:13:18.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/24/157
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/25/158
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":158,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Attended Divine Service both morning and evening at Carlow church Dined at Mr Jamesons</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":148,"lock":null}
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/25/158
20:13:18.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":158,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Attended Divine Service both morning and evening at Carlow church Dined at Mr Jamesons</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":148,"lock":null}
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/26/159
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":159,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet &amp; unpleasant day. Made up Mr Jamesons account by which it appears there is a balance of &pound;50.9.3 due to him. Dined at home Mr O'Connor with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":149,"lock":null}
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/26/159
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":159,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet &amp; unpleasant day. Made up Mr Jamesons account by which it appears there is a balance of &pound;50.9.3 due to him. Dined at home Mr O'Connor with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":149,"lock":null}
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/27/160
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":160,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Settled with Mr Price for the sale of the furniture &amp; after paying his charges &amp; received from him a bill on Mr Conolly for &pound;18.17.6 at 2 Nov, payable at n<sup>o</sup> 1 Upper Orsmond Quay Dublin &amp; &pound;13.5.8 cash for balance. Dined at the Careys. Met Captain DeLacy &amp; Mr Nugent of the 30<sup>th</sup> &amp; went to a pleasant dinner at E Butlins in the evening &amp; kept up until after 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":150,"lock":null}
20:13:18.850 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.851 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/27/160
20:13:18.851 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":160,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Settled with Mr Price for the sale of the furniture &amp; after paying his charges &amp; received from him a bill on Mr Conolly for &pound;18.17.6 at 2 Nov, payable at n<sup>o</sup> 1 Upper Orsmond Quay Dublin &amp; &pound;13.5.8 cash for balance. Dined at the Careys. Met Captain DeLacy &amp; Mr Nugent of the 30<sup>th</sup> &amp; went to a pleasant dinner at E Butlins in the evening &amp; kept up until after 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":150,"lock":null}
20:13:18.851 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/28/161
20:13:18.851 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":161,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful &amp; beautiful day we have had this summer. Engaged the whole of the morning with Mr Turner in examining &amp; taking down the particulars of the original &amp; sub-leases. Dined at home quietly</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":151,"lock":null}
20:13:18.851 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/28/161
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":161,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful &amp; beautiful day we have had this summer. Engaged the whole of the morning with Mr Turner in examining &amp; taking down the particulars of the original &amp; sub-leases. Dined at home quietly</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":151,"lock":null}
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/29/162
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":162,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; Mr Digan about the house. Answered this letter. Dined at Mr Coopers. Cooper Hill, met a party. Paid Drs Reed &amp; Stone &pound;5 each for their attendance upon my poor sister</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":152,"lock":null}
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/29/162
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":162,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; Mr Digan about the house. Answered this letter. Dined at Mr Coopers. Cooper Hill, met a party. Paid Drs Reed &amp; Stone &pound;5 each for their attendance upon my poor sister</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":152,"lock":null}
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/3/136
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":136,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine spring day, very warm, with a few gentle showers. Wind SW. Engaged in the morning packing then called upon Mr W Fishbeam. Dined at Mr Vernon. The two Mr Cureys dined with us. Spent a very pleasant evening</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":126,"lock":null}
20:13:18.852 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
