20:13:18.854 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":163,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather windy. Engaged writing the greater part of the morning. Dined at Mr Stones &amp; met a larger party. Won at whist 18/- wrote to Ryan Parkinson respecting the debt of H Fitzmaurice estate &amp; also a letter to Tom Tinley</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":153,"lock":null}
20:13:18.854 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/31/164
20:13:18.854 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":164,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Engaged in the morning writing. Took a walk with the boys. Dined at home. My Jameson with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":154,"lock":null}
20:13:18.854 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
