20:13:18.858 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":140,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Engaged in the morning at the house. Left Carlow about 2 o'clock in a post chase with Mr Vernon for Broomville where we arrived at dinner</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":130,"lock":null}
20:13:18.858 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/8/141
20:13:18.858 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":141,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summers day. Amused myself with fly fishing, but had poor sport. Returned to captain Butlers to dinner. Mr &amp; Mrs S George dined with us. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":131,"lock":null}
20:13:18.858 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
