20:13:18.859 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":141,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summers day. Amused myself with fly fishing, but had poor sport. Returned to captain Butlers to dinner. Mr &amp; Mrs S George dined with us. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":131,"lock":null}
20:13:18.859 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/9/142
20:13:18.859 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":142,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Got up at 5 o'clock to fish but had no sport. Tried again breakfast. Fished the whole of the morning but never had a rise, in consequence I suppose of the wind being from the east</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":132,"lock":null}
20:13:18.859 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
