20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":142,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Got up at 5 o'clock to fish but had no sport. Tried again breakfast. Fished the whole of the morning but never had a rise, in consequence I suppose of the wind being from the east</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":132,"lock":null}
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/1/165
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":165,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Received letter from William &amp; Ryan &amp; Parkinson that H Fitzmaurice estates were not sold, but that they were going to raise money upon them to pay off all debts. Did not go to church in the morning. Engaged in writing to William etc . Dined at Mr Jameson</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":155,"lock":null}
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
