20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":165,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Received letter from William &amp; Ryan &amp; Parkinson that H Fitzmaurice estates were not sold, but that they were going to raise money upon them to pay off all debts. Did not go to church in the morning. Engaged in writing to William etc . Dined at Mr Jameson</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":155,"lock":null}
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/10/174
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":174,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A summer day. Attended Mr Stock &amp; did what was necessary at the Prerogative court in making the affidavit &amp; got the leases by coach from Carlow. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":164,"lock":null}
20:13:18.860 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
