20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":174,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A summer day. Attended Mr Stock &amp; did what was necessary at the Prerogative court in making the affidavit &amp; got the leases by coach from Carlow. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":164,"lock":null}
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/11/175
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":175,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. Attended at Mr Stocks again &amp; Mr Carmichael. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":165,"lock":null}
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/11/175
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":175,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. Attended at Mr Stocks again &amp; Mr Carmichael. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":165,"lock":null}
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/12/176
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":176,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. At the courts in the morning getting petition drawn out. Went to Mr Stocks &amp; signed a bond &amp; to my dismay was told it was also necessary I should also have two friends to give bond, for where am I to find them, being a stranger in Dublin. Paid for Bond stamp 20/- fee to council 21/- &amp; advanced Mr Carmichael &pound;5 Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":166,"lock":null}
20:13:18.861 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
