20:13:18.862 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":177,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summers day &amp; very hot Engaged during the morning at the four-court in preparing petition &amp; in the afternoon went down by steam to Kingston with Mr Gale to show him the yacht &amp; to see J Thompson with whom we dined &amp; returned to Dublin in the evening</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":167,"lock":null}
20:13:18.862 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/14/178
20:13:18.862 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":178,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day engaged as usual. Dined at Mackens Received a letter from Mr Vernon saying that he &amp; Mr Turner would come up to Dublin to sign the bonds</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":168,"lock":null}
20:13:18.862 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
