20:13:18.863 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":178,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day engaged as usual. Dined at Mackens Received a letter from Mr Vernon saying that he &amp; Mr Turner would come up to Dublin to sign the bonds</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":168,"lock":null}
20:13:18.863 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/15/179
20:13:18.863 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":179,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went in the morning to Christchurch &amp; delighted with the fine chanting. Dined at Mackeners</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":169,"lock":null}
20:13:18.863 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
