20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":180,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Mr Turner came to town. Attended Mr Carmichael &amp; the four-courts. Dined at Mackens. Mr Vernon arrived in the afternoon. At the gardens in the evening</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":170,"lock":null}
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/17/181
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":181,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Attended the Consistory court. Mr Vernon &amp; Mr Turner gave bond, which settled for the administration. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":171,"lock":null}
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
