20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":181,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Attended the Consistory court. Mr Vernon &amp; Mr Turner gave bond, which settled for the administration. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":171,"lock":null}
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/18/182
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":182,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Returned to Carlow. Dined at Mr Jameson</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":172,"lock":null}
20:13:18.864 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/18/182
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":182,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Returned to Carlow. Dined at Mr Jameson</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":172,"lock":null}
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/19/183
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":183,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a few light showers of rain. Mr Walker received the L<font color=#BFBFBF>ord</font> Chancellors orders from Mr Carmichael &amp; served Mrs Falkener with a copy &amp; notice. Entered into an agreement with Mr Digan to grant him a lease when legally authorized of the house in Dublin street &amp; gave him possession upon his paying one year's rent in advance reg:&pound;35 less &pound;2 allowed him for the difference in time between the 30<sup>th</sup> May the day the lease is to be taken from to this day. Dined with Dr Reed</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":173,"lock":null}
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/19/183
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":183,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a few light showers of rain. Mr Walker received the L<font color=#BFBFBF>ord</font> Chancellors orders from Mr Carmichael &amp; served Mrs Falkener with a copy &amp; notice. Entered into an agreement with Mr Digan to grant him a lease when legally authorized of the house in Dublin street &amp; gave him possession upon his paying one year's rent in advance reg:&pound;35 less &pound;2 allowed him for the difference in time between the 30<sup>th</sup> May the day the lease is to be taken from to this day. Dined with Dr Reed</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":173,"lock":null}
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/2/166
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":166,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy day with heavy showers of rain. Had some conversation with Mr Walker. Determined upon going to Dublin to administer to the amount of sale of furniture only &amp; take out letters of guardianship. Received from Mr Cleer &pound;1.11 for whisky &amp; malting. Dined at home Finished my letter to William &amp; put it into the post. Ordered a car to be with me at 7 o'clock in the morning if fine to go to Athy to see Mr Pope</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":156,"lock":null}
20:13:18.865 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.866 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/2/166
20:13:18.866 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":166,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy day with heavy showers of rain. Had some conversation with Mr Walker. Determined upon going to Dublin to administer to the amount of sale of furniture only &amp; take out letters of guardianship. Received from Mr Cleer &pound;1.11 for whisky &amp; malting. Dined at home Finished my letter to William &amp; put it into the post. Ordered a car to be with me at 7 o'clock in the morning if fine to go to Athy to see Mr Pope</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":156,"lock":null}
20:13:18.866 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/20/184
20:13:18.866 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":184,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day. Not particularly engaged. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Dinned at College Hotel</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":174,"lock":null}
20:13:18.866 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/20/184
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":184,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day. Not particularly engaged. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Dinned at College Hotel</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":174,"lock":null}
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/21/185
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":185,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Heavy rain towards afternoon with thunder. Took walk with the boys &amp; got wet through. Dined at Cossays</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":175,"lock":null}
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/21/185
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":185,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Heavy rain towards afternoon with thunder. Took walk with the boys &amp; got wet through. Dined at Cossays</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":175,"lock":null}
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/22/186
20:13:18.867 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":186,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Left Carlow for Dublin to attend an appointment before Mr Townsend, a master in chancery tomorrow Arrived in Dublin &frac12; past 4 o'clock &ndash; after a pleasant journey. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":176,"lock":null}
