20:13:18.880 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":211,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Dined at home &amp; turned in the evening. Went with Mrs Reed &amp; Miss Harrison to take tea. Not very well. Returned home early. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":201,"lock":null}
20:13:18.880 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/18/212
