20:13:18.881 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":212,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Walked out with Emma &amp; dined again, Emma and I, with I Tindley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":202,"lock":null}
20:13:18.881 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/19/213
20:13:18.881 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":213,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy day. Emma not very well. Stayed and dined at home. I dined with I Tindley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":203,"lock":null}
20:13:18.881 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
