20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":215,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A tremendous fall of rain all the morning, fear it will do much injury to the crops. Dined with I Tindley. Emma spent the day with Mrs Greenhow</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":205,"lock":null}
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/22/216
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":216,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another extremely wet morning. A deluge of rain, cleared &amp; turned out a fine afternoon. Wind varying between NW &amp; NNE Dined with a large party at Mrs Reeds Emma spent the day at Mrs N Fenwicks</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":206,"lock":null}
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/22/216
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":216,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another extremely wet morning. A deluge of rain, cleared &amp; turned out a fine afternoon. Wind varying between NW &amp; NNE Dined with a large party at Mrs Reeds Emma spent the day at Mrs N Fenwicks</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":206,"lock":null}
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/23/217
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":217,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind E a little rain. Robert arrived at 5 O'Clock this morning from Togston for Emma &amp; they left in the evening intending to stay all night at Newcastle &amp; take the coach to Fillon. Went over the water but did not see Mr P Laing about C Harry's business. Left the papers with R Bowlby. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":207,"lock":null}
20:13:18.883 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/23/217
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":217,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind E a little rain. Robert arrived at 5 O'Clock this morning from Togston for Emma &amp; they left in the evening intending to stay all night at Newcastle &amp; take the coach to Fillon. Went over the water but did not see Mr P Laing about C Harry's business. Left the papers with R Bowlby. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":207,"lock":null}
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/24/218
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":218,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning &amp; evening. Dined with Mrs Tenley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":208,"lock":null}
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
