20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":218,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning &amp; evening. Dined with Mrs Tenley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":208,"lock":null}
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/25/219
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":219,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with a little rain. Wind N by E. Sea high. Dined with J Tinley &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":209,"lock":null}
20:13:18.884 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.885 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/25/219
20:13:18.885 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":219,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with a little rain. Wind N by E. Sea high. Dined with J Tinley &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":209,"lock":null}
20:13:18.885 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/26/220
20:13:18.885 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":220,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet and unpleasant day. Wind N &amp; N by E. Breakfasted with J Tinley &amp; drove the two young horses to Newcastle &amp; returned to dinner Mr Day &amp; I Wright dined with us Misses Watt, Kelso, Carr, two Mr M<sup>c</sup>Carrs &amp; Mr Hutchson in the evening</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":210,"lock":null}
20:13:18.885 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
