20:13:18.887 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":222,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a fine day, wind in the morning NW but changed again towards afternoon &amp; variable at N. N by E with rain at night. Received a letter from William. Had a <span class=highlight_yellow>hifetable</span> at home</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":212,"lock":null}
20:13:18.887 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/29/223
20:13:18.887 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":223,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day with showers of rain &amp; some hail. Wind N &amp; NNE a few ships got to sea at considerable risk with steam boats although it was high. The Hilton Lolifte &amp; United Kingdom Steam Boats arrived after a long and stormy &amp; long passage from London, the latter put in for a supply of coal &amp; sailed again. Dined with I Tindley &amp; in the evening walked to Preston &amp; took tea with Miss Kilse</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":213,"lock":null}
20:13:18.887 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
