20:13:18.891 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/5/199
20:13:18.891 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":199,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Amused myself with John, fishing. The Cary's dined with Mr Vernon &amp; spent a very pleasant evening at Major Wolsleys, quadrilles etc</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":189,"lock":null}
20:13:18.891 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
