20:13:18.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/3/229
20:13:18.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":229,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind WNW Did not go to church. Went in the afternoon Dined with I Tindley.. Hearing they wished to load their ships before us, I called upon J Carr about it. Suppered with him</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":218,"lock":null}
