20:13:18.913 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/10/272
20:13:18.913 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":272,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet day. Wind E in the morning &amp; afterwards changed to SW blowing fresh. Walked about the town and pier.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":256,"lock":null}
20:13:18.913 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
