20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":276,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day &amp; blowing a gale of wind from ENE. Did not go to church being unwell with the toothache. Walked upon the pier in the afternoon</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":260,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/15/277
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":277,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Air sharp &amp; frosty. Wind ENE. Walked upon the pier. Played a few games of billiards. Still trouble with the toothache</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":261,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
