20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":277,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Air sharp &amp; frosty. Wind ENE. Walked upon the pier. Played a few games of billiards. Still trouble with the toothache</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":261,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/16/278
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":278,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of uncommonly fine weather. Wind SSE. Captain &amp; Mrs Lewis, Laura, B<font color=#BFBFBF>ob</font> Marsh &amp; I took a sail to &amp; up Portsmouth Harbour round all the men-of-war. Went on board the Royal George Yacht and returned to dinner much gratified &amp; delighted with our excursion.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":262,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/16/278
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":278,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of uncommonly fine weather. Wind SSE. Captain &amp; Mrs Lewis, Laura, B<font color=#BFBFBF>ob</font> Marsh &amp; I took a sail to &amp; up Portsmouth Harbour round all the men-of-war. Went on board the Royal George Yacht and returned to dinner much gratified &amp; delighted with our excursion.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":262,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/17/279
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":279,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind ESE. We amused ourselves in the morning making a large kite for the boys &amp; in the afternoon walked on the pier. Received from William by George Lee two &pound;5 notes with a letter from Stephenson of the arrival of the Hope at Shields after an 8 day passage on for journey</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":263,"lock":null}
20:13:18.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.917 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/17/279
20:13:18.917 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":279,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind ESE. We amused ourselves in the morning making a large kite for the boys &amp; in the afternoon walked on the pier. Received from William by George Lee two &pound;5 notes with a letter from Stephenson of the arrival of the Hope at Shields after an 8 day passage on for journey</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":263,"lock":null}
20:13:18.917 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/18/280
20:13:18.917 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":280,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Extraordinary fine weather . Wind about east. Finished &amp; set the kite up. Lounged about the town in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":264,"lock":null}
20:13:18.917 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
