20:13:18.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":397,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but cold. Wind SE &amp; ESE. Sea high. Several light ships got down. Dined at home. In the evening at Tibbs whist club. Paid Reed <span class=highlight_yellow>app</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rentice</span> I Weeks board lodgings 7/-</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":379,"lock":null}
20:13:18.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/11/398
20:13:18.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":398,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick dull day, but dry. Wind variable. At church in the morning. Received a letter from I &amp; B Galbraith &amp; Mr Vernon. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":380,"lock":null}
20:13:18.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
