20:13:18.930 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":398,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick dull day, but dry. Wind variable. At church in the morning. Received a letter from I &amp; B Galbraith &amp; Mr Vernon. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":380,"lock":null}
20:13:18.930 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/12/399
20:13:18.930 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":399,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Cold with a little hail. Wind ESE &amp; sea high. Several light ships got in. Dined at home. In the evening called &amp; took wine with Tom Wright upon his marriage. A great many there. Spent a pleasant evening.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":381,"lock":null}
20:13:18.930 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
