20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/13/400
20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":400,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind E by S. A few ships arrived. At the court <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Taverne</span> the principle part to the morning. Dined with the Liberal club,  Commercial Hotel &amp; spent a pleasant day. A large party.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":382,"lock":null}
20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
