20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/14/401
20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":401,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW with a slight frost. Walked to Tynemouth with Mr Boswell * took a warm bath. Dined at home. In the evening joined a party to drink a little punch at the Mulstream. Lots of fun. Got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":383,"lock":null}
20:13:18.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/14/401
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":401,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW with a slight frost. Walked to Tynemouth with Mr Boswell * took a warm bath. Dined at home. In the evening joined a party to drink a little punch at the Mulstream. Lots of fun. Got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":383,"lock":null}
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/15/402
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":402,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day with a hard frost. Wind variable between SW &amp; NW. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the whist club. Called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":384,"lock":null}
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/15/402
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":402,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day with a hard frost. Wind variable between SW &amp; NW. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the whist club. Called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":384,"lock":null}
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/16/403
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":403,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day with snow &amp; wind variable between W by S &amp; SE. At night got to west again. Drew &pound;10 out of Chapmans &amp; paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Cluigh</span> for G <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>cloathes</span> &pound;2.14/0. Dined at home. In the evening at the Albion whist club. Called at the Mulstrum but did not stop long.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":385,"lock":null}
20:13:18.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/16/403
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":403,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day with snow &amp; wind variable between W by S &amp; SE. At night got to west again. Drew &pound;10 out of Chapmans &amp; paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Cluigh</span> for G <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>cloathes</span> &pound;2.14/0. Dined at home. In the evening at the Albion whist club. Called at the Mulstrum but did not stop long.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":385,"lock":null}
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/17/404
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":404,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Ground covered with snow, but not much of a frost. Wind at NNW. Called  upon Mr Ferguson &amp; got some drawings for copying, engaged in it all afternoon. Dined at home. Mrs Scott down stairs in one of her bad humours &amp; very disagreeable. Attended the whist club at <span class=highlight_yellow>Drewgs</span>. Paid Reed apprentice 7/- cost week board &amp; lodgings.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":386,"lock":null}
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/17/404
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":404,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Ground covered with snow, but not much of a frost. Wind at NNW. Called  upon Mr Ferguson &amp; got some drawings for copying, engaged in it all afternoon. Dined at home. Mrs Scott down stairs in one of her bad humours &amp; very disagreeable. Attended the whist club at <span class=highlight_yellow>Drewgs</span>. Paid Reed apprentice 7/- cost week board &amp; lodgings.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":386,"lock":null}
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/18/405
20:13:18.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":405,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day with frost &amp; showers of snow. Wind N &amp; NNW. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Mrs Scott downstairs. Went to Stowells Chapel in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":387,"lock":null}
