20:13:18.935 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/21/408
20:13:18.935 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":408,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day &amp; frosty. Wind E by S &amp; changed in the afternoon to W by S. A great many light ships arrived. Walked to Tynemouth with W Ferguson &amp; called upon Captain Bunbury. Dined at home. In the evening at the theatre &frac12; price. Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Grose</span><span class=highlight_yellow>'</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span> benefit &pound;17 in the house. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>average</span> Elizabeth. <span class=highlight_yellow>Choice to</span> Hope Club &pound;28.19.2</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":390,"lock":null}
