20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":409,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Exceedingly cold. Wind SE blowing fresh &amp; sea high. A <span class=highlight_yellow>King</span> ship came in in <span class=highlight_yellow>the</span>. Dined at J Tinley's &amp; went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>apunbly</span> in the evening. A most delightful Ball. Suppered afterwards. The dancing at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; Kept it up till 6 o'clock.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":391,"lock":null}
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/23/410
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":410,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. A continuance of frost &amp; snow and a gale of wind SE &amp; SSE, sea high. A few loaded ships put back. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. Paid Reed a week's lodging 7/-.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":392,"lock":null}
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/23/410
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":410,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. A continuance of frost &amp; snow and a gale of wind SE &amp; SSE, sea high. A few loaded ships put back. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. Paid Reed a week's lodging 7/-.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":392,"lock":null}
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/24/411
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":411,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost &amp; snow &amp; a gale of wind from SE to SSE. Went to Newcastle to endeavour to get something for the Hope, but did not succeed. People not willing to do anything until after the meeting of coal owners. Dined with J Tinley, a party, Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Morins</span> &amp; 2 Lieutenants  of the <span class=highlight_yellow>childers</span>, C <span class=highlight_yellow>Milners</span> &amp; sister Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Atlen</span> Lieutenants 80<sup>th</sup> Regiment</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":393,"lock":null}
20:13:18.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
