20:13:18.937 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":412,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home &amp; took wine with A Metcalf</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":394,"lock":null}
20:13:18.937 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/26/413
20:13:18.937 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":413,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This morning a thaw commenced, early at blew  a gale of wind with sleet. Wind blowing E by S &amp; S by E. Excessively wet &amp; sloppy walking. Dined at home. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with  Mr Allen. A very pleasant party. Got home at 1 o'clock. Engaged a new washer woman by the quarter.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":395,"lock":null}
20:13:18.937 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/26/413
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":413,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This morning a thaw commenced, early at blew  a gale of wind with sleet. Wind blowing E by S &amp; S by E. Excessively wet &amp; sloppy walking. Dined at home. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with  Mr Allen. A very pleasant party. Got home at 1 o'clock. Engaged a new washer woman by the quarter.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":395,"lock":null}
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/27/414
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":414,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw with heavy rain. Much of the snow disappeared. Wind SSE. Went to Newcastle but no freights or anything offering. The <span class=highlight_yellow>fuller</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>obsheiate</span>.  On my return found Mr Watson of Walkworth here. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. <span class=highlight_yellow>Miss</span> Nicholas, Miss Allen and Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Moorers</span> there.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":396,"lock":null}
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/27/414
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":414,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw with heavy rain. Much of the snow disappeared. Wind SSE. Went to Newcastle but no freights or anything offering. The <span class=highlight_yellow>fuller</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>obsheiate</span>.  On my return found Mr Watson of Walkworth here. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. <span class=highlight_yellow>Miss</span> Nicholas, Miss Allen and Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Moorers</span> there.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":396,"lock":null}
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/28/415
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":415,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A unpleasant day. Rainy &amp; very wet &amp; dirty walking. Wind NE in the morning which changed to NW. Dined &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":397,"lock":null}
20:13:18.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/28/415
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":415,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A unpleasant day. Rainy &amp; very wet &amp; dirty walking. Wind NE in the morning which changed to NW. Dined &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":397,"lock":null}
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/29/416
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":416,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind ENE. Mr Watson left us for Newcastle. Went up to Newcastle to attend the annual meeting of the Hope Club. No material alterations made in the rules. Took Mr Boswell up to dine with me. Returned in the evening &amp; attended the whist club. Reduced my <span class=highlight_yellow>investment</span> in the Hope Club to &pound;500. With <span class=highlight_yellow>Ana</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Gallop</span> for the first time.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":398,"lock":null}
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/29/416
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":416,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind ENE. Mr Watson left us for Newcastle. Went up to Newcastle to attend the annual meeting of the Hope Club. No material alterations made in the rules. Took Mr Boswell up to dine with me. Returned in the evening &amp; attended the whist club. Reduced my <span class=highlight_yellow>investment</span> in the Hope Club to &pound;500. With <span class=highlight_yellow>Ana</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Gallop</span> for the first time.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":398,"lock":null}
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/3/390
20:13:18.939 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":390,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. On board the Hope. People engaged smoking her. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at the Craiges. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Geo</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Sl</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ops</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>apple</span> the balance of his wages 18/3 &amp; advances him 3 weeks lodging money &amp; 10/9 cash. Tom Wright junior married today to his grace of Felling.</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":372,"lock":null}
