20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":392,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Wind NE. Cols &amp; sea high at night, a little snow &amp; frost. Dined at home. Received a letter from William. Engaged most of the morning in the office writing. Mrs Dixon brought Emma home.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":374,"lock":null}
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/5/392
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":392,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Wind NE. Cols &amp; sea high at night, a little snow &amp; frost. Dined at home. Received a letter from William. Engaged most of the morning in the office writing. Mrs Dixon brought Emma home.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":374,"lock":null}
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/6/393
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":393,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day with frost. Wind NE &amp; sea high. Walked to Preston with Robert &amp; Emma to talk to Moor about arrears of rent. Went on board the Hope. All safe. Dined at home. Mrs Marr called  in the evening with whom we agreed to send Emma to school the next morning. Suppered and smoked a few <span class=highlight_yellow>segar</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span> with A Harry. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":375,"lock":null}
20:13:18.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/6/393
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":393,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day with frost. Wind NE &amp; sea high. Walked to Preston with Robert &amp; Emma to talk to Moor about arrears of rent. Went on board the Hope. All safe. Dined at home. Mrs Marr called  in the evening with whom we agreed to send Emma to school the next morning. Suppered and smoked a few <span class=highlight_yellow>segar</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span> with A Harry. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":375,"lock":null}
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/7/394
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":394,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; cold. Wind ENE &amp; E by N. Attended a general meeting of the ship owners &amp; entered into resolutions relative to the rate of timber freights for the <span class=highlight_yellow>ensuring</span> years &amp; agreed not to take less than 45/- for <span class=highlight_yellow>Quebec</span>, other ports in proportion. The meeting from the conflicting interests could come to no resolution with regard to the coal trade. Dined at home in the evening. Took wine &amp; suppered with A Harry, A French &amp; A Nicolson at the Albion. Called at the Mulstream.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":376,"lock":null}
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
