20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/8/2300
20:13:18.943 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2300,"version":8,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p><span class=highlight_yellow>Called</span> upon Chapmans for &pound;10 for self &amp; gave Stephenson a draft for &pound;26.18.5 being the balance of his account for the last voyage. Paid into Chapmans WBS balance not foe &pound;30.5/-. Paid entrance &amp; expenses up to the end of the year to the whist club &pound;1.13/-</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2240,"lock":null}
