20:13:18.944 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/8/395
20:13:18.944 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":395,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An unpleasant day. Ground very wet &amp; dirty from the snow not <span class=highlight_yellow>laying</span>. Wind variable during the day. Between the E &amp; S. Once or twice it was at SW for a short time. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening. Called at the Mulstream.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":377,"lock":null}
