20:13:18.945 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/1/711
20:13:18.945 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":711,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Received a letter from William &amp; another from Richmond putting off my visit until Thursday next. Went over to South Shields &amp; called upon ____. Received the butcher for William. Returned &amp; took a walk to Cullercoats. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. The children sailed this afternoon. At the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":669,"lock":null}
