20:13:18.946 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":722,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@54.8211806,-1.7414375,3a,75y,106.58h,91.42t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1s2SwrPh4prbPZkzzXtzMIqA!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2926-lanchester-church.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Lanchester Church</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:18.947 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/11/723
20:13:18.947 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":723,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful mild day. Wind about West. Got up this morning.  Very stiff and aching from the exercise of yesterday. Mr Richmond, Joe &amp; I walked to Lanchester Church. Heard the service &amp; saw the natives. Returned home by the Greenwells of the Ford. Saw Mr White &amp; family of Woodlands at church, <span class=highlight_yellow>lops</span> kindly invited us to dine with him next week. Dined at 3 o'clock without company. Took a stroll after our wine, spent a quiet evening &amp; got to bed early</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":679,"lock":null}
