20:13:18.947 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":723,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful mild day. Wind about West. Got up this morning.  Very stiff and aching from the exercise of yesterday. Mr Richmond, Joe &amp; I walked to Lanchester Church. Heard the service &amp; saw the natives. Returned home by the Greenwells of the Ford. Saw Mr White &amp; family of Woodlands at church, <span class=highlight_yellow>lops</span> kindly invited us to dine with him next week. Dined at 3 o'clock without company. Took a stroll after our wine, spent a quiet evening &amp; got to bed early</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":679,"lock":null}
20:13:18.947 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/12/724
20:13:18.947 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":724,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Out shooting until dinner time, but poor sport. I killed a brace. Only had three shots. Mr Greenwall 3 birds. Mr G dined with us. Played a rubber in the evening</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":680,"lock":null}
