20:13:18.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":755,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind SW &amp; blowing fresh. Walked out. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Emma came from school for a few days. Spent the evening at home</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":709,"lock":null}
20:13:18.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/11/756
20:13:18.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":756,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from WBS. No account yet of the Hope's arrival. At the billiard room all the morning. Dined at home at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening in the house. Paid Mrs Stephenson  mom o &pound;4 carpenter &pound;2.5/- &amp; cook &pound;1.10/-</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":710,"lock":null}
20:13:18.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/11/756
20:13:18.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":756,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from WBS. No account yet of the Hope's arrival. At the billiard room all the morning. Dined at home at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening in the house. Paid Mrs Stephenson  mom o &pound;4 carpenter &pound;2.5/- &amp; cook &pound;1.10/-</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":710,"lock":null}
20:13:18.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/12/757
20:13:18.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":757,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy and wet morning. Wind WSW. At the news room &amp; in the house all the morning. Received a notice from Brown of the George to quit in May. Called &amp; told him I would not accept it. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening went to the whist club being a wet evening Tom Smith would not go. Wrote to <span class=highlight_aqua>Baker Galbraith</span></p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":711,"lock":null}
20:13:18.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/12/757
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":757,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy and wet morning. Wind WSW. At the news room &amp; in the house all the morning. Received a notice from Brown of the George to quit in May. Called &amp; told him I would not accept it. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening went to the whist club being a wet evening Tom Smith would not go. Wrote to <span class=highlight_aqua>Baker Galbraith</span></p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":711,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/13/758
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":758,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Blowing hard from the SE. Walked to Shields with Tom Smith. He set off for Togston, being such an unpleasant morning. Fanny remained. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Took wine with H Harry &amp; J Cunningham at the Commercial.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":712,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/13/758
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":758,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Blowing hard from the SE. Walked to Shields with Tom Smith. He set off for Togston, being such an unpleasant morning. Fanny remained. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Took wine with H Harry &amp; J Cunningham at the Commercial.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":712,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/14/759
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":759,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick &amp; very damp morning, having been a great deal of rain. Wind South. Fanny Smith left for Togston. Dined with Boswell on board the William Shard. Mark, H Harry &amp; Richardson took wine with us. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":713,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
