20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":759,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick &amp; very damp morning, having been a great deal of rain. Wind South. Fanny Smith left for Togston. Dined with Boswell on board the William Shard. Mark, H Harry &amp; Richardson took wine with us. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":713,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/15/760
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":760,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Wind N &amp; NE. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. Boswell &amp; I took wine &amp; tea with H Harry. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":714,"lock":null}
20:13:18.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
