20:13:18.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":761,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. After a stormy night. Wind variable N by W. N &amp; NE &amp; a heavy sea upon the bar. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him an account of rents. Received a letter from him of the arrival of the Hope at Gravesend. Dined at 5 o'clock at J Tinley's. William &amp; H Metcalf, H Dale, Mr Gosling, R A J. Wright jn &amp; Mr Duncan from Liverpool there. A very pleasant party.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":715,"lock":null}
20:13:18.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/17/762
20:13:18.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":762,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp, thick morning. Wind NW &amp; cold. Dined with Bill Wright on board the Stephen. J Wright jr &amp; Mr Hawks, H French, Mr Wright, Mr Watt, Mr Hobroyd, Mr Hall &amp; myself.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":716,"lock":null}
