20:13:18.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/2/748
20:13:18.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":748,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Attended the justice room until dinner time. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Played at billiards with Ben Wright until 10 o'clock. Several ships got down.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":702,"lock":null}
20:13:18.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
