20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":748,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Attended the justice room until dinner time. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Played at billiards with Ben Wright until 10 o'clock. Several ships got down.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":702,"lock":null}
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/20/765
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":765,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine frosty morning. Wind about West. An idle day with me. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Boswell &amp; I spent the evening with Allen.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":719,"lock":null}
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
