20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":765,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine frosty morning. Wind about West. An idle day with me. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Boswell &amp; I spent the evening with Allen.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":719,"lock":null}
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/21/766
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":766,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NW by N. Received a letter from WBS with a bank post bill for &pound;50. Went to church.</p>\r\n<p>The wind suddenly changed to NE blowing very hard with heavy showers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Boswell came in &amp; took wine with me. Wrote to WBS. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":720,"lock":null}
20:13:18.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/21/766
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":766,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NW by N. Received a letter from WBS with a bank post bill for &pound;50. Went to church.</p>\r\n<p>The wind suddenly changed to NE blowing very hard with heavy showers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Boswell came in &amp; took wine with me. Wrote to WBS. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":720,"lock":null}
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/23/767
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":767,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind E by N blowing fresh &amp; a heavy sea upon the bar. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>accounts</span> Chapman &pound;50 to <span class=highlight_yellow>C</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span></sup> of my account &amp; paid by <span class=highlight_yellow>diss</span> upon <span class=highlight_yellow>them</span> Premium Club bill &pound;25.12.6 &amp; average Hope club &pound;5.10.5. Dined at home. Went to a <span class=highlight_yellow>lobicst</span> party in the evening at Mr Harrison's</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":721,"lock":null}
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/23/767
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":767,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind E by N blowing fresh &amp; a heavy sea upon the bar. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>accounts</span> Chapman &pound;50 to <span class=highlight_yellow>C</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span></sup> of my account &amp; paid by <span class=highlight_yellow>diss</span> upon <span class=highlight_yellow>them</span> Premium Club bill &pound;25.12.6 &amp; average Hope club &pound;5.10.5. Dined at home. Went to a <span class=highlight_yellow>lobicst</span> party in the evening at Mr Harrison's</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":721,"lock":null}
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/24/768
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":768,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing very hard all night from ESE &amp; still continues nearly the same about E by S with a heavy sea upon the bar but clear weather &amp; exceedingly cold. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went on board the Choice &amp; had some punch with H Harry. The wind increased to a heavy gale. Drank tea with Miss Harry &amp; spent the evening with mark</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":722,"lock":null}
20:13:18.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/24/768
20:13:18.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":768,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing very hard all night from ESE &amp; still continues nearly the same about E by S with a heavy sea upon the bar but clear weather &amp; exceedingly cold. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went on board the Choice &amp; had some punch with H Harry. The wind increased to a heavy gale. Drank tea with Miss Harry &amp; spent the evening with mark</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":722,"lock":null}
20:13:18.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/25/769
20:13:18.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":769,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning &amp; a heavy gale of wind at E by N with sleet showers &amp; been so all night. Increased <font color=#BFBFBF>to </font>a perfect hurricane with a most tremendous sea. Dined at home. H Harry, H Nicolson, Boswell &amp; I had some punch at the Commercial.</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":723,"lock":null}
20:13:18.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
