20:13:18.984 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":792,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind NNW. On board the Hope. The carpenter's busy with the stern <span class=highlight_yellow>bolling</span>. The timber ends etc &amp; going to put in another hook, having finished the after <span class=highlight_yellow>raftport</span>. Drew &pound;5 cash out of Chapmans. Dined at home. Spent the evening with Allen. Paid E Reed's mother &pound;2.9 the balance of his wages. Turned out a very wet night.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":746,"lock":null}
20:13:18.984 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/19/793
20:13:18.984 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":793,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning, having been a heavy fall of rain &amp; hail during the night. Wind WNW. Dined at home. Drank tea with Allen &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":747,"lock":null}
20:13:18.984 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
