20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":793,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning, having been a heavy fall of rain &amp; hail during the night. Wind WNW. Dined at home. Drank tea with Allen &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":747,"lock":null}
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/2/776
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":776,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp &amp; unpleasant morning. After a stormy night, a heavy sea upon the bar. Wind SE.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At another max with Catherine. In the evening went to South Shields to Mr Bullocks &amp; partook of an oyster supper &amp; milk. Punch with H Harry, Boswell, Allen &amp; J Richardson. The oysters very large &amp; fine, from Wells</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":730,"lock":null}
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/2/776
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":776,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp &amp; unpleasant morning. After a stormy night, a heavy sea upon the bar. Wind SE.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At another max with Catherine. In the evening went to South Shields to Mr Bullocks &amp; partook of an oyster supper &amp; milk. Punch with H Harry, Boswell, Allen &amp; J Richardson. The oysters very large &amp; fine, from Wells</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":730,"lock":null}
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/20/794
20:13:18.985 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":794,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp raw morning. Wind SE by E. received a letter from WBS with Hope's freight account. Stayed in the house all day, having a swelled face</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":748,"lock":null}
