20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":423,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather rather damp &amp; foggy. Wind from W to N by S. Passed the first of the morning in drawing. Dined at home. Saw <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nn</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>&gamma;&alpha;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&pi;</span>. At the whist club</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":405,"lock":null}
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/6/424
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":424,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N. Paid Brown for <span class=highlight_yellow>oakeun</span> &amp; for Hope's buffet &amp; the year &pound;21. Dined at I Fenwicks, Preston Villa, a party of 18</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":406,"lock":null}
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
