20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":424,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N. Paid Brown for <span class=highlight_yellow>oakeun</span> &amp; for Hope's buffet &amp; the year &pound;21. Dined at I Fenwicks, Preston Villa, a party of 18</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":406,"lock":null}
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/7/425
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
20:13:19.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/7/425
20:13:19.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
20:13:19.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/8/426
20:13:19.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
20:13:19.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/8/426
20:13:19.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
20:13:19.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/9/427
20:13:19.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
20:13:19.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/9/427
20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/1/447
20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
