20:13:19.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
