20:13:19.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/11/457
20:13:19.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":457,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NW. Amused myself the best part of morning with drawing. At the billiard table &amp; dined on board the XYZ with Mr Harrison. Saw Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":439,"lock":null}
