20:13:19.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/12/458
20:13:19.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":458,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but rather cool. Wind W by S. Walked up to the ship. Sent Master Scott Crathorn &pound;2. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":440,"lock":null}
