20:13:19.030 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":474,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold &amp; frosty. Wind SSE. Dined at home. Took grog on board the Brodwick. R Peach. Drank tea &amp; attended the whist club at H Harry's<u> </u></p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":456,"lock":null}
20:13:19.030 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/29/475
20:13:19.030 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":475,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold dry weather. Wind E by S. Attended morning service with Dale at Tynemouth Barracks &amp; heard Mr Mark preach to the soldiers. Dined at home. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":457,"lock":null}
20:13:19.030 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
