20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":482,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning wind SSE. Turned out very wet. Wrote to William. Wind changed in the afternoon to SE. Found myself very queer this morning in consequence of late hours &amp; last night at the Dales. Stayed in the house all day. In the evening at the newsroom &amp; called at the Mulstrum &amp; gave Bennett a <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span>.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":464,"lock":null}
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/6/483
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":483,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind E. Engaged in the house reading until 12 o'clock. Called upon J Hearn about his bell for the Hope, but he was not at the sail-loft. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":465,"lock":null}
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
