20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":483,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind E. Engaged in the house reading until 12 o'clock. Called upon J Hearn about his bell for the Hope, but he was not at the sail-loft. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":465,"lock":null}
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/7/484
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":484,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind East &amp; been much rain during the night. Dined with ben Wright &amp; a party <span class=highlight_yellow>ra</span><span class=highlight_yellow> bard</span>. Then Stephen &amp; spent a very pleasant evening.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":466,"lock":null}
20:13:19.051 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
