20:13:19.054 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":517,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning &amp; summers weather SE. Went with Emma to church. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Took wine with H Harry. Walked to Tynemouth in the  evening.</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":499,"lock":null}
20:13:19.054 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/5/11/518
20:13:19.054 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":518,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Turned out a very fine day. Went to Newcastle by steam but did not fix the Hope. Returned home to dinner. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Paid the men their wages &amp; gave Stephenson a draft for &pound;45</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":500,"lock":null}
20:13:19.054 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
