20:13:19.162 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/4/678
20:13:19.162 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":678,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind the same. Bob &amp; I again walked into the city &amp; to the Hope where we lunched. Got all the tallow out today &amp; expect to deliver the copper. Returned to Philpot Lane where I met with Mr James Gale from Carlow. With Maryann again. Took a Greenwich boat at the tower Stairs &amp; went down to Watts, where I dined &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":772,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":640,"lock":null}
