20:13:19.163 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/5/681
20:13:19.163 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":681,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning, with a slight shower or two of rain. Wind I think about WSW. Watt prevailed upon me to remain till Monday. Amused ourselves during the morning fishing for eels near Bugsby's Hole. Had poor sport, patience exhausted.  A great many large ships passed us from foreign, with some collisions. Dined at 6 o'clock &amp; in the evening played a rubber of whist</p>","pageId":772,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":641,"lock":null}
20:13:19.163 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
