20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":820,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine dry winters morning. Rather frosty &amp; blowing fresh at NE. Dined at home. H Harry, Mr Hewson, Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York. A stormy night, a hurricane with snow.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":772,"lock":null}
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/14/821
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/14/821
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/15/822
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
20:13:19.170 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/15/822
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/16/823
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/16/823
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/17/824
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
20:13:19.171 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/17/824
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/18/825
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":825,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. The frost continued very keen throughout the day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Things very dull. Could get nothing for the Hope. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. In the evening Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":777,"lock":null}
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/18/825
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":825,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. The frost continued very keen throughout the day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Things very dull. Could get nothing for the Hope. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. In the evening Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":777,"lock":null}
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/19/826
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":826,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; very intense frost. Been a little snow in the night. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tynemouth with Captain Webb. Dined at home. At the Commercial with Brown &amp; Newton</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":778,"lock":null}
20:13:19.172 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.173 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/19/826
20:13:19.173 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":826,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; very intense frost. Been a little snow in the night. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tynemouth with Captain Webb. Dined at home. At the Commercial with Brown &amp; Newton</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":778,"lock":null}
20:13:19.173 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/2/808
20:13:19.173 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":808,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning rather inclined to thaw. Wind NW. J Tinley drove me to Newcastle but could do nothing for the Hope. The Colliers being still off work. Returned with J Tinley &amp; dined with him. In the evening attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":761,"lock":null}
20:13:19.173 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/2/808
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":808,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning rather inclined to thaw. Wind NW. J Tinley drove me to Newcastle but could do nothing for the Hope. The Colliers being still off work. Returned with J Tinley &amp; dined with him. In the evening attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":761,"lock":null}
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/20/827
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":827,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very severe frost. Wind fresh at ESE. A large fleet of light ships coming in. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy snow storm, turned in the evening to a thaw with sleet &amp; rain very wet &amp; sloppy. Spent the evening at J Tinley's. A ship got upon the Heard Sand at night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":779,"lock":null}
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/20/827
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":827,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very severe frost. Wind fresh at ESE. A large fleet of light ships coming in. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy snow storm, turned in the evening to a thaw with sleet &amp; rain very wet &amp; sloppy. Spent the evening at J Tinley's. A ship got upon the Heard Sand at night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":779,"lock":null}
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/21/828
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
20:13:19.174 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/21/828
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/22/829
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":829,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fresh weather &amp; been blowing very hard all night from the SE. One ship has got upon the Heard Sand, another upon the rocks &amp; two riding off the Bar. One having cut away her masts &amp; the other with main mast gone. Both these ships &amp; the one on the Heard Sand got into the harbour. Walked to Tynemouth with Nicholson &amp; Cunningham. Dined at home. In the evening H harry, Nicholson &amp; I went to the Duke of York where we found Mr Heweson</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":781,"lock":null}
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/22/829
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":829,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fresh weather &amp; been blowing very hard all night from the SE. One ship has got upon the Heard Sand, another upon the rocks &amp; two riding off the Bar. One having cut away her masts &amp; the other with main mast gone. Both these ships &amp; the one on the Heard Sand got into the harbour. Walked to Tynemouth with Nicholson &amp; Cunningham. Dined at home. In the evening H harry, Nicholson &amp; I went to the Duke of York where we found Mr Heweson</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":781,"lock":null}
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/23/830
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":830,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Still blowing fresh from S by E. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening at Drury's</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":782,"lock":null}
20:13:19.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.176 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/23/830
20:13:19.176 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":830,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Still blowing fresh from S by E. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening at Drury's</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":782,"lock":null}
20:13:19.176 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/24/831
20:13:19.176 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":831,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant raw damp morning. Wind SSE</p>\r\n<p>A serious accident has befallen Mrs Scott. This morning having fallen off the bed &amp; broken her thigh. It is only a simple fracture &amp; having got it set immediately, she is suffering as little pain as could possibly be expected. Wrote to Mrs Dixon to come down immediately. Sent a messenger off to Togston. Dined at J Tinleys. Met Mr Mark there. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":783,"lock":null}
20:13:19.176 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
