20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/3/810
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":810,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning having been a frost in the night. Wind NW. Went to church in the morning. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Walked with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lens</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Kills</span> &amp; J Tinley to Tynemouth Lodge &amp; afterwards to Tynemouth with J T<font color=#BFBFBF>inley</font>. Dined with him. Mark came in after dinner.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":762,"lock":null}
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/3/810
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":810,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning having been a frost in the night. Wind NW. Went to church in the morning. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Walked with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lens</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Kills</span> &amp; J Tinley to Tynemouth Lodge &amp; afterwards to Tynemouth with J T<font color=#BFBFBF>inley</font>. Dined with him. Mark came in after dinner.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":762,"lock":null}
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/30/837
20:13:19.179 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":837,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind NE. Went to the newsroom, read the papers. Dined at home at 9 o'clock. Spent the afternoon at the billiard room. Wind suddenly changed to SE. Blowing fresh. Attended the whist club at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":789,"lock":null}
