20:13:19.181 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/5/812
20:13:19.181 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":812,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Walked with Mark to Cullercoats &amp; saw the boats come in. Returned home to dinner. Spent the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":764,"lock":null}
