20:13:19.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/13/1096
20:13:19.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1096,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine calm morning. Wind SE. Started at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; walked to Wallsend &amp; dined with Potts, a large party there. Spent a very pleasant day. Walked home in the evening. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":854,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1044,"lock":null}
