20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1098,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but foggy which is clearing away Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth Could not see the Hope. Dined at home At Dr Drury's garden in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;3.5.6 for making mainsail</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1046,"lock":null}
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/16/1099
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1099,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning again foggy. Wind about West. Walked to Tynemouth. The Hope not in sight. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Allen suppered with me in the evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1047,"lock":null}
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/16/1099
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1099,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning again foggy. Wind about West. Walked to Tynemouth. The Hope not in sight. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Allen suppered with me in the evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1047,"lock":null}
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/17/1100
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1100,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind SSW. The Hope arrived last night &amp; is laid upon the Lowlight shore. Did not go to church having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidlity</span>. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1048,"lock":null}
20:13:19.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/17/1100
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1100,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind SSW. The Hope arrived last night &amp; is laid upon the Lowlight shore. Did not go to church having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidlity</span>. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1048,"lock":null}
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/18/1101
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1101,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Stephenson breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went by coach to Newcastle. Freights being so low I fixed the Hope to Load Holywell on my own account. Walked round by Bentow, saw Mrs Dixon &amp; proceeded to Billy Smith &amp; dined with Charlton. A wet evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1049,"lock":null}
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
