20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/2/1085
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1085,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind at SE. Received a letter from B B Galbralth. Dined at home. Spent the evening at Dr Wiltons</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1033,"lock":null}
20:13:19.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
