20:13:19.191 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/25/1108
20:13:19.191 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1108,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning A little wind at West. Paid Premium bill Archangel voyage &pound;12.13.8. Dined at home. Engaged in the afternoon entering the archangel voyage in the ships book. In the evening at the Albion &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1056,"lock":null}
20:13:19.191 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
