20:13:19.193 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/29/1112
20:13:19.193 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1112,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Blowing hard from NW Cloudy with the appearance of rain. Drew on chapman for &pound;14.1.5. <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> Mrs Brown making square mainsail &pound;3.11 &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> Bradshaw for canvas &pound;11.4. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; finished at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1060,"lock":null}
20:13:19.193 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
