20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1086,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind SW. A great many light ships off the bar. Went to church. Dined at home. Took wine with Mr Allen. Walked to Tynemouth. In the evening. Saw Ann. H Harry spent the evening with me.</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1034,"lock":null}
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/30/1113
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1113,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning wind  light at WNW. Employed entering Hope's 2<sup>nd</sup> coal voyage in the book. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the club held at In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dales</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1061,"lock":null}
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/30/1113
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1113,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning wind  light at WNW. Employed entering Hope's 2<sup>nd</sup> coal voyage in the book. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the club held at In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dales</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1061,"lock":null}
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/31/1114
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1114,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather dull morning having been rain in the night. Blowing fresh at WNW. Having a bad swelled face, sent for the doctor who prescribed a dose of physic for me. Remained in the house all day. Blowing a gale of wind at NW</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1062,"lock":null}
20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
