20:13:19.195 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1114,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather dull morning having been rain in the night. Blowing fresh at WNW. Having a bad swelled face, sent for the doctor who prescribed a dose of physic for me. Remained in the house all day. Blowing a gale of wind at NW</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1062,"lock":null}
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/4/1087
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1087,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind NW. Sent &amp; brought Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> home. Mrs Man having died last night. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; saw the 80<sup>th</sup> inspected by General Bouverie Spent the evening with H Harry. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1035,"lock":null}
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/4/1087
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1087,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind NW. Sent &amp; brought Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> home. Mrs Man having died last night. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; saw the 80<sup>th</sup> inspected by General Bouverie Spent the evening with H Harry. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1035,"lock":null}
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/5/1088
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1088,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful autumnal morning &amp; wind NW. Walked with H Harry round by the rocks. Tynemouth Cullercoats Sands &amp; fields, home. Dined at home &amp; spent the afternoon at Dr <span class=highlight_yellow>Dr</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>y's</span> garden. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1036,"lock":null}
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/5/1088
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1088,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful autumnal morning &amp; wind NW. Walked with H Harry round by the rocks. Tynemouth Cullercoats Sands &amp; fields, home. Dined at home &amp; spent the afternoon at Dr <span class=highlight_yellow>Dr</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>y's</span> garden. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1036,"lock":null}
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/6/1089
20:13:19.196 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1089,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind NNW. Mrs Dixon came down before I was dressed &amp; took Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> to Newcastle with her. Dined at home. Allen fed with me. &amp; we afterwards spend the afternoon on board the Broderick. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1037,"lock":null}
