20:13:19.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/14/1128
20:13:19.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1128,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind SW. Went to church. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon Dined at J Tealays. Captain Deans &amp; two lieutenants of HMS Childers there. Received a parcel from WBS by J H Richardson, deeds <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> silver spoon</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1076,"lock":null}
20:13:19.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
