20:13:19.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/15/1129
20:13:19.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1129,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine cold morning Wind WSW. Received a letter from WBS with Hope's archangel account but not <span class=highlight_yellow>reliance</span> the delivered very little more than <span class=highlight_yellow>good</span> deals Paid Robert &amp; Leadbetter their &frac14; year wages &pound;10.11/- draft on chapmans exor account Dined at home. Called on J Young Paid Mrs Wright for E<font color=#BFBFBF>mma</font> Galbraiths education &pound;13.3.9 at the theatre &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1077,"lock":null}
