20:13:19.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1130,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Showery weather. Attended this magistrates meeting. Dined at home &amp; went to a party in the evening at J Tenleys a quadrille</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1078,"lock":null}
20:13:19.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/17/1131
20:13:19.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1131,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, rather frosty. Wind west Walked up to the ship Took an early dinner on board the Crises. In the evening at the Albion &amp; Duke of York.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Mrs Bagot Wishing Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> to be placed under their mothers care</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1079,"lock":null}
