20:13:19.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/19/1133
20:13:19.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1133,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind light at SW. Walked with Cunningham &amp; A Richardson round by the fields to Cullercoats, returning by the <span class=highlight_yellow>jany</span> &amp; Tynemouth home to dinner. In the afternoon at the billiard room &amp; at the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1081,"lock":null}
