20:13:19.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/22/1136
20:13:19.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1136,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to load Adams to be load on <span class=highlight_yellow>her</span> before the 8<sup>th</sup> December. Returned by steam. Dined at Mr Harrison's the brewers &amp; in the evening at the Theatre &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1084,"lock":null}
