20:13:19.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1139,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a change of wind from SW On board the Hope, ordered new paul bits. Walked to Tynemouth Dined at home. Mr Herd of the 15<sup>th</sup> regiment with me at the billiard room &amp; whist club in the evening</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson to Newcastle</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1087,"lock":null}
20:13:19.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/26/1140
20:13:19.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1140,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Showering morning &amp; blowing hard from SE. Stephenson called, could not prevail on Mr Walker to send us coal down tomorrow to ensure us an earlier <span class=highlight_yellow>turey</span>. Dined at home. Got &pound;5 of chapman Took wine with I A Richardson at the Albion</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1088,"lock":null}
20:13:19.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
