20:13:19.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1117,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind west by South. At South Shields. Dined at home. On board the Choice in the afternoon &amp; finished at the Malstrum Got &pound;5 at chapmans</p>","pageId":859,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1065,"lock":null}
20:13:19.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/11/30/1144
20:13:19.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1144,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The wind still present from ESE but both it &amp; the sea much fallen. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>g</span><span class=highlight_yellow>esheding</span> a draft on chapmans for &pound;8.6.8 an average Premium Club. Walked up to Coble dean, carpenters busy with wind cap. Got 7 Keels more down, making 14. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":863,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1092,"lock":null}
