20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1148,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind SSW. Gave Stephenson a draft on chapman for &pound;10 being the balance of his archangel account 3.12.6 Tongues &pound;1.18 &amp; cash for present voy<font color=#BFBFBF>age</font> &pound;4.9.7. Dined with J B Wright at the Star &amp; Garter Tynemouth at 5 o'clock &amp; in the evening attended the whist club at Tibbe</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1096,"lock":null}
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/5/1149
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1149,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather cold wind SSW. Several ships got to sea. Not very well. Did not go to church. Dined with H Harry &amp; also took tea &amp; in the evening at the Mulstrum &amp; Abbey</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1097,"lock":null}
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/5/1149
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1149,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather cold wind SSW. Several ships got to sea. Not very well. Did not go to church. Dined with H Harry &amp; also took tea &amp; in the evening at the Mulstrum &amp; Abbey</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1097,"lock":null}
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/6/1150
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1150,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night blowing hard from the ESE. Just as well the Hope did not get to sea yesterday. Gave Robert a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon and the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1098,"lock":null}
20:13:19.229 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/6/1150
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1150,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night blowing hard from the ESE. Just as well the Hope did not get to sea yesterday. Gave Robert a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon and the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1098,"lock":null}
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/7/1151
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1151,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but stated blowing hard from E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships light &amp; loaded came in. One a <span class=highlight_yellow>Scarb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ra</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>oefsel</span> from the Baltic in taking the bar at an improper time of teder, struck, knocked her rudder off &amp; drove upon the Hurdsand. Dined at Mr R Fenwicks a party</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1099,"lock":null}
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/7/1151
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1151,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but stated blowing hard from E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships light &amp; loaded came in. One a <span class=highlight_yellow>Scarb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ra</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>oefsel</span> from the Baltic in taking the bar at an improper time of teder, struck, knocked her rudder off &amp; drove upon the Hurdsand. Dined at Mr R Fenwicks a party</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1099,"lock":null}
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/8/1152
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1152,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but still blowing fresh from ESE with showers of rain. On board the Hope Dined at home. At the billiard room A Nicholson came &amp; took a glass of Toddy with me in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1100,"lock":null}
20:13:19.230 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
