20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1152,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but still blowing fresh from ESE with showers of rain. On board the Hope Dined at home. At the billiard room A Nicholson came &amp; took a glass of Toddy with me in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1100,"lock":null}
20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/9/1153
20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1153,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of much the same sort of weather with the fresh from the E &amp; E by S. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1101,"lock":null}
