20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/9/1153
20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1153,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of much the same sort of weather with the fresh from the E &amp; E by S. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1101,"lock":null}
20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/1/839
20:13:19.231 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":839,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold winters day, Wind fresh at about East with Showers of snow. Attended the sale Of the Glattons stores upon the Low Lights Quay. Brought a Capstan for &pound;3.1. and 23 faths of 1 3/16 mock chain quite new at 17/6 a cwt. Played a few pools at billiards W Peast   H Nickolson and all at the Duke of York in the evening.</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":791,"lock":null}
