20:13:19.233 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/13/851
20:13:19.233 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":851,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind about SW. On board the Hopes &amp; engaged looking for a Kedger getting but the beef at 4 o'clock. Dined with I Tiney &amp; at the Whist Club in the evening at Mr Richmounds The Hope got these Rich</p>","pageId":798,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":803,"lock":null}
