20:13:19.241 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/25/863
20:13:19.241 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":863,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by S.  Received a note from T Young demanding the return upon the note. Called upon him, not at home. Dined at home. In the evening at the Whist Club. Received a letter from Salmon enclosing a draft for &pound;88.9.3 Dated 11<sup>th</sup> March for Mrs Ghireson's Estate</p>","pageId":801,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":815,"lock":null}
