20:13:19.242 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/28/866
20:13:19.242 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":866,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning Rather dull; been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind NW. Went to church in the morning. A rainy afternoon. Dined with I Judy At the Mulstream</p>","pageId":801,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":818,"lock":null}
