20:13:19.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/6/844
20:13:19.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":844,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S.W. &amp; keen frost. Walked to Cullercoats Dined at home. In the evening the whist Club. Tea at Mr N Finwicks<u> </u></p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":796,"lock":null}
20:13:19.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
