20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":844,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S.W. &amp; keen frost. Walked to Cullercoats Dined at home. In the evening the whist Club. Tea at Mr N Finwicks<u> </u></p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":796,"lock":null}
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/7/845
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/7/845
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/8/846
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":846,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The thaw continues &amp; the  snow has disappeared. Blowing a gale of wind at WNW. Went by Dunn's coach to Newcastle Fixed the Hope for the Bursaton Walls to be loaded on Monday. Gave Stephenson orders to lay her the shore line. Dined at home at 3 then took wine with I Craig &amp; afterwards spent the evening At Tynemouth Castle with Captain French of The 80<sup>th</sup>. A large Hulk sailed today. Ann Maxwell delivered of a fine boy</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":798,"lock":null}
20:13:19.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/8/846
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":846,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The thaw continues &amp; the  snow has disappeared. Blowing a gale of wind at WNW. Went by Dunn's coach to Newcastle Fixed the Hope for the Bursaton Walls to be loaded on Monday. Gave Stephenson orders to lay her the shore line. Dined at home at 3 then took wine with I Craig &amp; afterwards spent the evening At Tynemouth Castle with Captain French of The 80<sup>th</sup>. A large Hulk sailed today. Ann Maxwell delivered of a fine boy</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":798,"lock":null}
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/9/847
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":847,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning and Mild weather.  Wind SW. A great deal Of ice in the river. Walked up to the Ship. &amp; dine at the annual dinner of the Great Premium Club. Reduced my insurance in at to &pound;500 &amp; paid &pound;500 into the eligibles. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":799,"lock":null}
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/9/847
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":847,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning and Mild weather.  Wind SW. A great deal Of ice in the river. Walked up to the Ship. &amp; dine at the annual dinner of the Great Premium Club. Reduced my insurance in at to &pound;500 &amp; paid &pound;500 into the eligibles. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":799,"lock":null}
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/1/867
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":867,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning Wind SSW. Took physic &amp; stayed in the house all the morning. Mrs Dixon &amp; Tom Smith down to see Mrs Scott On board the Brodnick with R Peach &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":819,"lock":null}
20:13:19.246 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.247 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/1/867
20:13:19.247 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":867,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning Wind SSW. Took physic &amp; stayed in the house all the morning. Mrs Dixon &amp; Tom Smith down to see Mrs Scott On board the Brodnick with R Peach &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":819,"lock":null}
20:13:19.247 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/10/876
20:13:19.247 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":876,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dull &amp; thick weather &amp; rather cold. Blowing fresh at NSW. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon &amp; I Smith came down today for the purpose of having Mrs Scott's will read &amp; which not a little surprised all of us, a more extraordinary one perhaps never was: By it I am left the very handsome legacy of &pound;10 !!! the same to my brother, plainly proving &amp; confirming what her feelings towards us throughout life must have been, inveterately bad, &amp; carried to the grave with her. Peace go with her. I forgive her For all the mischief &amp; misery she Has caused in our family. The party left us in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":828,"lock":null}
20:13:19.247 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/10/876
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":876,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dull &amp; thick weather &amp; rather cold. Blowing fresh at NSW. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon &amp; I Smith came down today for the purpose of having Mrs Scott's will read &amp; which not a little surprised all of us, a more extraordinary one perhaps never was: By it I am left the very handsome legacy of &pound;10 !!! the same to my brother, plainly proving &amp; confirming what her feelings towards us throughout life must have been, inveterately bad, &amp; carried to the grave with her. Peace go with her. I forgive her For all the mischief &amp; misery she Has caused in our family. The party left us in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":828,"lock":null}
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/11/877
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":877,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but blowing hard from about west. Received at the bank for Salmon's debt &pound;88.9.3 for WBS &amp; deducted from it 20/- for my trouble &amp; &pound;11.6 money lent to Bob Marsh &amp; sec by WBS in London. Dined with I Finley, being less Of the confinement to the house. Received a letter from WBS </p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":829,"lock":null}
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/11/877
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":877,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but blowing hard from about west. Received at the bank for Salmon's debt &pound;88.9.3 for WBS &amp; deducted from it 20/- for my trouble &amp; &pound;11.6 money lent to Bob Marsh &amp; sec by WBS in London. Dined with I Finley, being less Of the confinement to the house. Received a letter from WBS </p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":829,"lock":null}
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/12/878
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":878,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather, but very windy at West. Received a letter from ABS in reply to their informing him of Mrs Scott's death, saying he cannot leave London before tonight or tomorrow morning Dined at home. Wes &amp; Fanny Smith excessively angry that we should claim the amount of taxes upon the house paid by us in error &amp; which ought to have been paid by Mrs Scott. Fanny inclined to be very violent, her conduct disgusting &amp; very insulting; displaying more regard for the money than for the aunt. Blew a perfect hurricane with heavy rain the afternoon</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":830,"lock":null}
20:13:19.248 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/12/878
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":878,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather, but very windy at West. Received a letter from ABS in reply to their informing him of Mrs Scott's death, saying he cannot leave London before tonight or tomorrow morning Dined at home. Wes &amp; Fanny Smith excessively angry that we should claim the amount of taxes upon the house paid by us in error &amp; which ought to have been paid by Mrs Scott. Fanny inclined to be very violent, her conduct disgusting &amp; very insulting; displaying more regard for the money than for the aunt. Blew a perfect hurricane with heavy rain the afternoon</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":830,"lock":null}
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/13/879
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":879,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but still Blowing very hard at NW. In the house All day</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":831,"lock":null}
