20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/14/880
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":880,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; blown very hard all day at west. Of course in the house. Fanny Smith again exceedingly violent today. More so than before &amp; insulting. Than I was obliged to speak to her in a way that had the effect of making her silent. Wonder ? Be at opposite William BS did not arrive until after 11 o'clock having called &amp; stopped a short time in Westgate Street. Went to bed from after his arrival.</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":832,"lock":null}
20:13:19.249 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
