20:13:19.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":868,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful spring day, quite warm weather. Went up to Newcastle by stream. The Courts so crowded could not get in. Dined &amp; stayed all night with D Dixon Tom Smith &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Hnoises</span> there</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":820,"lock":null}
20:13:19.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/20/887
20:13:19.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":887,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but blowing fresh at WNW. Norman &amp; I went by steam to Newcastle. Called at Dixons, Mr Loathinby's for the Dined &amp; stayed all night at Dixons</p>","pageId":806,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":839,"lock":null}
20:13:19.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
