20:13:19.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/24/891
20:13:19.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":891,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather wind WNW. Blowing fresh Dined on board the Cluanicucty with A Nicholson, A Harry, French &amp; I Wright There. Attended a meeting at the Northumberland circus <span class=highlight_yellow>raspectary</span> the Customs House &amp; approved  his departure to proceed to London</p>","pageId":807,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":843,"lock":null}
