20:13:19.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/3/869
20:13:19.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":869,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful Day. Wind SW. Returned to Shields by stream early with the intention of going back to help them but changed my mind &amp; dined at home. On board the Choice in the afternoon with A Harry &amp; A Nicholson &amp; at the Mulstream at night</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":821,"lock":null}
