20:13:19.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/1/899
20:13:19.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":899,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still very cold &amp; wind NE. Sea upon the bar. Dined at home. Captain Webb spent the evening with us</p>","pageId":809,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":851,"lock":null}
20:13:19.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
