20:13:19.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":899,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still very cold &amp; wind NE. Sea upon the bar. Dined at home. Captain Webb spent the evening with us</p>","pageId":809,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":851,"lock":null}
20:13:19.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/10/908
20:13:19.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":908,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning. Wind WNW Walk with J Tinley to Newcastle. WBS &amp; Mary Carf went up in Dunn's coach Torrents of rain the whole day after our arrival. Dined &amp; stayed all night at A Dixon</p>","pageId":811,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":860,"lock":null}
20:13:19.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
