20:13:19.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/16/915
20:13:19.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":915,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful warm morning. Wind W by S. The painters began painting the house. Repairing the doors, windows. &amp; Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Emma with us. WBS left us at &frac12; past 5 % o'clock by steam for Newcastle and thence to take the ship to London</p>","pageId":812,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":867,"lock":null}
