20:13:19.273 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":916,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine soft spring morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at W by S. Dined at home. Took tea with W Allen &amp; attended the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":868,"lock":null}
20:13:19.273 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/18/917
20:13:19.273 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":917,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind WNW. Went to church Rev Mark did duty &amp; gave us an excellent sermon I Tenby &amp; I walked to Tynemouth &amp; I afterwards dined with him, Mr Mark with us</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":869,"lock":null}
20:13:19.273 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
