20:13:19.279 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":922,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Received a note from In Carr of Walkers, that he could not see me to dinner today a fixed upon &amp; immediately me for next Tuesday. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Bulman cargo club &pound;1.12. Entrance on policy 1830. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":874,"lock":null}
20:13:19.279 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/24/923
20:13:19.279 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":923,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning with rain. Wind SE. Walked with Captain Webb to Tynmouth &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton at the Star &amp; Garter. Dined at house &amp; attended the whist club in the evening at the A Fenwicks. Rained very heavy  all the afternoon with the wind changed to N by W</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":875,"lock":null}
20:13:19.279 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/24/923
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":923,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning with rain. Wind SE. Walked with Captain Webb to Tynmouth &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton at the Star &amp; Garter. Dined at house &amp; attended the whist club in the evening at the A Fenwicks. Rained very heavy  all the afternoon with the wind changed to N by W</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":875,"lock":null}
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/25/924
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":924,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again &amp; glafs risen considerably since yesterday evening about 1 &frac12;  inch &amp; up to fair. Wind NNW. Attended morning wives. Dined with I Tealeg, Mrs Cumliff &amp; keifs of the These. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon; At the S <span class=highlight_yellow>Cellegator</span> off several ships went to sea, bound foreign, the Broderweck, 3 Brothers, Dalsymple, Hannah, Equity les. Spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Tealegs</span> A heavy rain at night.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":876,"lock":null}
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/25/924
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":924,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again &amp; glafs risen considerably since yesterday evening about 1 &frac12;  inch &amp; up to fair. Wind NNW. Attended morning wives. Dined with I Tealeg, Mrs Cumliff &amp; keifs of the These. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon; At the S <span class=highlight_yellow>Cellegator</span> off several ships went to sea, bound foreign, the Broderweck, 3 Brothers, Dalsymple, Hannah, Equity les. Spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Tealegs</span> A heavy rain at night.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":876,"lock":null}
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/26/925
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":925,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Teymouth; called at Libb's where I met Mrs Ildeston, he returned to Shields with <span class=highlight_yellow>bum</span>. Invited by him to go &amp; stay at <span class=highlight_yellow>Lnasoington</span> with Captain Webb. Dined at home. Jebbs &amp; Webb took wine with over at the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":877,"lock":null}
20:13:19.281 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.282 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/26/925
20:13:19.282 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":925,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Teymouth; called at Libb's where I met Mrs Ildeston, he returned to Shields with <span class=highlight_yellow>bum</span>. Invited by him to go &amp; stay at <span class=highlight_yellow>Lnasoington</span> with Captain Webb. Dined at home. Jebbs &amp; Webb took wine with over at the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":877,"lock":null}
20:13:19.282 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/27/926
20:13:19.282 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":926,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW.  Walked up to Sadlers at Lokiltsy Point and took lunch &amp; he &amp; I afterwards got onboard a steam boat &amp; went up to Walker where we dined with I Carr &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Returned to Shields in evening in a gig. Wind changed to SE</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":878,"lock":null}
