20:13:19.283 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":926,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW.  Walked up to Sadlers at Lokiltsy Point and took lunch &amp; he &amp; I afterwards got onboard a steam boat &amp; went up to Walker where we dined with I Carr &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Returned to Shields in evening in a gig. Wind changed to SE</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":878,"lock":null}
20:13:19.283 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/28/927
