20:13:19.283 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/29/928
20:13:19.283 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":928,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Took a walk to Tynemouth with <span class=highlight_yellow>Lt H</span><span class=highlight_yellow>arry</span>. Dined at home. Onboard the John Dunn in the evening with I <span class=highlight_yellow>Wesglot</span> &amp; afterwards at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":880,"lock":null}
20:13:19.284 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
