20:13:19.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":930,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning much like rain. Wind WSW Turned out a most beautiful day. Went with H Harry by steam to Newcastle. Could not fix the Hope, but almost determined to talk 11 Gr Kent to Dublin. Returned home to dinner. Tour Seventh A Harry &amp; Emma G: dined with me. Mark came in to wine. In the evening we went to whist club at Allens</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":882,"lock":null}
20:13:19.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/10/938
20:13:19.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":938,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind East blowing fresh &amp; heavy sea. Lower ladder off its put back left Shields </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":890,"lock":null}
20:13:19.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
