20:13:19.295 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":947,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind the same. Robert Ilderton &amp; I rose early &amp; rode over to the Till about 8 miles off where we spent the day in fishing &amp; had most excellent sport. I tickled &frac12; day of lays trout. Returned to Lemmington to supper</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":899,"lock":null}
20:13:19.295 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/19/948
20:13:19.295 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":948,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Amused ourselves this morning in shooting rooks. Rode over to Broom Park to call upon Mr Burrell, not at home.</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":900,"lock":null}
20:13:19.295 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
