20:13:19.298 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/23/952
20:13:19.298 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":952,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Went with the carriage in the morning to church. <span class=highlight_yellow>Pa</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ss</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ed</span> the afternoon in walking about the garden. In the evening a thick fog set in &amp; the wind from the SE.</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":904,"lock":null}
