20:13:19.322 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":989,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE blowing fresh. At the heavy roam. Called to see A Harry who was much better. Dined at home. Partook of a bottle of port at ward with Charlton Howard</p>","pageId":830,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":940,"lock":null}
