20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":998,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Allen. Turned out a very rainy afternoon. At the Mr Estream in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":949,"lock":null}
20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/11/999
20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":999,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a heavy fall of rain during the night. Wind NW. Captain Webb &amp; I intended going out fishing but the clouds looked so threatening we thought it prudent to stay on shore. Went with the Teinleys to L Midney at Biddick, dined  &amp; walked home in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":950,"lock":null}
20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/11/999
20:13:19.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":999,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a heavy fall of rain during the night. Wind NW. Captain Webb &amp; I intended going out fishing but the clouds looked so threatening we thought it prudent to stay on shore. Went with the Teinleys to L Midney at Biddick, dined  &amp; walked home in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":950,"lock":null}
20:13:19.324 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/13/1000
20:13:19.324 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1000,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW Captain Webb &amp; I with the boys went on a boat down to the rocks to fish but had no sport. Whilst there a part of the cliff gave way &amp; falling upon a poor girl who happened to be sitting underneath completely buried. She was soon dug out but dreadfully crushed &amp; quite dead. Her sister was close to her &amp; saw the accident. Returned home &amp; had some dinner at 5 o'clock. Spent the latter part of the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":951,"lock":null}
20:13:19.324 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/13/1000
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1000,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW Captain Webb &amp; I with the boys went on a boat down to the rocks to fish but had no sport. Whilst there a part of the cliff gave way &amp; falling upon a poor girl who happened to be sitting underneath completely buried. She was soon dug out but dreadfully crushed &amp; quite dead. Her sister was close to her &amp; saw the accident. Returned home &amp; had some dinner at 5 o'clock. Spent the latter part of the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":951,"lock":null}
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/14/1001
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1001,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning but rather dull. Wind SSW &amp; blowing hard. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the evening walked with Mark to Tynemouth. Heard this evening of Leddill having resigned! Consequently there is no possibility of a contest for the county</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":952,"lock":null}
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/14/1001
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1001,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning but rather dull. Wind SSW &amp; blowing hard. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the evening walked with Mark to Tynemouth. Heard this evening of Leddill having resigned! Consequently there is no possibility of a contest for the county</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":952,"lock":null}
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/15/1002
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1002,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning blowing fresh at SW. Walked up to Tynemouth, met Harry Nicholson &amp; Richardson who had been over the bar with the Harvey bound to <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascksaget</span>. Dined at home. Took wine with Richardson &amp; spent a very pleasant afternoon &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":953,"lock":null}
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.325 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/15/1002
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1002,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning blowing fresh at SW. Walked up to Tynemouth, met Harry Nicholson &amp; Richardson who had been over the bar with the Harvey bound to <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascksaget</span>. Dined at home. Took wine with Richardson &amp; spent a very pleasant afternoon &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":953,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/16/1003
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1003,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning But again blowing hard at WSW It large concussion of people with A professional gentleman with <span class=highlight_yellow>Baudr</span>, flags to went to Chester Whence they met the Bale &amp; brought him through the upper part of town to the George Tavern after which low sat down to an excellent &amp; well arranged discussion nearly 200 freehold all went off well. The latter part of the evening a glorious scene of drunk cuffs and confusion amongst the lower set of freeholders.</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":954,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/16/1003
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1003,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning But again blowing hard at WSW It large concussion of people with A professional gentleman with <span class=highlight_yellow>Baudr</span>, flags to went to Chester Whence they met the Bale &amp; brought him through the upper part of town to the George Tavern after which low sat down to an excellent &amp; well arranged discussion nearly 200 freehold all went off well. The latter part of the evening a glorious scene of drunk cuffs and confusion amongst the lower set of freeholders.</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":954,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/17/1004
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1004,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth Had a little rain. In the afternoon Henry Mark Nicklinson had a little Wiskey todd at Koddams. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening and finished off at the Duke of York (paid the <span class=highlight_yellow>su</span><span class=highlight_yellow>shious</span> wives the amount of &pound;16-10)</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":955,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/17/1004
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1004,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth Had a little rain. In the afternoon Henry Mark Nicklinson had a little Wiskey todd at Koddams. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening and finished off at the Duke of York (paid the <span class=highlight_yellow>su</span><span class=highlight_yellow>shious</span> wives the amount of &pound;16-10)</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":955,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/18/1005
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1005,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day with puffs of wind at WSW. Went to Church in the morning. Stayed at home in the evening walked to Tynemouth in large afternoon blaze of company thence</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":956,"lock":null}
20:13:19.326 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
