20:13:19.331 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1011,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Dined at home. In the afternoon walked round by the Doctor's garden &amp; the Bullring. In the evening at Tynemouth</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":962,"lock":null}
20:13:19.331 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/25/1012
20:13:19.331 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1012,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful sunny morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Could not go to church, having taken taken Cubebs. Our new vicar. Mr Reed preached today for the first time. Dined at home. A Harry and Allen took wine with me &amp; in the evening we walked to Tynemouth. An immense deal of company there</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":963,"lock":null}
20:13:19.331 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
