20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":992,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE Did not go to church. Walked to Tynemouth. Attended afternoon services A Mr Hicks preached. Dined with I Tealey &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth, an immense number of people there</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":943,"lock":null}
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/5/993
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":993,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind SE. Had a pleasant walk by the shore to Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; dined at home. Mark &amp; Webb came &amp; took wine with me. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening &amp; suppered at Marks</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":944,"lock":null}
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
