20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":993,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind SE. Had a pleasant walk by the shore to Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; dined at home. Mark &amp; Webb came &amp; took wine with me. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening &amp; suppered at Marks</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":944,"lock":null}
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/6/994
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":994,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull calm morning. Wind SW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Received &pound;4.9.2 balance of premium out of Hope club. Saw the exhibition of paintings which was very good. Walked with D Dixon out to Beaton. Dined &amp; stayed all night</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":945,"lock":null}
20:13:19.337 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.338 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/6/994
20:13:19.338 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":994,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull calm morning. Wind SW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Received &pound;4.9.2 balance of premium out of Hope club. Saw the exhibition of paintings which was very good. Walked with D Dixon out to Beaton. Dined &amp; stayed all night</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":945,"lock":null}
20:13:19.338 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/7/995
20:13:19.338 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":995,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy heavy thunder storm this morning. A deluge of rain. Wind SW &amp; afterwards NW. Set off after breakfast &amp; walked down to Shields between storms. After my arrival it commenced again &amp; continued the remainder of the day, heavy thunder &amp; rain. Dined at I Tealeys</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":946,"lock":null}
20:13:19.338 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/7/995
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":995,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy heavy thunder storm this morning. A deluge of rain. Wind SW &amp; afterwards NW. Set off after breakfast &amp; walked down to Shields between storms. After my arrival it commenced again &amp; continued the remainder of the day, heavy thunder &amp; rain. Dined at I Tealeys</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":946,"lock":null}
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/8/996
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":996,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine clear morning blowing fresh from W by N. Dined at home. Wrote to ABS &amp; sent him his inventory of <span class=highlight_yellow>fumition</span> &amp; by Mr Gosling who sets off for London in the morning. In the evening walked with H Harry to Tynemouth &amp; called in at the Duke of York on our way home</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":947,"lock":null}
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/8/996
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":996,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine clear morning blowing fresh from W by N. Dined at home. Wrote to ABS &amp; sent him his inventory of <span class=highlight_yellow>fumition</span> &amp; by Mr Gosling who sets off for London in the morning. In the evening walked with H Harry to Tynemouth &amp; called in at the Duke of York on our way home</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":947,"lock":null}
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/9/997
20:13:19.339 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":997,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy &amp; not <span class=highlight_yellow>walike</span> showers. Wind E. Walked up to the point &amp; dined with Sadlar, spent a pleasant day &amp; got home late in the evening.</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":948,"lock":null}
