20:13:19.348 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1040,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. A fresh breeze at NNE &amp; sea upon the bar. A great many ships from Archangel &amp; America passed yesterday. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":843,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":989,"lock":null}
20:13:19.348 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/2/1021
20:13:19.348 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1021,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning wind SW. Very Squally with a heavy shower about 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine with Allen &amp; afterwards went to the Doctor's Garden. In the evening at Tynemouth again.</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":972,"lock":null}
20:13:19.348 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
