20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1021,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning wind SW. Very Squally with a heavy shower about 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine with Allen &amp; afterwards went to the Doctor's Garden. In the evening at Tynemouth again.</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":972,"lock":null}
20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/20/1041
20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1041,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing hard from the N with a heavy sea upon the bar. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Expected C Milman to go to the concert, but he did not come. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":843,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":990,"lock":null}
20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
