20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1041,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing hard from the N with a heavy sea upon the bar. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Expected C Milman to go to the concert, but he did not come. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":843,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":990,"lock":null}
20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/21/1042
20:13:19.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1042,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning. Wind NNE. WBS went to Newcastle. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p>","pageId":843,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":991,"lock":null}
