20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1046,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a good deal of rain during the night. Wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at the George with Mr Weatherby &amp; Mr Barker, being licencing day. A very pleasant party.</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":994,"lock":null}
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/25/1047
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1047,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Dined at home. An idle day. A good many light ships got down. Received a letter from Stephenson of his arrival in London , the ship having sprung a leak in <font color=#BFBFBF>a </font>gale in the White sea. Made a great deal of water on her passage</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":995,"lock":null}
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/25/1047
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1047,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Dined at home. An idle day. A good many light ships got down. Received a letter from Stephenson of his arrival in London , the ship having sprung a leak in <font color=#BFBFBF>a </font>gale in the White sea. Made a great deal of water on her passage</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":995,"lock":null}
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/26/1048
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1048,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Been rain in the night. Wind N to NE &amp; WNW. Turned out a very fine day. Received a letter from J Chapman. William and I went out with our guns &amp; walked to Marsden Rock by the sands. Got to the top of the rock, a man having made steps up. Got a lunch there &amp; on our way home took a few glasses of punch with the sea breeze &amp; Phasine Society who has <span class=highlight_yellow>this tent</span> pitched on the cliffs.</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":996,"lock":null}
20:13:19.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
