20:13:19.355 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/30/1052
20:13:19.355 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1052,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Showers during the day. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":845,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1000,"lock":null}
20:13:19.355 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
