20:13:19.368 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1074,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning but calmer weather. Wind SW. J Drury &amp; Allen dined with me on board the Hope. Got five keels down</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1022,"lock":null}
20:13:19.368 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/22/1075
20:13:19.368 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1075,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. 8 more keels came down. Dines at home. At the Duke in the evening</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1023,"lock":null}
