20:13:19.368 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/23/1076
20:13:19.368 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1076,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; blowing hard at SE. On board the Hope, got the remainder of her coals Dined at home. H Harry had <span class=highlight_yellow>pusieto</span> on board the Hope.  In the afternoon. Got the new mainsail on board &amp; bent, fits very well. Stove out this evening to go to sea, but having a foul anchor was prevented. A pity being a fierce NW wind. At the Duke.</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1024,"lock":null}
