20:13:19.369 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1077,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at WSW. The Hope got to sea about &frac12; past 6 o'clock. At 7 o'clock turned out &amp; walked to Tynemouth. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Pelors &pound;1.15. &amp; E Reed &frac14; wages &pound;1.8.6. Walked to Tynemouth to the sale of the Suffolk's stores. Dined at home. In the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked to the new Quay &amp; afterwards called at the Pig &amp; Whistle. Spent the evening at William Harrisons</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1025,"lock":null}
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/25/1078
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1078,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing fresh at NW. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> came down &amp; spent the day with us. Finished the evening at H Harrys</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1026,"lock":null}
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/25/1078
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1078,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing fresh at NW. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> came down &amp; spent the day with us. Finished the evening at H Harrys</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1026,"lock":null}
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/26/1079
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1079,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning early, but about 9 o'clock a little rain. Wind WNW. Attended morning service &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ficinifs</span> from <span class=highlight_yellow>Po</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ta</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>d</span> preached. &amp; gave us a very good sermon. Sadler dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine. In the evening with Mary <span class=highlight_yellow>Mactp</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eeson</span></p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1027,"lock":null}
20:13:19.370 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/26/1079
20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1079,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning early, but about 9 o'clock a little rain. Wind WNW. Attended morning service &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ficinifs</span> from <span class=highlight_yellow>Po</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ta</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>d</span> preached. &amp; gave us a very good sermon. Sadler dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine. In the evening with Mary <span class=highlight_yellow>Mactp</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eeson</span></p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1027,"lock":null}
20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/27/1080
20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1080,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; very like more rain. Wind SSW. Dined at home. After dinner walked with H Harry up to Tynemouth and took punch with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Cu</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nningham</span>. Suppered off oysters at the Marstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1028,"lock":null}
20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
