20:13:19.371 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1080,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; very like more rain. Wind SSW. Dined at home. After dinner walked with H Harry up to Tynemouth and took punch with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Cu</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nningham</span>. Suppered off oysters at the Marstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1028,"lock":null}
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/28/1081
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1081,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind west. Attended a court at the George &amp; lunched with Mr Hodgson. Dined at 4 o'clock with In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1029,"lock":null}
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/28/1081
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1081,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind west. Attended a court at the George &amp; lunched with Mr Hodgson. Dined at 4 o'clock with In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1029,"lock":null}
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/29/1082
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1082,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a long walk round by the heigh end of the town. Preston &amp; by the fields to Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon waiting for me on my return. Dined &amp; spent a pleasant day at H Dales. At the Marlstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1030,"lock":null}
20:13:19.372 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.373 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/29/1082
20:13:19.373 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1082,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a long walk round by the heigh end of the town. Preston &amp; by the fields to Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon waiting for me on my return. Dined &amp; spent a pleasant day at H Dales. At the Marlstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1030,"lock":null}
20:13:19.373 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/3/1056
20:13:19.373 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1056,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very boisterous day with rain &amp; blowing hard from N by W to N &amp; NNE which brought on a heavy sea. HMS Cordelia came in. William &amp; I took the coach to Benton Lane &amp; walked up to Dixons, but they were at Belford.  Walked home to dinner. In the evening at a Quadrille party at J Tenby.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1004,"lock":null}
20:13:19.373 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/3/1056
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1056,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very boisterous day with rain &amp; blowing hard from N by W to N &amp; NNE which brought on a heavy sea. HMS Cordelia came in. William &amp; I took the coach to Benton Lane &amp; walked up to Dixons, but they were at Belford.  Walked home to dinner. In the evening at a Quadrille party at J Tenby.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1004,"lock":null}
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/30/1083
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1083,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home. On board the Brodewick in the afternoon In the evening went to a concert at the theatre at which Miss Hughes sang a march, beautiful voice &amp; fine execution. Suppered with Mr Tinley</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1031,"lock":null}
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/30/1083
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1083,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home. On board the Brodewick in the afternoon In the evening went to a concert at the theatre at which Miss Hughes sang a march, beautiful voice &amp; fine execution. Suppered with Mr Tinley</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1031,"lock":null}
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/4/1057
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1057,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calmer weather. Wind NE. Engaged with WBS preparing for his departure. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> with us. Dined at home. WBS embarked at 5 o'clock on board the Ahoy of <span class=highlight_yellow>Ed</span><span class=highlight_yellow>inb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rgh</span> Steamer for London. Wind changed to SSE. At the Duke &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Druries</span> in the evening.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1005,"lock":null}
20:13:19.374 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.375 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/4/1057
20:13:19.375 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1057,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calmer weather. Wind NE. Engaged with WBS preparing for his departure. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> with us. Dined at home. WBS embarked at 5 o'clock on board the Ahoy of <span class=highlight_yellow>Ed</span><span class=highlight_yellow>inb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rgh</span> Steamer for London. Wind changed to SSE. At the Duke &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Druries</span> in the evening.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1005,"lock":null}
20:13:19.375 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/5/1058
20:13:19.375 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1058,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. Attended morning service with the military. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Sadler dined with me. H Harry came in afterwards. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1006,"lock":null}
20:13:19.375 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
