20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/1/1178
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1178,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A slight frost during the night wind WSW.  Walked up to Beaton. Dined and stayed all night. Mr Allinson and their daughters dined there.  Emma Galbraith not very well and looking delicate.</p>","pageId":873,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1125,"lock":null}
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
