20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1178,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A slight frost during the night wind WSW.  Walked up to Beaton. Dined and stayed all night. Mr Allinson and their daughters dined there.  Emma Galbraith not very well and looking delicate.</p>","pageId":873,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1125,"lock":null}
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/10/1188
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1188,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, blowing fresh from NNE. Went by steam to Newcastle. Fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>ords</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Redheught</span> to be upheld 11/- freight go to WBS as factor, &amp; all profit above 11/- to be divided. Returned by coach. Attended the annual meeting of the Eligible and United clubs to alter &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>receive</span> the rules etc. Sat down a large party to dinner afterwards. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1134,"lock":null}
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/10/1188
20:13:19.378 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1188,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, blowing fresh from NNE. Went by steam to Newcastle. Fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>ords</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Redheught</span> to be upheld 11/- freight go to WBS as factor, &amp; all profit above 11/- to be divided. Returned by coach. Attended the annual meeting of the Eligible and United clubs to alter &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>receive</span> the rules etc. Sat down a large party to dinner afterwards. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1134,"lock":null}
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/11/1189
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1189,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp morning but likely to be finer weather. Wind NW. At the George tavern a great part of the morning. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> there, with whom &amp; a small party, I afterwards dined. Bob <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> &amp; I called at the Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p>Hope got 3 keels down.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1135,"lock":null}
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/11/1189
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1189,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp morning but likely to be finer weather. Wind NW. At the George tavern a great part of the morning. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> there, with whom &amp; a small party, I afterwards dined. Bob <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> &amp; I called at the Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p>Hope got 3 keels down.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1135,"lock":null}
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/12/1190
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1190,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy damp morning. A little wind <span class=highlight_yellow>lope at</span> appears to be W.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to WBS giving him a copy of Chapmans <span class=highlight_yellow>book on</span>. In the afternoon at the billiard room. Wrote to Tom Smith &amp; sent him some <span class=highlight_yellow>tripe</span>. Harry, Nicholas, Drury &amp; Cunningham came home with me in the evening &amp; played a rubber.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1136,"lock":null}
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/12/1190
20:13:19.379 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1190,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy damp morning. A little wind <span class=highlight_yellow>lope at</span> appears to be W.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to WBS giving him a copy of Chapmans <span class=highlight_yellow>book on</span>. In the afternoon at the billiard room. Wrote to Tom Smith &amp; sent him some <span class=highlight_yellow>tripe</span>. Harry, Nicholas, Drury &amp; Cunningham came home with me in the evening &amp; played a rubber.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1136,"lock":null}
20:13:19.380 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/13/1191
20:13:19.380 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1191,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An unpleasant foggy morning. Wind NW. Shanks called &amp; I gave him a draft on Chapmans for &pound;18.18 his bill for new windless repairs to the Hope. Gave Stephenson a draft on Chapmans for &pound;30. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening. 5 keels came down. None yesterday.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1137,"lock":null}
20:13:19.380 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/13/1191
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1191,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An unpleasant foggy morning. Wind NW. Shanks called &amp; I gave him a draft on Chapmans for &pound;18.18 his bill for new windless repairs to the Hope. Gave Stephenson a draft on Chapmans for &pound;30. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening. 5 keels came down. None yesterday.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1137,"lock":null}
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/14/1192
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1192,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning but rather frosty. Wind West. Got the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship of Gibson. This voyage <span class=highlight_yellow>6</span> ____ @ 42/- went on board with the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span>. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Geo </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Stoss</span> &pound;2 on account. Five more keels came down this morning. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at the theatre in the evening. The last <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> of the company performing this season. Engaged to dine with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Telbs</span> but did not go, rather unwell.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1138,"lock":null}
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/14/1192
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1192,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning but rather frosty. Wind West. Got the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship of Gibson. This voyage <span class=highlight_yellow>6</span> ____ @ 42/- went on board with the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span>. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Geo </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Stoss</span> &pound;2 on account. Five more keels came down this morning. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at the theatre in the evening. The last <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> of the company performing this season. Engaged to dine with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Telbs</span> but did not go, rather unwell.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1138,"lock":null}
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/15/1193
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1193,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy morning. Wind about west. On board the Hope, finished her loading, but did not go to sea, the weather having such an unsettled appearance &amp; wind so far from the southward. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Mr Gortlier R A at Tynemouth Place</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1139,"lock":null}
20:13:19.381 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
