20:13:19.382 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1193,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy morning. Wind about west. On board the Hope, finished her loading, but did not go to sea, the weather having such an unsettled appearance &amp; wind so far from the southward. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Mr Gortlier R A at Tynemouth Place</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1139,"lock":null}
20:13:19.382 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/16/1194
20:13:19.382 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1194,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind SW. Did not go to church as Mr Burdan was to sit in our pew to try how he liked it before he would determine upon taking it. Dined at home. Dr Drury &amp; friends came in &amp; took a glass of wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1140,"lock":null}
