20:13:19.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1181,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day. Wind ___. Dined at home. The Saturday night whist club with me in the evening. Kept it up till &frac12; past 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":874,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1128,"lock":null}
