20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1484,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but blowing hard from the SW. Gave Robert a draft on executors account for &frac12; years taxes &pound;9.5.2. Paid &pound;20 in executors account from my own. Money advanced me by WBS. Walked out &amp; called on Mr Robson. High Cheston. Dined at home at 5 o'clock &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1430,"lock":null}
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/15/1485
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1485,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Afterwards WNW. Went to Newcastle by steamer, called at Chapmans about their &pound;300 bill which they had negotiated upwards of a month ago. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Dined with H Nicholson &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1431,"lock":null}
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
