20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1485,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Afterwards WNW. Went to Newcastle by steamer, called at Chapmans about their &pound;300 bill which they had negotiated upwards of a month ago. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Dined with H Nicholson &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1431,"lock":null}
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/16/1486
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1486,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind W by N. After a breakfast walked to Tynemouth. Called upon &amp; lunched with W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Laidlers. Lounged about the Castle Yard all the afternoon. Dined with J Readhead &amp; Lockwood &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1432,"lock":null}
20:13:19.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/16/1486
20:13:19.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1486,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind W by N. After a breakfast walked to Tynemouth. Called upon &amp; lunched with W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Laidlers. Lounged about the Castle Yard all the afternoon. Dined with J Readhead &amp; Lockwood &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1432,"lock":null}
20:13:19.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/17/1487
20:13:19.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1487,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning blowing fresh at WNW. Went across the water to Shortridge's Glass works to order some claret glasses for Mr Lee according to patterns</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1433,"lock":null}
20:13:19.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/17/1487
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1487,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning blowing fresh at WNW. Went across the water to Shortridge's Glass works to order some claret glasses for Mr Lee according to patterns</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1433,"lock":null}
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/18/1488
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1488,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Went again to South Shields &amp; ordered 2 doz<font color=#BFBFBF>en</font> claret glasses. Played at billiards. Made up the Hope's Wyburg voyage. Dined at home &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1434,"lock":null}
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/18/1488
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1488,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Went again to South Shields &amp; ordered 2 doz<font color=#BFBFBF>en</font> claret glasses. Played at billiards. Made up the Hope's Wyburg voyage. Dined at home &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1434,"lock":null}
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/19/1489
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1489,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fair morning. Wind from SW. Got up early &amp; took Dunn's gig to Newcastle. Took a place in the Alnwick coach at 10 o'clock. Got there before 3 o'clock where most of the officers who intended dining at the mess had arrived. Sat down to dinner at 6 o'clock. Spent a very pleasant &amp; jovial evening &amp; kept it up until 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1435,"lock":null}
20:13:19.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/19/1489
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1489,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fair morning. Wind from SW. Got up early &amp; took Dunn's gig to Newcastle. Took a place in the Alnwick coach at 10 o'clock. Got there before 3 o'clock where most of the officers who intended dining at the mess had arrived. Sat down to dinner at 6 o'clock. Spent a very pleasant &amp; jovial evening &amp; kept it up until 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1435,"lock":null}
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/2/1472
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1472,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>At anchor off Erith. A cloudy morning with showers. Wind fresh from SSW after washing the decks &amp; trimming ballast, the ship having been by the stern, we got under way at about 11 o'clock &amp; beat down to the <span class=highlight_yellow>home</span> light where we brought up at 6 o'clock. The wind having changed during the day to S by W: S: &amp; S by E blowing fresh. Turned after a glass of grog between 8 &amp; 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":949,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1418,"lock":null}
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/2/1472
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1472,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>At anchor off Erith. A cloudy morning with showers. Wind fresh from SSW after washing the decks &amp; trimming ballast, the ship having been by the stern, we got under way at about 11 o'clock &amp; beat down to the <span class=highlight_yellow>home</span> light where we brought up at 6 o'clock. The wind having changed during the day to S by W: S: &amp; S by E blowing fresh. Turned after a glass of grog between 8 &amp; 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":949,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1418,"lock":null}
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/20/1490
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1490,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Did not rain till late. A fine morning. A fine morning. Walked about Alnwick. Left my card at Sir D Smith's. The <span class=highlight_yellow>Jefson</span> held the day. The <span class=highlight_yellow>heapesteutes</span> dined together. I dined with W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Forstes. A party there consisting of <span class=highlight_yellow>Chat</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span> MP, cap<font color=#BFBFBF>tain</font> Forster &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Justies</span> Hodgson MP etc. They all in the eve<font color=#BFBFBF>ning</font>s event to the Ball &amp; I dressed in my uniform having no other cloths with me with the intention of going but finding at the door that all the officers, even those who had promised to be in uniform were in plain cloths. I returned to the Inn, had a glass of brandy &amp; water &amp; went to bed</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1436,"lock":null}
20:13:19.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/20/1490
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1490,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Did not rain till late. A fine morning. A fine morning. Walked about Alnwick. Left my card at Sir D Smith's. The <span class=highlight_yellow>Jefson</span> held the day. The <span class=highlight_yellow>heapesteutes</span> dined together. I dined with W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Forstes. A party there consisting of <span class=highlight_yellow>Chat</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span> MP, cap<font color=#BFBFBF>tain</font> Forster &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Justies</span> Hodgson MP etc. They all in the eve<font color=#BFBFBF>ning</font>s event to the Ball &amp; I dressed in my uniform having no other cloths with me with the intention of going but finding at the door that all the officers, even those who had promised to be in uniform were in plain cloths. I returned to the Inn, had a glass of brandy &amp; water &amp; went to bed</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1436,"lock":null}
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/21/1491
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1491,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. The air rather frosty. Wind NSW. Left Alnwick by the Wonder coach at 10 o'clock, got to Newcastle before 3 o'clock, took a Shields gig &amp; got home in time to order dinner at 6 o'clock when Cha<font color=#BFBFBF>rle</font>s Redley came &amp; stayed all night. I spoke to Col<font color=#BFBFBF>onel  </font>Colson yesterday respecting the second gazetteer stating that I still considered myself very unhandsomely treated. <font color=#BFBFBF>I</font> showed him the Dukes letter but could get nothing out of him</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1437,"lock":null}
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/21/1491
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1491,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. The air rather frosty. Wind NSW. Left Alnwick by the Wonder coach at 10 o'clock, got to Newcastle before 3 o'clock, took a Shields gig &amp; got home in time to order dinner at 6 o'clock when Cha<font color=#BFBFBF>rle</font>s Redley came &amp; stayed all night. I spoke to Col<font color=#BFBFBF>onel  </font>Colson yesterday respecting the second gazetteer stating that I still considered myself very unhandsomely treated. <font color=#BFBFBF>I</font> showed him the Dukes letter but could get nothing out of him</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1437,"lock":null}
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/22/1492
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1492,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning blowing hard from the SW.</p>\r\n<p>Redley &amp; I walked to the newsroom, thence to Preston where we parted, he going on to Hartley. Saw Moore &amp; urged him to thrash &amp; sell everything. Dined at 5 o'clock alone. Stephenson called &amp; informed me the Eligible Committee had been on board surveyed the stores etc. &amp; reported the ship complete. Had got the dung out, the ship upon the shore to look at &amp; clean her bottom. Found her in good order, only a <span class=highlight_yellow>butts and or</span> two wanting caulking.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1438,"lock":null}
20:13:19.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/22/1492
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1492,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning blowing hard from the SW.</p>\r\n<p>Redley &amp; I walked to the newsroom, thence to Preston where we parted, he going on to Hartley. Saw Moore &amp; urged him to thrash &amp; sell everything. Dined at 5 o'clock alone. Stephenson called &amp; informed me the Eligible Committee had been on board surveyed the stores etc. &amp; reported the ship complete. Had got the dung out, the ship upon the shore to look at &amp; clean her bottom. Found her in good order, only a <span class=highlight_yellow>butts and or</span> two wanting caulking.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1438,"lock":null}
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/23/1493
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1493,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with showers &amp; SW wind. Did not go to church. At the newsroom all the morning. Dined at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Ed Chesterton dined with me. Lockerwood came in in the afternoon.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1439,"lock":null}
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/23/1493
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1493,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with showers &amp; SW wind. Did not go to church. At the newsroom all the morning. Dined at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Ed Chesterton dined with me. Lockerwood came in in the afternoon.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1439,"lock":null}
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/24/1494
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1494,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh from the SW. Lockerwood &amp; I walked up to Wallsend &amp; breakfasted with Potts. The hounds after breakfast were taken out. Charlton offered me his horse but I declined it. Laid the hounds on a <span class=highlight_yellow>bag</span> fox. Returned home. Dined with Readhead &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1440,"lock":null}
20:13:19.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/24/1494
20:13:19.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1494,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh from the SW. Lockerwood &amp; I walked up to Wallsend &amp; breakfasted with Potts. The hounds after breakfast were taken out. Charlton offered me his horse but I declined it. Laid the hounds on a <span class=highlight_yellow>bag</span> fox. Returned home. Dined with Readhead &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1440,"lock":null}
20:13:19.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/25/1495
20:13:19.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1495,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Heavy SW wind. Called at Chapman's &amp; settled for WBS to take up the &pound;300 note in London. They to give the executors account credit for &pound;200 &amp; take our note at 6 months for it. Wrote to WBS in answer to his letter received yesterday about it. Dined at home at 2 o'clock &amp; Lockwood &amp; I walked up afterwards to Billy Mill &amp; took wine with Charlton.</p>\r\n<p>At Bess in the evening</p>\r\n<p>Got &pound;5 of GH</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1441,"lock":null}
20:13:19.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
