20:13:19.409 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/26/1496
20:13:19.409 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1496,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning continues blowing hard from SW. Called upon Jobling at the George. Walked up to the ship, returned &amp; rode up with Jobling in his cart to Tynemouth. He &amp; his brother dined with me at 4 o'clock. In the evening at Mr Atkinson &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1442,"lock":null}
