20:13:19.409 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1497,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the whist club &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1443,"lock":null}
20:13:19.409 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
