20:13:19.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1521,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. At the newsroom in the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening with Bess. Jobling there.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1467,"lock":null}
20:13:19.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/21/1522
20:13:19.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
