20:13:19.432 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
20:13:19.432 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/30/1531
20:13:19.432 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
20:13:19.432 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/30/1531
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/4/1505
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1505,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Been showers in the night. Wind NW</p>\r\n<p>The Hope got to sea this morning's tide. Walked to Tynemouth and round by Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Wright. Dined with A Dale at 5 o'clock to meet the bridal party from Whitley park. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1451,"lock":null}
