20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1505,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Been showers in the night. Wind NW</p>\r\n<p>The Hope got to sea this morning's tide. Walked to Tynemouth and round by Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Wright. Dined with A Dale at 5 o'clock to meet the bridal party from Whitley park. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1451,"lock":null}
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/5/1506
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1506,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Went to Newcastle by steam. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;211.12.1 on WBS. Called at Angus about the carriage. Returned by steam. Dined with J Tinley &amp; in the evening at the whist club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1452,"lock":null}
20:13:19.433 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
