20:13:19.434 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1506,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Went to Newcastle by steam. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;211.12.1 on WBS. Called at Angus about the carriage. Returned by steam. Dined with J Tinley &amp; in the evening at the whist club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1452,"lock":null}
20:13:19.434 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/6/1507
20:13:19.434 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1507,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been showers in the night. A cold morning. Wind SW &amp; S by W. Did not go church. Walked round by Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. With Bess in the evening. A very wet night</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1453,"lock":null}
20:13:19.434 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
