20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1507,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been showers in the night. A cold morning. Wind SW &amp; S by W. Did not go church. Walked round by Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. With Bess in the evening. A very wet night</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1453,"lock":null}
20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/7/1508
20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1508,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but all the appearance of more rain. Glass very low. Wind WSW. Blew in heavy squalls during the day with showers. Made the Hopes last or 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage up. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, drank a glass of toddy with Lockwood &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1454,"lock":null}
