20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1508,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but all the appearance of more rain. Glass very low. Wind WSW. Blew in heavy squalls during the day with showers. Made the Hopes last or 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage up. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, drank a glass of toddy with Lockwood &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1454,"lock":null}
20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/8/1509
20:13:19.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
