20:13:19.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
20:13:19.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/9/1510
20:13:19.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1510,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Air frosty &amp; glass high. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Wilkinson &amp; Angus saying they could not purchase the carriage.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Jobling arrived &amp; agreed to stay with me. He dined with me at 2 o'clock. At the billiards room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Ordered 2 gallons of whiskey for one of which Jobling paid.</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1456,"lock":null}
20:13:19.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/9/1510
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1510,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Air frosty &amp; glass high. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Wilkinson &amp; Angus saying they could not purchase the carriage.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Jobling arrived &amp; agreed to stay with me. He dined with me at 2 o'clock. At the billiards room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Ordered 2 gallons of whiskey for one of which Jobling paid.</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1456,"lock":null}
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/1/1532
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/1/1532
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/10/1541
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
20:13:19.437 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.438 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/10/1541
20:13:19.438 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
20:13:19.438 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/11/1542
20:13:19.438 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
20:13:19.438 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/11/1542
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/12/1543
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/12/1543
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/13/1544
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
20:13:19.439 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.440 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/13/1544
20:13:19.440 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
20:13:19.440 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/14/1545
20:13:19.440 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
20:13:19.440 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.441 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/14/1545
20:13:19.441 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
20:13:19.441 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/15/1546
20:13:19.441 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
20:13:19.441 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.442 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/15/1546
20:13:19.442 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
20:13:19.442 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/16/1547
20:13:19.442 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1547,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Paid the Hope's piolet &pound;1.16 &amp; to 3 men for getting the ship chain hawser which she was obliged to ship &amp; leave behind &amp; for placing it on shore 7/6.</p>\r\n<p>Gave a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman</font>'s &amp; Co for self &pound;5</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Joblings brothers with us.</p>\r\n<p>At the theatre &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening blew a gale at SSE</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1493,"lock":null}
20:13:19.442 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/16/1547
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1547,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Paid the Hope's piolet &pound;1.16 &amp; to 3 men for getting the ship chain hawser which she was obliged to ship &amp; leave behind &amp; for placing it on shore 7/6.</p>\r\n<p>Gave a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman</font>'s &amp; Co for self &pound;5</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Joblings brothers with us.</p>\r\n<p>At the theatre &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening blew a gale at SSE</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1493,"lock":null}
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/17/1548
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1548,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, but fine weather. A fresh breeze from WSW &amp; SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;216.10.6 at 60 days from the 14 Dec.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Dixon Dixon. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Lockwood dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. At the whist club with me at Ben Wrights</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1494,"lock":null}
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/17/1548
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1548,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, but fine weather. A fresh breeze from WSW &amp; SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;216.10.6 at 60 days from the 14 Dec.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Dixon Dixon. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Lockwood dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. At the whist club with me at Ben Wrights</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1494,"lock":null}
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/18/1549
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
20:13:19.443 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.444 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/18/1549
20:13:19.444 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
20:13:19.444 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/19/1550
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/19/1550
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/2/1533
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1533,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Thick cold weather wind WNW. The committee of the Eligible &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Whcatley</span> as a member of the Hope Club committee, went on board the Hope &amp; surveyed her &amp; found her much strained &amp; they readily agreed to give her a caulking, if I were willing to accept it &amp; not strip her etc. two warps a <span class=highlight_yellow>trwlinge</span> &amp; studding sail continued. Set the men on to work after dinner.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Messrs Hurry &amp; Co. <font color=#BFBFBF>of </font>Yarmouth acknowledging the receipt of these accounts &amp; vouchers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with a party at Gordons at Tynemouth Place at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1479,"lock":null}
20:13:19.445 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.446 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/2/1533
20:13:19.446 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1533,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Thick cold weather wind WNW. The committee of the Eligible &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Whcatley</span> as a member of the Hope Club committee, went on board the Hope &amp; surveyed her &amp; found her much strained &amp; they readily agreed to give her a caulking, if I were willing to accept it &amp; not strip her etc. two warps a <span class=highlight_yellow>trwlinge</span> &amp; studding sail continued. Set the men on to work after dinner.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Messrs Hurry &amp; Co. <font color=#BFBFBF>of </font>Yarmouth acknowledging the receipt of these accounts &amp; vouchers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with a party at Gordons at Tynemouth Place at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1479,"lock":null}
20:13:19.446 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/20/1551
20:13:19.446 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1551,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Found myself at Bess's this morning. Where I remained all day. Went home a little after 5 o'clock. Showed myself at the newsroom. Had two glasses of toddy with H Harry &amp; Charlton at the Albion &amp; returned in the evening to Bess's</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1497,"lock":null}
20:13:19.446 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.447 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/20/1551
20:13:19.447 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1551,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Found myself at Bess's this morning. Where I remained all day. Went home a little after 5 o'clock. Showed myself at the newsroom. Had two glasses of toddy with H Harry &amp; Charlton at the Albion &amp; returned in the evening to Bess's</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1497,"lock":null}
20:13:19.447 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/21/1552
20:13:19.447 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1552,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after rain. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; back to dinner at 2 o'clock. Jobling got down today. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1498,"lock":null}
20:13:19.447 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
