20:13:19.451 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/27/1558
20:13:19.451 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1558,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Variously employed during the day. Dined with Lockwood at 6 o'clock. Called at Bess's &amp; went to the Ball in the evening. Not numerously attended. Did not get home till 6 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1504,"lock":null}
20:13:19.451 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
