20:13:19.453 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1560,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went up to the new quay with Drury. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Attended the whist club in the evening. Called at Bess's but slept at home.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1506,"lock":null}
20:13:19.453 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/3/1534
20:13:19.453 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1534,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. At the dock the men 21 busy caulking. Stephenson &amp; the carpenter found the ship in good order &amp; not at all broken. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At the billiard room. Called to see Bess &amp; at night at the club at Drury</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1480,"lock":null}
20:13:19.453 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
