20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1562,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At the billiard room. Spent the evening with Bess. Boswell &amp; Nicholson there.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1508,"lock":null}
20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/4/1535
20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1535,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning. Afterwards cleared away &amp; turned out fine. Wind W by N. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1481,"lock":null}
