20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1535,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning. Afterwards cleared away &amp; turned out fine. Wind W by N. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1481,"lock":null}
20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/5/1536
20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1536,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Jobley, Boswell &amp; H Harry dined with me on board the Hope. At Mr Atkinson's in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1482,"lock":null}
20:13:19.455 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.456 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/5/1536
20:13:19.456 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1536,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Jobley, Boswell &amp; H Harry dined with me on board the Hope. At Mr Atkinson's in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1482,"lock":null}
20:13:19.456 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/6/1537
20:13:19.456 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1537,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, after rain &amp; blowing very heavy from WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach, called on bell &amp; Brown to let them know when the Hope would be out of dock. Saw Emma Galbraith who was quite well. Returned to Shields by steam. At the ship. Dined with Dr Drury.  At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1483,"lock":null}
20:13:19.456 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/6/1537
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1537,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, after rain &amp; blowing very heavy from WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach, called on bell &amp; Brown to let them know when the Hope would be out of dock. Saw Emma Galbraith who was quite well. Returned to Shields by steam. At the ship. Dined with Dr Drury.  At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1483,"lock":null}
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/7/1538
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/7/1538
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/8/1539
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
20:13:19.457 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
