20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/9/1540
20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1540,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a great deal of rain during the night. Wind WSW. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1486,"lock":null}
20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/1/1210
20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1210,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Such a winters day. Blowing very hard at ESE and frosty. Wind increased to a perfect hurricane with one continuous shower of snow all day. I fear we shall have bad accounts of the shipping, many vessels being upon the coast. Dined at home and in the evening at the Mulstrum</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":883,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1156,"lock":null}
20:13:19.459 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.460 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/1/1210
20:13:19.460 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1210,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Such a winters day. Blowing very hard at ESE and frosty. Wind increased to a perfect hurricane with one continuous shower of snow all day. I fear we shall have bad accounts of the shipping, many vessels being upon the coast. Dined at home and in the evening at the Mulstrum</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":883,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1156,"lock":null}
20:13:19.460 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/10/1221
20:13:19.460 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1221,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful mild spring morning. Wind fresh at about W by S. A great deal of damage done last night amongst the shipping.</p> <p></p> <p>Lunched on board the Choice. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, being my birthday, had a party of friends consisting of J &amp; H Dale, H Harry, Mark, H Nicholas &amp; Drury &amp; spent a very pleasant day.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1167,"lock":null}
20:13:19.460 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/10/1221
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1221,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful mild spring morning. Wind fresh at about W by S. A great deal of damage done last night amongst the shipping.</p> <p></p> <p>Lunched on board the Choice. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, being my birthday, had a party of friends consisting of J &amp; H Dale, H Harry, Mark, H Nicholas &amp; Drury &amp; spent a very pleasant day.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1167,"lock":null}
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/11/1222
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1222,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful day. Quite spring weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>In consequence of late <span class=highlight_yellow>homes</span> etc last night &amp; did not breakfast &lsquo;<span class=highlight_yellow>till</span> 12 o'clock. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1168,"lock":null}
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/11/1222
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1222,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful day. Quite spring weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>In consequence of late <span class=highlight_yellow>homes</span> etc last night &amp; did not breakfast &lsquo;<span class=highlight_yellow>till</span> 12 o'clock. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1168,"lock":null}
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/12/1223
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1223,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A delightful morning. Quite spring, mild weather. A light air from about W.  Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at H Harry's in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1169,"lock":null}
20:13:19.461 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
