20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1253,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.4151682,-1.7032641,607m/data=!3m1!1e3?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2754-castle-alnwick.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Alnwick Castle</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":894,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1199,"lock":null}
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/15/1254
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1254,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold evening. Appearance of rain. Wind SSW. Attended drill at 10 o'clock for an hour &amp; half. <span class=highlight_yellow>Portmonteau</span> arrived from town with my red coat etc. Attended drill at 2 o'clock again but for a short time in consequence of the rain. Turned out a very wet day. Dined at Messrs at 6 o'clock &amp; sat rather late.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1200,"lock":null}
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/15/1254
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1254,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold evening. Appearance of rain. Wind SSW. Attended drill at 10 o'clock for an hour &amp; half. <span class=highlight_yellow>Portmonteau</span> arrived from town with my red coat etc. Attended drill at 2 o'clock again but for a short time in consequence of the rain. Turned out a very wet day. Dined at Messrs at 6 o'clock &amp; sat rather late.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1200,"lock":null}
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/16/1255
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1255,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning blowing a cool fresh breeze at SW. Attended parade &amp; marched to the pasture to drill. Drill again in the afternoon. Dined at the mess. Turned out a very wet day.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1201,"lock":null}
20:13:19.486 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
