20:13:19.487 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/16/1256
20:13:19.487 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1256,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":16,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1202,"lock":null}
20:13:19.487 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/17/1257
20:13:19.487 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1257,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning early but afterwards turned very wet. Wind SW. Attended parade, but could not march in consequence of the appearance of rain and the wetness of the ground. Captain Coulson arrived this morning. Drilled in the pasture in the afternoon. Wrote to WBS. Dined at the Mess. Captain Bigg met his com<font color=#BFBFBF>pany</font> with 6 bottles of port &amp; 3 of claret</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1203,"lock":null}
20:13:19.487 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.488 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/17/1257
20:13:19.488 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1257,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning early but afterwards turned very wet. Wind SW. Attended parade, but could not march in consequence of the appearance of rain and the wetness of the ground. Captain Coulson arrived this morning. Drilled in the pasture in the afternoon. Wrote to WBS. Dined at the Mess. Captain Bigg met his com<font color=#BFBFBF>pany</font> with 6 bottles of port &amp; 3 of claret</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1203,"lock":null}
20:13:19.488 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/18/1258
