20:13:19.488 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.489 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/18/1258
20:13:19.489 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1258,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. Parade morning &amp; afternoon &amp; dinner as usual at 6 o'clock</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1204,"lock":null}
20:13:19.489 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/19/1259
20:13:19.489 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1259,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Parade &amp; dinner as usual. <del>Captain </del><del>Bigg</del><del> finished the meeting</del> <span class=highlight_yellow>went</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>late</span>. Consequently did not get to bed <del>until 4 o'clock with</del> until late. Gave &frac12; doz<font color=#BFBFBF>en bottles</font><font color=#BFBFBF> of</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font>port &amp; &frac12; doz<font color=#BFBFBF>en</font> <font color=#BFBFBF>bottles of </font>claret.</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1205,"lock":null}
