20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1262,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.4110752,-1.7082778,3a,85.6y,200.94h,97.02t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sEpkBHGOg9bPekbR1GlrjGw!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2754-the-bull-alnwick.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>The Bull at Alnwick</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":894,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1208,"lock":null}
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/22/1263
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1263,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; rather cool. Wind SE. Did not march to the pasture having been rain in the night &amp; ground very wet. Dined at the mess. Towsouille &amp; others strangers there. Afterwards went to the Bull which was very gay &amp; well attended. After the Bull, suppered with Potts</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1209,"lock":null}
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
