20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1263,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; rather cool. Wind SE. Did not march to the pasture having been rain in the night &amp; ground very wet. Dined at the mess. Towsouille &amp; others strangers there. Afterwards went to the Bull which was very gay &amp; well attended. After the Bull, suppered with Potts</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1209,"lock":null}
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/23/1264
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1264,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning. Wind NE. At morning drill marched to the pasture &amp; back. Wrote to WBS &amp; attended afternoon parade at 2 o'clock in the pasture. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> D </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Sucth</span></p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1210,"lock":null}
20:13:19.492 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/23/1264
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1264,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning. Wind NE. At morning drill marched to the pasture &amp; back. Wrote to WBS &amp; attended afternoon parade at 2 o'clock in the pasture. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> D </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Sucth</span></p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1210,"lock":null}
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/24/1265
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1265,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold. Wind NE. Attended morning drill in the pasture. Marched round with my company for the first time. Marched to the pasture again in the afternoon at 2 o'clock marched past slow &amp; quick time &amp; went through the manoeuvres. The two  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ric</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>har</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>ds</span> &amp; I went in <span class=highlight_yellow>chaise</span> to dine with <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r Bur</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rell</span> BroomPark. Spent a pleasant day &amp; got home at 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1211,"lock":null}
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/24/1265
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1265,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold. Wind NE. Attended morning drill in the pasture. Marched round with my company for the first time. Marched to the pasture again in the afternoon at 2 o'clock marched past slow &amp; quick time &amp; went through the manoeuvres. The two  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ric</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>har</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>ds</span> &amp; I went in <span class=highlight_yellow>chaise</span> to dine with <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r Bur</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rell</span> BroomPark. Spent a pleasant day &amp; got home at 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1211,"lock":null}
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/25/1266
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1266,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Exceptionally cold. East wind with showers. Attended 10 o'clock drill, but did not go to the pasture. Received a letter from WBS of the safe arrival of the Hop at London, but not able to sell her coals, the <span class=highlight_yellow>proves</span> quite light. Lunched with W Torston. At 2 o'clock parade marched to the pasture &amp; went through the manoeuvres. Returned earlier than usual in consequence of the rain. Dined at the mess. A stranger day, but a small party. The band had a concert at the Town hall. I took a ticket but <font color=#BFBFBF>did </font>not go.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1212,"lock":null}
20:13:19.494 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/25/1266
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1266,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Exceptionally cold. East wind with showers. Attended 10 o'clock drill, but did not go to the pasture. Received a letter from WBS of the safe arrival of the Hop at London, but not able to sell her coals, the <span class=highlight_yellow>proves</span> quite light. Lunched with W Torston. At 2 o'clock parade marched to the pasture &amp; went through the manoeuvres. Returned earlier than usual in consequence of the rain. Dined at the mess. A stranger day, but a small party. The band had a concert at the Town hall. I took a ticket but <font color=#BFBFBF>did </font>not go.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1212,"lock":null}
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/26/1267
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1267,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Wind E but with heavy showers of rain &amp; sleet. Continued raining very heavy all day, so that we could not have any parade. Dined at the mess</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1213,"lock":null}
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/26/1267
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1267,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Wind E but with heavy showers of rain &amp; sleet. Continued raining very heavy all day, so that we could not have any parade. Dined at the mess</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1213,"lock":null}
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/27/1268
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1268,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NE. After breakfast got the Johnston's horse &amp; rode to Togston stopping at Warkworth where I met the Smith's after church. Called upon Mr Clatterbuck. Mrs Watson there. Messrs Watson &amp; Mr Burn. Dined &amp; stayed all night at Togston</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1214,"lock":null}
20:13:19.495 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
