20:13:19.496 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1268,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NE. After breakfast got the Johnston's horse &amp; rode to Togston stopping at Warkworth where I met the Smith's after church. Called upon Mr Clatterbuck. Mrs Watson there. Messrs Watson &amp; Mr Burn. Dined &amp; stayed all night at Togston</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1214,"lock":null}
