20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1276,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@54.9712348,-1.6197996,3a,75y,248.87h,99.1t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sjkW-FSICa3Xaw_UO-Et8nA!2e0!7i16384!8i8192?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2758-charlotte-square-newcastle.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Charlotte Square, Newcastle</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":895,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1222,"lock":null}
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/2/1277
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1277,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very cold. Lockerand breakfasted with me &amp; we went up to Newcastle together by Duma coach. Called at Westgate Street, saw the Dixons and Emma Galbraith who was looking very well &amp; is spending her Easter holidays there. Wrote to WBS. Dined with D Dixon at Tom Fenwick in Charlotte Square. Met a party there. Slept at Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Willi</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span></p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1223,"lock":null}
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/2/1277
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1277,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very cold. Lockerand breakfasted with me &amp; we went up to Newcastle together by Duma coach. Called at Westgate Street, saw the Dixons and Emma Galbraith who was looking very well &amp; is spending her Easter holidays there. Wrote to WBS. Dined with D Dixon at Tom Fenwick in Charlotte Square. Met a party there. Slept at Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Willi</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span></p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1223,"lock":null}
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/20/1298
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1298,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but rather damp morning. Wind ESE. The charter for the Hope arrived by the post from Hull. The Merchants Messrs Wade Sons &amp; Forster Wybury &amp; Hull. 70/ for <span class=highlight_yellow>deals</span> &amp; buttons. The latter not to exceed 6/8. Ordered 3 casks or pork of Bradshaws &amp; 5 <span class=highlight_yellow>loaves</span> of bread of Walkerley &amp; a new main topgallantsail. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon H Harry gave the Doctor &amp; me some wine at the Northumberland Alms. Afterwards at the Abbey &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1244,"lock":null}
20:13:19.511 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/20/1298
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1298,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but rather damp morning. Wind ESE. The charter for the Hope arrived by the post from Hull. The Merchants Messrs Wade Sons &amp; Forster Wybury &amp; Hull. 70/ for <span class=highlight_yellow>deals</span> &amp; buttons. The latter not to exceed 6/8. Ordered 3 casks or pork of Bradshaws &amp; 5 <span class=highlight_yellow>loaves</span> of bread of Walkerley &amp; a new main topgallantsail. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon H Harry gave the Doctor &amp; me some wine at the Northumberland Alms. Afterwards at the Abbey &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1244,"lock":null}
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/21/1299
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1299,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold morning. Wind NE. Paid into Chapmans the <span class=highlight_yellow>hote</span> for &pound;97.9. Gave Stephenson &pound;50. Got the pork, bread etc on board. Had a few friends to dine with me at 5 o'clock. <span class=highlight_yellow>veg</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Te</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nley's</span> Rudyard 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment Dick artillery J Wright &amp; Boswell.</p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1245,"lock":null}
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/21/1299
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1299,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold morning. Wind NE. Paid into Chapmans the <span class=highlight_yellow>hote</span> for &pound;97.9. Gave Stephenson &pound;50. Got the pork, bread etc on board. Had a few friends to dine with me at 5 o'clock. <span class=highlight_yellow>veg</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Te</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nley's</span> Rudyard 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment Dick artillery J Wright &amp; Boswell.</p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1245,"lock":null}
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/22/1300
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1300,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but cool with a NE wind. Got a cask of rum on board the Hope. Ordered the men on shore as they refused to sign articles for less than &pound;3 per month. Stephenson at Newcastle clearing.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Ministries in a minority of eight upon Gen<font color=#BFBFBF>era</font>l  Gascoyne's amendment on the reform bill respecting English members. Attended a meeting at the George tavern called in consequence of the minister being in the minority for the purpose of explaining their determination to support them in their proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>grievances</span> &amp; not to give any candidate a vote until he promises to support reform.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Finished at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p><u> </u></p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1246,"lock":null}
20:13:19.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/22/1300
20:13:19.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1300,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but cool with a NE wind. Got a cask of rum on board the Hope. Ordered the men on shore as they refused to sign articles for less than &pound;3 per month. Stephenson at Newcastle clearing.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Ministries in a minority of eight upon Gen<font color=#BFBFBF>era</font>l  Gascoyne's amendment on the reform bill respecting English members. Attended a meeting at the George tavern called in consequence of the minister being in the minority for the purpose of explaining their determination to support them in their proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>grievances</span> &amp; not to give any candidate a vote until he promises to support reform.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Finished at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p><u> </u></p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1246,"lock":null}
20:13:19.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/23/1301
20:13:19.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1301,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold day &amp; blowing fresh from NNE &amp; sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Called at Chapmans, Mr Spence declines answering our note, but proposes continuing the <span class=highlight_yellow>loan</span> on my giving a bill upon WBS to have his acceptance, the <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> to be afterward agreed upon when I secure WBS's answer. Walked up to the ship, all ready for sea, excepting <span class=highlight_yellow>wind</span>. Towed her down to the low end of the town. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand in the afternoon &amp; at the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1247,"lock":null}
20:13:19.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/23/1301
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1301,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold day &amp; blowing fresh from NNE &amp; sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Called at Chapmans, Mr Spence declines answering our note, but proposes continuing the <span class=highlight_yellow>loan</span> on my giving a bill upon WBS to have his acceptance, the <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> to be afterward agreed upon when I secure WBS's answer. Walked up to the ship, all ready for sea, excepting <span class=highlight_yellow>wind</span>. Towed her down to the low end of the town. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand in the afternoon &amp; at the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1247,"lock":null}
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/24/1302
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1302,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind NNE &amp; much sea. A good deal of rain during the day. An account this morning of there being having prorogued parliament in person.  Dined at home. Took wine with the doctor &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1248,"lock":null}
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/24/1302
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1302,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind NNE &amp; much sea. A good deal of rain during the day. An account this morning of there being having prorogued parliament in person.  Dined at home. Took wine with the doctor &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1248,"lock":null}
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/25/1303
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1303,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NNE. Paid by draft on executors account &frac12; years taxes &pound;14.7.11 &amp; on my own account {premium &pound;8.17, own account &pound;10.15, WBS &pound;5} &pound;24.12. Dined on board the Hope, H Harry &amp; Webb with me. Finished off at the Albion.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1249,"lock":null}
20:13:19.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/25/1303
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1303,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NNE. Paid by draft on executors account &frac12; years taxes &pound;14.7.11 &amp; on my own account {premium &pound;8.17, own account &pound;10.15, WBS &pound;5} &pound;24.12. Dined on board the Hope, H Harry &amp; Webb with me. Finished off at the Albion.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1249,"lock":null}
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/26/1304
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1304,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy rainy day. Wind SE &amp; SSE. Some ships went to sea amongst them the Geronimi. We could not get men &amp; were therefore obliged to lay. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1250,"lock":null}
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/26/1304
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1304,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy rainy day. Wind SE &amp; SSE. Some ships went to sea amongst them the Geronimi. We could not get men &amp; were therefore obliged to lay. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1250,"lock":null}
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/27/1305
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1305,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy &amp; rainy morning &amp; but little wind at SSW. Got our men this morning for &pound;2.17.6 per month &amp; have the ship out. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon the Hope sailed with a fresh breeze at SSE. Finished at the Albion. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1251,"lock":null}
20:13:19.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/27/1305
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1305,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy &amp; rainy morning &amp; but little wind at SSW. Got our men this morning for &pound;2.17.6 per month &amp; have the ship out. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon the Hope sailed with a fresh breeze at SSE. Finished at the Albion. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1251,"lock":null}
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/28/1306
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1306,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still dull &amp; looks like more rain. Called and saw Mr Spear who agreed to take out joint note payable at <span class=highlight_yellow>neis</span>. Leis for the loan of &pound;300 at 4 or 6 months. Wrote to WBS to that effect. Dined with the Committees of the Eligible &amp; United clubs. In the evening at the Malstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1252,"lock":null}
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/28/1306
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1306,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still dull &amp; looks like more rain. Called and saw Mr Spear who agreed to take out joint note payable at <span class=highlight_yellow>neis</span>. Leis for the loan of &pound;300 at 4 or 6 months. Wrote to WBS to that effect. Dined with the Committees of the Eligible &amp; United clubs. In the evening at the Malstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1252,"lock":null}
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/29/1307
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1307,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Went with Lockwood by Dunn's coach to Newcastle &amp; put up at the Turf Hotel where we also dined at the Wallsend Hunt dinner &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1253,"lock":null}
20:13:19.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/29/1307
20:13:19.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1307,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Went with Lockwood by Dunn's coach to Newcastle &amp; put up at the Turf Hotel where we also dined at the Wallsend Hunt dinner &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1253,"lock":null}
20:13:19.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/3/1278
20:13:19.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
20:13:19.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/3/1278
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/30/1308
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1308,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy day. Wind continues from SE. The election for Newcastle took place. I went to the Guild Hall but I could not get near enough to the hustings to hear any part of the speeches. For Mr Ridley &amp; Mr Hodgson returned without opposition. Lucky fellows. Saw them chained. Had a lunch at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by Dunn. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1254,"lock":null}
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/30/1308
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1308,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy day. Wind continues from SE. The election for Newcastle took place. I went to the Guild Hall but I could not get near enough to the hustings to hear any part of the speeches. For Mr Ridley &amp; Mr Hodgson returned without opposition. Lucky fellows. Saw them chained. Had a lunch at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by Dunn. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1254,"lock":null}
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1279
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1279,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.0041194,-1.4447524,3a,75y,339.81h,100.97t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sNXfk0bvCxm_VYD96i4mOOQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2758-northumberland-alms-tynemouth.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Northumbrland Alms, Tynemouth</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":895,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1225,"lock":null}
20:13:19.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1279
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1279,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.0041194,-1.4447524,3a,75y,339.81h,100.97t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sNXfk0bvCxm_VYD96i4mOOQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2758-northumberland-alms-tynemouth.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Northumbrland Alms, Tynemouth</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":895,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1225,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1280
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1280,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind changed to WNW. Settled Robert's book &amp; paid him &pound;13.-1<sup>d</sup> my private expenses for the year up to this time. Looked into the Duke's court. Went to Tynemouth races. A great many people there. Dined at 4 o'clock at the Northumberland Alms with McBain &amp; the jury. Called in the evening at the Mulstrum. Wind changed to east.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1226,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1280
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1280,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind changed to WNW. Settled Robert's book &amp; paid him &pound;13.-1<sup>d</sup> my private expenses for the year up to this time. Looked into the Duke's court. Went to Tynemouth races. A great many people there. Dined at 4 o'clock at the Northumberland Alms with McBain &amp; the jury. Called in the evening at the Mulstrum. Wind changed to east.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1226,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/5/1281
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1281,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Turned out rather showery. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Jibbs &amp; afterwards went to the Sands to see the races. Lockerwood and Charlton gave us wine in the evening &amp; finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1227,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/5/1281
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1281,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Turned out rather showery. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Jibbs &amp; afterwards went to the Sands to see the races. Lockerwood and Charlton gave us wine in the evening &amp; finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1227,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/6/1282
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1282,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind changeable being <span class=highlight_yellow>raily</span> in the morning from the west &amp; afterwards NE. Received a letter from WBS. Called on Mr Robinson but got no money. The W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Shand, Boswell arrived from Rotterdam. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth nut nothing doing. In the evening at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1228,"lock":null}
20:13:19.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/6/1282
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1282,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind changeable being <span class=highlight_yellow>raily</span> in the morning from the west &amp; afterwards NE. Received a letter from WBS. Called on Mr Robinson but got no money. The W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Shand, Boswell arrived from Rotterdam. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth nut nothing doing. In the evening at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1228,"lock":null}
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/7/1283
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1283,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Afterwards turned out a most beautiful day, wind a little to E of S. Wrote to WBS with a account of rents. Afterwards J Cunningham &amp; I started &amp; had a most delightful walk to <span class=highlight_yellow>Hastley</span> where we dined with C Ridley &amp; walked home again in the evening. But before we reached Tynemouth at 6 o'clock we were caught in a heavy rain &amp; got thoroughly wet. After taking a glass of whiskey Toddy with JC to keep the cold out, made the best of my way home &amp; changed my cloths &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1229,"lock":null}
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/7/1283
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1283,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Afterwards turned out a most beautiful day, wind a little to E of S. Wrote to WBS with a account of rents. Afterwards J Cunningham &amp; I started &amp; had a most delightful walk to <span class=highlight_yellow>Hastley</span> where we dined with C Ridley &amp; walked home again in the evening. But before we reached Tynemouth at 6 o'clock we were caught in a heavy rain &amp; got thoroughly wet. After taking a glass of whiskey Toddy with JC to keep the cold out, made the best of my way home &amp; changed my cloths &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1229,"lock":null}
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/8/1284
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1284,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at SE. &amp; suddenly changed to SW. With most beautiful spring weather. J Cunningham &amp; I walked up to the Doctors garden &amp; round by Preston when I had some <span class=highlight_yellow>talk</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Moon</span>. Dined at home. Dined at home. Took a long walk in the afternoon round by Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1230,"lock":null}
20:13:19.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/8/1284
20:13:19.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1284,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at SE. &amp; suddenly changed to SW. With most beautiful spring weather. J Cunningham &amp; I walked up to the Doctors garden &amp; round by Preston when I had some <span class=highlight_yellow>talk</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Moon</span>. Dined at home. Dined at home. Took a long walk in the afternoon round by Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1230,"lock":null}
20:13:19.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/9/1285
20:13:19.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1285,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by W. changed to fresh breeze from SE. Wrote to WBS &amp; also sent 20/- to <span class=highlight_yellow>Mayt</span> Scott. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Boswell on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Low</span> Shand. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1231,"lock":null}
20:13:19.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/9/1285
20:13:19.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1285,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by W. changed to fresh breeze from SE. Wrote to WBS &amp; also sent 20/- to <span class=highlight_yellow>Mayt</span> Scott. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Boswell on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Low</span> Shand. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1231,"lock":null}
20:13:19.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/1/1309
20:13:19.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1309,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; all the appearance of more rain. Afterwards turned out a fine warm spring day. Walked to Cullercoats Sands. Ed Charlton dined with me. H Harry &amp; Sadler came in afterwards &amp; took wine. Sadler brought the account from the committee room of the Bell having retired. Finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1255,"lock":null}
20:13:19.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/1/1309
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1309,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; all the appearance of more rain. Afterwards turned out a fine warm spring day. Walked to Cullercoats Sands. Ed Charlton dined with me. H Harry &amp; Sadler came in afterwards &amp; took wine. Sadler brought the account from the committee room of the Bell having retired. Finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1255,"lock":null}
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/10/1319
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1319,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind ENE. H Harry &amp; I walked by the river side through Howdon to Willington colliery and returned home by the turnpike.  The men at work with detachments of the yeomanry &amp; the 15<sup>th</sup> to protect them. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon walked up to Billy Mill &amp; took wine with Charlton's. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1265,"lock":null}
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/10/1319
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1319,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind ENE. H Harry &amp; I walked by the river side through Howdon to Willington colliery and returned home by the turnpike.  The men at work with detachments of the yeomanry &amp; the 15<sup>th</sup> to protect them. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon walked up to Billy Mill &amp; took wine with Charlton's. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1265,"lock":null}
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/11/1320
20:13:19.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1320,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SE. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Met Bess!! Returned home to dinner. On board the Broderville in the afternoon &amp; walked again to Tynemouth in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1266,"lock":null}
