20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1321,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"http://radicaltyneside.org/events/keelmens-strike-1819-and-shooting-north-shields\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2769-archibald-reed.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Archibald Reed</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":909,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1267,"lock":null}
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/12/1322
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1322,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. Ascension day. The Mayor <font color=#333333>Archibald Reed</font><font color=#333333> down in his barge. I breakfasted with him. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at the Albion with Bradshaw. Had an excellent dinner. At the </font><font color=#333333>Mulstrum</font></p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1268,"lock":null}
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
