20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1322,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. Ascension day. The Mayor <font color=#333333>Archibald Reed</font><font color=#333333> down in his barge. I breakfasted with him. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at the Albion with Bradshaw. Had an excellent dinner. At the </font><font color=#333333>Mulstrum</font></p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1268,"lock":null}
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/13/1323
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1323,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having been rain in the night. Wind E by S. Dined at home. At the Northumberland Arms in the afternoon &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening &amp; afterwards called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1269,"lock":null}
20:13:19.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/13/1323
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1323,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having been rain in the night. Wind E by S. Dined at home. At the Northumberland Arms in the afternoon &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening &amp; afterwards called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1269,"lock":null}
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/14/1324
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1324,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW afterwards changed to NE &amp; SE. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS sending him a account of may rents. Spent the evening with a party of officers at Lockerwoods</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1270,"lock":null}
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/14/1324
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1324,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW afterwards changed to NE &amp; SE. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS sending him a account of may rents. Spent the evening with a party of officers at Lockerwoods</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1270,"lock":null}
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/15/1325
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1325,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning but still rather cool. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Did not go to church. Dined with H Harry. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1271,"lock":null}
20:13:19.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/15/1325
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1325,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning but still rather cool. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Did not go to church. Dined with H Harry. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1271,"lock":null}
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/16/1326
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1326,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. received a letter from WBS. Walked to the Doctor's garden. Gave H Harry &pound;11.7.6 which he paid for me on Saturday to Junior Hall, <span class=highlight_yellow>Brokerage</span> Archangel voyage. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1272,"lock":null}
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/16/1326
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1326,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. received a letter from WBS. Walked to the Doctor's garden. Gave H Harry &pound;11.7.6 which he paid for me on Saturday to Junior Hall, <span class=highlight_yellow>Brokerage</span> Archangel voyage. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1272,"lock":null}
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/17/1327
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1327,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind S by E. H Harry Cunningham &amp; I took a long walk round by Burdon &amp; Percy Main collieries. The <span class=highlight_yellow>pitmen</span> in a very disturbed state. Dined with Dr Drury &amp; in the afternoon walked to Billy Mill to play a quoits &amp; took wine with Charlton. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1273,"lock":null}
20:13:19.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/17/1327
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1327,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind S by E. H Harry Cunningham &amp; I took a long walk round by Burdon &amp; Percy Main collieries. The <span class=highlight_yellow>pitmen</span> in a very disturbed state. Dined with Dr Drury &amp; in the afternoon walked to Billy Mill to play a quoits &amp; took wine with Charlton. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1273,"lock":null}
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/18/1328
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1328,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful morning. Wind SE. Captain <font color=#BFBFBF>William Fanshawe</font> Martin of the Samarang having hired a steamer I accompanied him &amp; a party to Seaham with which we were much pleased and surprised at so vast an undertaking  for one individual. Having taken one <span class=highlight_yellow>prog</span><span class=highlight_yellow>:</span> etc with us we dined at the <span class=highlight_yellow>Prince</span> &amp; embarked again at &frac12; past 6 o'clock &amp; reached Shields between 10 &amp; 11 o'clock after having spent an uncommonly   pleasant day. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1274,"lock":null}
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/18/1328
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1328,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful morning. Wind SE. Captain <font color=#BFBFBF>William Fanshawe</font> Martin of the Samarang having hired a steamer I accompanied him &amp; a party to Seaham with which we were much pleased and surprised at so vast an undertaking  for one individual. Having taken one <span class=highlight_yellow>prog</span><span class=highlight_yellow>:</span> etc with us we dined at the <span class=highlight_yellow>Prince</span> &amp; embarked again at &frac12; past 6 o'clock &amp; reached Shields between 10 &amp; 11 o'clock after having spent an uncommonly   pleasant day. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1274,"lock":null}
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/19/1329
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1329,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather, blowing fresh from the ESE. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Bradsham's</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>roping</span> in the afternoon playing at quoits &amp; took coffee in the evening at J Tinley's. Wrote to ask R B Reed of Brandon White House to spend next week with me.</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1275,"lock":null}
20:13:19.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/19/1329
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1329,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather, blowing fresh from the ESE. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Bradsham's</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>roping</span> in the afternoon playing at quoits &amp; took coffee in the evening at J Tinley's. Wrote to ask R B Reed of Brandon White House to spend next week with me.</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1275,"lock":null}
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/2/1310
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1310,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather much the same. Wind about N by E. Tom Smith arrived this morning being his rent day. Walked with him to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. Received a letter from WBS this morning. Called upon Mrs Robinson but she refused to give me an order on Chapmans for Mr R's debt. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1256,"lock":null}
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/2/1310
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1310,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather much the same. Wind about N by E. Tom Smith arrived this morning being his rent day. Walked with him to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. Received a letter from WBS this morning. Called upon Mrs Robinson but she refused to give me an order on Chapmans for Mr R's debt. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1256,"lock":null}
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/20/1330
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1330,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ESE &amp; high sea. Boswell &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine at the George in the afternoon &amp; coffee at Mr Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1276,"lock":null}
20:13:19.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/20/1330
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1330,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ESE &amp; high sea. Boswell &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine at the George in the afternoon &amp; coffee at Mr Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1276,"lock":null}
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/21/1331
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1331,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind NNE. Took a walk to Tynemouth both morning &amp; afternoon. Dined at 6 o'clock on board the Samarang with Captain Martin &amp; spent the evening with Mr Tinley. Rob Reed arrived this evening</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1277,"lock":null}
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/21/1331
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1331,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind NNE. Took a walk to Tynemouth both morning &amp; afternoon. Dined at 6 o'clock on board the Samarang with Captain Martin &amp; spent the evening with Mr Tinley. Rob Reed arrived this evening</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1277,"lock":null}
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/22/1332
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1332,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from N by E with a sea upon the bar. Went to church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at J Tinley's &amp; called at the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1278,"lock":null}
20:13:19.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
