20:13:19.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1332,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from N by E with a sea upon the bar. Went to church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at J Tinley's &amp; called at the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1278,"lock":null}
20:13:19.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/23/1333
20:13:19.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1333,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; rather cold wind NNE. Dined with Junior Richardson &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races. Very good sport. Potts won the claret jug cards at the Mulstrum. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1279,"lock":null}
