20:13:19.532 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1335,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day. Wind <span class=highlight_yellow>NS</span>. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon again went over to South Shields races which were very good. Met <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span> there &amp; returned home with her.</p>","pageId":912,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1281,"lock":null}
20:13:19.532 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/26/1336
20:13:19.532 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1336,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold &amp; unpleasant day. Wind NE. Took a walk round by Tynemouth. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon walked up to Billy Mill &amp; drank wine with Charlton. Bess came up in the car<font color=#BFBFBF>riage</font> &amp; a pretty finish we made of it.</p>","pageId":912,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1282,"lock":null}
20:13:19.532 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
