20:13:19.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1342,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful day. Wind NNE &amp; very warm, Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1288,"lock":null}
20:13:19.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
