20:13:19.552 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1347,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning with slight rain &amp; blowing fresh from N by E &amp; good deal of sea on. Received a letter from WBS. Attended a meeting for the relief of the seamen out of employment, whose families are in great distress, subscribed a Guinea. Dined at home. Called at the Doctor's &amp; walked up to his garden &amp; spent the evening playing at quoits. At the Albion</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1293,"lock":null}
20:13:19.552 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/7/1348
20:13:19.552 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1348,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Afterwards turned out a most delightful day &amp; the wind again from the old quarter NE. Walked up to High Cheston &amp; called upon Mr Robson as bridegroom. Dined at home. At Tynemouth in the evening.. Took coffee with J Tinley.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1294,"lock":null}
20:13:19.552 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
