20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1348,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Afterwards turned out a most delightful day &amp; the wind again from the old quarter NE. Walked up to High Cheston &amp; called upon Mr Robson as bridegroom. Dined at home. At Tynemouth in the evening.. Took coffee with J Tinley.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1294,"lock":null}
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/8/1349
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1349,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NW. Glass fallen &amp; more the appearance of rain. Received a letter from Emma Galbraith informing me of the holy days commencing on the 17<sup>th</sup>. <span class=highlight_yellow>But</span> glad to see her so much improved in her writing. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again &amp; Cullercoat Sands in the afternoon &amp; evening. At the Albion.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Towards noon the wind got into the old quarter NE again &amp; turned out a most beautiful day.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1295,"lock":null}
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/8/1349
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1349,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NW. Glass fallen &amp; more the appearance of rain. Received a letter from Emma Galbraith informing me of the holy days commencing on the 17<sup>th</sup>. <span class=highlight_yellow>But</span> glad to see her so much improved in her writing. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again &amp; Cullercoat Sands in the afternoon &amp; evening. At the Albion.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Towards noon the wind got into the old quarter NE again &amp; turned out a most beautiful day.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1295,"lock":null}
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/9/1350
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1350,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind W by N. Afterwards NE. H Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went again to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Saw Bess became friends again &amp; had a long walk with her. Got to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Mont</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>trcien</span> about 11 o'clock</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1296,"lock":null}
20:13:19.553 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/9/1350
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1350,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind W by N. Afterwards NE. H Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went again to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Saw Bess became friends again &amp; had a long walk with her. Got to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Mont</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>trcien</span> about 11 o'clock</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1296,"lock":null}
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/1/1372
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1372,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNW. At Mr Garbutt's &amp; on board the ship. Got the remainder of her ballast. Went out with Mr Bell to dine with his partner J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Wood. At Hezzle <font color=#BFBFBF>(</font><i><font color=#BFBFBF>Hessle</font></i><font color=#BFBFBF>, Hull</font><font color=#BFBFBF>),</font> met a party there</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1318,"lock":null}
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/1/1372
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1372,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNW. At Mr Garbutt's &amp; on board the ship. Got the remainder of her ballast. Went out with Mr Bell to dine with his partner J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Wood. At Hezzle <font color=#BFBFBF>(</font><i><font color=#BFBFBF>Hessle</font></i><font color=#BFBFBF>, Hull</font><font color=#BFBFBF>),</font> met a party there</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1318,"lock":null}
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/10/1383
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1383,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after the rain, having been a good deal in the night 7 the appearance yet of more wind E by N &amp; ENE. At church in the morning. D Dixon called but we were out. Dined at home. Took tea with Messrs Harry, walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Very foggy &amp; damp. Finished at H Harry's with a glass of whiskey</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1329,"lock":null}
20:13:19.554 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/10/1383
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1383,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after the rain, having been a good deal in the night 7 the appearance yet of more wind E by N &amp; ENE. At church in the morning. D Dixon called but we were out. Dined at home. Took tea with Messrs Harry, walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Very foggy &amp; damp. Finished at H Harry's with a glass of whiskey</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1329,"lock":null}
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/11/1384
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1384,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Very foggy. Ben &amp; I got on board a steamer &amp; went to Newcastle. Saw D Dixon. I walked with him out to Benton, dined &amp; in the evening walked through the country to Shields. Called at the Mustrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1330,"lock":null}
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/11/1384
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1384,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Very foggy. Ben &amp; I got on board a steamer &amp; went to Newcastle. Saw D Dixon. I walked with him out to Benton, dined &amp; in the evening walked through the country to Shields. Called at the Mustrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1330,"lock":null}
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/12/1385
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1385,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind ENE. Paid Gibson butcher. Wyburg &pound;8.6/-. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards out to Preston &amp; dined with Mr Wright. Walked home again in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1331,"lock":null}
20:13:19.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/12/1385
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1385,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind ENE. Paid Gibson butcher. Wyburg &pound;8.6/-. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards out to Preston &amp; dined with Mr Wright. Walked home again in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1331,"lock":null}
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/13/1386
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1386,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy &amp; damp morning. Wind NE. Cleared away towards noon. I joined Mr Ilderton &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>ofserted</span> in his <span class=highlight_yellow>canses</span> also promised him my vote. Dined with him &amp; party at the George at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1332,"lock":null}
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/13/1386
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1386,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy &amp; damp morning. Wind NE. Cleared away towards noon. I joined Mr Ilderton &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>ofserted</span> in his <span class=highlight_yellow>canses</span> also promised him my vote. Dined with him &amp; party at the George at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1332,"lock":null}
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/14/1387
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1387,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with the appearance of showers having been showers during the night. Wind SE. Ben Galbraith &amp; Robert set off in Dunn's gig to catch the Alnwick coach at Newcastle for Felton where Tom Smith's phaeton will meet them. I could not go having promised to continue my assistance to Mr Ilderton all day &amp; very successful. Sat down to dinner at 5 o'clock. Called at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1333,"lock":null}
20:13:19.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/14/1387
20:13:19.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1387,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with the appearance of showers having been showers during the night. Wind SE. Ben Galbraith &amp; Robert set off in Dunn's gig to catch the Alnwick coach at Newcastle for Felton where Tom Smith's phaeton will meet them. I could not go having promised to continue my assistance to Mr Ilderton all day &amp; very successful. Sat down to dinner at 5 o'clock. Called at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1333,"lock":null}
20:13:19.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/15/1388
20:13:19.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1388,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning &amp; been some rain. Wind ENE. A very heavy rain for an hour or so which prevented us beginning our canvas until near 11 o'clock commencing at the Wooden bridge &amp; canvassed all the upper part of the town. Milburn Place etc and were very successful. Lunched at Mr Barkers &amp; canvassed Tynemouth in the evening. Dined at 8 o'clock &amp; spent a jolly evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1334,"lock":null}
20:13:19.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/15/1388
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1388,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning &amp; been some rain. Wind ENE. A very heavy rain for an hour or so which prevented us beginning our canvas until near 11 o'clock commencing at the Wooden bridge &amp; canvassed all the upper part of the town. Milburn Place etc and were very successful. Lunched at Mr Barkers &amp; canvassed Tynemouth in the evening. Dined at 8 o'clock &amp; spent a jolly evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1334,"lock":null}
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/16/1389
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1389,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfasted early &amp; took the 8 o'clock steamer for Newcastle &amp; at 1 o'clock got upon the coach for Felton where I arrived at a little after 1 o'clock. Had an early dinner &amp; afterwards borrowed a nod of Melrose &amp; had a few hours fishing but little success. Walked down in the cool of the evening to Togston. Got there at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Found the Clutterbucks dining there.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1335,"lock":null}
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/16/1389
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1389,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfasted early &amp; took the 8 o'clock steamer for Newcastle &amp; at 1 o'clock got upon the coach for Felton where I arrived at a little after 1 o'clock. Had an early dinner &amp; afterwards borrowed a nod of Melrose &amp; had a few hours fishing but little success. Walked down in the cool of the evening to Togston. Got there at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Found the Clutterbucks dining there.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1335,"lock":null}
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/17/1390
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1390,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind SW. Accompanied the family to church at Warkworth. We <span class=highlight_yellow>gin</span> then amused ourselves strolling about until dinner time. Mr Burn came up to <span class=highlight_yellow>wine</span> &amp; spent the evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1336,"lock":null}
20:13:19.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/17/1390
20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1390,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind SW. Accompanied the family to church at Warkworth. We <span class=highlight_yellow>gin</span> then amused ourselves strolling about until dinner time. Mr Burn came up to <span class=highlight_yellow>wine</span> &amp; spent the evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1336,"lock":null}
20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/18/1391
20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1391,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW with showers. <span class=highlight_yellow>Ioma</span> Dixon, Baker <span class=highlight_yellow>Cmenon</span> &amp; I walked down to Amble. I had a little fishing but caught nothing. Dined a family party</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1337,"lock":null}
20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
