20:13:19.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1391,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW with showers. <span class=highlight_yellow>Ioma</span> Dixon, Baker <span class=highlight_yellow>Cmenon</span> &amp; I walked down to Amble. I had a little fishing but caught nothing. Dined a family party</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1337,"lock":null}
