20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/2/1374
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1374,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind SW. the Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>warped</span> down to Southend pier &amp; at high water sailed for Wyburg. Mr Garbutt settled the freight with the merchant &amp; I settled his account for brokerage etc receiving a bill at 4 months, accepted payment at <span class=highlight_yellow>Glgme</span> &amp; their bills at 2 months for balance of first half freight <span class=highlight_yellow>smith</span> to &pound;50.4 &amp; cash &pound;1-9-9. Mr G<font color=#BFBFBF>arbutt</font>'s account &pound;15.6.6</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined with Mr Garbutt &amp; in the evening H French took grog with me at the Cross Keys. Received of Mr Stephenson &pound;8- to give the carpenter's wife &pound;5 &amp; the cook &pound;3. Paid Stephenson &pound;6.0.1 the balance of his Wyburg account due to him.</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1320,"lock":null}
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/2/1374
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1374,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind SW. the Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>warped</span> down to Southend pier &amp; at high water sailed for Wyburg. Mr Garbutt settled the freight with the merchant &amp; I settled his account for brokerage etc receiving a bill at 4 months, accepted payment at <span class=highlight_yellow>Glgme</span> &amp; their bills at 2 months for balance of first half freight <span class=highlight_yellow>smith</span> to &pound;50.4 &amp; cash &pound;1-9-9. Mr G<font color=#BFBFBF>arbutt</font>'s account &pound;15.6.6</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined with Mr Garbutt &amp; in the evening H French took grog with me at the Cross Keys. Received of Mr Stephenson &pound;8- to give the carpenter's wife &pound;5 &amp; the cook &pound;3. Paid Stephenson &pound;6.0.1 the balance of his Wyburg account due to him.</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1320,"lock":null}
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/20/1394
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1394,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day &amp; fresh SW breeze. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon left us for Benton. Walked to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Burches</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Colleerg</span>  with Tom, Lady Smith &amp; family of Tyleys. Called &amp; took lunch. A family party to dinner</p>","pageId":927,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1340,"lock":null}
20:13:19.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/20/1394
20:13:19.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1394,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day &amp; fresh SW breeze. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon left us for Benton. Walked to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Burches</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Colleerg</span>  with Tom, Lady Smith &amp; family of Tyleys. Called &amp; took lunch. A family party to dinner</p>","pageId":927,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1340,"lock":null}
20:13:19.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/21/1395
20:13:19.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1395,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Baker Kop Snowdon &amp; I walked down to <span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>aters</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ide</span> to finish, by the time we got there it began to rain heavily, which gave us a soaking. Had but poor sport. Killed about a dozen, not large but fine fish. Returned to dinner at &frac12; past 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":927,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1341,"lock":null}
