20:13:19.568 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/3/1376
20:13:19.568 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1376,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Started at 6 o'clock from the Cross Keys having taken an outside place &amp; arrived at York at 12 o'clock noon. Saw the interior of the Minster &amp; passed the afternoon in walking about the town &amp; banks of the river. Dined at the Black Swan at &frac12; past 5 o'clock and mounted the Shields mail at 9 o'clock. A fine evening.</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1322,"lock":null}
20:13:19.568 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/3/1376
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1376,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Started at 6 o'clock from the Cross Keys having taken an outside place &amp; arrived at York at 12 o'clock noon. Saw the interior of the Minster &amp; passed the afternoon in walking about the town &amp; banks of the river. Dined at the Black Swan at &frac12; past 5 o'clock and mounted the Shields mail at 9 o'clock. A fine evening.</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1322,"lock":null}
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/30/1407
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/30/1407
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/31/1408
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1408,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most delightful weather. Wind from the S &amp; E. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Lockerwood dined with me. H Harry came in &amp; took wine. At Tynemouth &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1354,"lock":null}
20:13:19.569 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/31/1408
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1408,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most delightful weather. Wind from the S &amp; E. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Lockerwood dined with me. H Harry came in &amp; took wine. At Tynemouth &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1354,"lock":null}
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/4/1377
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1377,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind with the heat got to ENE. Arrived at Shields at 7 o'clock. Crossed the water &amp; got home in time to go to the Low Lights &amp; bath before breakfast. Dined at home. Being excessively sleepy, turned into bed for three hours. Walked after tea up to Preston through the fields to examine them &amp; see <span class=highlight_yellow>moors</span>. Went to the theatre in the evening &amp; afterwards called at the Mulstrum to see Bess</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1323,"lock":null}
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/4/1377
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1377,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind with the heat got to ENE. Arrived at Shields at 7 o'clock. Crossed the water &amp; got home in time to go to the Low Lights &amp; bath before breakfast. Dined at home. Being excessively sleepy, turned into bed for three hours. Walked after tea up to Preston through the fields to examine them &amp; see <span class=highlight_yellow>moors</span>. Went to the theatre in the evening &amp; afterwards called at the Mulstrum to see Bess</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1323,"lock":null}
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/5/1378
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1378,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine warm morning . Wind W by N &amp; looks like showers. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. At the Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1324,"lock":null}
20:13:19.570 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/5/1378
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1378,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine warm morning . Wind W by N &amp; looks like showers. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. At the Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1324,"lock":null}
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/6/1379
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1379,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. paid into Chapmans a bill at 4 months, <span class=highlight_yellow>Weider</span> accepted on <span class=highlight_yellow>Hoarses</span> for &pound;175. Took a walk round by the rocks to Tynemouth. Dined at 5 o'clock With Mr J Metcalf &amp; went to the theatre in the evening being thebespeak of the officers of the marines. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1325,"lock":null}
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/6/1379
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1379,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. paid into Chapmans a bill at 4 months, <span class=highlight_yellow>Weider</span> accepted on <span class=highlight_yellow>Hoarses</span> for &pound;175. Took a walk round by the rocks to Tynemouth. Dined at 5 o'clock With Mr J Metcalf &amp; went to the theatre in the evening being thebespeak of the officers of the marines. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1325,"lock":null}
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/7/1380
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1380,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind SE. paid Walnsley baker &pound;9.3, Morris butcher &pound;9, Bradshaws Irish pork 3 casks &pound;9. J Tinley dined with us at 5 o'clock. Ben Galbraith &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the evening.</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1326,"lock":null}
20:13:19.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/7/1380
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1380,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind SE. paid Walnsley baker &pound;9.3, Morris butcher &pound;9, Bradshaws Irish pork 3 casks &pound;9. J Tinley dined with us at 5 o'clock. Ben Galbraith &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the evening.</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1326,"lock":null}
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/8/1381
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1381,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SE. Went with WBS on board the City of Edinburgh to take his birth to London.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Bathed at 1 o'clock. Accompanied a party of officers to Wallsend and dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Hotts</span> a large party &amp; spent a very pleasant day. He was so kind as to send his carriage for us. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1327,"lock":null}
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/8/1381
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1381,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SE. Went with WBS on board the City of Edinburgh to take his birth to London.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Bathed at 1 o'clock. Accompanied a party of officers to Wallsend and dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Hotts</span> a large party &amp; spent a very pleasant day. He was so kind as to send his carriage for us. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1327,"lock":null}
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/9/1382
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1382,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SE. Moor &amp; his brothers with J Tinley with us. Foster Moor signed a document making over to us all his stack &amp; crop etc &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>resigning</span> the farm which we have allowed Mr Moor to take as <span class=highlight_yellow>tinanl</span>. Walked up to Preston. People busy with the potatoes &amp; turnips &amp; clearing the hedges.  Gave in a draft on Chapmans for &pound;20 for WBS. <span class=highlight_yellow>Dined</span> at 2 o'clock. Went on board the City of Edinburgh steamer with WBS &amp; saw him sail for London. Ben &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the evening. A heavy rain about &frac12; past 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1328,"lock":null}
20:13:19.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/9/1382
20:13:19.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1382,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SE. Moor &amp; his brothers with J Tinley with us. Foster Moor signed a document making over to us all his stack &amp; crop etc &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>resigning</span> the farm which we have allowed Mr Moor to take as <span class=highlight_yellow>tinanl</span>. Walked up to Preston. People busy with the potatoes &amp; turnips &amp; clearing the hedges.  Gave in a draft on Chapmans for &pound;20 for WBS. <span class=highlight_yellow>Dined</span> at 2 o'clock. Went on board the City of Edinburgh steamer with WBS &amp; saw him sail for London. Ben &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the evening. A heavy rain about &frac12; past 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1328,"lock":null}
20:13:19.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/10/1409
20:13:19.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1409,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined &amp; spent a very pleasant day with H Dale, I Dale Joe Hawkes &amp; Mark there. Received a letter from WBS. Paid Cheghton for rum &pound;4.6</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1355,"lock":null}
20:13:19.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/10/1409
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1409,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined &amp; spent a very pleasant day with H Dale, I Dale Joe Hawkes &amp; Mark there. Received a letter from WBS. Paid Cheghton for rum &pound;4.6</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1355,"lock":null}
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/11/1410
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1410,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW &amp; ESE. Walked to Tynemouth. Ben G<font color=#BFBFBF>ailbraith</font> went to Newcastle to see Emma. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Had a most delightful bath at the end of Cullercoats Sands &amp; dined with L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Mitchel &amp; Lockerwood at the castle. Bess met me on the mound, gave her a long lecture but <span class=highlight_yellow>query</span> it has any good effect. Heavy shower of rain</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1356,"lock":null}
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/11/1410
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1410,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW &amp; ESE. Walked to Tynemouth. Ben G<font color=#BFBFBF>ailbraith</font> went to Newcastle to see Emma. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Had a most delightful bath at the end of Cullercoats Sands &amp; dined with L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Mitchel &amp; Lockerwood at the castle. Bess met me on the mound, gave her a long lecture but <span class=highlight_yellow>query</span> it has any good effect. Heavy shower of rain</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1356,"lock":null}
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/12/1411
20:13:19.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1411,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Bathed before breakfast. Engaged at home writing. Dined at home. Called and took a glass of wine with the Doctor. Walked up to Tynemouth. Called &amp; spent the evening at the Castle. At the Mulstrum at night. P<font color=#BFBFBF>ai</font><sup>d</sup> Brown <span class=highlight_yellow>Tarters</span> 17/-</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1357,"lock":null}
