20:13:19.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1423,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but blowing hard from the N by E. got up &amp; walked to Mr Lee's to breakfast. Walked down to the post office &amp; pier. Mr Lee drove me down to Shirley to call upon the Lewis. Dined at Mr Lees</p>","pageId":933,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1369,"lock":null}
20:13:19.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/22/1424
20:13:19.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1424,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning . Wind fresh from N by E. Played at billiards. The Lewis's came in &amp; dined at Mr Lees. Messrs Horsford &amp; Hawksley came in the evening. My back much better.</p>","pageId":933,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1370,"lock":null}
