20:13:19.608 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1566,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine frosty day with a SW wind. Gave Robert leave to go &amp; spend the day at Benton. Went to church. Dined at home with Jobling. Had j<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font>r <span class=highlight_lime>R. Maxwell</span> along to see him. A fine boy.</p>\r\n<p>H Harry came in &amp; spent the afternoon with us in the evening. We went to window Atkinson &amp; at night I was with Bess.</p>","pageId":980,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1510,"lock":null}
