20:13:19.608 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1575,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy morning. Wind W by N &amp; WNW. At the News &amp; billiard rooms. Jobling, B Wright, J Redhead &amp; I went out in the street chariot &amp; dined with W C Wright at Muston House. Walked home in the evening. With Bess  who came out as far as Billy Mill to meet us</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1519,"lock":null}
20:13:19.608 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
