20:13:19.609 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/12/1577
20:13:19.609 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1577,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SSE. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling dined out. In the billiard room most of the day. At the south Kitchen. Attended the Whist Club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1521,"lock":null}
20:13:19.609 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
