20:13:19.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1577,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SSE. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling dined out. In the billiard room most of the day. At the south Kitchen. Attended the Whist Club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1521,"lock":null}
20:13:19.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/13/1578
20:13:19.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1578,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another cold and damp morning. Fresh breeze from the ESE. Dined at home. H Hurry, Boswell Elder &amp; I took some punch together at the Albion &amp; I suppered off oysters at Bess</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1522,"lock":null}
20:13:19.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
