20:13:19.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/15/1580
20:13:19.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1580,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind WSW. Glass as high as set fair. Walked up to Benton. Dined &amp; stayed all night. Found them all well</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1524,"lock":null}
