20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/19/1584
20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1584,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly mild fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Dined at home &amp; went to the Whist Club in the evening</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1528,"lock":null}
