20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1584,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly mild fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Dined at home &amp; went to the Whist Club in the evening</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1528,"lock":null}
20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/2/1567
20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1567,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. A holyday in the town. Walked to Tynemouth etc. Dined at home. At the billiard room. At night at the Albion &amp; theatre. A very good house</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1511,"lock":null}
20:13:19.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/2/1567
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1567,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. A holyday in the town. Walked to Tynemouth etc. Dined at home. At the billiard room. At night at the Albion &amp; theatre. A very good house</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1511,"lock":null}
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/20/1585
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1585,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; rather frosty. Wind SW. Started after breakfast with my gun &amp; had a most delightful walk to Hartley by the coast. Jobling met me there in Wards gig. Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Redley dined with us &amp; I drove Bess home at night, leaving Jobbing there. Suppered at Lockwoods.</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1529,"lock":null}
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/20/1585
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1585,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; rather frosty. Wind SW. Started after breakfast with my gun &amp; had a most delightful walk to Hartley by the coast. Jobling met me there in Wards gig. Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Redley dined with us &amp; I drove Bess home at night, leaving Jobbing there. Suppered at Lockwoods.</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1529,"lock":null}
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/21/1586
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1586,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him copies of the rent &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>chapenaus</span> book up to the end of the year. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Lockwood took some dinner with me. Called at Bess &amp; at night attended the Whist Club at H Hurries</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1530,"lock":null}
20:13:19.614 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/21/1586
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1586,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him copies of the rent &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>chapenaus</span> book up to the end of the year. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Lockwood took some dinner with me. Called at Bess &amp; at night attended the Whist Club at H Hurries</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1530,"lock":null}
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/22/1587
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1587,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather still continues. Rather frosty with SW wind. Read a letter from WBS. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined at home. H French looked in in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1531,"lock":null}
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/22/1587
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1587,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather still continues. Rather frosty with SW wind. Read a letter from WBS. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined at home. H French looked in in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1531,"lock":null}
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/23/1588
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
20:13:19.615 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/23/1588
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/24/1589
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/24/1589
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/25/1590
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
20:13:19.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/25/1590
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/26/1591
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/26/1591
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/27/1592
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1592,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frosty with showers of snow. Wind abated &amp; now from N by W &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;6.1. by draft on Chapmans. Dined at home. Took wine with H French &amp; a party at the Albion &amp; went to the Theatre. In the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1536,"lock":null}
20:13:19.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
