20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1592,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frosty with showers of snow. Wind abated &amp; now from N by W &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;6.1. by draft on Chapmans. Dined at home. Took wine with H French &amp; a party at the Albion &amp; went to the Theatre. In the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1536,"lock":null}
20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/28/1593
20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1593,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Received the Hope's average papers from the Hope Club with the statement in very <span class=highlight_yellow>angust</span> one, not having allowed one the caulking to &pound;12.4.10. Dined at home. At Bess in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Whist Club at Mr Fenwicks, North<font color=#BFBFBF>umber</font>l<font color=#BFBFBF>an</font>d Square</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1537,"lock":null}
20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/28/1593
20:13:19.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1593,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Received the Hope's average papers from the Hope Club with the statement in very <span class=highlight_yellow>angust</span> one, not having allowed one the caulking to &pound;12.4.10. Dined at home. At Bess in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Whist Club at Mr Fenwicks, North<font color=#BFBFBF>umber</font>l<font color=#BFBFBF>an</font>d Square</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1537,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/29/1594
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1594,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoat. Mr Evington &amp; Lockwood dined with us and in the evening we went to Bess.</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1538,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/29/1594
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1594,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoat. Mr Evington &amp; Lockwood dined with us and in the evening we went to Bess.</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1538,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/3/1568
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1568,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Wind ESE. A good deal of rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to WBS &amp; remitted him two promise notes &pound;142.15.6 &amp; &pound;71.2.2 to take up the Hopes cargo bill of &pound;211.12/-. Gave a draft on Chapmans for the amount of the bills. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; suppered with Lockwood</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1512,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/3/1568
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1568,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Wind ESE. A good deal of rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to WBS &amp; remitted him two promise notes &pound;142.15.6 &amp; &pound;71.2.2 to take up the Hopes cargo bill of &pound;211.12/-. Gave a draft on Chapmans for the amount of the bills. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; suppered with Lockwood</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1512,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/30/1595
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1595,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind WSW. Walked up to Me Edwards dock to see Mr Evington &amp; the Alexander. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with J H Richardson, a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1539,"lock":null}
20:13:19.619 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/30/1595
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1595,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind WSW. Walked up to Me Edwards dock to see Mr Evington &amp; the Alexander. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with J H Richardson, a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1539,"lock":null}
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/31/1596
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1596,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wine with Boswell. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; left Jobling &amp; Boswell there. Attended the assembly at the George at night. A very good one. 70 persons there</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1540,"lock":null}
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/31/1596
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1596,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wine with Boswell. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; left Jobling &amp; Boswell there. Attended the assembly at the George at night. A very good one. 70 persons there</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1540,"lock":null}
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/4/1569
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1569,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Engaged to dine with Charlton at Billy Mill at 2 o'clock. Thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Did not go to Charlton being unwell. Received from Eligible Club &pound;____ in notes at 2 months date 30 December which with Hurry &amp; Co's bill of &pound;59.9 making &pound;228.5/- I paid into Chapmans. Dined at home. <span class=highlight_yellow>Rec</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>eived</span></font> an <span class=highlight_yellow>Brt</span> Andersons acceptance at 2 months from 4. I am on account of average for &pound;50. I am on account of average for &pound;50</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1513,"lock":null}
20:13:19.620 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/4/1569
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1569,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Engaged to dine with Charlton at Billy Mill at 2 o'clock. Thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Did not go to Charlton being unwell. Received from Eligible Club &pound;____ in notes at 2 months date 30 December which with Hurry &amp; Co's bill of &pound;59.9 making &pound;228.5/- I paid into Chapmans. Dined at home. <span class=highlight_yellow>Rec</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>eived</span></font> an <span class=highlight_yellow>Brt</span> Andersons acceptance at 2 months from 4. I am on account of average for &pound;50. I am on account of average for &pound;50</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1513,"lock":null}
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/5/1570
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1570,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost &amp; foggy. Wind SSW but I should think from the e<font color=#BFBFBF>ast</font> of sea. Wrote to Mr Anderson acknowledging the receipt of the &pound;50 bill</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening attended the whist club, With Bess at night who had submitted to be examined by Dr Horsley who pronounced her quite well &amp; therefore I must be free from disease</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1514,"lock":null}
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/5/1570
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1570,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost &amp; foggy. Wind SSW but I should think from the e<font color=#BFBFBF>ast</font> of sea. Wrote to Mr Anderson acknowledging the receipt of the &pound;50 bill</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening attended the whist club, With Bess at night who had submitted to be examined by Dr Horsley who pronounced her quite well &amp; therefore I must be free from disease</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1514,"lock":null}
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/6/1571
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1571,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Wind from the S &amp; E &amp; hard frost.</p>\r\n<p>Lunched at home. Dined at 6 o'clock with j<font color=#BFBFBF>unio</font>r Redhead at Tynemouth.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>\r\n<p>Paid the &pound;50 bill into my account at Chapmans</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1515,"lock":null}
20:13:19.621 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/6/1571
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1571,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Wind from the S &amp; E &amp; hard frost.</p>\r\n<p>Lunched at home. Dined at 6 o'clock with j<font color=#BFBFBF>unio</font>r Redhead at Tynemouth.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>\r\n<p>Paid the &pound;50 bill into my account at Chapmans</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1515,"lock":null}
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/7/1572
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1572,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind E by S &amp; ESE. Been blowing very hard all night. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Tibbs eat his dinner with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; attended the whist club at night at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1516,"lock":null}
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
