20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1572,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind E by S &amp; ESE. Been blowing very hard all night. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Tibbs eat his dinner with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; attended the whist club at night at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1516,"lock":null}
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/8/1573
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1573,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind SE &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Having taken a couple of pills last night I did not go to church. Lockwood dined with us at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening at Bess</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1517,"lock":null}
20:13:19.622 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
