20:13:19.623 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/9/1574
20:13:19.623 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1574,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SE &amp; heavy sea. Did not get up till late. Lunched with the Doctor at the billiard room in the afternoon. W C Wright dined with us at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1518,"lock":null}
