20:13:19.625 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/10/14/1847
20:13:19.626 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1847,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind W. After seeing the yeomanry go to church. Left my card upon the Major &amp; sheriff &amp; returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Received a letter from WBS and answered it. Report of the Hope being waterlogged.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1020,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1790,"lock":null}
