20:13:19.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/10/17/1850
20:13:19.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1850,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SW. Went to Newcastle &amp; Took the court Alnwick. Dined at the Mess &amp; spent a pleasant day only about 12 officers present. Got to bed about 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1793,"lock":null}
