20:13:19.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1851,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at 12 o'clock. A beautiful day. Dined with W Forster &amp; afterwards attended the Ball in uniform. Then attended the Duke and Duchess there. Went out to Lamington at night. Mr &amp; Mrs &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Thiss</span></p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1794,"lock":null}
