20:13:19.629 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/10/20/1853
20:13:19.629 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1853,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind NW. Mr Hodgson, R Ilderton &amp; young Fenwick walked to Whillingham &amp; went to Roster to shoot. I was out all the morning. Got only two shots &amp; killed nothing.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1796,"lock":null}
