20:13:19.631 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/10/25/1858
20:13:19.631 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1858,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. After breakfast Ildeston &amp; I drove into Alnwick. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. Engaged ourselves over a bottle of Champagne &amp; old port</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1801,"lock":null}
20:13:19.631 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
