20:13:19.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1872,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Dined early with the intention of leaving togston by the 3 o'clock coach but did not, the coachman being drunk &amp; an accident having occurred &amp; also being an hour after I <span class=highlight_yellow>one</span>.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1815,"lock":null}
20:13:19.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/11/9/1873
20:13:19.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1873,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning but afterwards cleared up. Again dined early &amp; left by the coach at 3 o'clock. Arrived at Shields at &frac12; past 9 o'clock. Called &amp; saw Bess. Letters from Stephenson , WBS etc.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1816,"lock":null}
