20:13:19.655 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/1/1895
20:13:19.655 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1895,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after much rain during the night. Blowing hard from WNW.</p>\r\n<p>Mr Alderton left. Dined at home. At the billiard room. The whist club with me this evening</p>","pageId":1027,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1838,"lock":null}
