20:13:19.656 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1904,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp foggy morning. Wind WSW. Went over to South Shields <span class=highlight_yellow>Homeralson</span> of <span class=highlight_yellow>quadsdates</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; committee in the afternoon and evening</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1847,"lock":null}
20:13:19.656 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/11/1905
