20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1905,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Attended the committee room &amp; canvassed.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at the Barkers</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1848,"lock":null}
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/12/1906
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1906,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Met Mr Ilderton at the George &amp; walked in procession with him to the <span class=highlight_yellow>leugs</span>. Shew of hands in his favour. Dined at Barkers at the theatre in the evening, Bespeak</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1849,"lock":null}
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
