20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1906,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Met Mr Ilderton at the George &amp; walked in procession with him to the <span class=highlight_yellow>leugs</span>. Shew of hands in his favour. Dined at Barkers at the theatre in the evening, Bespeak</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1849,"lock":null}
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/13/1907
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1907,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The following commenced at 9 o'clock. Young took the lead &amp; kept all day 6/ ahead at the close. Dined at Barkers.</p>\r\n<p>A very rainy night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1850,"lock":null}
20:13:19.657 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/13/1907
20:13:19.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1907,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The following commenced at 9 o'clock. Young took the lead &amp; kept all day 6/ ahead at the close. Dined at Barkers.</p>\r\n<p>A very rainy night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1850,"lock":null}
20:13:19.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/14/1908
20:13:19.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1908,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Polling began at 8 o'clock. Young still kept the lead, our voters not daring to come up intimidated by the threats of the Young party. At the close Young won by.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1851,"lock":null}
20:13:19.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
