20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/28/1922
20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1922,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. Engaged with WBS all the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At the billiard room. WBS left me at 6 o'clock for Newcastle, thence for mail to London. At Bess</p>","pageId":1031,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1865,"lock":null}
