20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1922,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. Engaged with WBS all the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At the billiard room. WBS left me at 6 o'clock for Newcastle, thence for mail to London. At Bess</p>","pageId":1031,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1865,"lock":null}
20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/29/1923
20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1923,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning, blowing a gale all day at SE. Sea high. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobblings quarrelled with me. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess in the evening. &amp; at whist club at J Tinley's in the evening</p>","pageId":1031,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1866,"lock":null}
20:13:19.666 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
