20:13:19.667 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/3/1897
20:13:19.667 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1897,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing hard from the WNW. Received a letter from WBS and answered it. Dined at home.</p>\r\n<p>At the billiard room.</p>\r\n<p>Attended the committee room &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":1028,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1840,"lock":null}
