20:13:19.668 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/31/1925
20:13:19.668 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1925,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Quite a winters morning with snow. Wind SW. After a stormy night &amp; SE wind</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room.</p>\r\n<p>Spent the evening &amp; night with Bess. The Doctor there</p>","pageId":1031,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1868,"lock":null}
