20:13:19.676 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/16/1612
20:13:19.676 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1612,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather &amp; Kean fresh wind SW. paid into Chapmans rents on account of executors: &pound;30. Drew on my own account &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":987,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1556,"lock":null}
