20:13:19.676 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1612,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather &amp; Kean fresh wind SW. paid into Chapmans rents on account of executors: &pound;30. Drew on my own account &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":987,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1556,"lock":null}
20:13:19.676 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/17/1613
20:13:19.676 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1613,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Walked up to <span class=highlight_yellow>Jkcuth</span> dock &amp; dined on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Crides</span> with H Nicholson. At the theatre at night.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got &pound;43.10/ of Cs &amp; co on executors account to pay E Galbraith's <span class=highlight_yellow>Buaisd</span> &amp; tomorrow</p>","pageId":987,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1557,"lock":null}
