20:13:19.677 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/18/1614
20:13:19.677 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1614,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; sharp frost. Wind WNW. Breakfasted with Tinley. John drove me up to Newcastle &amp; back again to dinner with him at 5 o'clock. Charles Mallory came &amp; attended the whist club at Goslings in the evening. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":987,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1558,"lock":null}
