20:13:19.683 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/26/1622
20:13:19.683 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1622,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp cold unpleasant morning. Wind SE. Slept at D. Dixon's all night. Attended a meeting of the officers to pay the dinner bill &amp; exact fines. Took the steamer at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; returned to Shields at 5 o'clock to dinner. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1566,"lock":null}
