20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/3/1599
20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1599,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at W by N. Went by Drew's coach to Newcastle. Attended the Hope Club annual meeting &amp; dined. Returned to Shields at night in a gig with Mr Harrison. At Bess'</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1543,"lock":null}
20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
