20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1599,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at W by N. Went by Drew's coach to Newcastle. Attended the Hope Club annual meeting &amp; dined. Returned to Shields at night in a gig with Mr Harrison. At Bess'</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1543,"lock":null}
20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/4/1600
20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1600,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind  WSW blowing fresh. Wrote to WBS with a copy of the Harrisons policy got from Mr Car yesterday. Dined at home. Had some punch at the Albion with Richardson, French, Nicholson on Boswell. Called at bess. Spent the evening at the Albion with the above party.</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1544,"lock":null}
20:13:19.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
