20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1600,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind  WSW blowing fresh. Wrote to WBS with a copy of the Harrisons policy got from Mr Car yesterday. Dined at home. Had some punch at the Albion with Richardson, French, Nicholson on Boswell. Called at bess. Spent the evening at the Albion with the above party.</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1544,"lock":null}
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/5/1601
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1601,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at SW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night. Began to blow very hard from the SSE</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1545,"lock":null}
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/5/1601
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1601,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at SW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night. Began to blow very hard from the SSE</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1545,"lock":null}
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/6/1602
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1602,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined at the Albion at 3 o'clock. Dinner given to H French by the party. A dull morning. Blowing hard &amp; has been all night. Nearly a gale from the SSE. Spent a very pleasant day at the theatre and the evening accepted J Tinley's bill for &pound;39 at 4 months.</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1546,"lock":null}
20:13:19.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/6/1602
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1602,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined at the Albion at 3 o'clock. Dinner given to H French by the party. A dull morning. Blowing hard &amp; has been all night. Nearly a gale from the SSE. Spent a very pleasant day at the theatre and the evening accepted J Tinley's bill for &pound;39 at 4 months.</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1546,"lock":null}
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/7/1603
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1603,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with H J Metcalf at 5 o'clock. A fine morning. Wind NW. Walked round by Tynemouth &amp; the fields home. Spent a very pleasant day at Metcalf's</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1547,"lock":null}
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.688 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/7/1603
20:13:19.689 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1603,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with H J Metcalf at 5 o'clock. A fine morning. Wind NW. Walked round by Tynemouth &amp; the fields home. Spent a very pleasant day at Metcalf's</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1547,"lock":null}
20:13:19.689 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/8/1604
20:13:19.689 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1604,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW at the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined at home. At the Billiard room again in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night. The Bachelors Bespeak at the theatre this night but I did not go, not approving of the farce</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1548,"lock":null}
20:13:19.689 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/8/1604
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1604,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW at the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined at home. At the Billiard room again in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night. The Bachelors Bespeak at the theatre this night but I did not go, not approving of the farce</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1548,"lock":null}
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/9/1605
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1605,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a good deal of rain in the night from NW. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening &amp; finished off with H French before he crossed the water for <span class=highlight_yellow>heck</span> at the widows</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1549,"lock":null}
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
