20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1605,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a good deal of rain in the night from NW. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening &amp; finished off with H French before he crossed the water for <span class=highlight_yellow>heck</span> at the widows</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1549,"lock":null}
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/1/1626
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
20:13:19.690 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/1/1626
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/10/1635
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1635,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind variable between NW &amp; SW. Got up early &amp; went to Newcastle. Received &pound;1.4. of Mr Spencer, Hope's average. Returned to Shields to dinner but obliged by a letter from WBS to start for Newcastle again to see <span class=highlight_yellow>K Bend</span>. Got the bills returned to Shields &amp; sent them off by post to WBS. At the whist club at Doctor Drewy's</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1579,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/10/1635
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1635,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind variable between NW &amp; SW. Got up early &amp; went to Newcastle. Received &pound;1.4. of Mr Spencer, Hope's average. Returned to Shields to dinner but obliged by a letter from WBS to start for Newcastle again to see <span class=highlight_yellow>K Bend</span>. Got the bills returned to Shields &amp; sent them off by post to WBS. At the whist club at Doctor Drewy's</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1579,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/11/1636
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1636,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind WSW. Leadbottom attacked by the cholera. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Doctor Drewry. Leadbottom doing very well in the evening. Slept with Bess.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1580,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/11/1636
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1636,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind WSW. Leadbottom attacked by the cholera. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Doctor Drewry. Leadbottom doing very well in the evening. Slept with Bess.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1580,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/12/1637
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1637,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind about S or S by E. Remained with Bess all day. Jobling came to dinner. Got home &amp; went to bed before 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1581,"lock":null}
20:13:19.691 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
