20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1643,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, blowing hard from NW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; round by the fields. Lunched at Home with Jobbling. At church in the afternoon. Dined with J Tinley &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1587,"lock":null}
20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/19/1644
20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1644,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Showery and blowing hard from the NW. paid E Reads mother &frac14; years wages &pound;2.7.3. Dined at home. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; with bess at night.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span class=highlight_yellow>Waed</span> declined giving more than &pound;60 for the George</p>","pageId":992,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1588,"lock":null}
20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
