20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/2/1627
20:13:19.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1627,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind S by E, afterwards SW. Walked to Tynemouth round by Cullercoats, home to dinner at the billiard room in the afternoon. Called on Bess &amp; went to the theatre in the evening. Slept <span class=highlight_yellow>Eastward</span></p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1571,"lock":null}
