20:13:19.697 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1646,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing hard from the NW &amp; W. Beeing the fast day I went to church twice &amp; heard excellent sermons from the curate &amp; Mr Mark, never saw the  church so full. W C Wright dined with me at 5 o'clock. H Hurry came &amp; took wine with Bess at night</p>","pageId":992,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1590,"lock":null}
20:13:19.697 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/22/1647
20:13:19.697 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1647,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; still blowing hard from the W by N. H Hurry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth castle yard. Wrote to WBS. Dined with Rudyard of the 15<sup>th</sup> regiment at 5 o'clock &amp; he accompanied me to the clerk in the evening. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":992,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1591,"lock":null}
