20:13:19.704 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/6/1631
20:13:19.704 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1631,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing hard from SW with showers. Very tired &amp; breakfasted in bed. Got up at 1 o'clock. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Went to a dance at Miss N Fenwick. A pleasant evening</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1575,"lock":null}
