20:13:19.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1668,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind NE. Mr Bird breakfasted with me &amp; came back for dinner. I signed a charter for S<sup>t</sup> Andrew &amp; sent it to WBS.</p>\r\n<p>Benton agricultural show. Dined with Charlton at Boggins. Did not go. Received a charter from the tees Co but refused it. At Bess</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1612,"lock":null}
