20:13:19.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1669,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another cold day. Wind ENE. Gully called &amp; lunched. Drury &amp; Charlton dined with me on board the Hope. Called at Harrisons. With Bess at night. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1613,"lock":null}
