20:13:19.710 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/4/14/1670
20:13:19.710 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1670,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Not quite <span class=highlight_yellow>cold</span>. Wind E. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Spent the afternoon playing at gravitas with Bradshaw, also spent the evening there</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1614,"lock":null}
