20:13:19.711 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1672,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning. Wind NNE. Received a letter from WBS advising me not to accept Birds charter. Wrote to Bird. Dined at home. On board the Choise in the afternoon &amp; had some punch. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1616,"lock":null}
