20:13:19.715 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1679,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Blowing hard from the SW. Went by steam to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to take coals out to <span class=highlight_yellow>Swinemsend</span> at &pound;6.6 per keel. Returned home to dinner &amp; afterwards went to Tynemouth races which were very bad. Turned out a wet day &amp; spoiled the sport.  At Bess at night</p>","pageId":997,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1623,"lock":null}
20:13:19.716 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/4/24/1680
20:13:19.716 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1680,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NNW. Went to Newcastle and returned home to dinner. Dr Drewry dined with me. Went to races in the afternoon. Pretty good sport for the cup which was won by Holroyd who entertained a large party at Smithson's. Spent a very pleasant evening. A deluge of rain</p>","pageId":997,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1624,"lock":null}
20:13:19.716 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
