20:13:19.724 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/10/1696
20:13:19.724 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1696,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Still blowing hard from N by E &amp; a heavy sea. Received a letter from WBS. Dined at home. Wrote to BBG <font color=#BFBFBF>(Benjamin Baker </font><font color=#BFBFBF>G</font><font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>) Went across the water with the Doctor. At the George and at night with Bess</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1640,"lock":null}
