20:13:19.725 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1697,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine dry weather. Wind N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1641,"lock":null}
20:13:19.725 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/12/1698
20:13:19.725 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1698,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather &amp; blowing hard at about N by W. Sea high. Dined at home. Walked in the afternoon with Charlton &amp; Doctor Drewry to Billy Mill &amp; had wine. Signed a bill to Chapmans for &pound;150. At Bess at night.</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1642,"lock":null}
