20:13:19.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1699,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind still from the N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Took wine &amp; spent the evening at Tibbs. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1643,"lock":null}
20:13:19.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/14/1700
20:13:19.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1700,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a cool NNW wind. Afterwards got to NNE. Went to the coach to Newcastle&amp; got settled with the Hope Club <span class=highlight_yellow>and allowing</span> a calking. Called and saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Got home to dinner. With Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Heavy shower of rain &amp; hail</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1644,"lock":null}
20:13:19.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
