20:13:19.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1702,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but still cool with a NNE wind. Walked round by the high end of the town to the Doctors garden, there to Tynemouth &amp; home to dinner. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1646,"lock":null}
20:13:19.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/17/1703
20:13:19.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1703,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. J Cunningham breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went to Sunderland to look at the Harmony. Returned home to dinner. The Reformers had a procession this evening. Received a letter from WBS. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1647,"lock":null}
20:13:19.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
