20:13:19.732 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1708,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful warm weather. Wind West. Walked to Newcastle. Dined at Harrisons at 3 o'clock. At Bess's at night. Drew &pound;16 of <span class=highlight_yellow>Co &amp; Co to pay Mo</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>y</span></sup><span class=highlight_yellow> Mr B</span></p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1652,"lock":null}
20:13:19.732 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/23/1709
