20:13:19.736 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/5/7/1693
20:13:19.736 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1693,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A fresh breeze from the WSW. The Hope's charter &amp; despatches came for Wyburg &amp; Hull at 60/ for Wades <span class=highlight_yellow>Flo</span>. Dined on board the Hope. She could not go to sea being too much swell on. Called upon <span class=highlight_yellow>Nelacd</span> the <span class=highlight_yellow>baedegream</span></p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1637,"lock":null}
