20:13:19.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/10/1720
20:13:19.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1720,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Walked out after breakfast to see Reeds <span class=highlight_yellow>hrrkeout</span> at Grays. Davison &amp; Duncan dined &amp; spent the day with us.</p>","pageId":1002,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1664,"lock":null}
