20:13:19.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/11/1721
20:13:19.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1721,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still cool damp weather. Wind SE. had two hours fishing before dinner, better sport. Dined at 2 o'clock &amp; at &frac12; past <span class=highlight_yellow>7</span> o'clock go <span class=highlight_yellow>upon</span>. The Highflyer &amp; came to Newcastle &amp; thence by gig home. With Bess at night. Very wet and stormy</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1665,"lock":null}
20:13:19.738 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
