20:13:19.739 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1722,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rainy morning. Wind SE. Dined at home. At Harrisons &amp; Doctor Drury's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1666,"lock":null}
