20:13:19.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/13/1723
20:13:19.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1723,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SSE. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon went by water with H Hurry to Saddlers with whom we had a bottle of wine. Attended Ilderton Committee. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1667,"lock":null}
