20:13:19.740 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1724,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine summer weather &amp; warm. Wind SW. Came <span class=highlight_yellow>afsed</span> the low town until 11 o'clock &amp; then went to Newcastle. Saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Sold the carriage for &pound;12. Got home to dinner a little after 4 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. At the committee Room. Also at Webb's &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1668,"lock":null}
