20:13:19.741 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1727,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SE. Went to church. Walked Tynemouth. Ilderton dined with me. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1671,"lock":null}
