20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1727,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SE. Went to church. Walked Tynemouth. Ilderton dined with me. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":1003,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1671,"lock":null}
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/18/1728
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1728,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind ___. After breakfast Reid &amp; I went by the steamer to Newcastle. Walked to the Racecourse. The running very bad. Dined at the stand. Walked back to Newcastle in the evening &amp; returned to Shields by steam. With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1672,"lock":null}
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/18/1728
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1728,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind ___. After breakfast Reid &amp; I went by the steamer to Newcastle. Walked to the Racecourse. The running very bad. Dined at the stand. Walked back to Newcastle in the evening &amp; returned to Shields by steam. With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1672,"lock":null}
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/19/1729
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1729,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind variable. Ceased raining during the day but very dull &amp; close. Woke at 11 o'clock by steam to Newcastle. Walked to the course, better sport than yesterday. Returned in the evening by a gig. At Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1673,"lock":null}
20:13:19.742 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/19/1729
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1729,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind variable. Ceased raining during the day but very dull &amp; close. Woke at 11 o'clock by steam to Newcastle. Walked to the course, better sport than yesterday. Returned in the evening by a gig. At Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1673,"lock":null}
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/20/1730
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/20/1730
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/21/1731
20:13:19.743 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1731,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went again to Newcastle by steam. Dined with Mr Dodds &amp; afterwards walked to the course. Poor running. Both cups won easily. The <span class=highlight_yellow>GoO</span> by Mary Cleveland &amp; the silver by Captain Potts. Returned to Mr Dodds &amp; got home by steam at 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1675,"lock":null}
