20:13:19.746 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1737,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Very warm. Went over the water &amp; attended Mr Fairles funeral which was followed by a long procession of gentlemen from all parts. I canvassed for Mr Bell. Dined at 4 o'clock &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1005,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1681,"lock":null}
