20:13:19.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/13/1754
20:13:19.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1754,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been raining heavily all night. Wind NE. Cleared up after breakfast. Went to sea with Cunningham. Got becalmed &amp; could not <span class=highlight_yellow>race</span> tide. Got a steamer which <span class=highlight_yellow>towed</span> us there. A heavy sea <span class=highlight_yellow>pooped</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>breeze</span>. Dined at <span class=highlight_yellow>Maltrevans</span>. With Bess</p>","pageId":1007,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1697,"lock":null}
