20:13:19.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/14/1755
20:13:19.754 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1755,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been heavy rain all night. Called upon Jon Laing.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>At Harrisons</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Walked to Tynemouth in the evening.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1007,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1698,"lock":null}
