20:13:19.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/27/1768
20:13:19.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1768,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind NNE. Robert &amp; BBG set off for Togston. Went to sea with Cunningham. Attended the committee room in the evening &amp; walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1711,"lock":null}
20:13:19.761 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
