20:13:19.762 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1769,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful moon. Wind ENE. Went to sea with a fair brig but as usual we were soon becalmed &amp; brought up off the Castle. Had sport fishing drove into the harbour with the tide &amp; got to our moorings at 4 o'clock. Dined on board. Called at Malthouse. At the committee room</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1712,"lock":null}
20:13:19.762 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/29/1770
20:13:19.762 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1770,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. Went to church. Dined at home Walked to Tynemouth. At Cunningham's &amp; drank tea</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1713,"lock":null}
20:13:19.762 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
