20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1770,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. Went to church. Dined at home Walked to Tynemouth. At Cunningham's &amp; drank tea</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1713,"lock":null}
20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/3/1744
20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1744,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather. Wind SE. Bathed again this morning. Walked to Tynemouth. Mr Harrison &amp; his friend Mr Lagcook dined with us at 5 o'clock</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":1006,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1687,"lock":null}
20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
