20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1744,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather. Wind SE. Bathed again this morning. Walked to Tynemouth. Mr Harrison &amp; his friend Mr Lagcook dined with us at 5 o'clock</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":1006,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1687,"lock":null}
20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/30/1771
20:13:19.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1771,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind from the E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Bess &amp; Jobling at June Laptons. Walked to Tynemouth gave us the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; night with Bess in the barracks having taken lodgings there for a few days</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1714,"lock":null}
