20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/9/1750
20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1750,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the W by N. Been a great deal of rain in the night. Walked to Cheston. Dined at home at Harrison in the afternoon. Attended the committee in the evening &amp; at home</p>","pageId":1007,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1693,"lock":null}
20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
