20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1750,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the W by N. Been a great deal of rain in the night. Walked to Cheston. Dined at home at Harrison in the afternoon. Attended the committee in the evening &amp; at home</p>","pageId":1007,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1693,"lock":null}
20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/1/1773
20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1773,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SE. Got up &amp; bathed. BBG &amp; Robert returned from Togston last night. <span class=highlight_yellow>Drank with</span> BBG. I went to Newcastle &amp; drank with D Dixon &amp; came home by steam in the evening</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1716,"lock":null}
20:13:19.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
