20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1773,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SE. Got up &amp; bathed. BBG &amp; Robert returned from Togston last night. <span class=highlight_yellow>Drank with</span> BBG. I went to Newcastle &amp; drank with D Dixon &amp; came home by steam in the evening</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1716,"lock":null}
20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/10/1782
20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1782,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather. Wind S by W &amp; SSW. Went out to sea with the intention of going to Seaham, but could not get further than Souter Point. Brought up at Marsden Rock &amp; dined, went onshore &amp; spent two or three hours &amp; got back in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Macherr's</span> &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1725,"lock":null}
20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
