20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1782,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather. Wind S by W &amp; SSW. Went out to sea with the intention of going to Seaham, but could not get further than Souter Point. Brought up at Marsden Rock &amp; dined, went onshore &amp; spent two or three hours &amp; got back in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Macherr's</span> &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1725,"lock":null}
20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/11/1783
20:13:19.768 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1783,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind blowing fresh from the SW. Walked round by <span class=highlight_yellow>Gra</span><span class=highlight_yellow>i</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ger</span> Garden. Dined at home. At Harrison's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1726,"lock":null}
