20:13:19.769 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/12/1784
20:13:19.769 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1784,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. At church. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening.</p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1727,"lock":null}
