20:13:19.769 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1785,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1728,"lock":null}
20:13:19.769 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/13/1785
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1785,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1728,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/14/1786
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1786,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Went to sea &amp; had a most delightful run to Seaham. Got our dinner on board &amp; afterwards spent a couple of hours on shore. Started at 4 o'clock &amp; turning quite calm. We did not get home until 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1729,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/14/1786
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1786,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Went to sea &amp; had a most delightful run to Seaham. Got our dinner on board &amp; afterwards spent a couple of hours on shore. Started at 4 o'clock &amp; turning quite calm. We did not get home until 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1729,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/15/1787
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1787,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Wind ESE. Turned out fine. BBG left us &amp; went by the steamer to Stockton there to take the Majestic for London. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS at Harrisons &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1730,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/15/1787
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1787,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Wind ESE. Turned out fine. BBG left us &amp; went by the steamer to Stockton there to take the Majestic for London. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS at Harrisons &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1730,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/16/1788
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1788,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind N. Received a letter from Mr Garbull with the Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>first</span> account &amp; bill of <span class=highlight_yellow>Wades</span> at 4 months dated the 11<sup>th</sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Jan</span> for &pound;153.6.3 &amp; paid it into Chapmans. Paid Bradshaw's bill for &pound;39.8. Dined at home. At Harrison's with Bess.</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1731,"lock":null}
20:13:19.770 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/16/1788
20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1788,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind N. Received a letter from Mr Garbull with the Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>first</span> account &amp; bill of <span class=highlight_yellow>Wades</span> at 4 months dated the 11<sup>th</sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Jan</span> for &pound;153.6.3 &amp; paid it into Chapmans. Paid Bradshaw's bill for &pound;39.8. Dined at home. At Harrison's with Bess.</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1731,"lock":null}
20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/17/1789
20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1789,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; little rain started up. Wind variable. Went to sea, dined at Marsden Rock &amp; got home in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Mathwens</span> &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1732,"lock":null}
