20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/18/1790
20:13:19.771 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1790,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Rainy morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 5 o'clock with J Tenley a party. Called at Dixon</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1733,"lock":null}
