20:13:19.774 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1794,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Cunningham &amp; I went to sea &amp; were joined by others at the Haven. Light showers but a beautiful breeze all day. Landed at Marsden Rock. Brought up under the castle until lunch <span class=highlight_yellow>cyssed</span> &amp; got home at 8o'clock. With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1737,"lock":null}
20:13:19.774 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/23/1795
20:13:19.774 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1795,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Premium club bill due &pound;9.10.6 paid. A fine morning &amp; fresh breeze at WNW. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth. Cunningham &amp; I called &amp; drank a glass with Captain Mann. With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1738,"lock":null}
20:13:19.774 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
