20:13:19.775 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1796,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind fresh from the Westward. Went over the water &amp; fished for <span class=highlight_yellow>hornests</span> &amp; was successful. Cunningham dined with me &amp; J H Richardson came &amp; took wine of which we had rather too much. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1739,"lock":null}
20:13:19.775 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/25/1797
20:13:19.775 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1797,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the NE. Went out hornect fishing but too much <span class=highlight_yellow>sheets</span> to catch any. Dined at home. Rather stormy &amp; wet evening.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1740,"lock":null}
