20:13:19.776 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1798,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with showers &amp; blowing hard from the NNE. Did not go to church. Walked to Tynemouth called upon captain Potts &amp; dined with him at 3 o'clock. With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1741,"lock":null}
