20:13:19.777 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/29/1801
20:13:19.777 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1801,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been torrents of rain all night &amp; blowing hard from the NE. A heavy sea. Dined at home. At the Doctors suppered at the Northumberland Alms &amp; spent the evening at the Widows</p>","pageId":1014,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1744,"lock":null}
