20:13:19.835 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/11/28/2260
20:13:19.835 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2260,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":11,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Douralled J Tinley about Bowles impossibility selling the manure off the farm. J Tinlet wrote him a letter threatening proceedings if he did not bring it back or pay the value &amp; also said that he would not charge us with the expenses but get them from Bowlls &amp; Souther. Dined at home. Suppered with the Albion whist club</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2200,"lock":null}
