20:13:19.841 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2263,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Blowing hard at W &amp; shower. Received a letter from WBS about his insurance out at &amp; will a letter to Chapmans. Saw them &amp; wrote to WBS with their answer. H Hurry dined with me. Spent a pleasant evening &amp; suppered with J Cunningham</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2203,"lock":null}
