20:13:19.842 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2272,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind from the N &amp; W. Went by steam to Newcastle &amp; from there walked with D Dixon to Benton's where we met Dr Fenwick who went home in the evening. I stayed all night.</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2212,"lock":null}
