20:13:19.868 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/3/1/1987
20:13:19.868 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1987,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Went to Newcastle. Brought Emma Galbraith down with me. We dined at Mrs Reeds to meet there Ilderton. Received a letter from BBG from the <span class=highlight_yellow>Macerations</span>. All well except Mr Barnes who was deranged</p>","pageId":1071,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1928,"lock":null}
