20:13:19.872 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/3/2/1988
20:13:19.872 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1988,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW. Did not go to church till the afternoon. Dined at J Tinley</p>","pageId":1071,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1929,"lock":null}
