20:13:19.888 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2041,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind NE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined on board the Craig. At the Albion in the evening. Quarrelled with W Charlton &amp; pulled his nose</p>","pageId":1076,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1982,"lock":null}
