20:13:19.897 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/15/2063
20:13:19.897 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2063,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Took the coach to Whittingham &amp; walked from thence to Lemmington. Dined with Mr Bussett at Broom park at 5 o'clock. Met the Smiths from Togston. Messrs Clatterbuck, the Morses etc</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2003,"lock":null}
