20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2063,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Took the coach to Whittingham &amp; walked from thence to Lemmington. Dined with Mr Bussett at Broom park at 5 o'clock. Met the Smiths from Togston. Messrs Clatterbuck, the Morses etc</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2003,"lock":null}
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/16/2064
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2064,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful morning. Amused ourselves shooting rooks. After lunch Bob Ilderton rode to Alnwick. Heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in the afternoon</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2004,"lock":null}
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
