20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2064,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful morning. Amused ourselves shooting rooks. After lunch Bob Ilderton rode to Alnwick. Heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in the afternoon</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2004,"lock":null}
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/17/2065
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
20:13:19.898 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/17/2065
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/18/2066
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/18/2066
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/19/2067
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
20:13:19.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/19/2067
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/2/2049
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2049,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind ESE. Mr Thompson of South Shields &amp; another examined the Hope. Dined with C Charlton at the Northumberland Alms. At H Hurry in the evening. He has got a slight attack of gout. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1077,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1990,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/2/2049
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2049,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind ESE. Mr Thompson of South Shields &amp; another examined the Hope. Dined with C Charlton at the Northumberland Alms. At H Hurry in the evening. He has got a slight attack of gout. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1077,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1990,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/20/2068
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/20/2068
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/21/2069
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
20:13:19.900 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/21/2069
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/22/2070
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2070,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather &amp; wind SE. Received a letter from WBS. Answered it with the Kent &amp; Gth account &amp; informing him of the the sale of the Hope. R Ilderton came down &amp; we &amp; H Hurry dined with Mr Tibbs</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2010,"lock":null}
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/22/2070
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2070,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather &amp; wind SE. Received a letter from WBS. Answered it with the Kent &amp; Gth account &amp; informing him of the the sale of the Hope. R Ilderton came down &amp; we &amp; H Hurry dined with Mr Tibbs</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2010,"lock":null}
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/23/2071
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2071,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Rob Ilderton left for Newcastle. Dined with Messrs Dobson, Richard, Richardson, Lowing &amp; Hurry at the Albion. An excellent dinner. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2011,"lock":null}
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.901 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/23/2071
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2071,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Rob Ilderton left for Newcastle. Dined with Messrs Dobson, Richard, Richardson, Lowing &amp; Hurry at the Albion. An excellent dinner. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2011,"lock":null}
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/24/2072
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2072,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The glass continues very high, at set fair &amp; fine weather. Wind NE. Mr Young gone from home, consequently his bill not paid. Went to Newcastle by steam. Paid Augur for cleaning carriage 18/-. Dined with Dr Fenwick &amp; returned in the evening. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2012,"lock":null}
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
