20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2072,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The glass continues very high, at set fair &amp; fine weather. Wind NE. Mr Young gone from home, consequently his bill not paid. Went to Newcastle by steam. Paid Augur for cleaning carriage 18/-. Dined with Dr Fenwick &amp; returned in the evening. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2012,"lock":null}
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/25/2073
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2073,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather, fresh breeze at NE &amp; sea high &amp; rather cool. H Hurry &amp; I walked round by Preston. Dined with him &amp; spent the evening at Tynemouth, the Barracks &amp; the Abbey</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2013,"lock":null}
20:13:19.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
