20:13:19.906 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/6/2053
20:13:19.906 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2053,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW. Went to Newcastle &amp; took the Alnwick Coach &amp; arrived at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Had a mutton chop at the Swan &amp; Walked out to Lamington. The Idleston's carriage was in but could not wait</p>","pageId":1077,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1994,"lock":null}
