20:13:19.909 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2080,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind as well as I can judge from the S &amp; W. the family did not attend morning service, it being at Bolton where they have no pew. They went in the afternoon. I did not.</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2020,"lock":null}
20:13:19.909 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/10/2089
20:13:19.909 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2089,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Went with Mr &amp; Mrs I<font color=#BFBFBF>lderton</font> to Ilderton Cottage &amp; returned to dinner at 6 o'clock. Robert went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Woolie</span> to join Major Grunward. A heavy fall of rain with thunder</p>","pageId":1081,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2029,"lock":null}
