20:13:19.910 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/12/2091
20:13:19.910 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2091,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>No change in the weather. Went to Rosen &amp; found Robert, I &amp; Major Greenwood there. Drove up in a cart to the Dod. Saw the ship washing. Dined upon the <span class=highlight_yellow>Jarf</span> &quot;Pie Nie&quot;. Took tea at Rosene with Mr &amp; Mrs Neil &amp; returned home at night</p>","pageId":1081,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2031,"lock":null}
