20:13:19.915 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2101,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with H Harry. We with Holdroyd &amp; Mr Burns went up by water &amp; Sadlers &amp; spent the afternoon. In the evening crossed the river to see the railroad &amp; walked down it. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1082,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2041,"lock":null}
