20:13:19.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/25/2104
20:13:19.916 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2104,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Sailed round to the Haven &amp; walked back. Dined at 2 o'clock. The steward of the St Hilda called, having brought Mr Baskes home &amp; gave me good account of BB Galbraith. Saw Mr Pletts. Out fishing for an hour with the doctor. Came on a very wet night. Finished at H Harry's</p>","pageId":1082,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2044,"lock":null}
