20:13:19.919 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/30/2109
20:13:19.919 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2109,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind NW. Bathed for the first time. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. H Hurry &amp; C Cockrill &amp; I rowed down to see the salmon fishing &amp; landed at the Haven. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2049,"lock":null}
