20:13:19.919 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2109,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind NW. Bathed for the first time. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. H Hurry &amp; C Cockrill &amp; I rowed down to see the salmon fishing &amp; landed at the Haven. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2049,"lock":null}
20:13:19.920 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/4/2083
20:13:19.920 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2083,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Mr Ilderton drove me over to Ilderton. Bob &amp; Tom rode. Left Mr I there &amp; we went out to the Glen to fish &amp; had pretty fair sport considering the weather. Sent some trout to Dr Drury  &amp; so tired that we stopped &amp; slept at Wooler Cottage</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2023,"lock":null}
20:13:19.920 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
