20:13:19.926 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/18/2127
20:13:19.926 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2127,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning after heavy rain during the night. Wind E by S. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went out in the boat with the Doctor. No sport. At Tynemouth again in the evening. At The Albion with My Sproogy &amp; Holroyd. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2067,"lock":null}
