20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2128,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning blowing hard at ENE &amp; sea high. Dined with H Hurry. Called at the Doctor's &amp; finished at the Pig</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2068,"lock":null}
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/2/2111
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2111,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Received a letter from WBS which much relieved my mind &amp; made me feel happier than I have done some time, stating the almost certainty of his getting appointed to a situation on the Coal Exchange by the Factors &amp; also giving me leave to <span class=highlight_yellow>dras</span> upon him for the Hope's tradesmen's bills. H Hurry dined with me. At Tynemouth. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2051,"lock":null}
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/2/2111
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2111,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Received a letter from WBS which much relieved my mind &amp; made me feel happier than I have done some time, stating the almost certainty of his getting appointed to a situation on the Coal Exchange by the Factors &amp; also giving me leave to <span class=highlight_yellow>dras</span> upon him for the Hope's tradesmen's bills. H Hurry dined with me. At Tynemouth. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2051,"lock":null}
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/20/2129
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2129,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning after a deluge of rain all night. Wind E, E by S &amp; SE. Dined with the Doctor. At Tynemouth both morning and evening</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2069,"lock":null}
20:13:19.928 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/20/2129
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2129,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning after a deluge of rain all night. Wind E, E by S &amp; SE. Dined with the Doctor. At Tynemouth both morning and evening</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2069,"lock":null}
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/21/2130
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2130,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after more heavy rain in the night. Wind SE. Dined at the Pig &amp; Thistle, intended to be beefsteaks to be sent by Jos Elder, but not done in his usual mean way, the beef was so course &amp; tough that was not fit to eat or be sent on board any ship. We were properly treated for condescending to receive a treat from such a man &amp; I blame myself much for going. He took good care not to be present himself. Drank tea at Hurry's &amp; at Tynemouth in the evening. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2070,"lock":null}
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/21/2130
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2130,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after more heavy rain in the night. Wind SE. Dined at the Pig &amp; Thistle, intended to be beefsteaks to be sent by Jos Elder, but not done in his usual mean way, the beef was so course &amp; tough that was not fit to eat or be sent on board any ship. We were properly treated for condescending to receive a treat from such a man &amp; I blame myself much for going. He took good care not to be present himself. Drank tea at Hurry's &amp; at Tynemouth in the evening. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2070,"lock":null}
20:13:19.929 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/22/2131
