20:13:19.930 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/25/2134
20:13:19.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2134,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. The artillery horse &amp; foot &amp; the 7<sup>th</sup> Hussars had a field day on Cullercoat Sands. A fine sight &amp; Richardson &amp; I afterwards dined with Charlton at Southerns</p>","pageId":1086,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2074,"lock":null}
