20:13:19.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/26/2135
20:13:19.931 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2135,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up early &amp; bathed, it afterwards rained, wind S by W. Dined with H Hurry &amp; spent the day. Heavy rain</p>","pageId":1086,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2075,"lock":null}
