20:13:19.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/27/2136
20:13:19.932 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2136,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Heavy rain until 9 o'clock. Wind from the East. C Cockrill breakfasted with me &amp; we went to the Catholic Chapple. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley.  <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>oist</span> scotch</p>","pageId":1086,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2076,"lock":null}
