20:13:19.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/3/2112
20:13:19.933 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2112,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Turned out fine. Wind SE. Received threatening letter from J Metcalf &amp; Son about the Hope's bill. Went over the water &amp; saw them. Promised to pay in 4 months. Dined at home. At the Pig. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2052,"lock":null}
