20:13:19.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/7/2116
20:13:19.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2116,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Walked to Tynemouth. H Hurry came up &amp; we had some cold beef with Henderson &amp; spent the afternoon. Met Bess. A fine shower in the afternoon &amp; wind changed to SW</p>","pageId":1084,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2056,"lock":null}
20:13:19.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
