20:13:19.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/7/8/2117
20:13:19.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2117,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW &amp; warm. Rose before 6 o'clock. Walked by the fields to Cullercoats, bather &amp; returned by Tynemouth &amp; the shore, home to breakfast. Took a drive with the doctor. Dined with H Hurry. At the Albion with Harrison &amp;</p>","pageId":1084,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2057,"lock":null}
