20:13:19.941 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/8/16/2156
20:13:19.941 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2156,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind from the W but changed with the heat to E by S. Gave Metcalf &amp; Dale a bill at 3 months on WBS for &pound;20. Dined at home. In the afternoon J H Richardson, Hurry &amp; I went to sea. At Tynemouth in the evening &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1088,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2096,"lock":null}
