20:13:19.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/8/17/2157
20:13:19.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2157,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the W and again changed with the heat to SE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with C Cockrill 7 H Hurry at 3 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening. At the Commercial with C Charlton. Wind changed to NW with rain <span class=highlight_yellow>10aC</span></p>","pageId":1088,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2097,"lock":null}
