20:13:19.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/8/18/2158
20:13:19.942 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2158,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been raining all night &amp; still continues heavy. Wind changed to NNE. Received a letter from WBS. Dined at home. Had a glass of grog with H Hurry in the afternoon at the Albion. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1088,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2098,"lock":null}
