20:13:19.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2175,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Much rain last night. Now fine most rather cloudy. Wind WSW. Took a walk round by High Cheston. Dined at the Custom House. Attended the first monthly meeting of the Tynemouth Amateur Musical Society at the George. A musical company &amp; performances good. Bess got the Cholera &amp; dangerously ill</p>","pageId":1090,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2115,"lock":null}
20:13:19.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/5/2176
20:13:19.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2176,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Took a drive with the Doctor to Tynemouth &amp; Carville &amp; dined at the Goose &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Gissrey</span> Club at 3 o'clock. Finished at the abbey &amp; &pi;&omicron;&lambda; Jarvis</p>","pageId":1090,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2116,"lock":null}
