20:13:19.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2177,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; blowing fresh from the N by E. Heavy rain. Dined with H Hurry. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Jymes</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>th</span></sup> in the evening. Finished at C Cockrill</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2117,"lock":null}
20:13:19.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/7/2178
20:13:19.965 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2178,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with C Cockrill &amp; H Hurry at 3 o'clock ay <span class=highlight_yellow>Jymes</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>th</span></sup> again in the evening</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2118,"lock":null}
