20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2178,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with C Cockrill &amp; H Hurry at 3 o'clock ay <span class=highlight_yellow>Jymes</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>th</span></sup> again in the evening</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2118,"lock":null}
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/8/2179
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2179,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SE. Began to rain heavily after breakfast &amp; never ceased all day. Dined at home. In the house all day.</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2119,"lock":null}
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/8/2179
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2179,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SE. Began to rain heavily after breakfast &amp; never ceased all day. Dined at home. In the house all day.</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2119,"lock":null}
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/9/2180
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2180,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been heavy showers during the night &amp; every appearance of more. Wind NE. Sat in the house till 12 o'clock. Dined at 3 o'clock with J Harrison at a house warming he gave at the &quot;King Well&quot;. <span class=highlight_yellow>Stephenson Street</span> a large party &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2120,"lock":null}
20:13:19.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1834/9/9/2180
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2180,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been heavy showers during the night &amp; every appearance of more. Wind NE. Sat in the house till 12 o'clock. Dined at 3 o'clock with J Harrison at a house warming he gave at the &quot;King Well&quot;. <span class=highlight_yellow>Stephenson Street</span> a large party &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2120,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/1/2294
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2294,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonal morning. Very queer from last night's dissipation. Did not get up till late. Walked to Preston. Dined with JH Richardson at 3 o'clock. At &pi;&omicron;&lambda; Jarvis again</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2234,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
