20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2294,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonal morning. Very queer from last night's dissipation. Did not get up till late. Walked to Preston. Dined with JH Richardson at 3 o'clock. At &pi;&omicron;&lambda; Jarvis again</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2234,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/2/2295
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2295,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost. Wind NW. Suffering from the effects of last two nights. H Hurry, Charlton &amp; I dined at the Northumberland Arms &amp; went to the theatre in the evening &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2235,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
