20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2295,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost. Wind NW. Suffering from the effects of last two nights. H Hurry, Charlton &amp; I dined at the Northumberland Arms &amp; went to the theatre in the evening &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2235,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/3/2296
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2296,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful day. Very hard frost. Wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 4 o'clock and remained in the house</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2236,"lock":null}
20:13:19.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
