20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2296,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful day. Very hard frost. Wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 4 o'clock and remained in the house</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2236,"lock":null}
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/4/2297
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2297,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Hard frost. Wind WNW. Had a 2 o'clock dinner with H Hurry &amp; went to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Spent the evening at Southerns</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2237,"lock":null}
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/4/2297
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2297,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Hard frost. Wind WNW. Had a 2 o'clock dinner with H Hurry &amp; went to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Spent the evening at Southerns</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2237,"lock":null}
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1835/1/5/2298
20:13:19.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2298,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. <span class=highlight_yellow>Six</span> Charles Grey came to the George having offered himself for the borough. His Addressed the election in a beautiful &amp; eloquent speech &amp; declined coming forward this, but explained his determination to do so the next election. Dined at the George with his committee &amp; spent a pleasant day. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> Liver Kill</span> too unwell to attend</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2238,"lock":null}
