20:13:21.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/10
20:13:21.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":10,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>At church morning &amp; afternoon. Dined quietly with Mrs Scott A cold raw day. Wind SE. Heavy sea on the bar</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":7,"lock":null}
