20:13:21.264 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1009
20:13:21.264 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1009,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Afterwards changed to SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Returned home to dinner. In the afternoon at the Pig &amp; Whistle with A Harry &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":960,"lock":null}
