20:13:21.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1011,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Dined at home. In the afternoon walked round by the Doctor's garden &amp; the Bullring. In the evening at Tynemouth</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":962,"lock":null}
20:13:21.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
