20:13:21.267 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1014,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... to Tynemouth haven where I bathed. Walked home to dinner. In the afternoon we took I Richardson's coble &amp; went to sea mackerel fishing. Stood as far as Hartley Bay but caught nothing. Ran to the south &amp; brought up off the Herd where we caught several guraets &amp; got home at 10 o'clock after a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":837,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":965,"lock":null}
20:13:21.267 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1015
20:13:21.267 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1015,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Further most beautiful day &amp; but for a SE breeze would have been insufferably hot. Bathed again this morning. The water in fine order. Walked to Tynemouth. Got home to dinner. Took Wine at the George. Tea at A Harry's &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth. A great many people in the castle yard</p>","pageId":837,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":966,"lock":null}
