20:13:21.268 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1017
20:13:21.268 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1017,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful morning. Wind SE. bathed again. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. In the afternoon went to sea in the coble &amp; got home at &frac12; past 9 o'clock. Caught only one mackerel.</p>","pageId":837,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":968,"lock":null}
