20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1020,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Wind from SSW to WSW. Attended morning service. Dined at home. Sadler took his dinner with me. At Tynemouth in the evening &amp; spent an hour in the billiards room. A revolution in France</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":971,"lock":null}
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1021
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1021,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning wind SW. Very Squally with a heavy shower about 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine with Allen &amp; afterwards went to the Doctor's Garden. In the evening at Tynemouth again.</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":972,"lock":null}
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
