20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1021,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning wind SW. Very Squally with a heavy shower about 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine with Allen &amp; afterwards went to the Doctor's Garden. In the evening at Tynemouth again.</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":972,"lock":null}
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1022
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1022,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing hard at WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Webb. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the evening. Took coffee at I Finleys</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":973,"lock":null}
20:13:21.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1022
20:13:21.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1022,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing hard at WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Webb. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the evening. Took coffee at I Finleys</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":973,"lock":null}
20:13:21.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1023
20:13:21.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1023,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind variable during the day W &amp; SSE with rain in the afternoon. After hard fighting between the Parisians &amp; the military where about 8 or 10000 were killed, the former drove the military out of the city &amp; established pro: term: a provisional government &amp; appointing the Duke of Orleans retired general of the kingdom which he accepted. Charles the X &amp; his minions flown. The Lord Khoas where the French with much credit to themselves have effected the revolution without those outrages which characterized the former. Dined with Doctor Drourg. He &amp; Richardson afterwards came &amp; took wine with me.</p>","pageId":839,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":974,"lock":null}
20:13:21.271 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1023
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1023,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind variable during the day W &amp; SSE with rain in the afternoon. After hard fighting between the Parisians &amp; the military where about 8 or 10000 were killed, the former drove the military out of the city &amp; established pro: term: a provisional government &amp; appointing the Duke of Orleans retired general of the kingdom which he accepted. Charles the X &amp; his minions flown. The Lord Khoas where the French with much credit to themselves have effected the revolution without those outrages which characterized the former. Dined with Doctor Drourg. He &amp; Richardson afterwards came &amp; took wine with me.</p>","pageId":839,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":974,"lock":null}
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1024
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1024,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth with Allen &amp; balled wine at houses. Remained in the town all the afternoon expecting Williams's arrival in the steam boat from London. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. The boat arrived off the bar at &frac12; past 9 o'clock but being thick could not see her. The Shields Pafseeyer landed in the Haven &amp; WBS got home about 11 o'clock. Received the rents &amp; paid &pound;70 cats chapmans on account of the Exors</p>","pageId":839,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":975,"lock":null}
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1024
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1024,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth with Allen &amp; balled wine at houses. Remained in the town all the afternoon expecting Williams's arrival in the steam boat from London. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. The boat arrived off the bar at &frac12; past 9 o'clock but being thick could not see her. The Shields Pafseeyer landed in the Haven &amp; WBS got home about 11 o'clock. Received the rents &amp; paid &pound;70 cats chapmans on account of the Exors</p>","pageId":839,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":975,"lock":null}
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1025
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1025,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having been rain during the night. Wind N by E &amp; the sea having risen put a stop to our fishery excursion. Dined at home. Hewes &amp; Robert Harry came in &amp; took wine with us. In the evening walked to Tynemouth. Suppered with H Harry</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":976,"lock":null}
20:13:21.272 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
