20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1030
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1030,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<img src=\"images/img2394-image-eldon-square-2.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1031
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1031,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at E by S. I went to Newcastle in the steam boat. I dined at the rooms at a <span class=highlight_yellow>deueser</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>geocor</span>. Mr Hodgson then returned home. I stayed all night at Mr Aireys in Eldon Square. A wet day</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":980,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1031
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1031,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at E by S. I went to Newcastle in the steam boat. I dined at the rooms at a <span class=highlight_yellow>deueser</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>geocor</span>. Mr Hodgson then returned home. I stayed all night at Mr Aireys in Eldon Square. A wet day</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":980,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1032
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1032,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>WBS came up and meet me in Newcastle just as I was about to start for Shields. We with I Nicholson dined together at the George &amp; returned to Shields in the evening by steamer. Turned out a very wet evening</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":981,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1032
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1032,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>WBS came up and meet me in Newcastle just as I was about to start for Shields. We with I Nicholson dined together at the George &amp; returned to Shields in the evening by steamer. Turned out a very wet evening</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":981,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1033
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1033,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SSW. Got up early and went to Newcastle by steam. Attended the courts. Dined with Mr Airy &amp; in the evening attended the <span class=highlight_yellow>afsize</span> bath which was a very good one, about 430 people them. Got home to Mr Airy at about 2 o'clock where I slept</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":982,"lock":null}
20:13:21.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1033
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1033,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SSW. Got up early and went to Newcastle by steam. Attended the courts. Dined with Mr Airy &amp; in the evening attended the <span class=highlight_yellow>afsize</span> bath which was a very good one, about 430 people them. Got home to Mr Airy at about 2 o'clock where I slept</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":982,"lock":null}
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1034
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1034,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning wind NW. A few showers during the morning. Attended the courts &amp; walked about Newcastle the Tom Smith &amp; until 2 o'clock when I got on board a steamer &amp; returned home to dinner</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":983,"lock":null}
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1034
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1034,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning wind NW. A few showers during the morning. Attended the courts &amp; walked about Newcastle the Tom Smith &amp; until 2 o'clock when I got on board a steamer &amp; returned home to dinner</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":983,"lock":null}
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1035
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1035,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Met Tom Smith &amp;  Dixon &amp; made arrangements for the payment of Mrs Scott's funeral expenses &amp; our settlement with them as executors. WBS &amp; I walked out to Benton with Dixon where we met Mr &amp; Mrs Brown who had arrived from London in the afternoon. We dined &amp; walked down to Shields in the evening</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":984,"lock":null}
20:13:21.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1035
20:13:21.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1035,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Met Tom Smith &amp;  Dixon &amp; made arrangements for the payment of Mrs Scott's funeral expenses &amp; our settlement with them as executors. WBS &amp; I walked out to Benton with Dixon where we met Mr &amp; Mrs Brown who had arrived from London in the afternoon. We dined &amp; walked down to Shields in the evening</p>","pageId":841,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":984,"lock":null}
20:13:21.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1036
20:13:21.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1036,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but during the day heavy showers. Wind very variable, from all quarters of the compass. Having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seid</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>le</span><span class=highlight_yellow>tz</span> could not go to church. Wallked with A Harry to Tynemouth. At church in the afternoon. Dined at 5 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Turned out very wet. Finished at A Harry's</p>","pageId":842,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":985,"lock":null}
20:13:21.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
