20:13:21.279 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1039,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Wind NNE. Paid &pound;16.10.3 from the money for Hope. At 12 o'clock started from the church with a large party. Picnic for Seaton <span class=highlight_yellow>D</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ilaual</span> where ww dined in the garden, afterwards danced on the lawn having the band of the 82<sup>nd</sup> Regiment &amp; spent a more delightful day. Drank tea at <span class=highlight_yellow>Holywell</span> &amp; got home before 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":842,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":988,"lock":null}
