20:13:21.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1058,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. Attended morning service with the military. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Sadler dined with me. H Harry came in afterwards. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1006,"lock":null}
20:13:21.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1059
20:13:21.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1059,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind east. Turned out a very fine day. H French &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; again at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":847,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1007,"lock":null}
20:13:21.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
