20:13:21.290 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1059,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind east. Turned out a very fine day. H French &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; again at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":847,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1007,"lock":null}
