20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1070,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind WSW. Went down to the Hope. The starboard side as bad as the other. A number of the bolts bad. Walked to Tynemouth. Saw Potts hounds run a trail. Dined on board the Hope. I Dale, Harry French &amp; I took wine at the George &amp; spent a pleasant afternoon at the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1018,"lock":null}
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1071
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1071,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind NW. Onboard the Hope. Got two keels of <span class=highlight_yellow>wqlaure</span> down. Pain G Slop &pound;3.11.3 wages up to today. Dined at home. H Henry &amp; I on board the Hope to taste some brandy. In the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1019,"lock":null}
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
