20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1071,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind NW. Onboard the Hope. Got two keels of <span class=highlight_yellow>wqlaure</span> down. Pain G Slop &pound;3.11.3 wages up to today. Dined at home. H Henry &amp; I on board the Hope to taste some brandy. In the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1019,"lock":null}
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1072
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1072,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with a little rain. Wind SW, increased in the afternoon to a gale. Attended morning service. The vicar did duty &amp; preached. Dined at home. Took wine with H Harry &amp; tea in the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1020,"lock":null}
20:13:21.296 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1072
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1072,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with a little rain. Wind SW, increased in the afternoon to a gale. Attended morning service. The vicar did duty &amp; preached. Dined at home. Took wine with H Harry &amp; tea in the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1020,"lock":null}
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1073
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1073,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has blown a gale of wind all night at SW &amp; continuing. The Suffolk Hull steamer was driven upon the rock in coming in last night. Walked to the rock to see the Suffolk. No chance of getting her off. Afterwards walked up to Sadlers at the Point to dinner &amp; spent a pleasant day at the Malstrum in the evening. Got our <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship this morning</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1021,"lock":null}
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1073
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1073,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has blown a gale of wind all night at SW &amp; continuing. The Suffolk Hull steamer was driven upon the rock in coming in last night. Walked to the rock to see the Suffolk. No chance of getting her off. Afterwards walked up to Sadlers at the Point to dinner &amp; spent a pleasant day at the Malstrum in the evening. Got our <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship this morning</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1021,"lock":null}
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1074
20:13:21.297 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1074,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning but calmer weather. Wind SW. J Drury &amp; Allen dined with me on board the Hope. Got five keels down</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1022,"lock":null}
