20:13:21.299 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1079
20:13:21.299 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1079,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning early, but about 9 o'clock a little rain. Wind WNW. Attended morning service &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ficinifs</span> from <span class=highlight_yellow>Po</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ta</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>d</span> preached. &amp; gave us a very good sermon. Sadler dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine. In the evening with Mary <span class=highlight_yellow>Mactp</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eeson</span></p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1027,"lock":null}
