20:13:21.300 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":108,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild day. Wind WSW. Master R Jldesters and I dined on board the Hope &amp; spent the afternoon</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":103,"lock":null}
