20:13:21.301 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1080,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; very like more rain. Wind SSW. Dined at home. After dinner walked with H Harry up to Tynemouth and took punch with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Cu</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nningham</span>. Suppered off oysters at the Marstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1028,"lock":null}
20:13:21.301 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1081
20:13:21.301 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1081,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind west. Attended a court at the George &amp; lunched with Mr Hodgson. Dined at 4 o'clock with In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1029,"lock":null}
