20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1083,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home. On board the Brodewick in the afternoon In the evening went to a concert at the theatre at which Miss Hughes sang a march, beautiful voice &amp; fine execution. Suppered with Mr Tinley</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1031,"lock":null}
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1084
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1084,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning Very little wind at W by S Received a letter from Stephenson on informing me of his safe arrival at Woolwich on Wednesday with a large fleet many of which have been at sea a fortnight. It lost anchors &amp; cables. Dined at home. On board the Brodarick. Attended the first meeting of the whist club</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1032,"lock":null}
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1084
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1084,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning Very little wind at W by S Received a letter from Stephenson on informing me of his safe arrival at Woolwich on Wednesday with a large fleet many of which have been at sea a fortnight. It lost anchors &amp; cables. Dined at home. On board the Brodarick. Attended the first meeting of the whist club</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1032,"lock":null}
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1085
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1085,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind at SE. Received a letter from B B Galbralth. Dined at home. Spent the evening at Dr Wiltons</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1033,"lock":null}
20:13:21.302 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
