20:13:21.306 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1090,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather Wind NW. In the house all the morning having taken medicine. Dined at home. At Allens in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1038,"lock":null}
20:13:21.306 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1091
20:13:21.306 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1091,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW Dined at home. Spent the afternoon on board the Telemachus &amp; the evening on the Mr Bradshaws</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1039,"lock":null}
20:13:21.306 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
