20:13:21.309 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/11
20:13:21.309 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":11,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mr T Wright of Whitley park. Met a very large party &amp; returned to Shields at 9 o'clock &amp; went to the Theatre. Very cold day. Wind SE. Sea high</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":8,"lock":null}
20:13:21.309 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
