20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1100,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind SSW. The Hope arrived last night &amp; is laid upon the Lowlight shore. Did not go to church having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidlity</span>. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1048,"lock":null}
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1101
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1101,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Stephenson breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went by coach to Newcastle. Freights being so low I fixed the Hope to Load Holywell on my own account. Walked round by Bentow, saw Mrs Dixon &amp; proceeded to Billy Smith &amp; dined with Charlton. A wet evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1049,"lock":null}
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
