20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1101,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Stephenson breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went by coach to Newcastle. Freights being so low I fixed the Hope to Load Holywell on my own account. Walked round by Bentow, saw Mrs Dixon &amp; proceeded to Billy Smith &amp; dined with Charlton. A wet evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1049,"lock":null}
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1102
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1102,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. A little rain last night . The Hope got her chalk done Dined at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1050,"lock":null}
20:13:21.311 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.312 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1102
20:13:21.312 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1102,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. A little rain last night . The Hope got her chalk done Dined at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1050,"lock":null}
20:13:21.312 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1103
20:13:21.312 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1103,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; a fresh breeze at SW Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; Elder in a sculler to the Point &amp; ate oysters &amp; spent the evening with Sadler. The Hope got 14 Keels today. A great many ships arrived</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1051,"lock":null}
20:13:21.312 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1103
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1103,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; a fresh breeze at SW Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; Elder in a sculler to the Point &amp; ate oysters &amp; spent the evening with Sadler. The Hope got 14 Keels today. A great many ships arrived</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1051,"lock":null}
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1104
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1104,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather continues with a fresh breeze at SW. The Hope finishes her loading &amp; took 17 Keels &amp; fine <span class=highlight_yellow>chal</span>. The 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>chat</span> over I took for the hours. Walked up to Benton to dinner. Had the beagles out &amp; killed a hare. Dixon &amp; J <span class=highlight_yellow>Jeutty</span> comfortable P.S. average Hope club &pound;2.19.2</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1052,"lock":null}
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1104
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1104,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather continues with a fresh breeze at SW. The Hope finishes her loading &amp; took 17 Keels &amp; fine <span class=highlight_yellow>chal</span>. The 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>chat</span> over I took for the hours. Walked up to Benton to dinner. Had the beagles out &amp; killed a hare. Dixon &amp; J <span class=highlight_yellow>Jeutty</span> comfortable P.S. average Hope club &pound;2.19.2</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1052,"lock":null}
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1105
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1105,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very thick rainy morning. Continued all day &amp; prevented me getting down to dine with J Tenby, being engaged. Then dined with Mrs Braordlesy &amp; Dixon being their last day as Lords of the manor, spent a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1053,"lock":null}
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1105
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1105,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very thick rainy morning. Continued all day &amp; prevented me getting down to dine with J Tenby, being engaged. Then dined with Mrs Braordlesy &amp; Dixon being their last day as Lords of the manor, spent a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1053,"lock":null}
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1106
20:13:21.313 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1106,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WBW. Walked into Newcastle. Called upon Miss Robinson &amp; fixed for Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> to go to her school on Tuesday. Went to the quayside, took a steamer &amp; got home to dinner. In the evening at J Tinlay, whist club</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1054,"lock":null}
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1106
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1106,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WBW. Walked into Newcastle. Called upon Miss Robinson &amp; fixed for Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> to go to her school on Tuesday. Went to the quayside, took a steamer &amp; got home to dinner. In the evening at J Tinlay, whist club</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1054,"lock":null}
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1107
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1107,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Went to church. Dined at home unto &frac12; past 1 o'clock. Five companies of the 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment landed today. at the Lowlights from Jersey. Walked to Tynemouth. Spent the afternoon at Cunningham's. In the evening at the Mulstrum. The Lady Jane arrived with only 3 fish</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1055,"lock":null}
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1107
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1107,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Went to church. Dined at home unto &frac12; past 1 o'clock. Five companies of the 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment landed today. at the Lowlights from Jersey. Walked to Tynemouth. Spent the afternoon at Cunningham's. In the evening at the Mulstrum. The Lady Jane arrived with only 3 fish</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1055,"lock":null}
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1108
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1108,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning A little wind at West. Paid Premium bill Archangel voyage &pound;12.13.8. Dined at home. Engaged in the afternoon entering the archangel voyage in the ships book. In the evening at the Albion &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1056,"lock":null}
20:13:21.314 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
