20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1108,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning A little wind at West. Paid Premium bill Archangel voyage &pound;12.13.8. Dined at home. Engaged in the afternoon entering the archangel voyage in the ships book. In the evening at the Albion &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1056,"lock":null}
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1109
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1109,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning rather frosty. Wind N by W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Saw Mis Dixon &amp; Emma. The latter was taken to Miss Robertson's. I walked out with Dixon to Benton. Dined &amp; stayed all night. Received a letter from Richmond</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1057,"lock":null}
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1109
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1109,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning rather frosty. Wind N by W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Saw Mis Dixon &amp; Emma. The latter was taken to Miss Robertson's. I walked out with Dixon to Benton. Dined &amp; stayed all night. Received a letter from Richmond</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1057,"lock":null}
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/111
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":111,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning at 3 o'clock &amp; left South Shields at &frac12; past 4 o'clock coach for Carlow. A fine day, arrived at Leeds at 6 o'clock where I stay all night</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":106,"lock":null}
20:13:21.315 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.316 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/111
20:13:21.316 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":111,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning at 3 o'clock &amp; left South Shields at &frac12; past 4 o'clock coach for Carlow. A fine day, arrived at Leeds at 6 o'clock where I stay all night</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":106,"lock":null}
20:13:21.316 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1110
20:13:21.316 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1110,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind NW Saw the Northhumberland fox hounds from Benton show off at Gosforth. Dixon &amp; I walked upto Newcastle. Saw Tom Smith, walked to see the horses being fair team. Sold an old silver spoon cracked &amp; gave five shillings in addition for a new one for Emma. Took the steam boat at 2 o'clock. Came home to dinner. Wrote to WBS expecting Miss Gauntley &amp; Mary Carfs. Wrote unto C Richmond that I could not meet him at Dersham on Saturday. Albion</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1058,"lock":null}
20:13:21.316 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
