20:13:21.320 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1118,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning quite summers weather. Wind SW Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Dr Welton Captain &amp; Mrs Bellew there at the Whist club in the evening</p>\r\n<p>xx</p>","pageId":859,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1066,"lock":null}
20:13:21.320 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1119
20:13:21.320 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1119,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind SW. Been a little rain in the night. Walked as far as Vrilly Mill &amp; saw Pott's harriers. Returned home to dinner In the afternoon on board the Crises with A Nicholson &amp; Webb. Afterwards at the fair &amp; Malstrum Turned out a very wet evening</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1067,"lock":null}
20:13:21.320 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
