20:13:21.322 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1123,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with the appearance of more rain Wind WSW. Dined with Allen. Went to the assembly in the evening, a very poor one. Took supper afterwards &amp; sat up very late</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1071,"lock":null}
20:13:21.322 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1124
20:13:21.322 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1124,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning Wind blowing fresh at S by W From the fatigues of last night, did not awake till 12 o'clock Walked to Tynemouth. Caught there by a tremendous gale with heavy rain. Got home at 5 o'clock Tom Smith arrived. Dined and went to the theatre at &frac12; price</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1072,"lock":null}
