20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1124,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning Wind blowing fresh at S by W From the fatigues of last night, did not awake till 12 o'clock Walked to Tynemouth. Caught there by a tremendous gale with heavy rain. Got home at 5 o'clock Tom Smith arrived. Dined and went to the theatre at &frac12; price</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1072,"lock":null}
20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1125
20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1125,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning Wind SW. A few light ships off. The Hope's mast by wear. Robert engaged collecting rents Dined at home &amp; in the evening Tom Smith &amp; I attended the whist club</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1073,"lock":null}
20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
