20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1125,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning Wind SW. A few light ships off. The Hope's mast by wear. Robert engaged collecting rents Dined at home &amp; in the evening Tom Smith &amp; I attended the whist club</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1073,"lock":null}
