20:13:21.323 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1126,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather fine day but cold. Wind WNW. The Hope arrived in the night. Went by coach to Newcastle Things very dull &amp; could do nothing <span class=highlight_yellow>deferenced</span> to let her lay for ten days Returned by steam &amp; afterwards rode up to Benton with Tom Smith. Gave Stephenson &pound;25</p>","pageId":860,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1074,"lock":null}
