20:13:21.324 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1127
20:13:21.324 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1127,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning Wind fresh at S by E. Accompanied Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon &amp; Tom Smith in the <font color=#A6A6A6>coach</font> To Newcastle. Saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> &amp; took The steam boat to Shields. Dined at home at 5 o'clock &amp; afterwards went to whist club. A heavy gale</p>","pageId":861,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1075,"lock":null}
