20:13:21.327 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1134,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Blowing hard from S by W with showers. Wrote to answer to Miss Bagot at Dublin about Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Dined at home At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the whist club in the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1082,"lock":null}
