20:13:21.327 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1135,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind SSW Went to church in the morning Dined at home &amp; took wine at the north D <span class=highlight_yellow>Assens</span> in the afternoon. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1083,"lock":null}
