20:13:21.328 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1136,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to load Adams to be load on <span class=highlight_yellow>her</span> before the 8<sup>th</sup> December. Returned by steam. Dined at Mr Harrison's the brewers &amp; in the evening at the Theatre &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1084,"lock":null}
20:13:21.328 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1137
20:13:21.328 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1137,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another delightful day. Wind NW. Walked up to the point. H Harry &amp; I dined with Sadler. Spent a quiet &amp; pleasant day &amp; got down again in good time. In the evening by <span class=highlight_yellow>atcre</span>. Called at the Albion</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1085,"lock":null}
20:13:21.328 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
