20:13:21.329 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1138,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very fine weather. Wind NW. with frost. Walked with A Nicholson to Tynemouth. Called on Dr Drury for some <span class=highlight_yellow>cubebs</span>  having got c___d. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; in the evening called at the Malstrum to inform Seaton of my disaster</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1086,"lock":null}
20:13:21.329 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1139
20:13:21.329 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1139,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a change of wind from SW On board the Hope, ordered new paul bits. Walked to Tynemouth Dined at home. Mr Herd of the 15<sup>th</sup> regiment with me at the billiard room &amp; whist club in the evening</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson to Newcastle</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1087,"lock":null}
