20:13:21.333 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1147,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing hard from the SE. Received an answer from Mr Coulter with the cago both for my <span class=highlight_yellow>seguaturn</span> &amp; refusing to make any allowance. Retuned it &amp; complaining of the <span class=highlight_yellow>enforshor</span> Cunningham &amp; A Nicholson dined With me on board the Hope. At the theater &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":864,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1095,"lock":null}
20:13:21.333 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1148
20:13:21.333 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1148,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind SSW. Gave Stephenson a draft on chapman for &pound;10 being the balance of his archangel account 3.12.6 Tongues &pound;1.18 &amp; cash for present voy<font color=#BFBFBF>age</font> &pound;4.9.7. Dined with J B Wright at the Star &amp; Garter Tynemouth at 5 o'clock &amp; in the evening attended the whist club at Tibbe</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1096,"lock":null}
