20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1150
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1150,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night blowing hard from the ESE. Just as well the Hope did not get to sea yesterday. Gave Robert a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon and the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1098,"lock":null}
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
