20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1150,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night blowing hard from the ESE. Just as well the Hope did not get to sea yesterday. Gave Robert a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon and the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1098,"lock":null}
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1151
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1151,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but stated blowing hard from E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships light &amp; loaded came in. One a <span class=highlight_yellow>Scarb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ra</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>oefsel</span> from the Baltic in taking the bar at an improper time of teder, struck, knocked her rudder off &amp; drove upon the Hurdsand. Dined at Mr R Fenwicks a party</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1099,"lock":null}
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1151
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1151,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but stated blowing hard from E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships light &amp; loaded came in. One a <span class=highlight_yellow>Scarb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ra</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>oefsel</span> from the Baltic in taking the bar at an improper time of teder, struck, knocked her rudder off &amp; drove upon the Hurdsand. Dined at Mr R Fenwicks a party</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1099,"lock":null}
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1152
20:13:21.335 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1152,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but still blowing fresh from ESE with showers of rain. On board the Hope Dined at home. At the billiard room A Nicholson came &amp; took a glass of Toddy with me in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1100,"lock":null}
