20:13:21.336 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1152,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but still blowing fresh from ESE with showers of rain. On board the Hope Dined at home. At the billiard room A Nicholson came &amp; took a glass of Toddy with me in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1100,"lock":null}
