20:13:21.344 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1170
20:13:21.344 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1170,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Xmas day</u> After a most intense frost during the night, we have a heavy fall of snow. Wind NW. At the newsroom. Paris in a fearful state of excitement. The most fearing the decision of the peers well be in favour of the later. Herewith to WBS giving him an account of the weather here. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined with J Cunningham, family party. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1118,"lock":null}
20:13:21.344 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1170
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1170,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Xmas day</u> After a most intense frost during the night, we have a heavy fall of snow. Wind NW. At the newsroom. Paris in a fearful state of excitement. The most fearing the decision of the peers well be in favour of the later. Herewith to WBS giving him an account of the weather here. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined with J Cunningham, family party. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1118,"lock":null}
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1171
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1171,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frosty weather. A good deal of snow fallen in the night. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Received an account these H Harry, A Clark &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Berges</span> of the sale of 84 more than Hope coals at 35/-. Dined with J Tealey. The officers of HMS Samarang &amp; Childers there &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Goshing</span> RA</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1119,"lock":null}
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1171
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1171,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frosty weather. A good deal of snow fallen in the night. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Received an account these H Harry, A Clark &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Berges</span> of the sale of 84 more than Hope coals at 35/-. Dined with J Tealey. The officers of HMS Samarang &amp; Childers there &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Goshing</span> RA</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1119,"lock":null}
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1172
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1172,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frost still continues. Wind wavering variable between SSW &amp; SSE.  Received a letter from WBS. HMS Childers sailed out in beautiful style. Dined at home. At Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening. Received &pound;1.15. for WBS. Herald <span class=highlight_yellow>hewop</span> open</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1120,"lock":null}
20:13:21.345 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1172
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1172,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frost still continues. Wind wavering variable between SSW &amp; SSE.  Received a letter from WBS. HMS Childers sailed out in beautiful style. Dined at home. At Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening. Received &pound;1.15. for WBS. Herald <span class=highlight_yellow>hewop</span> open</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1120,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1173
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1173,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but still frosty, although the wind is from the SE. Dined at home at 5 o'clock H Harry. L<font color=#222222>ieutenant </font><font color=#222222>Gostl</font><font color=#222222>i</font><font color=#222222>ng</font><font color=#222222>, K A</font><font color=#222222>.</font><font color=#222222> </font>L<font color=#222222>ieutenant Rudyard 15</font><sup><font color=#222222>th</font></sup><font color=#222222> regiment </font><font color=#222222>Tibbs &amp; </font><font color=#222222>Dr</font><font color=#222222> Wilton dined with me</font><font color=#222222>. H</font><font color=#222222>ad a very pleasant day &amp; in the evening went to the Ball which was very well attended</font></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1121,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1173
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1173,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but still frosty, although the wind is from the SE. Dined at home at 5 o'clock H Harry. L<font color=#222222>ieutenant </font><font color=#222222>Gostl</font><font color=#222222>i</font><font color=#222222>ng</font><font color=#222222>, K A</font><font color=#222222>.</font><font color=#222222> </font>L<font color=#222222>ieutenant Rudyard 15</font><sup><font color=#222222>th</font></sup><font color=#222222> regiment </font><font color=#222222>Tibbs &amp; </font><font color=#222222>Dr</font><font color=#222222> Wilton dined with me</font><font color=#222222>. H</font><font color=#222222>ad a very pleasant day &amp; in the evening went to the Ball which was very well attended</font></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1121,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1174
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1174,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; continuance of frost. Wind SW. Walked round by the <span class=highlight_yellow>ridges</span>, the ice so thickly covered with snow, the <span class=highlight_yellow>skating</span> bad. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>at</span><span class=highlight_yellow>re</span></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1122,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1174
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1174,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; continuance of frost. Wind SW. Walked round by the <span class=highlight_yellow>ridges</span>, the ice so thickly covered with snow, the <span class=highlight_yellow>skating</span> bad. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>at</span><span class=highlight_yellow>re</span></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1122,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1175
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1175,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frost this morning but slight. Mark Webb &amp; I set off to walk to Hartley with our guns, but by the time we reached Whetley it began to sleet &amp; rain so <span class=highlight_yellow>heavy</span> that we turned back but got wet before we got home. Dined at home &amp; attended the whist club in the evening. Was engaged to supper at Cheston with Lowrey but being such a stormy night did not go.</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1123,"lock":null}
20:13:21.346 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1175
20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1175,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frost this morning but slight. Mark Webb &amp; I set off to walk to Hartley with our guns, but by the time we reached Whetley it began to sleet &amp; rain so <span class=highlight_yellow>heavy</span> that we turned back but got wet before we got home. Dined at home &amp; attended the whist club in the evening. Was engaged to supper at Cheston with Lowrey but being such a stormy night did not go.</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1123,"lock":null}
20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1176
20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1176,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Very thick &amp; damp &amp; from the heavy rain last night, the snow has quite disappeared . Wind SW. Dined at home. Spent the evening at Mr Richmond's &amp; sat the new year in. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":872,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1124,"lock":null}
20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
