20:13:21.347 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1176,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Very thick &amp; damp &amp; from the heavy rain last night, the snow has quite disappeared . Wind SW. Dined at home. Spent the evening at Mr Richmond's &amp; sat the new year in. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":872,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1124,"lock":null}
