20:13:21.348 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1177,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<div class=\"highlights-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n\t<h2>Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-01-27\">\r\n\t<p>1831-01-27 Fires the landlord of the George Tavern</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-02-02\">\r\n\t<p>1831-02-02 Storm wrecks many ships</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-03-13\">\r\n\t<p>1831-03-13 2 weeks of military training at Alnwick Castle</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-05-03\">\r\n\t<p>1831-05-03 Campaigning for the great reform bill</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-05-12\">\r\n\t<p>1831-05-12 Breakfast with the mayor of Newcastle</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-05-18\">\r\n\t<p>1831-05-18 Trip to Seaham with the captain of HMS Samarang</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-06-14\">\r\n\t<p>1831-06-14 Food poisening due to eating salmon</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-06-26\">\r\n\t<p>1831-06-26 Trip to Hull, met the Hope</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-03\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-03 Returned Home via York</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-15\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-15 Campaigning for the great reform bill</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-15\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-15 Trip to Togston</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-19\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-19 Rowed to Croquet Island</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-23\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-23 Visited the Hermitage at Warkworth</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-07-28\">\r\n\t<p>1831-07-28 Returned home via Newcastle to see the High Sheriff</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-13\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-13 Trip to London</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-15\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-15 Reconciled with Bob Marsh after 2 years</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-19\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-19 By coach to Southampton</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-23\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-23 Sailed to Guernsey</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-26\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-26 Returned to Southampton</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-02\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-02 Returned to London</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-08\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-08 Coronation procession of King William IV along Pall Mall</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-21\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-21 Presented to the King at a 'Levee' and kissed his hand</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-22\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-22 Launch of HMS Thunderer</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-10-01\">\r\n\t<p>1831-10-01 Sailed home to North Shields</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-10-10\">\r\n\t<p>1831-10-10 The Hope spings a leak!</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
