20:13:21.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1180
20:13:21.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1180,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most unpleasant weather, damp &amp; uncomfortable. Wind SW. Received a letter yesterday from Stephenson of the ship being out on Thursday delivering 282 char &amp; expecting to get his ballast on Saturday. Received the Hope's <span class=highlight_yellow>afsales</span> with a balance note for &pound;93.7. which I paid into Chapmans &amp; drew for &pound;50 with which I paid the bells for the Archangel voyage viz: swan &pound;___ sharp &pound;___ &amp; spares &pound;___. At the theatre in the evening, Michaels benefit. A good house.</p>","pageId":873,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1127,"lock":null}
20:13:21.349 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
