20:13:21.350 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1182,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2734-doodle-on-blotting-paper.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n  <figcaption>Doodle on blotting paper</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:21.350 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1183
20:13:21.350 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1183,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of damp weather. Wind E by S. The Hope arrived, having had a quick passage, left on Sunday. Went to Newcastle but did not fix. Got home to dinner a 5 o'clock. Stephenson reports the ship as being very leaky on the <span class=highlight_yellow>London</span> passage, so much so that they could hardly keep up. Desired him to get Sharks to examine her in the morning. At the Albion</p>","pageId":874,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1129,"lock":null}
20:13:21.350 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1183
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1183,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of damp weather. Wind E by S. The Hope arrived, having had a quick passage, left on Sunday. Went to Newcastle but did not fix. Got home to dinner a 5 o'clock. Stephenson reports the ship as being very leaky on the <span class=highlight_yellow>London</span> passage, so much so that they could hardly keep up. Desired him to get Sharks to examine her in the morning. At the Albion</p>","pageId":874,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1129,"lock":null}
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1184
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1184,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind ENE &amp; afterwards go to about N by E. Too much sea for the large ships to get out. Got up early &amp; went up to the ship. Sharks on board examining her. Still of opinion she must be leaking in the stern which is certainly very bad &amp; also under her <span class=highlight_yellow>counter</span>. Sent for one of his men &amp; a <span class=highlight_yellow>punt</span> to endeavour to avoid entering into repairs at present. Took the steam boat to Newcastle but could not get more than 11/3 freights or upheld 10/6 &amp; their only at two offices, things very dull, &amp; as no light ships can get down with this wind, I returned home to dinner without fixing. Gave Stephenson a draft for &pound;20 to pay wages. In the account of the whist club, paid subscription etc 22/- up to the end of ...</p>","pageId":874,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1130,"lock":null}
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1184
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1184,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind ENE &amp; afterwards go to about N by E. Too much sea for the large ships to get out. Got up early &amp; went up to the ship. Sharks on board examining her. Still of opinion she must be leaking in the stern which is certainly very bad &amp; also under her <span class=highlight_yellow>counter</span>. Sent for one of his men &amp; a <span class=highlight_yellow>punt</span> to endeavour to avoid entering into repairs at present. Took the steam boat to Newcastle but could not get more than 11/3 freights or upheld 10/6 &amp; their only at two offices, things very dull, &amp; as no light ships can get down with this wind, I returned home to dinner without fixing. Gave Stephenson a draft for &pound;20 to pay wages. In the account of the whist club, paid subscription etc 22/- up to the end of ...</p>","pageId":874,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1130,"lock":null}
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1185
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1185,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind NNW. Thought of going to Newcastle, but received a message from Shanks that he wished to see me on board the Hope having found the <span class=highlight_yellow>stew</span> in a very bad state. H Harry went with me, the stern certainly in a very damages &amp; rotten state, but Shanks thinks he can cobble it up so as to be safe &amp; enable the ship to go a voyage or two until the days get longer.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with Dale &amp; spent the evening at Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Dork</span> Metcalf's where there was a large party. Received a letter from WBS enclosing a note at 4 months for &pound;300 which I gave to R Spence &amp; got the old one cancelled.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1131,"lock":null}
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1185
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1185,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind NNW. Thought of going to Newcastle, but received a message from Shanks that he wished to see me on board the Hope having found the <span class=highlight_yellow>stew</span> in a very bad state. H Harry went with me, the stern certainly in a very damages &amp; rotten state, but Shanks thinks he can cobble it up so as to be safe &amp; enable the ship to go a voyage or two until the days get longer.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with Dale &amp; spent the evening at Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Dork</span> Metcalf's where there was a large party. Received a letter from WBS enclosing a note at 4 months for &pound;300 which I gave to R Spence &amp; got the old one cancelled.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1131,"lock":null}
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1186
20:13:21.351 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1186,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; slight frost. Wind WNW. Went up to the ship. Shanks just left. Gave orders to do the stern up in the best way they could to enable her to go to sea. Walked round by Chirton. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1132,"lock":null}
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1186
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1186,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; slight frost. Wind WNW. Went up to the ship. Shanks just left. Gave orders to do the stern up in the best way they could to enable her to go to sea. Walked round by Chirton. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1132,"lock":null}
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1187
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1187,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning &amp; blowing fresh from the NW. Did not go to church. Walked up &amp; dined with Sadler at the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1133,"lock":null}
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1187
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1187,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning &amp; blowing fresh from the NW. Did not go to church. Walked up &amp; dined with Sadler at the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":875,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1133,"lock":null}
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1188
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1188,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, blowing fresh from NNE. Went by steam to Newcastle. Fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>ords</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Redheught</span> to be upheld 11/- freight go to WBS as factor, &amp; all profit above 11/- to be divided. Returned by coach. Attended the annual meeting of the Eligible and United clubs to alter &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>receive</span> the rules etc. Sat down a large party to dinner afterwards. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1134,"lock":null}
20:13:21.352 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.353 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1188
20:13:21.353 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1188,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, blowing fresh from NNE. Went by steam to Newcastle. Fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>ords</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Redheught</span> to be upheld 11/- freight go to WBS as factor, &amp; all profit above 11/- to be divided. Returned by coach. Attended the annual meeting of the Eligible and United clubs to alter &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>receive</span> the rules etc. Sat down a large party to dinner afterwards. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1134,"lock":null}
20:13:21.353 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1189
20:13:21.353 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1189,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp morning but likely to be finer weather. Wind NW. At the George tavern a great part of the morning. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> there, with whom &amp; a small party, I afterwards dined. Bob <span class=highlight_yellow>Ilderton</span> &amp; I called at the Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p>Hope got 3 keels down.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1135,"lock":null}
