20:13:21.385 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1250,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing fresh from WSW. Engaged at home all the morning packing up. Dined at home. Took wine with H Harry. A very rainy afternoon &amp; blowing hard from SSW. At the Abbey &amp; Mulstrum in the evening. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1196,"lock":null}
20:13:21.385 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1251
