20:13:21.385 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1252
20:13:21.385 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1252,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind S by W. Got up early &amp; took gig to Newcastle. Joined the Alnwick coach at 10 o'clock &amp; arrived there 3 o'clock. Found a box with by blue <span class=highlight_yellow>susloop</span> etc at the White Swan. Got a billet at the Star with Potts &amp; two Reeds. Reported myself to the adjutant. Dined at the Keep at 6 o'clock &amp; in the evening went to the Theatre with Major Ogle. A very cold raw day. Heavy rain in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1198,"lock":null}
