20:13:21.389 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":126,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A change of wind and weather. Wind WSW with heavy rain which warmed the air. Engaged all the morning in taking inventory of furniture &amp; packing up the linin that I intended to go to England. Dined at Coopers Hill. Spent a very quiet &amp; pleasant day</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":116,"lock":null}
