20:13:21.390 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":126,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A change of wind and weather. Wind WSW with heavy rain which warmed the air. Engaged all the morning in taking inventory of furniture &amp; packing up the linin that I intended to go to England. Dined at Coopers Hill. Spent a very quiet &amp; pleasant day</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":116,"lock":null}
20:13:21.390 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1260
20:13:21.390 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1260,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine mild weather. Wind West. Attended church parade the whole of the officers &amp; men. Went to church. Paraded at 5 o'clock in the afternoon. Dined at the mess. Captain Biggs finished <span class=highlight_yellow>withing</span> his <span class=highlight_yellow>com</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>pany</span></font>. Kept it up very late. Did not get to bed till 4 o'clock in the morning. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1206,"lock":null}
20:13:21.390 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
