20:13:21.391 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1263,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; rather cool. Wind SE. Did not march to the pasture having been rain in the night &amp; ground very wet. Dined at the mess. Towsouille &amp; others strangers there. Afterwards went to the Bull which was very gay &amp; well attended. After the Bull, suppered with Potts</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1209,"lock":null}
20:13:21.391 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1264
20:13:21.391 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1264,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning. Wind NE. At morning drill marched to the pasture &amp; back. Wrote to WBS &amp; attended afternoon parade at 2 o'clock in the pasture. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> D </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Sucth</span></p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1210,"lock":null}
