20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1264,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning. Wind NE. At morning drill marched to the pasture &amp; back. Wrote to WBS &amp; attended afternoon parade at 2 o'clock in the pasture. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> D </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Sucth</span></p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1210,"lock":null}
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1265
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1265,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold. Wind NE. Attended morning drill in the pasture. Marched round with my company for the first time. Marched to the pasture again in the afternoon at 2 o'clock marched past slow &amp; quick time &amp; went through the manoeuvres. The two  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ric</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>har</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>ds</span> &amp; I went in <span class=highlight_yellow>chaise</span> to dine with <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r Bur</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rell</span> BroomPark. Spent a pleasant day &amp; got home at 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1211,"lock":null}
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
