20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1265,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold. Wind NE. Attended morning drill in the pasture. Marched round with my company for the first time. Marched to the pasture again in the afternoon at 2 o'clock marched past slow &amp; quick time &amp; went through the manoeuvres. The two  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ric</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>har</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>ds</span> &amp; I went in <span class=highlight_yellow>chaise</span> to dine with <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r Bur</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rell</span> BroomPark. Spent a pleasant day &amp; got home at 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1211,"lock":null}
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1266
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1266,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Exceptionally cold. East wind with showers. Attended 10 o'clock drill, but did not go to the pasture. Received a letter from WBS of the safe arrival of the Hop at London, but not able to sell her coals, the <span class=highlight_yellow>proves</span> quite light. Lunched with W Torston. At 2 o'clock parade marched to the pasture &amp; went through the manoeuvres. Returned earlier than usual in consequence of the rain. Dined at the mess. A stranger day, but a small party. The band had a concert at the Town hall. I took a ticket but <font color=#BFBFBF>did </font>not go.</p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1212,"lock":null}
20:13:21.392 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
