20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/127
20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":127,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind WSW. Engaged all day in finishing inventory he. Dined at Mr Vernon's with the boys.</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":117,"lock":null}
20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
