20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":127,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind WSW. Engaged all day in finishing inventory he. Dined at Mr Vernon's with the boys.</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":117,"lock":null}
20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1270
20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1270,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Another delightful morning. Very warm. Wind NE. The Regiment had a field day. The colours out &amp; went through the manoeuvres with great correctness. A great many people on the ground in the pasture. At 2 o'clock <span class=highlight_yellow>marshalled</span> &amp; the men delivered this army and accoutrements into the <span class=highlight_yellow>store</span>. Dined at the mess &amp; went to an evening party at Mr Carr's. Bondgate Hall</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1216,"lock":null}
20:13:21.394 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
