20:13:21.395 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1271,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day. Wind NNE. The men delivered their clothing out store. After which they were all paid <span class=highlight_yellow>what</span> was due to them. I made ...</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1217,"lock":null}
20:13:21.395 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1272
20:13:21.395 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1272,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... my company a present of 1/- to each man, 2/ to the corpral &amp; 21/- to the three sergeants:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got my clothes etc all packed up &amp; sent them home by Ellcots the Warkworth carrier. Dined at the mess &amp; being the last we spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day all regretting that we were to separate but hoping that we shall soon be <span class=highlight_yellow>personally</span>  called out.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Robert rode one of Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Potters</span> horses home.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1218,"lock":null}
20:13:21.395 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1272
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1272,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... my company a present of 1/- to each man, 2/ to the corpral &amp; 21/- to the three sergeants:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got my clothes etc all packed up &amp; sent them home by Ellcots the Warkworth carrier. Dined at the mess &amp; being the last we spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day all regretting that we were to separate but hoping that we shall soon be <span class=highlight_yellow>personally</span>  called out.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Robert rode one of Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Potters</span> horses home.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1218,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1273
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1273,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NNE. Called &amp; left my card at Mr Carr's, Bondgate hall.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Mr Potts having offered me a seat in his carriage, we all lunched together at 1 o'clock at Mr Spousers. The ladies having previously been to see the castle. Started between 2 &amp; 3 o'clock &amp; reached Mr Joblings in Newcastle between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Had two glasses of spirits &amp; water which <span class=highlight_yellow>screwed</span> me. Got a gig &amp; reached Shields between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock. Called at the Mulstrum &amp; stayed there till 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1219,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1273
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1273,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NNE. Called &amp; left my card at Mr Carr's, Bondgate hall.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Mr Potts having offered me a seat in his carriage, we all lunched together at 1 o'clock at Mr Spousers. The ladies having previously been to see the castle. Started between 2 &amp; 3 o'clock &amp; reached Mr Joblings in Newcastle between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Had two glasses of spirits &amp; water which <span class=highlight_yellow>screwed</span> me. Got a gig &amp; reached Shields between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock. Called at the Mulstrum &amp; stayed there till 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1219,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1274
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1274,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Did not rise till late. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Attended the whist club in the evening. Paid H Dale my contribution, this being the last night of the season &pound;1.4.6</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1220,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1274
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1274,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Did not rise till late. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Attended the whist club in the evening. Paid H Dale my contribution, this being the last night of the season &pound;1.4.6</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1220,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1275
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1275,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Having been living so well for the last fortnight with the Regiment thought it necessary to take a dose of physic, therefore remained at home all the morning. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; in the evening called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1221,"lock":null}
20:13:21.396 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
