20:13:21.397 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1275,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Having been living so well for the last fortnight with the Regiment thought it necessary to take a dose of physic, therefore remained at home all the morning. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; in the evening called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1221,"lock":null}
20:13:21.397 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1276
