20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1276,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@54.9712348,-1.6197996,3a,75y,248.87h,99.1t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sjkW-FSICa3Xaw_UO-Et8nA!2e0!7i16384!8i8192?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2758-charlotte-square-newcastle.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Charlotte Square, Newcastle</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":895,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1222,"lock":null}
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1277
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1277,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very cold. Lockerand breakfasted with me &amp; we went up to Newcastle together by Duma coach. Called at Westgate Street, saw the Dixons and Emma Galbraith who was looking very well &amp; is spending her Easter holidays there. Wrote to WBS. Dined with D Dixon at Tom Fenwick in Charlotte Square. Met a party there. Slept at Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Willi</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span></p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1223,"lock":null}
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1277
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1277,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very cold. Lockerand breakfasted with me &amp; we went up to Newcastle together by Duma coach. Called at Westgate Street, saw the Dixons and Emma Galbraith who was looking very well &amp; is spending her Easter holidays there. Wrote to WBS. Dined with D Dixon at Tom Fenwick in Charlotte Square. Met a party there. Slept at Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Willi</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span></p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1223,"lock":null}
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1278
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
20:13:21.398 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.399 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1278
20:13:21.399 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
20:13:21.399 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1279
