20:13:21.400 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1281,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Turned out rather showery. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Jibbs &amp; afterwards went to the Sands to see the races. Lockerwood and Charlton gave us wine in the evening &amp; finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1227,"lock":null}
20:13:21.400 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1282
20:13:21.400 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1282,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind changeable being <span class=highlight_yellow>raily</span> in the morning from the west &amp; afterwards NE. Received a letter from WBS. Called on Mr Robinson but got no money. The W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Shand, Boswell arrived from Rotterdam. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth nut nothing doing. In the evening at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1228,"lock":null}
20:13:21.400 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1282
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1282,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind changeable being <span class=highlight_yellow>raily</span> in the morning from the west &amp; afterwards NE. Received a letter from WBS. Called on Mr Robinson but got no money. The W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Shand, Boswell arrived from Rotterdam. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth nut nothing doing. In the evening at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1228,"lock":null}
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1283
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1283,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Afterwards turned out a most beautiful day, wind a little to E of S. Wrote to WBS with a account of rents. Afterwards J Cunningham &amp; I started &amp; had a most delightful walk to <span class=highlight_yellow>Hastley</span> where we dined with C Ridley &amp; walked home again in the evening. But before we reached Tynemouth at 6 o'clock we were caught in a heavy rain &amp; got thoroughly wet. After taking a glass of whiskey Toddy with JC to keep the cold out, made the best of my way home &amp; changed my cloths &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1229,"lock":null}
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1283
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1283,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Afterwards turned out a most beautiful day, wind a little to E of S. Wrote to WBS with a account of rents. Afterwards J Cunningham &amp; I started &amp; had a most delightful walk to <span class=highlight_yellow>Hastley</span> where we dined with C Ridley &amp; walked home again in the evening. But before we reached Tynemouth at 6 o'clock we were caught in a heavy rain &amp; got thoroughly wet. After taking a glass of whiskey Toddy with JC to keep the cold out, made the best of my way home &amp; changed my cloths &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1229,"lock":null}
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1284
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1284,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at SE. &amp; suddenly changed to SW. With most beautiful spring weather. J Cunningham &amp; I walked up to the Doctors garden &amp; round by Preston when I had some <span class=highlight_yellow>talk</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Moon</span>. Dined at home. Dined at home. Took a long walk in the afternoon round by Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1230,"lock":null}
20:13:21.401 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
