20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1284,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at SE. &amp; suddenly changed to SW. With most beautiful spring weather. J Cunningham &amp; I walked up to the Doctors garden &amp; round by Preston when I had some <span class=highlight_yellow>talk</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Moon</span>. Dined at home. Dined at home. Took a long walk in the afternoon round by Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1230,"lock":null}
20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1285
20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1285,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by W. changed to fresh breeze from SE. Wrote to WBS &amp; also sent 20/- to <span class=highlight_yellow>Mayt</span> Scott. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Boswell on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Low</span> Shand. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1231,"lock":null}
20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
