20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1285,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by W. changed to fresh breeze from SE. Wrote to WBS &amp; also sent 20/- to <span class=highlight_yellow>Mayt</span> Scott. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Boswell on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Low</span> Shand. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1231,"lock":null}
20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1286
20:13:21.402 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1286,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning having been showery during the night. Wind S. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; had a warm bath. Dined with J Tinley at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1232,"lock":null}
