20:13:21.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1287
20:13:21.403 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1287,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. Been showers in the night. Wind WNW. Received a letter from WBS. Took a walk to Cullercoats with J Cunningham by the Sands. Had a party to dinner at 2 o'clock. H harry, Jebbs, Cunningham &amp; C Ridley from Hartley spent a very pleasant day. E Charlton took wine with us. At the Mulstrum at night or rather in the morning</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1233,"lock":null}
