20:13:21.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":129,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A little rain in the morning. Wind WSW but afterwards turned out a beautiful day. Wrote to William. Called upon Mr Jameson. Had a very delightful drive in the afternoon to Broomfield.  Found the Butlers &amp; Emma quite well, a very affecting meeting, my feelings quite overpowered un &amp; I blubbered like a child, but I could not help it.</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":119,"lock":null}
20:13:21.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1290
20:13:21.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1290,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy morning. Wind ESE. Dined at home. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; the evening at the Abbey &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1236,"lock":null}
20:13:21.404 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
