20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1290,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy morning. Wind ESE. Dined at home. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; the evening at the Abbey &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1236,"lock":null}
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1291
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1291,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. The Hope arrived at 5 o'clock am. Went by Duma coach to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell &amp; Brown being the readiest time &amp; all other collieries being off work excepting Wellington, <span class=highlight_yellow>Pontop</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Jaasects</span>. Wrote to WBS. Dined at the Geo<font color=#BFBFBF>rge</font> Tavern being the annual dinner of the whist club.</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1237,"lock":null}
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1291
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1291,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. The Hope arrived at 5 o'clock am. Went by Duma coach to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell &amp; Brown being the readiest time &amp; all other collieries being off work excepting Wellington, <span class=highlight_yellow>Pontop</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Jaasects</span>. Wrote to WBS. Dined at the Geo<font color=#BFBFBF>rge</font> Tavern being the annual dinner of the whist club.</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1237,"lock":null}
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1292
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1292,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Received the Hopes accounts &amp; balance note &pound;97.9/ = { balance accounts 47.9 : on account 50 } Received also a letter from Leadbottom, the <span class=highlight_yellow>introduction</span> Newcastle w entry a statement of the account between us &amp; Mrs Scott executors which I sent him.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. On board the Harvy in the afternoon &amp; went over the bar <span class=highlight_yellow>with:</span> bound to Quebec. Finished off at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1238,"lock":null}
20:13:21.405 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1292
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1292,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Received the Hopes accounts &amp; balance note &pound;97.9/ = { balance accounts 47.9 : on account 50 } Received also a letter from Leadbottom, the <span class=highlight_yellow>introduction</span> Newcastle w entry a statement of the account between us &amp; Mrs Scott executors which I sent him.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. On board the Harvy in the afternoon &amp; went over the bar <span class=highlight_yellow>with:</span> bound to Quebec. Finished off at the Albion &amp; called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1238,"lock":null}
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1293
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1293,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning. Wind NW. Took a walk with H Harry up to the Hope, taking out the dung at Smiths Crane, proceeded round by Burdon Main, Chirton &amp; Dr Drury's garden. Home to dinner. In the afternoon again walked up to the Doctors garden. Played at Quoits &amp; finished the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1239,"lock":null}
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1293
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1293,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning. Wind NW. Took a walk with H Harry up to the Hope, taking out the dung at Smiths Crane, proceeded round by Burdon Main, Chirton &amp; Dr Drury's garden. Home to dinner. In the afternoon again walked up to the Doctors garden. Played at Quoits &amp; finished the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1239,"lock":null}
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1294
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1294,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine spring weather. Went to church &amp; heard a most excellent sermon from the vicar's brother. Had a long walk in the castle yard in the afternoon &amp; dined with Jebbs at 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1240,"lock":null}
20:13:21.406 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1294
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1294,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine spring weather. Went to church &amp; heard a most excellent sermon from the vicar's brother. Had a long walk in the castle yard in the afternoon &amp; dined with Jebbs at 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1240,"lock":null}
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1295
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1295,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The same sort of weather. Wind changeable. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach. The collieries all off work, could get no coal. Took the Hope off Bell &amp; Brown's list. Returned by steam. Dined at home. In the afternoon at the news &amp; billiard rooms &amp; finished the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum. H Harry wrote to Hull for a <span class=highlight_yellow>Wybung</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>chailer</span> for me.</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1241,"lock":null}
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.407 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1295
20:13:21.408 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1295,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The same sort of weather. Wind changeable. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach. The collieries all off work, could get no coal. Took the Hope off Bell &amp; Brown's list. Returned by steam. Dined at home. In the afternoon at the news &amp; billiard rooms &amp; finished the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum. H Harry wrote to Hull for a <span class=highlight_yellow>Wybung</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>chailer</span> for me.</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1241,"lock":null}
