20:13:21.417 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1316
20:13:21.417 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1316,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Received a letter from WBS enclosing our note for &pound;300 at 6 months payable to Messrs Lees which I gave to Mr Spence. Went to Preston <span class=highlight_yellow>Main</span> &amp; his brother signed another lease for 3 years. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined at 6 o'clock with Captain <font color=#BFBFBF>William Fanshawe</font> Martin on board the Samarang frigate</p>","pageId":907,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1262,"lock":null}
20:13:21.417 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
