20:13:21.418 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1317,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day but cold. Wind NE. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. Drank tea at H Harry &amp; walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Had a glass of whiskey toddy at <span class=highlight_yellow>Southerns</span> &amp; finished off at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1263,"lock":null}
20:13:21.418 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1318
20:13:21.418 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1318,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful day. Wind NE. Walked to Tynemouth. The mariners under <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rre</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ars</span> in case they should be wanted at the collieries. Dined at home. Drank punch on board the Douglas in the afternoon &amp; at the Musltrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1264,"lock":null}
20:13:21.418 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
