20:13:21.420 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1322
20:13:21.420 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1322,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. Ascension day. The Mayor <font color=#333333>Archibald Reed</font><font color=#333333> down in his barge. I breakfasted with him. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at the Albion with Bradshaw. Had an excellent dinner. At the </font><font color=#333333>Mulstrum</font></p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1268,"lock":null}
