20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":133,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers day. Engaged all the morning packing up books then took an hours walk. Dined quietly with Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":123,"lock":null}
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1330
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1330,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ESE &amp; high sea. Boswell &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine at the George in the afternoon &amp; coffee at Mr Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1276,"lock":null}
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1330
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1330,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ESE &amp; high sea. Boswell &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took wine at the George in the afternoon &amp; coffee at Mr Tinley's in the evening.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1276,"lock":null}
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1331
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1331,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind NNE. Took a walk to Tynemouth both morning &amp; afternoon. Dined at 6 o'clock on board the Samarang with Captain Martin &amp; spent the evening with Mr Tinley. Rob Reed arrived this evening</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1277,"lock":null}
20:13:21.425 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1331
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1331,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind NNE. Took a walk to Tynemouth both morning &amp; afternoon. Dined at 6 o'clock on board the Samarang with Captain Martin &amp; spent the evening with Mr Tinley. Rob Reed arrived this evening</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1277,"lock":null}
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1332
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1332,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from N by E with a sea upon the bar. Went to church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at J Tinley's &amp; called at the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1278,"lock":null}
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1332
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1332,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; blowing fresh from N by E with a sea upon the bar. Went to church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at J Tinley's &amp; called at the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1278,"lock":null}
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1333
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1333,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; rather cold wind NNE. Dined with Junior Richardson &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races. Very good sport. Potts won the claret jug cards at the Mulstrum. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1279,"lock":null}
20:13:21.426 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
