20:13:21.427 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1336
20:13:21.427 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1336,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold &amp; unpleasant day. Wind NE. Took a walk round by Tynemouth. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon walked up to Billy Mill &amp; drank wine with Charlton. Bess came up in the car<font color=#BFBFBF>riage</font> &amp; a pretty finish we made of it.</p>","pageId":912,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1282,"lock":null}
