20:13:21.429 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1339
20:13:21.429 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1339,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather dull wind S by E. Attended morning service. Dined at home. Lockwood took dinner with me. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Took wine with Tibbs &amp; spent the evening in the castle yard &amp; Lockwood</p>","pageId":913,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1285,"lock":null}
