20:13:21.430 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":134,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another exceedingly fine day. Wind WSW. The boys having a holiday. Went fishing with them but had bad sport. Dined with the Jameson's</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":124,"lock":null}
