20:13:21.435 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1344,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day, rather foggy at sea. Wind NNE. Walked to Tynemouth with Webb. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; I together in the afternoon. Played at Quoits in the evening at the Doctor's garden. Called at the Mulstrum on our way home.</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1290,"lock":null}
