20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1345,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still fine weather. Wind NE. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands with Bess. Dined at home. Walked again in the evening on the Sands with Bess</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1291,"lock":null}
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1346
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1346,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNE. Went to church. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined with J Tinley. At 5 o'clock met Cap<sup>t</sup><font color=#BFBFBF>ain</font> Glasscost &amp; L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Drickey of the <font color=#BFBFBF>HMS</font> Orestes, Major Mitchell &amp; Rudyard at the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1292,"lock":null}
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1346
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1346,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNE. Went to church. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined with J Tinley. At 5 o'clock met Cap<sup>t</sup><font color=#BFBFBF>ain</font> Glasscost &amp; L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Drickey of the <font color=#BFBFBF>HMS</font> Orestes, Major Mitchell &amp; Rudyard at the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1292,"lock":null}
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1347
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1347,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning with slight rain &amp; blowing fresh from N by E &amp; good deal of sea on. Received a letter from WBS. Attended a meeting for the relief of the seamen out of employment, whose families are in great distress, subscribed a Guinea. Dined at home. Called at the Doctor's &amp; walked up to his garden &amp; spent the evening playing at quoits. At the Albion</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1293,"lock":null}
20:13:21.436 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
