20:13:21.449 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1371,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NNW. Breakfasted with Orr &amp; his wife at the Garrison. Saw the armoury containing the arms of all the local militias etc of the district, about 20000. Walked up to the ship, a <span class=highlight_yellow>lighter</span> up with 40 tons of ballast. At Garbutt's, Wade not having got the deal <span class=highlight_yellow>counted</span> are unable to settle the freight. Dined on board. Walked about the town &amp; docks in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening with Orr. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1317,"lock":null}
20:13:21.449 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1372
20:13:21.449 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1372,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNW. At Mr Garbutt's &amp; on board the ship. Got the remainder of her ballast. Went out with Mr Bell to dine with his partner J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Wood. At Hezzle <font color=#BFBFBF>(</font><i><font color=#BFBFBF>Hessle</font></i><font color=#BFBFBF>, Hull</font><font color=#BFBFBF>),</font> met a party there</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1318,"lock":null}
