20:13:21.449 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1373
20:13:21.449 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1373,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@53.741044,-0.3337215,3a,75y,64.63h,92.28t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1scLHcGbd_2wPlsjJKGXzqHQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2780-cross-keys-hull.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>The Cross Keys Hotel, Hull</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":920,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1319,"lock":null}
