20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1378,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine warm morning . Wind W by N &amp; looks like showers. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. At the Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1324,"lock":null}
20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
