20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1379,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind E by S. paid into Chapmans a bill at 4 months, <span class=highlight_yellow>Weider</span> accepted on <span class=highlight_yellow>Hoarses</span> for &pound;175. Took a walk round by the rocks to Tynemouth. Dined at 5 o'clock With Mr J Metcalf &amp; went to the theatre in the evening being thebespeak of the officers of the marines. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1325,"lock":null}
20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/138
20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":138,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a cool NW wind. The cattle fair at Carlow, town was crowded. Got the last trunk nearly packed with books, plates etc. Dined at Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":128,"lock":null}
20:13:21.452 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
