20:13:21.463 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1400
20:13:21.463 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1400,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Tom Smith taken suddenly ill. Tom, Bea &amp; I drove down to church, returned home after calling upon Mr Clutterbuck by Amble. Dined at 3 o'clock &amp; took a walk with Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> &amp; Tom round the farm in the evening</p>","pageId":928,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1346,"lock":null}
20:13:21.463 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
