20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1400,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Tom Smith taken suddenly ill. Tom, Bea &amp; I drove down to church, returned home after calling upon Mr Clutterbuck by Amble. Dined at 3 o'clock &amp; took a walk with Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> &amp; Tom round the farm in the evening</p>","pageId":928,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1346,"lock":null}
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1401
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1401,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. After breakfast, Tom drove Ben &amp; I into Alnwick being fair day. Called upon Ian W Smith who with others of the family being very unwell, we did not go in. Called upon Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Wund</span> Forster &amp; got home to dinner at 5 o'clock.</p>","pageId":928,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1347,"lock":null}
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1401
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1401,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. After breakfast, Tom drove Ben &amp; I into Alnwick being fair day. Called upon Ian W Smith who with others of the family being very unwell, we did not go in. Called upon Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Wund</span> Forster &amp; got home to dinner at 5 o'clock.</p>","pageId":928,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1347,"lock":null}
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1402
20:13:21.464 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1402,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Walked down after breakfast to Amble &amp; fish the Granary Stream but without success. Ben G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> &amp; Rob S<font color=#BFBFBF>mith</font> with me afterwards. Ben &amp; I bathed &amp; then joined Tom at Amble. Looked over his fields there. Turnips in a very bad state. Got home to dinner at 3 o'clock. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ellenth</span> dined with us. Mrs Scott much better.</p>","pageId":929,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1348,"lock":null}
