20:13:21.465 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1404
20:13:21.465 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1404,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A glorious day. Wind SW. Went up to Newcastle by Dunn's Gig in the morning. Saw &amp; had some conversation about Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Haig</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>regagatted</span> &amp; placed below <span class=highlight_yellow>Lorain</span> &amp; Cleaning could make nothing of him. He <span class=highlight_yellow>evidently</span> the friend of the other <span class=highlight_yellow>Party</span>. <span class=highlight_yellow>went</span> go up ...</p>","pageId":929,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1350,"lock":null}
