20:13:21.466 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1406,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very hot weather. Gave a draft on <span class=highlight_yellow>Cols</span> for balance of Premium and Hope clubs &pound;4.7.1 also a draft for &pound;6.15 <span class=highlight_yellow>momo</span> to be paid tomorrow. Attended Mr Ilderton's Committee room and came <span class=highlight_yellow>after</span> Lenskill Street. Dined at home. At the Committee Room again in the afternoon. A fine shower of rain in the afterwards. At the theatre &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1352,"lock":null}
20:13:21.466 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1407
20:13:21.466 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
