20:13:21.466 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
20:13:21.467 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1408
20:13:21.467 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1408,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most delightful weather. Wind from the S &amp; E. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Lockerwood dined with me. H Harry came in &amp; took wine. At Tynemouth &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1354,"lock":null}
