20:13:21.467 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1409
20:13:21.467 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1409,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined &amp; spent a very pleasant day with H Dale, I Dale Joe Hawkes &amp; Mark there. Received a letter from WBS. Paid Cheghton for rum &pound;4.6</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1355,"lock":null}
20:13:21.467 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
