20:13:21.473 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":142,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Got up at 5 o'clock to fish but had no sport. Tried again breakfast. Fished the whole of the morning but never had a rise, in consequence I suppose of the wind being from the east</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":132,"lock":null}
