20:13:21.482 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/144
20:13:21.482 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":144,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers day. Went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Free</span> Church in the morning &amp; afterwards walked to Crossleigh with the boys. Dined at the Jamesons</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":134,"lock":null}
20:13:21.482 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
