20:13:21.483 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1443
20:13:21.483 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1443,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coronation_of_William_IV_and_Adelaide\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2799-coronation-william-4th.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Coronation of William IV</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":939,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1389,"lock":null}
20:13:21.483 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
