20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1499,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind SW. Took a long walk with Mark to Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; dined with Joblings at the George at 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1445,"lock":null}
20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/15
20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":15,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott Went to the theatre in the evening. The bespeak of the Bachelors of North Shields for the benefit of Miss C Scsuton. A good house &pound;59.16/-. Play The Haunted Tower with Registers Officer &amp; High life below stairs, a very good company. Wind SSE. A heavy fall of snow, the latter part of the evening it thawed. Sea fallen</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":12,"lock":null}
