20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":15,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott Went to the theatre in the evening. The bespeak of the Bachelors of North Shields for the benefit of Miss C Scsuton. A good house &pound;59.16/-. Play The Haunted Tower with Registers Officer &amp; High life below stairs, a very good company. Wind SSE. A heavy fall of snow, the latter part of the evening it thawed. Sea fallen</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":12,"lock":null}
20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/150
20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":150,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Called upon Mr Syms &amp; Mr Grey, respecting the Athy property. But got no information. Mr Syms who was not at home. Went to the catholic association to hear O'Connell &amp; others speak. Was disappointed. Dined with Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry. Young O'Connel dined with us. A heavy fall of rain [<font color=#D9D9D9>in</font>] the evening</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":140,"lock":null}
20:13:21.512 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/150
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":150,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Called upon Mr Syms &amp; Mr Grey, respecting the Athy property. But got no information. Mr Syms who was not at home. Went to the catholic association to hear O'Connell &amp; others speak. Was disappointed. Dined with Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry. Young O'Connel dined with us. A heavy fall of rain [<font color=#D9D9D9>in</font>] the evening</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":140,"lock":null}
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1500
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1500,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SW.</p>\r\n<p>After breakfast took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; went to church in the afternoon, again walked to Tynemouth. Jobling dined with me at 5 o'clock. Reconciled with <font color=#BFBFBF>Bess</font></p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1446,"lock":null}
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1500
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1500,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SW.</p>\r\n<p>After breakfast took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; went to church in the afternoon, again walked to Tynemouth. Jobling dined with me at 5 o'clock. Reconciled with <font color=#BFBFBF>Bess</font></p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1446,"lock":null}
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1501
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1501,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind West. After breakfast walked to Tynemouth &amp; with others. Amused ourselves on Cullercoat Sands practicing ball firing. Dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Mr Archer last night the owner of the planter to meet me at 11 o'clock on Tuesday morning to survey the damage.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1447,"lock":null}
20:13:21.513 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1501
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1501,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind West. After breakfast walked to Tynemouth &amp; with others. Amused ourselves on Cullercoat Sands practicing ball firing. Dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Mr Archer last night the owner of the planter to meet me at 11 o'clock on Tuesday morning to survey the damage.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1447,"lock":null}
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1502
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1502,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning blowing &amp; has been all night hard from the SW. Ob board the Hope. Mr Archer did not come to survey the damage but sent a letter with an estimate, offering me &pound;1.10 &amp; the old boom etc. Walked up &amp; saw him but did not agree, however afterwards determined to take it with an 18 inch plank.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1448,"lock":null}
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1502
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1502,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning blowing &amp; has been all night hard from the SW. Ob board the Hope. Mr Archer did not come to survey the damage but sent a letter with an estimate, offering me &pound;1.10 &amp; the old boom etc. Walked up &amp; saw him but did not agree, however afterwards determined to take it with an 18 inch plank.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1448,"lock":null}
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1503
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1503,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind fresh from SW &amp; little rain.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson up to &amp; he settled with Mr Archer. Received 30/0 &amp; a deal plank. The ship got her beef on board. Sent WBS a round up. Walked up to Tynemouth. Saw Rifles march for Manchester. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Lockerwood came in &amp; took a glass of toddy with me.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1449,"lock":null}
20:13:21.514 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1503
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1503,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind fresh from SW &amp; little rain.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson up to &amp; he settled with Mr Archer. Received 30/0 &amp; a deal plank. The ship got her beef on board. Sent WBS a round up. Walked up to Tynemouth. Saw Rifles march for Manchester. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Lockerwood came in &amp; took a glass of toddy with me.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1449,"lock":null}
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1504
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1504
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1505
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1505,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Been showers in the night. Wind NW</p>\r\n<p>The Hope got to sea this morning's tide. Walked to Tynemouth and round by Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Wright. Dined with A Dale at 5 o'clock to meet the bridal party from Whitley park. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1451,"lock":null}
20:13:21.515 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1505
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1505,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Been showers in the night. Wind NW</p>\r\n<p>The Hope got to sea this morning's tide. Walked to Tynemouth and round by Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Wright. Dined with A Dale at 5 o'clock to meet the bridal party from Whitley park. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1451,"lock":null}
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1506
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1506,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Went to Newcastle by steam. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;211.12.1 on WBS. Called at Angus about the carriage. Returned by steam. Dined with J Tinley &amp; in the evening at the whist club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1452,"lock":null}
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1506
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1506,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Went to Newcastle by steam. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;211.12.1 on WBS. Called at Angus about the carriage. Returned by steam. Dined with J Tinley &amp; in the evening at the whist club &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1452,"lock":null}
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1507
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1507,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been showers in the night. A cold morning. Wind SW &amp; S by W. Did not go church. Walked round by Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. With Bess in the evening. A very wet night</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1453,"lock":null}
20:13:21.516 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1507
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1507,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been showers in the night. A cold morning. Wind SW &amp; S by W. Did not go church. Walked round by Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. With Bess in the evening. A very wet night</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1453,"lock":null}
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1508
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1508,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but all the appearance of more rain. Glass very low. Wind WSW. Blew in heavy squalls during the day with showers. Made the Hopes last or 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage up. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, drank a glass of toddy with Lockwood &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1454,"lock":null}
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1508
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1508,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but all the appearance of more rain. Glass very low. Wind WSW. Blew in heavy squalls during the day with showers. Made the Hopes last or 3<sup>rd</sup> coal voyage up. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, drank a glass of toddy with Lockwood &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1454,"lock":null}
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1509
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
20:13:21.517 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1509
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/151
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":151,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy damp morning. Wind East. Got up early &amp; went by the steam boat to Kingstown to see Tom Thompson on board the Royal Charlotte Yacht. He was much surprised too when I went on board. I spent the day &amp; dined with him &amp; returned to Dublin by steam in the evening. It turned out a fine afternoon</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":141,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/151
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":151,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy damp morning. Wind East. Got up early &amp; went by the steam boat to Kingstown to see Tom Thompson on board the Royal Charlotte Yacht. He was much surprised too when I went on board. I spent the day &amp; dined with him &amp; returned to Dublin by steam in the evening. It turned out a fine afternoon</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":141,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1510
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1510,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Air frosty &amp; glass high. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Wilkinson &amp; Angus saying they could not purchase the carriage.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Jobling arrived &amp; agreed to stay with me. He dined with me at 2 o'clock. At the billiards room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Ordered 2 gallons of whiskey for one of which Jobling paid.</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1456,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1510
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1510,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Air frosty &amp; glass high. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Wilkinson &amp; Angus saying they could not purchase the carriage.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Jobling arrived &amp; agreed to stay with me. He dined with me at 2 o'clock. At the billiards room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Ordered 2 gallons of whiskey for one of which Jobling paid.</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1456,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1511
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1511,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp &amp; cold morning. Wind WSW. Two ships got upon the herd in coming into the harbour. Received a letter from Harry &amp;  G of Yarmouth informing me that the Hope had sprung a leak on Sunday night off Orford &amp; got a boat with 14 men to assist in pumping &amp; could scarcely keep her with both pumps going. They however had got her to Yarmouth close to the bar where they were lightening her to get her into the harbour. Laid the letter before the club who sent instructions to Messrs Hurry. I wrote to Stephenson &amp; WBS &amp; also sent a copy of the letter to the Hope Club at Newcastle.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at 2 o'clock. At the whist club in the evening &amp; suppered with Bess. Jobling with me</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1457,"lock":null}
20:13:21.518 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1511
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1511,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp &amp; cold morning. Wind WSW. Two ships got upon the herd in coming into the harbour. Received a letter from Harry &amp;  G of Yarmouth informing me that the Hope had sprung a leak on Sunday night off Orford &amp; got a boat with 14 men to assist in pumping &amp; could scarcely keep her with both pumps going. They however had got her to Yarmouth close to the bar where they were lightening her to get her into the harbour. Laid the letter before the club who sent instructions to Messrs Hurry. I wrote to Stephenson &amp; WBS &amp; also sent a copy of the letter to the Hope Club at Newcastle.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at 2 o'clock. At the whist club in the evening &amp; suppered with Bess. Jobling with me</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1457,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1512
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1512,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>The two ships got off the herd.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS with our note to Chapman for &pound;200 dated the 9<sup>th</sup> Nov. Jobling left for Seghill. Tom Smith arrived from Togston. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1458,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1512
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1512,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>The two ships got off the herd.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS with our note to Chapman for &pound;200 dated the 9<sup>th</sup> Nov. Jobling left for Seghill. Tom Smith arrived from Togston. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1458,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1513
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1513,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; Co &amp; Stephenson of the ship having struck upon the bar in going into Yarmouth. Wrote to them to deliver &amp; sell the coals, get the leak stopped &amp; return to Shields. Wrote also to WBS. Went across the water &amp; saw Mr Potts who is to send me a copy of the <span class=highlight_yellow>Harmongs</span> protest on Monday. Tom Smith &amp; I dined at home at 5 o'clock &amp; had the whist club in the evening. A pleasant party. Jobling returned late</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1459,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1513
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1513,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; Co &amp; Stephenson of the ship having struck upon the bar in going into Yarmouth. Wrote to them to deliver &amp; sell the coals, get the leak stopped &amp; return to Shields. Wrote also to WBS. Went across the water &amp; saw Mr Potts who is to send me a copy of the <span class=highlight_yellow>Harmongs</span> protest on Monday. Tom Smith &amp; I dined at home at 5 o'clock &amp; had the whist club in the evening. A pleasant party. Jobling returned late</p>","pageId":960,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1459,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1514
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1514,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but cold morning blowing hard from the NW &amp; NNW.</p>\r\n<p>Tom Smith &amp; I walked to Tynemouth &amp; he afterwards drove up to Benton. Jobling &amp; I dined at home at 4 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>At night with Bess</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1460,"lock":null}
20:13:21.519 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1514
20:13:21.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1514,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but cold morning blowing hard from the NW &amp; NNW.</p>\r\n<p>Tom Smith &amp; I walked to Tynemouth &amp; he afterwards drove up to Benton. Jobling &amp; I dined at home at 4 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>At night with Bess</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1460,"lock":null}
20:13:21.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1515
20:13:21.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1515,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold raw damp morning. Frosty during the night. Wind W &amp; W by S.</p>\r\n<p>Gave Spencer our note for &pound;200 at 6 months dated 9<sup>th</sup> Nov to be placed to the credit of the executors &amp; paid &pound;85 rents to their credit also Jobling &amp; I dined at home at 2 o'clock. I refused an invitation to dinner at Mr Reeds. At the billiard</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1461,"lock":null}
20:13:21.520 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1515
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1515,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold raw damp morning. Frosty during the night. Wind W &amp; W by S.</p>\r\n<p>Gave Spencer our note for &pound;200 at 6 months dated 9<sup>th</sup> Nov to be placed to the credit of the executors &amp; paid &pound;85 rents to their credit also Jobling &amp; I dined at home at 2 o'clock. I refused an invitation to dinner at Mr Reeds. At the billiard</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1461,"lock":null}
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1516
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1516,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind W by N. Received two letters, one from Hurry &amp; Co, the other from Stephenson stating the ship to be still very leaky requiring 6 extra men to pumps. They had got her about &frac14; of a mile up the way up to the quay. Laid the letters before the club. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1462,"lock":null}
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1516
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1516,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind W by N. Received two letters, one from Hurry &amp; Co, the other from Stephenson stating the ship to be still very leaky requiring 6 extra men to pumps. They had got her about &frac14; of a mile up the way up to the quay. Laid the letters before the club. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1462,"lock":null}
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1517
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1517,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Received a letter from WBS</p>\r\n<p>A comfortable winter's morning. Been a heavy fall of snow during the night. The country covered. Wind NNW. Thawing.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. With Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Robert over the water to Mr Potts who let me have the Harmony Protest in the evening for which I paid &pound;1.11-6</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1463,"lock":null}
20:13:21.521 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1517
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1517,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Received a letter from WBS</p>\r\n<p>A comfortable winter's morning. Been a heavy fall of snow during the night. The country covered. Wind NNW. Thawing.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. With Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Robert over the water to Mr Potts who let me have the Harmony Protest in the evening for which I paid &pound;1.11-6</p>","pageId":961,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1463,"lock":null}
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1518
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1518,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A sharp frost in the night having been a thaw yesterday. The streets this morning a sheet of ice &amp; dangerous walking. Wind WNW. The clubs received a letter from Messrs Hurry's stating they had sold the remainder of the coals to be taken out of the ship in two days. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent the Hairmongers protest with a copy of Chapman's book &amp; an account of rents. Attended the whist club. Boswell came home with us in the evening to join us in a glass of toddy. Took physic</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1464,"lock":null}
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1518
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1518,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A sharp frost in the night having been a thaw yesterday. The streets this morning a sheet of ice &amp; dangerous walking. Wind WNW. The clubs received a letter from Messrs Hurry's stating they had sold the remainder of the coals to be taken out of the ship in two days. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent the Hairmongers protest with a copy of Chapman's book &amp; an account of rents. Attended the whist club. Boswell came home with us in the evening to join us in a glass of toddy. Took physic</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1464,"lock":null}
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1519
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1519,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. Having from cold I suppose, the back of my neck &amp; head much affected &amp; sore. I this morning took a black draught &amp; lay in bed till 1 o'clock. Charles Redley called from Hartley. Dined &amp; spent the afternoon with us. He left us at &frac14; past 9 o'clock to walk back being a fine moonlight night. I went along &amp; slept with Bess. Robert yesterday paid Philipson Mason his bill &pound;37 &amp; today paid into Chapman's &pound;15 more rents</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1465,"lock":null}
20:13:21.522 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1519
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1519,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. Having from cold I suppose, the back of my neck &amp; head much affected &amp; sore. I this morning took a black draught &amp; lay in bed till 1 o'clock. Charles Redley called from Hartley. Dined &amp; spent the afternoon with us. He left us at &frac14; past 9 o'clock to walk back being a fine moonlight night. I went along &amp; slept with Bess. Robert yesterday paid Philipson Mason his bill &pound;37 &amp; today paid into Chapman's &pound;15 more rents</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1465,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/152
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":152,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Mr Vernon &amp; I left Dublin at 9 o'clock &amp; got to Carlow at 4 o'clock. Dined at home at 6 o'clock. Called upon Mr Price who informed me he had got about &pound;150 by the sale of the furniture which is much more than I expected</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":142,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/152
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":152,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Mr Vernon &amp; I left Dublin at 9 o'clock &amp; got to Carlow at 4 o'clock. Dined at home at 6 o'clock. Called upon Mr Price who informed me he had got about &pound;150 by the sale of the furniture which is much more than I expected</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":142,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1520
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1520,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of snow last night again. A complete thaw with sleet. Wind E by N. Paid average Eligible Club &pound;12. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1466,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1520
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1520,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of snow last night again. A complete thaw with sleet. Wind E by N. Paid average Eligible Club &pound;12. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1466,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1521
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1521,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. At the newsroom in the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening with Bess. Jobling there.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1467,"lock":null}
20:13:21.523 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1521
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1521,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. At the newsroom in the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening with Bess. Jobling there.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1467,"lock":null}
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1522
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1522
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1523
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
20:13:21.524 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1523
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1524
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1524,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; fresh breezes from WNW. Wrote to WBS with a list of ships that sailed before &amp; after the Hope. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess's. Jobling, H Hurry &amp; Boswell <font color=#BFBFBF>there</font>.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1470,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1524
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1524,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; fresh breezes from WNW. Wrote to WBS with a list of ships that sailed before &amp; after the Hope. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess's. Jobling, H Hurry &amp; Boswell <font color=#BFBFBF>there</font>.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1470,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1525
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1525,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of mild weather. Wind WSW. Received a letter from Stephenson of his having got the leak stopped. The ballast alongside &amp; expecting to get away the next day. Gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;5 <span class=highlight_yellow>account</span> for self. Dined with Mr Harrison the brewer at 3 o'clock. At the whist club &amp; at night with Bess. Jobling went to South Shields</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1471,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1525
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1525,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of mild weather. Wind WSW. Received a letter from Stephenson of his having got the leak stopped. The ballast alongside &amp; expecting to get away the next day. Gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;5 <span class=highlight_yellow>account</span> for self. Dined with Mr Harrison the brewer at 3 o'clock. At the whist club &amp; at night with Bess. Jobling went to South Shields</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1471,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1526
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1526,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SW. gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;9.10 average Hope Club. Wind changed to SE. A great many ships got down. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. With Bess at night. Lockwood there</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1472,"lock":null}
20:13:21.525 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1526
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1526,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SW. gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;9.10 average Hope Club. Wind changed to SE. A great many ships got down. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. With Bess at night. Lockwood there</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1472,"lock":null}
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1527
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1527,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but cold and wind SE. A great many light ships arrived <span class=highlight_yellow>ravenjot</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>this</span>. The Hope from Yarmouth quite light. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell&amp; Brown again to be loaded in 3 weeks,. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; attended the club. At night at <span class=highlight_yellow>Garthays</span></p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1473,"lock":null}
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1527
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1527,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but cold and wind SE. A great many light ships arrived <span class=highlight_yellow>ravenjot</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>this</span>. The Hope from Yarmouth quite light. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell&amp; Brown again to be loaded in 3 weeks,. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; attended the club. At night at <span class=highlight_yellow>Garthays</span></p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1473,"lock":null}
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1528
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1528,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold &amp; frosty. Wind SW. My head still being bad from cold, T this morning breakfasted in bed &amp; got up at 12 o'clock. Went to church in the afternoon. Afterwards walked round by Tynemouth. Dined with Tinley at 5 o'clock, Jobley &amp; Captain Cuthbert 15<sup>th</sup> there</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1474,"lock":null}
20:13:21.526 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
