20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1529,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, rather frosty. Wind SW. Walked up to the ship. On board the Crisis. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; in the evening at Mr Jarvis</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1475,"lock":null}
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/153
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":153,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Called upon Mr Price in the morning, who gave me a list of the goods sold, with the prices &amp; &pound;90 on account. Had some conversation with Mr Walker with regard to administrating etc. Took a short walk with the boys &amp; returned to dinner. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":143,"lock":null}
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/153
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":153,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Called upon Mr Price in the morning, who gave me a list of the goods sold, with the prices &amp; &pound;90 on account. Had some conversation with Mr Walker with regard to administrating etc. Took a short walk with the boys &amp; returned to dinner. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":143,"lock":null}
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1530
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1530,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather, rather frosty. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Beall app<font color=#BFBFBF>renti</font><sup>ce</sup><sup> </sup> in advance &pound;1. Received a letter from Hurry &amp; Co Yarmouth with their accounts &amp; a bill for balance at 2 months for &pound;59.9.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with H Hurry &amp; Richardson up to Sadlers &amp; dined with him</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1476,"lock":null}
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1530
20:13:21.527 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1530,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather, rather frosty. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Beall app<font color=#BFBFBF>renti</font><sup>ce</sup><sup> </sup> in advance &pound;1. Received a letter from Hurry &amp; Co Yarmouth with their accounts &amp; a bill for balance at 2 months for &pound;59.9.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with H Hurry &amp; Richardson up to Sadlers &amp; dined with him</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1476,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1531
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1531
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1532
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1532
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1533
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1533,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Thick cold weather wind WNW. The committee of the Eligible &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Whcatley</span> as a member of the Hope Club committee, went on board the Hope &amp; surveyed her &amp; found her much strained &amp; they readily agreed to give her a caulking, if I were willing to accept it &amp; not strip her etc. two warps a <span class=highlight_yellow>trwlinge</span> &amp; studding sail continued. Set the men on to work after dinner.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Messrs Hurry &amp; Co. <font color=#BFBFBF>of </font>Yarmouth acknowledging the receipt of these accounts &amp; vouchers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with a party at Gordons at Tynemouth Place at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1479,"lock":null}
20:13:21.528 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1533
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1533,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Thick cold weather wind WNW. The committee of the Eligible &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Whcatley</span> as a member of the Hope Club committee, went on board the Hope &amp; surveyed her &amp; found her much strained &amp; they readily agreed to give her a caulking, if I were willing to accept it &amp; not strip her etc. two warps a <span class=highlight_yellow>trwlinge</span> &amp; studding sail continued. Set the men on to work after dinner.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Messrs Hurry &amp; Co. <font color=#BFBFBF>of </font>Yarmouth acknowledging the receipt of these accounts &amp; vouchers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with a party at Gordons at Tynemouth Place at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1479,"lock":null}
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1534
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1534,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. At the dock the men 21 busy caulking. Stephenson &amp; the carpenter found the ship in good order &amp; not at all broken. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At the billiard room. Called to see Bess &amp; at night at the club at Drury</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1480,"lock":null}
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1534
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1534,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. At the dock the men 21 busy caulking. Stephenson &amp; the carpenter found the ship in good order &amp; not at all broken. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At the billiard room. Called to see Bess &amp; at night at the club at Drury</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1480,"lock":null}
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1535
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1535,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning. Afterwards cleared away &amp; turned out fine. Wind W by N. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1481,"lock":null}
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1535
20:13:21.529 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1535,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning. Afterwards cleared away &amp; turned out fine. Wind W by N. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1481,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1536
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1536,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Jobley, Boswell &amp; H Harry dined with me on board the Hope. At Mr Atkinson's in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1482,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1536
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1536,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Jobley, Boswell &amp; H Harry dined with me on board the Hope. At Mr Atkinson's in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1482,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1537
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1537,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, after rain &amp; blowing very heavy from WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach, called on bell &amp; Brown to let them know when the Hope would be out of dock. Saw Emma Galbraith who was quite well. Returned to Shields by steam. At the ship. Dined with Dr Drury.  At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1483,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1537
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1537,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, after rain &amp; blowing very heavy from WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach, called on bell &amp; Brown to let them know when the Hope would be out of dock. Saw Emma Galbraith who was quite well. Returned to Shields by steam. At the ship. Dined with Dr Drury.  At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1483,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1538
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
20:13:21.530 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1538
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1539
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1539
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/154
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":154,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant day. Engaged the principle part of the morning with Mr Walker in reading over Bessy's marriage settlements etc. Paid Lamb &pound;51 being the balance with interest of his bill of &pound;100. Wrote to William asking him to act as sole guardian to the children</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":144,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
