20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":154,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant day. Engaged the principle part of the morning with Mr Walker in reading over Bessy's marriage settlements etc. Paid Lamb &pound;51 being the balance with interest of his bill of &pound;100. Wrote to William asking him to act as sole guardian to the children</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":144,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1540
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1540,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a great deal of rain during the night. Wind WSW. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1486,"lock":null}
20:13:21.531 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1540
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1540,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a great deal of rain during the night. Wind WSW. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1486,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1541
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1541
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1542
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1542
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1543
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
20:13:21.533 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1543
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1544
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1544
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1545
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
20:13:21.534 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1545
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1546
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1546
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1547
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1547,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Paid the Hope's piolet &pound;1.16 &amp; to 3 men for getting the ship chain hawser which she was obliged to ship &amp; leave behind &amp; for placing it on shore 7/6.</p>\r\n<p>Gave a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman</font>'s &amp; Co for self &pound;5</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Joblings brothers with us.</p>\r\n<p>At the theatre &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening blew a gale at SSE</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1493,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1547
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1547,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Paid the Hope's piolet &pound;1.16 &amp; to 3 men for getting the ship chain hawser which she was obliged to ship &amp; leave behind &amp; for placing it on shore 7/6.</p>\r\n<p>Gave a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman</font>'s &amp; Co for self &pound;5</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Joblings brothers with us.</p>\r\n<p>At the theatre &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening blew a gale at SSE</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1493,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1548
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1548,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, but fine weather. A fresh breeze from WSW &amp; SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;216.10.6 at 60 days from the 14 Dec.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Dixon Dixon. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Lockwood dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. At the whist club with me at Ben Wrights</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1494,"lock":null}
20:13:21.535 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1548
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1548,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, but fine weather. A fresh breeze from WSW &amp; SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;216.10.6 at 60 days from the 14 Dec.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Dixon Dixon. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Lockwood dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. At the whist club with me at Ben Wrights</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1494,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1549
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1549
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/155
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":155,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer day. Engaged writing all morning. Took a walk with Mr Vernon. Returned home to dinner. The two Careys dined with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":145,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/155
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":155,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer day. Engaged writing all morning. Took a walk with Mr Vernon. Returned home to dinner. The two Careys dined with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":145,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1550
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
20:13:21.536 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.537 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1550
20:13:21.537 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
20:13:21.537 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1551
20:13:21.537 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1551,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Found myself at Bess's this morning. Where I remained all day. Went home a little after 5 o'clock. Showed myself at the newsroom. Had two glasses of toddy with H Harry &amp; Charlton at the Albion &amp; returned in the evening to Bess's</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1497,"lock":null}
20:13:21.537 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1551
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1551,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Found myself at Bess's this morning. Where I remained all day. Went home a little after 5 o'clock. Showed myself at the newsroom. Had two glasses of toddy with H Harry &amp; Charlton at the Albion &amp; returned in the evening to Bess's</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1497,"lock":null}
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1552
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1552,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after rain. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; back to dinner at 2 o'clock. Jobling got down today. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1498,"lock":null}
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1552
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1552,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after rain. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; back to dinner at 2 o'clock. Jobling got down today. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1498,"lock":null}
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1553
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1553,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp morning. Wind South. At the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined with J Tinley at 6 o'clock to meet Colonel Creagh, an officer sent down by government to establish Boards of Health &amp; the precautions against the cholera. Captain Lenthbest &amp; Gosling there</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1499,"lock":null}
20:13:21.538 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1553
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1553,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp morning. Wind South. At the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined with J Tinley at 6 o'clock to meet Colonel Creagh, an officer sent down by government to establish Boards of Health &amp; the precautions against the cholera. Captain Lenthbest &amp; Gosling there</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1499,"lock":null}
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1554
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1554,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The wind at last got to the NW. the warps &amp; towlines of the Hope were sold yesterday. Dined at home. At the billiard room. In the evening took wine with ben Wright. Went to the theatre &amp; afterwards with Bess.</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1500,"lock":null}
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1554
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1554,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The wind at last got to the NW. the warps &amp; towlines of the Hope were sold yesterday. Dined at home. At the billiard room. In the evening took wine with ben Wright. Went to the theatre &amp; afterwards with Bess.</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1500,"lock":null}
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1555
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1555,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Sent J Anderson <font color=#BFBFBF>of the </font>Hope Club an account of the voyage made by the Hope from the 10<sup>th</sup> May to 20<sup>th</sup> Dec. Received last night from WBS from India silk pocket handkerchief.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Bess. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; the windows</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1501,"lock":null}
20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
