20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1555,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Sent J Anderson <font color=#BFBFBF>of the </font>Hope Club an account of the voyage made by the Hope from the 10<sup>th</sup> May to 20<sup>th</sup> Dec. Received last night from WBS from India silk pocket handkerchief.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Bess. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; the windows</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1501,"lock":null}
