20:13:21.539 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1556,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Xmas Day. A very fine morning. Wind SW. Walked up to Benton &amp; spent the day at Dixon Dixon's</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1502,"lock":null}
