20:13:21.540 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1557
20:13:21.540 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1557,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind NNS. Walked into Newcastle with D Dixon. Called at the Hope office &amp; came down to Shields by steam. Dined at the George with the Joblings &amp; at the theatre &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1503,"lock":null}
