20:13:21.541 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1558,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Variously employed during the day. Dined with Lockwood at 6 o'clock. Called at Bess's &amp; went to the Ball in the evening. Not numerously attended. Did not get home till 6 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1504,"lock":null}
20:13:21.541 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1559
20:13:21.541 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1559,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Did not get up until 2 o'clock. Dined &amp; went along to the billiard room. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1505,"lock":null}
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1559
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1559,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Did not get up until 2 o'clock. Dined &amp; went along to the billiard room. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1505,"lock":null}
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/156
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":156,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wrote to Mr Digan about the house in Dublin Street that I could give him no decisive answer. Hired a car &amp; drove up the mountain &amp; saw H Fitzmaurice about the bonds, who promised as soon as he could raise money upon his estates to pay them &amp; that on Sunday sennight he would give me some money on account of the interest, perhaps sooner. Returned to Mr Vernon to dinner</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":146,"lock":null}
20:13:21.543 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/156
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":156,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wrote to Mr Digan about the house in Dublin Street that I could give him no decisive answer. Hired a car &amp; drove up the mountain &amp; saw H Fitzmaurice about the bonds, who promised as soon as he could raise money upon his estates to pay them &amp; that on Sunday sennight he would give me some money on account of the interest, perhaps sooner. Returned to Mr Vernon to dinner</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":146,"lock":null}
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1560
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1560,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went up to the new quay with Drury. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Attended the whist club in the evening. Called at Bess's but slept at home.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1506,"lock":null}
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
