20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1560,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went up to the new quay with Drury. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Attended the whist club in the evening. Called at Bess's but slept at home.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1506,"lock":null}
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1561
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1561,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind N by W. Been a great deal of rain in the night. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; with Bess at night. Charlton dined with us</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1507,"lock":null}
20:13:21.544 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
