20:13:21.547 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1567,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. A holyday in the town. Walked to Tynemouth etc. Dined at home. At the billiard room. At night at the Albion &amp; theatre. A very good house</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1511,"lock":null}
20:13:21.547 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1568
20:13:21.547 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1568,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Wind ESE. A good deal of rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to WBS &amp; remitted him two promise notes &pound;142.15.6 &amp; &pound;71.2.2 to take up the Hopes cargo bill of &pound;211.12/-. Gave a draft on Chapmans for the amount of the bills. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; suppered with Lockwood</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1512,"lock":null}
