20:13:21.548 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/157
20:13:21.548 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
