20:13:21.549 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
20:13:21.549 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1570
20:13:21.549 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1570,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost &amp; foggy. Wind SSW but I should think from the e<font color=#BFBFBF>ast</font> of sea. Wrote to Mr Anderson acknowledging the receipt of the &pound;50 bill</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening attended the whist club, With Bess at night who had submitted to be examined by Dr Horsley who pronounced her quite well &amp; therefore I must be free from disease</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1514,"lock":null}
