20:13:21.549 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1571
20:13:21.549 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1571,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Wind from the S &amp; E &amp; hard frost.</p>\r\n<p>Lunched at home. Dined at 6 o'clock with j<font color=#BFBFBF>unio</font>r Redhead at Tynemouth.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>\r\n<p>Paid the &pound;50 bill into my account at Chapmans</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1515,"lock":null}
