20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1584,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly mild fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoat Sands. Dined at home &amp; went to the Whist Club in the evening</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1528,"lock":null}
20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1585
20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1585,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; rather frosty. Wind SW. Started after breakfast with my gun &amp; had a most delightful walk to Hartley by the coast. Jobling met me there in Wards gig. Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Redley dined with us &amp; I drove Bess home at night, leaving Jobbing there. Suppered at Lockwoods.</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1529,"lock":null}
