20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1585,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; rather frosty. Wind SW. Started after breakfast with my gun &amp; had a most delightful walk to Hartley by the coast. Jobling met me there in Wards gig. Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Redley dined with us &amp; I drove Bess home at night, leaving Jobbing there. Suppered at Lockwoods.</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1529,"lock":null}
20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1586
20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1586,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him copies of the rent &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>chapenaus</span> book up to the end of the year. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Lockwood took some dinner with me. Called at Bess &amp; at night attended the Whist Club at H Hurries</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1530,"lock":null}
20:13:21.555 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1586
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1586,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him copies of the rent &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>chapenaus</span> book up to the end of the year. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Lockwood took some dinner with me. Called at Bess &amp; at night attended the Whist Club at H Hurries</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1530,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1587
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1587,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather still continues. Rather frosty with SW wind. Read a letter from WBS. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined at home. H French looked in in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1531,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1587
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1587,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather still continues. Rather frosty with SW wind. Read a letter from WBS. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined at home. H French looked in in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1531,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1588
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1588
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1589
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
20:13:21.556 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1589
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/159
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":159,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet &amp; unpleasant day. Made up Mr Jamesons account by which it appears there is a balance of &pound;50.9.3 due to him. Dined at home Mr O'Connor with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":149,"lock":null}
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/159
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":159,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet &amp; unpleasant day. Made up Mr Jamesons account by which it appears there is a balance of &pound;50.9.3 due to him. Dined at home Mr O'Connor with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":149,"lock":null}
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1590
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
20:13:21.557 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1590
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1591
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1591
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1592
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1592,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frosty with showers of snow. Wind abated &amp; now from N by W &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;6.1. by draft on Chapmans. Dined at home. Took wine with H French &amp; a party at the Albion &amp; went to the Theatre. In the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1536,"lock":null}
20:13:21.558 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1592
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1592,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frosty with showers of snow. Wind abated &amp; now from N by W &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;6.1. by draft on Chapmans. Dined at home. Took wine with H French &amp; a party at the Albion &amp; went to the Theatre. In the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1536,"lock":null}
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1593
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1593,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Received the Hope's average papers from the Hope Club with the statement in very <span class=highlight_yellow>angust</span> one, not having allowed one the caulking to &pound;12.4.10. Dined at home. At Bess in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Whist Club at Mr Fenwicks, North<font color=#BFBFBF>umber</font>l<font color=#BFBFBF>an</font>d Square</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1537,"lock":null}
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1593
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1593,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Received the Hope's average papers from the Hope Club with the statement in very <span class=highlight_yellow>angust</span> one, not having allowed one the caulking to &pound;12.4.10. Dined at home. At Bess in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Whist Club at Mr Fenwicks, North<font color=#BFBFBF>umber</font>l<font color=#BFBFBF>an</font>d Square</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1537,"lock":null}
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1594
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1594,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoat. Mr Evington &amp; Lockwood dined with us and in the evening we went to Bess.</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1538,"lock":null}
20:13:21.559 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1594
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1594,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoat. Mr Evington &amp; Lockwood dined with us and in the evening we went to Bess.</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1538,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1595
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1595,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind WSW. Walked up to Me Edwards dock to see Mr Evington &amp; the Alexander. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with J H Richardson, a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1539,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1595
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1595,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind WSW. Walked up to Me Edwards dock to see Mr Evington &amp; the Alexander. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with J H Richardson, a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1539,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1596
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1596,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wine with Boswell. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; left Jobling &amp; Boswell there. Attended the assembly at the George at night. A very good one. 70 persons there</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1540,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1596
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1596,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wine with Boswell. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; left Jobling &amp; Boswell there. Attended the assembly at the George at night. A very good one. 70 persons there</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1540,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1597
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1597,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind SW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1541,"lock":null}
20:13:21.560 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1597
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1597,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind SW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1541,"lock":null}
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1598
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1598,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind SW. Wrote to the secretary of the Hope Club about the caulking requesting the committee to give it <font color=#BFBFBF>to </font>me. Called at Bess. Attended the whist club &amp; spent the evening at J <span class=highlight_yellow>Tenlies</span></p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1542,"lock":null}
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1598
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1598,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind SW. Wrote to the secretary of the Hope Club about the caulking requesting the committee to give it <font color=#BFBFBF>to </font>me. Called at Bess. Attended the whist club &amp; spent the evening at J <span class=highlight_yellow>Tenlies</span></p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1542,"lock":null}
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1599
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1599,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at W by N. Went by Drew's coach to Newcastle. Attended the Hope Club annual meeting &amp; dined. Returned to Shields at night in a gig with Mr Harrison. At Bess'</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1543,"lock":null}
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.561 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1599
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1599,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at W by N. Went by Drew's coach to Newcastle. Attended the Hope Club annual meeting &amp; dined. Returned to Shields at night in a gig with Mr Harrison. At Bess'</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1543,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/16
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":16,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy unpleasant day &amp; the thaw continuing, excessively wet and sloppy Received a letter from Dixon stating the impossibility of his assisting me (Promises much easier made than kept). Wind W&amp;SW. Sea fallen &amp; ship &amp; sailed</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":13,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/16
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":16,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy unpleasant day &amp; the thaw continuing, excessively wet and sloppy Received a letter from Dixon stating the impossibility of his assisting me (Promises much easier made than kept). Wind W&amp;SW. Sea fallen &amp; ship &amp; sailed</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":13,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/160
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":160,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Settled with Mr Price for the sale of the furniture &amp; after paying his charges &amp; received from him a bill on Mr Conolly for &pound;18.17.6 at 2 Nov, payable at n<sup>o</sup> 1 Upper Orsmond Quay Dublin &amp; &pound;13.5.8 cash for balance. Dined at the Careys. Met Captain DeLacy &amp; Mr Nugent of the 30<sup>th</sup> &amp; went to a pleasant dinner at E Butlins in the evening &amp; kept up until after 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":150,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/160
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":160,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Settled with Mr Price for the sale of the furniture &amp; after paying his charges &amp; received from him a bill on Mr Conolly for &pound;18.17.6 at 2 Nov, payable at n<sup>o</sup> 1 Upper Orsmond Quay Dublin &amp; &pound;13.5.8 cash for balance. Dined at the Careys. Met Captain DeLacy &amp; Mr Nugent of the 30<sup>th</sup> &amp; went to a pleasant dinner at E Butlins in the evening &amp; kept up until after 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":150,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1600
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1600,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind  WSW blowing fresh. Wrote to WBS with a copy of the Harrisons policy got from Mr Car yesterday. Dined at home. Had some punch at the Albion with Richardson, French, Nicholson on Boswell. Called at bess. Spent the evening at the Albion with the above party.</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1544,"lock":null}
20:13:21.562 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
