20:13:21.563 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1603,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with H J Metcalf at 5 o'clock. A fine morning. Wind NW. Walked round by Tynemouth &amp; the fields home. Spent a very pleasant day at Metcalf's</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1547,"lock":null}
20:13:21.563 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1604
20:13:21.563 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1604,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW at the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined at home. At the Billiard room again in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night. The Bachelors Bespeak at the theatre this night but I did not go, not approving of the farce</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1548,"lock":null}
