20:13:21.565 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1605,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a good deal of rain in the night from NW. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening &amp; finished off with H French before he crossed the water for <span class=highlight_yellow>heck</span> at the widows</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1549,"lock":null}
20:13:21.565 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1606
20:13:21.565 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1606,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind NW. Took a long walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoats home by the fields to dinner. Being my birthday, H Hurry &amp; Boswell came in &amp; took wine with me. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1550,"lock":null}
