20:13:21.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":162,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; Mr Digan about the house. Answered this letter. Dined at Mr Coopers. Cooper Hill, met a party. Paid Drs Reed &amp; Stone &pound;5 each for their attendance upon my poor sister</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":152,"lock":null}
20:13:21.571 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
