20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1620,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Rather frosty. Wind WSW. Went over the water, called at Mr H Wright with an average bill for &pound;3.3.8 not at home. Dined at home &amp; at Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1564,"lock":null}
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1621
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1621,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Northumbrian Regimental dinner at the Turf at 6 o'clock. A fine morning. Been a shower of rain. Wind WNW. Went to Newcastle by steam. Dined at 6 o'clock. 23 officers at dinner &amp; strangers. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>B</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eerrall</span> of Broom Park, D Dixon, I Cockson, Pollard, Lambert, Reed &amp; Small. Spent a pleasant day &amp; left the party before 1 o'clock in the morning. Some remained till 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1565,"lock":null}
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1621
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1621,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Northumbrian Regimental dinner at the Turf at 6 o'clock. A fine morning. Been a shower of rain. Wind WNW. Went to Newcastle by steam. Dined at 6 o'clock. 23 officers at dinner &amp; strangers. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>B</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eerrall</span> of Broom Park, D Dixon, I Cockson, Pollard, Lambert, Reed &amp; Small. Spent a pleasant day &amp; left the party before 1 o'clock in the morning. Some remained till 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1565,"lock":null}
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1622
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1622,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp cold unpleasant morning. Wind SE. Slept at D. Dixon's all night. Attended a meeting of the officers to pay the dinner bill &amp; exact fines. Took the steamer at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; returned to Shields at 5 o'clock to dinner. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1566,"lock":null}
20:13:21.572 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1622
20:13:21.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1622,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp cold unpleasant morning. Wind SE. Slept at D. Dixon's all night. Attended a meeting of the officers to pay the dinner bill &amp; exact fines. Took the steamer at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; returned to Shields at 5 o'clock to dinner. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1566,"lock":null}
20:13:21.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1623
20:13:21.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1623,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid a average bill Hope Club of &pound;14.10/- &amp; received one of &pound;3.3.8. I spent the evening with Bess. Jobling &amp; Boswell there</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1567,"lock":null}
20:13:21.573 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1623
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1623,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid a average bill Hope Club of &pound;14.10/- &amp; received one of &pound;3.3.8. I spent the evening with Bess. Jobling &amp; Boswell there</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1567,"lock":null}
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1624
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1624,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind W by S. After breakfast, H Hurry, Boswell &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle, attended the court &amp; heard the trial of the Liberty and <span class=highlight_yellow>plunter</span> when the Club of North Shields got a verdict against the latter. We afterwards dined at the Turf with Mr Richmond &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>witnessed</span>. I slept there all night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1568,"lock":null}
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1624
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1624,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind W by S. After breakfast, H Hurry, Boswell &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle, attended the court &amp; heard the trial of the Liberty and <span class=highlight_yellow>plunter</span> when the Club of North Shields got a verdict against the latter. We afterwards dined at the Turf with Mr Richmond &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>witnessed</span>. I slept there all night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1568,"lock":null}
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1625
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1625,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. After breakfast  went  down to the Towns Court &amp; heard part of the trial in which H Wheatley was <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>defendant &amp; a verdict <font color=#BFBFBF>was </font>given against him. Walked about the town. Dined at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by the &frac12; past 5 o'clock boat. Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1569,"lock":null}
20:13:21.574 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1625
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1625,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. After breakfast  went  down to the Towns Court &amp; heard part of the trial in which H Wheatley was <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>defendant &amp; a verdict <font color=#BFBFBF>was </font>given against him. Walked about the town. Dined at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by the &frac12; past 5 o'clock boat. Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1569,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1626
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1626
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1627
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1627,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind S by E, afterwards SW. Walked to Tynemouth round by Cullercoats, home to dinner at the billiard room in the afternoon. Called on Bess &amp; went to the theatre in the evening. Slept <span class=highlight_yellow>Eastward</span></p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1571,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1627
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1627,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind S by E, afterwards SW. Walked to Tynemouth round by Cullercoats, home to dinner at the billiard room in the afternoon. Called on Bess &amp; went to the theatre in the evening. Slept <span class=highlight_yellow>Eastward</span></p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1571,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1628
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1628,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and blowing fresh from the SW with rain during the day. Dined  at home. Called at Bess' in consequence of what I had heard &amp; the <span class=highlight_yellow>someward</span><span class=highlight_yellow> have </span>of her <span class=highlight_yellow>innacsome</span>. Went to the whist club at Tom Wrights in the evening, Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1572,"lock":null}
20:13:21.575 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
