20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1628,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and blowing fresh from the SW with rain during the day. Dined  at home. Called at Bess' in consequence of what I had heard &amp; the <span class=highlight_yellow>someward</span><span class=highlight_yellow> have </span>of her <span class=highlight_yellow>innacsome</span>. Went to the whist club at Tom Wrights in the evening, Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1572,"lock":null}
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1629
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1629,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N variable during the day, got SW &amp; SSE. Settled at SW blowing a gale with rain. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning. Dined at home. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1573,"lock":null}
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
