20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1629,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N variable during the day, got SW &amp; SSE. Settled at SW blowing a gale with rain. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning. Dined at home. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1573,"lock":null}
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/163
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":163,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather windy. Engaged writing the greater part of the morning. Dined at Mr Stones &amp; met a larger party. Won at whist 18/- wrote to Ryan Parkinson respecting the debt of H Fitzmaurice estate &amp; also a letter to Tom Tinley</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":153,"lock":null}
20:13:21.576 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
