20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":163,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather windy. Engaged writing the greater part of the morning. Dined at Mr Stones &amp; met a larger party. Won at whist 18/- wrote to Ryan Parkinson respecting the debt of H Fitzmaurice estate &amp; also a letter to Tom Tinley</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":153,"lock":null}
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1630
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1630,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind N by W. Dined at home. In the afternoon with Mr Hearson &amp; H Hurry at Harrison. Stopped at the Doctor's &amp; finished off with Bess</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1574,"lock":null}
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1630
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1630,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind N by W. Dined at home. In the afternoon with Mr Hearson &amp; H Hurry at Harrison. Stopped at the Doctor's &amp; finished off with Bess</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1574,"lock":null}
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1631
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1631,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing hard from SW with showers. Very tired &amp; breakfasted in bed. Got up at 1 o'clock. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Went to a dance at Miss N Fenwick. A pleasant evening</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1575,"lock":null}
20:13:21.577 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1631
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1631,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing hard from SW with showers. Very tired &amp; breakfasted in bed. Got up at 1 o'clock. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Went to a dance at Miss N Fenwick. A pleasant evening</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1575,"lock":null}
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1632
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1632,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Got two average bills returned for non-payment. Two on Mr Richmond = &pound;3 &amp; one on Mr Spence Newcastle for &pound;1.4. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. W C Wright came &amp; drank a bottle of wine with me, a bet.  Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1576,"lock":null}
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1632
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1632,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Got two average bills returned for non-payment. Two on Mr Richmond = &pound;3 &amp; one on Mr Spence Newcastle for &pound;1.4. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. W C Wright came &amp; drank a bottle of wine with me, a bet.  Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1576,"lock":null}
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1633
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1633,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather frosty. Wind NW. paid Beal's mother &frac14; years wages &pound;6.8.9. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at town at Harrison's. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1577,"lock":null}
