20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1633,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather frosty. Wind NW. paid Beal's mother &frac14; years wages &pound;6.8.9. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at town at Harrison's. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1577,"lock":null}
