20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1634,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; frosty. Wind NW. Walked round by Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1578,"lock":null}
20:13:21.578 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
