20:13:21.580 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1636,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind WSW. Leadbottom attacked by the cholera. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Doctor Drewry. Leadbottom doing very well in the evening. Slept with Bess.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1580,"lock":null}
20:13:21.580 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1637
20:13:21.580 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1637,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind about S or S by E. Remained with Bess all day. Jobling came to dinner. Got home &amp; went to bed before 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1581,"lock":null}
20:13:21.580 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
