20:13:21.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1638,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. Wind SW. Leadbottom going on favourably, was down stairs last night. Determined not to dine with J Tindley or go to the Ball in consequence of the cholera. Dined at home. At Harrison's after &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1582,"lock":null}
20:13:21.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1639
20:13:21.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1639,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Attended two meetings at the library. One to fix upon a returning officer under the new reform bill, the other to partition the Duke to appoint two resident magistrates. Dined at home. At Harrison's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1583,"lock":null}
20:13:21.581 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
