20:13:21.582 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1641
20:13:21.582 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1641,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind WSW. Dined at home. Went to the theatre in the evening being the last night &amp; Mr Beverley's benefit, a good house. They performed <span class=highlight_yellow>Ma</span><span class=highlight_yellow>sa</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nvill</span><span class=highlight_yellow>'</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span>  uncommonly well &amp; the scenery was beautiful</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1585,"lock":null}
