20:13:21.583 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1643
20:13:21.583 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1643,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, blowing hard from NW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; round by the fields. Lunched at Home with Jobbling. At church in the afternoon. Dined with J Tinley &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1587,"lock":null}
20:13:21.583 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
