20:13:21.584 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1645,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, blowing fresh from the NW. Dined at home. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; in the evening H Hurry &amp; Nicholson went with me to Bess</p>","pageId":992,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1589,"lock":null}
20:13:21.584 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1646
20:13:21.584 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1646,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing hard from the NW &amp; W. Beeing the fast day I went to church twice &amp; heard excellent sermons from the curate &amp; Mr Mark, never saw the  church so full. W C Wright dined with me at 5 o'clock. H Hurry came &amp; took wine with Bess at night</p>","pageId":992,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1590,"lock":null}
20:13:21.584 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
