20:13:21.591 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1659,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind variable. Dined with h Dale &amp; went to the Fancy dress ball in the evening which was well attended. 137 there. A great many excellent characters. Suppered with  Mr Weatherty's</p>","pageId":994,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1603,"lock":null}
20:13:21.591 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
