20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1662
20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1662,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind from the NNE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. On board the Crisis in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night. A thick fog set in</p>","pageId":994,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1606,"lock":null}
