20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1663,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NE. The Hope got into the harbour at 10 o'clock am. Gave &pound;15 draft to Stephenson. Paid into Chapmans the note for &pound;15.10/-. Dined at home. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; at the whist club at H Beeles in the evening.</p>","pageId":994,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1607,"lock":null}
20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1664
20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1664,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Went to church. Saddlers dined with us. H Hurry came in &amp; took wine. At Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":994,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1608,"lock":null}
20:13:21.593 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
