20:13:21.594 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1664,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Went to church. Saddlers dined with us. H Hurry came in &amp; took wine. At Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":994,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1608,"lock":null}
20:13:21.594 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1665
20:13:21.594 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1665,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cool morning. Wind ESE. Got up at 4 o'clock &amp; went by the coach from South Shields to Stockton, got there at &frac12; past 9 o'clock. Walked to Middlesbrough &amp; saw Mr Harris about fixing the Hope. He is to send me a charter. Returned by the 2 o'clock coach &amp; got to North Shields at 8 o'clock. With Bess</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1609,"lock":null}
20:13:21.594 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
