20:13:21.595 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1666,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; cool wind ESE. Dined at home. At Harrisons</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1610,"lock":null}
20:13:21.595 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1667
