20:13:21.597 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1670,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Not quite <span class=highlight_yellow>cold</span>. Wind E. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Spent the afternoon playing at gravitas with Bradshaw, also spent the evening there</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1614,"lock":null}
20:13:21.597 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1671
20:13:21.597 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1671,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NE. Went to church. Dined at home. Went over the bar with H Nicholson who sailed from Copenhagen. At W Lawton's Tynemouth in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1615,"lock":null}
20:13:21.597 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
