20:13:21.598 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1672,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning. Wind NNE. Received a letter from WBS advising me not to accept Birds charter. Wrote to Bird. Dined at home. On board the Choise in the afternoon &amp; had some punch. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1616,"lock":null}
20:13:21.598 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1673
20:13:21.598 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1673,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind from the WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunn's coach but could do nothing for the Hope. Returned by steam. Landed at the point &amp; dined with Sadler. With Bess</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1617,"lock":null}
20:13:21.598 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
