20:13:21.599 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1674,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but blowing very hard from the SSE. Went again to Newcastle but did nothing. Returned by steam. Authorised H Hurry to fix the Hope for Wyburg &amp; Hull at 3.2.6. Dined at home. On board the Choice in the afternoon &amp; with Bess. A large fleet arrived. Rain at night</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1618,"lock":null}
20:13:21.599 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1675
20:13:21.599 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1675,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Rained all night. Wind NW. Dined at home. At Tynemouth in the afternoon. At the Albion &amp; eastward at night. The Choice sailed for Wyburg</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1619,"lock":null}
