20:13:21.599 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1676
20:13:21.599 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1676,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning blowing fresh from the SSW. Brought a bullock for the Hope off J Swan at 46/-. Dined at home. Called &amp; sat with J Richardson in the evening. Afterwards with Bess</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1620,"lock":null}
