20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1678,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring day with a few showers. Wind SW. At church in the morning. Dr Drewry &amp; I walked out to Preston &amp; drank with W C Wright. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":996,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1622,"lock":null}
20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1679
20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1679,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Blowing hard from the SW. Went by steam to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to take coals out to <span class=highlight_yellow>Swinemsend</span> at &pound;6.6 per keel. Returned home to dinner &amp; afterwards went to Tynemouth races which were very bad. Turned out a wet day &amp; spoiled the sport.  At Bess at night</p>","pageId":997,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1623,"lock":null}
20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
