20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":168,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Quite a deluge of rain. Confined to the house all the morning by the wet. Engaged in covrtey for wrote a letter to Mr Buther of Athy. Asking to whom he pays rent for the tanyard. Dined at home with Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":158,"lock":null}
