20:13:21.601 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1680,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NNW. Went to Newcastle and returned home to dinner. Dr Drewry dined with me. Went to races in the afternoon. Pretty good sport for the cup which was won by Holroyd who entertained a large party at Smithson's. Spent a very pleasant evening. A deluge of rain</p>","pageId":997,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1624,"lock":null}
