20:13:21.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1697,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine dry weather. Wind N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1641,"lock":null}
