20:13:21.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1698,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather &amp; blowing hard at about N by W. Sea high. Dined at home. Walked in the afternoon with Charlton &amp; Doctor Drewry to Billy Mill &amp; had wine. Signed a bill to Chapmans for &pound;150. At Bess at night.</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1642,"lock":null}
20:13:21.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1699
20:13:21.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1699,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind still from the N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Took wine &amp; spent the evening at Tibbs. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1643,"lock":null}
20:13:21.610 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1699
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1699,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind still from the N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Took wine &amp; spent the evening at Tibbs. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1643,"lock":null}
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/17
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":17,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>After a blowy and rainy night, on rising this morning, found the snow nearly dissolved. Wind E to ESE &amp; very heavy sea upon the bar, a few ships arrived. Another disappointment! Received a letter from Sir D Smith stating the Dukes inability to comply with my request for a loan. Every person poor when you want assistance! Adversities the time for trying friendship, in prosperity you have professions enough. I've oft been told, but I have now ascertained it's a d-d selfish world we live in; every one for himself. &lsquo;tis almost a crime to be liberal &amp; kind hearted</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":14,"lock":null}
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/17
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":17,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>After a blowy and rainy night, on rising this morning, found the snow nearly dissolved. Wind E to ESE &amp; very heavy sea upon the bar, a few ships arrived. Another disappointment! Received a letter from Sir D Smith stating the Dukes inability to comply with my request for a loan. Every person poor when you want assistance! Adversities the time for trying friendship, in prosperity you have professions enough. I've oft been told, but I have now ascertained it's a d-d selfish world we live in; every one for himself. &lsquo;tis almost a crime to be liberal &amp; kind hearted</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":14,"lock":null}
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/170
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":170,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Left Carlow for Dublin to take over letters of guardianship. A showery day. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":160,"lock":null}
20:13:21.611 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/170
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":170,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Left Carlow for Dublin to take over letters of guardianship. A showery day. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":160,"lock":null}
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1700
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1700,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a cool NNW wind. Afterwards got to NNE. Went to the coach to Newcastle&amp; got settled with the Hope Club <span class=highlight_yellow>and allowing</span> a calking. Called and saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Got home to dinner. With Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Heavy shower of rain &amp; hail</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1644,"lock":null}
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
