20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1701,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning but wind still from the NE. A heavy rain. Dined at the Doctor. Afterwards &amp; in the evening had a crab supper at Mr Harrisons. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1645,"lock":null}
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1702
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1702,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but still cool with a NNE wind. Walked round by the high end of the town to the Doctors garden, there to Tynemouth &amp; home to dinner. At Harrisons in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1646,"lock":null}
20:13:21.612 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
