20:13:21.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1703,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. J Cunningham breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went to Sunderland to look at the Harmony. Returned home to dinner. The Reformers had a procession this evening. Received a letter from WBS. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1647,"lock":null}
20:13:21.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1704
20:13:21.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1704,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; much warmer. Having slept with Bess did not turn out till late. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Harrisons. Walked to <span class=highlight_yellow>Joganodsout</span> in the evening. At the Duke of York &amp; called at Bess</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1648,"lock":null}
20:13:21.613 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
