20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1707,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; warm. The first summers day we have had. Wind SW. Walked from Benton to Billy Mill &amp; dined with Charlton. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1651,"lock":null}
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1708
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1708,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful warm weather. Wind West. Walked to Newcastle. Dined at Harrisons at 3 o'clock. At Bess's at night. Drew &pound;16 of <span class=highlight_yellow>Co &amp; Co to pay Mo</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>y</span></sup><span class=highlight_yellow> Mr B</span></p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1652,"lock":null}
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
