20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1708,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful warm weather. Wind West. Walked to Newcastle. Dined at Harrisons at 3 o'clock. At Bess's at night. Drew &pound;16 of <span class=highlight_yellow>Co &amp; Co to pay Mo</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>y</span></sup><span class=highlight_yellow> Mr B</span></p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1652,"lock":null}
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1709
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1709,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE Walked to Tynemouth with Webb, Captain Potts &amp; his son. Cleaned with and went across the water with him in the evening to his brother and drank tea. Finished off at the George &amp; home</p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1653,"lock":null}
20:13:21.616 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1709
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1709,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE Walked to Tynemouth with Webb, Captain Potts &amp; his son. Cleaned with and went across the water with him in the evening to his brother and drank tea. Finished off at the George &amp; home</p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1653,"lock":null}
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/171
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":171,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The first thing in the morning called upon Mr Carmichael but being engaged made an appointment with for 1 o'clock. Walked down to see the guard returned at the castle. Much to my surprise, met captain <span class=highlight_yellow>flu </span><span class=highlight_yellow>ie</span> Butler. At 1 o'clock saw Mr C<font color=#BFBFBF>armichael</font> &amp; then went to Mr Stocks the Proctor who filled up a form for the children to sign that they are willing. I should administer (in my opinion very inconsistent), sent it off by post to Mr Vernon. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":161,"lock":null}
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/171
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":171,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The first thing in the morning called upon Mr Carmichael but being engaged made an appointment with for 1 o'clock. Walked down to see the guard returned at the castle. Much to my surprise, met captain <span class=highlight_yellow>flu </span><span class=highlight_yellow>ie</span> Butler. At 1 o'clock saw Mr C<font color=#BFBFBF>armichael</font> &amp; then went to Mr Stocks the Proctor who filled up a form for the children to sign that they are willing. I should administer (in my opinion very inconsistent), sent it off by post to Mr Vernon. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":161,"lock":null}
20:13:21.617 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1710
