20:13:21.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1711,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind NNW. Engaged in the house writing. Dined at home. Paid average bills &pound;80.1.10 into chapman's &amp; drew out &pound;10 for self. At Holroyds, Billy Mill in the evening. Came home.</p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1655,"lock":null}
20:13:21.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1712
20:13:21.618 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1712,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNE. Went to Newcastle by steam. Called upon &amp; took Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albriath</font> out to walk. Returned home by steam to dinner at 5 o'clock. Jobling went to Durham. Received a letter from WBS. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1001,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1656,"lock":null}
