20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1729,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind variable. Ceased raining during the day but very dull &amp; close. Woke at 11 o'clock by steam to Newcastle. Walked to the course, better sport than yesterday. Returned in the evening by a gig. At Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1673,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/173
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/173
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1730
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1730
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1731
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1731,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went again to Newcastle by steam. Dined with Mr Dodds &amp; afterwards walked to the course. Poor running. Both cups won easily. The <span class=highlight_yellow>GoO</span> by Mary Cleveland &amp; the silver by Captain Potts. Returned to Mr Dodds &amp; got home by steam at 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1675,"lock":null}
20:13:21.627 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1731
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1731,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went again to Newcastle by steam. Dined with Mr Dodds &amp; afterwards walked to the course. Poor running. Both cups won easily. The <span class=highlight_yellow>GoO</span> by Mary Cleveland &amp; the silver by Captain Potts. Returned to Mr Dodds &amp; got home by steam at 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1675,"lock":null}
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1732
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1732,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy day. Wind SE. A draft on Chapmans for <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr Mid</span> &pound;16 <span class=highlight_yellow>Pduct</span> on Hope's bill for coal freight to <span class=highlight_yellow>Swenmundr</span> &pound;38.11.10 dated 5 June at 60 days.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><font size=2.5pt color=#BFBFBF>Sanderson</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font>Ilderton <font color=#BFBFBF>MP </font>came down. I dined with him at the George &amp; he in this evening, addressed the electors.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1676,"lock":null}
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1732
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1732,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy day. Wind SE. A draft on Chapmans for <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr Mid</span> &pound;16 <span class=highlight_yellow>Pduct</span> on Hope's bill for coal freight to <span class=highlight_yellow>Swenmundr</span> &pound;38.11.10 dated 5 June at 60 days.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><font size=2.5pt color=#BFBFBF>Sanderson</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font>Ilderton <font color=#BFBFBF>MP </font>came down. I dined with him at the George &amp; he in this evening, addressed the electors.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1676,"lock":null}
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1733
20:13:21.628 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1733,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing hard from the SW.  Ilderton came down from Newcastle &amp; we were engaged canvassing all the morning. Dined at the George tavern at 6 o'clock. Ilderton came home with me to sleep</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1677,"lock":null}
