20:13:21.629 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1735,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cloudy. Wind NW. Engaged canvassing the whole of the morning with Ilderton. Dined with him at the George at 6 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Suppered at Barkers.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess</p>","pageId":1005,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1679,"lock":null}
