20:13:21.630 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1736,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Engaged all day in canvassing Tynemouth, Cullercoats etc for Mr Ilderton. Dined at home at 6 o'clock. Spent the evening at Mr Barkers</p>","pageId":1005,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1680,"lock":null}
