20:13:21.637 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1751,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at SW. Took a carriage out to see with Cunningham in the <span class=highlight_yellow>Bomits</span>. Returned at 2 o'clock &amp; had a mutton chop at Harrison's.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Heavy rain</p>","pageId":1007,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1694,"lock":null}
