20:13:21.640 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1759,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing hard from the NNW. Took a long walk round by Tynemouth, Cullercoats, Whatley Park through Tynemouth <font color=#BFBFBF>and </font>home to dinner. At Doctor's &amp; Harrisons in the afternoon. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1702,"lock":null}
20:13:21.640 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1759
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1759,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing hard from the NNW. Took a long walk round by Tynemouth, Cullercoats, Whatley Park through Tynemouth <font color=#BFBFBF>and </font>home to dinner. At Doctor's &amp; Harrisons in the afternoon. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1702,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/176
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":176,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. At the courts in the morning getting petition drawn out. Went to Mr Stocks &amp; signed a bond &amp; to my dismay was told it was also necessary I should also have two friends to give bond, for where am I to find them, being a stranger in Dublin. Paid for Bond stamp 20/- fee to council 21/- &amp; advanced Mr Carmichael &pound;5 Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":166,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/176
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":176,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. At the courts in the morning getting petition drawn out. Went to Mr Stocks &amp; signed a bond &amp; to my dismay was told it was also necessary I should also have two friends to give bond, for where am I to find them, being a stranger in Dublin. Paid for Bond stamp 20/- fee to council 21/- &amp; advanced Mr Carmichael &pound;5 Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":166,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1760
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1760,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine cool morning with a strong wind at NNE &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At Harrison's.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>At the committee rooms in the evening &amp; afterwards at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1703,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1760
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1760,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine cool morning with a strong wind at NNE &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At Harrison's.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>At the committee rooms in the evening &amp; afterwards at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1703,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1761
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1761,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but still blowing fresh from the NNE cold &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Engaged in getting voters to pay <span class=highlight_yellow>fees</span> &amp; taxes.  Captain Webb &amp; Mr Rippon dined with me. At the committee rooms &amp; at night with Bess.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>A letter from Stephenson</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1704,"lock":null}
20:13:21.641 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1761
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1761,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but still blowing fresh from the NNE cold &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Engaged in getting voters to pay <span class=highlight_yellow>fees</span> &amp; taxes.  Captain Webb &amp; Mr Rippon dined with me. At the committee rooms &amp; at night with Bess.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>A letter from Stephenson</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1704,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1762
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1762,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning &amp; NE wind. Received a letter from Harman &amp; Co <span class=highlight_yellow>losed</span><span class=highlight_yellow> one</span> with Stephenson's Wyburg bill for <span class=highlight_yellow>aucblane</span> dated the 30<sup>th</sup> June at 3 months for &pound;51</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At Harrison's in the afternoon. At Bell's committee room in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1705,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1762
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1762,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning &amp; NE wind. Received a letter from Harman &amp; Co <span class=highlight_yellow>losed</span><span class=highlight_yellow> one</span> with Stephenson's Wyburg bill for <span class=highlight_yellow>aucblane</span> dated the 30<sup>th</sup> June at 3 months for &pound;51</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At Harrison's in the afternoon. At Bell's committee room in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1705,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1763
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1763,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cool. Wind NNW. Returned the bill for &pound;51 to Major Harrison&amp; Co. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again all the afternoon &amp; evening with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1706,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1763
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1763,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cool. Wind NNW. Returned the bill for &pound;51 to Major Harrison&amp; Co. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again all the afternoon &amp; evening with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1706,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1764
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1764,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind WNW. Engaged the whole of the day canvassing with Mr Bell. Dined at Mr Robson at High Cheston at 8 o'clock. A rainy night</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1707,"lock":null}
20:13:21.642 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1764
20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1764,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind WNW. Engaged the whole of the day canvassing with Mr Bell. Dined at Mr Robson at High Cheston at 8 o'clock. A rainy night</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1707,"lock":null}
20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1765
20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1765,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Went with a party <span class=highlight_yellow>to</span> McDowarty came to <span class=highlight_yellow>Blg</span> the races. Dined there. Good running. Holroyd won the cup &amp; we brought it home with us &amp; suppered at the Albion &amp; got <span class=highlight_yellow>infernally</span> drunk</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1708,"lock":null}
20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
