20:13:21.643 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1765,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Went with a party <span class=highlight_yellow>to</span> McDowarty came to <span class=highlight_yellow>Blg</span> the races. Dined there. Good running. Holroyd won the cup &amp; we brought it home with us &amp; suppered at the Albion &amp; got <span class=highlight_yellow>infernally</span> drunk</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1708,"lock":null}
