20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1766,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind <del>SSE</del>. With Bess all day</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1709,"lock":null}
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1767
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1767,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SSE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Attended the committee room in the evening</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1710,"lock":null}
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
