20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1767,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SSE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Attended the committee room in the evening</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1710,"lock":null}
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1768
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1768,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind NNE. Robert &amp; BBG set off for Togston. Went to sea with Cunningham. Attended the committee room in the evening &amp; walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1711,"lock":null}
20:13:21.644 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1768
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1768,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind NNE. Robert &amp; BBG set off for Togston. Went to sea with Cunningham. Attended the committee room in the evening &amp; walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1711,"lock":null}
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1769
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1769,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful moon. Wind ENE. Went to sea with a fair brig but as usual we were soon becalmed &amp; brought up off the Castle. Had sport fishing drove into the harbour with the tide &amp; got to our moorings at 4 o'clock. Dined on board. Called at Malthouse. At the committee room</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1712,"lock":null}
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1769
20:13:21.645 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1769,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful moon. Wind ENE. Went to sea with a fair brig but as usual we were soon becalmed &amp; brought up off the Castle. Had sport fishing drove into the harbour with the tide &amp; got to our moorings at 4 o'clock. Dined on board. Called at Malthouse. At the committee room</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1712,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/177
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":177,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summers day &amp; very hot Engaged during the morning at the four-court in preparing petition &amp; in the afternoon went down by steam to Kingston with Mr Gale to show him the yacht &amp; to see J Thompson with whom we dined &amp; returned to Dublin in the evening</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":167,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/177
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":177,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summers day &amp; very hot Engaged during the morning at the four-court in preparing petition &amp; in the afternoon went down by steam to Kingston with Mr Gale to show him the yacht &amp; to see J Thompson with whom we dined &amp; returned to Dublin in the evening</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":167,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1770
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1770,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. Went to church. Dined at home Walked to Tynemouth. At Cunningham's &amp; drank tea</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1713,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1770
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1770,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. Went to church. Dined at home Walked to Tynemouth. At Cunningham's &amp; drank tea</p>","pageId":1009,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1713,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1771
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1771,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind from the E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Bess &amp; Jobling at June Laptons. Walked to Tynemouth gave us the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; night with Bess in the barracks having taken lodgings there for a few days</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1714,"lock":null}
20:13:21.646 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1771
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1771,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind from the E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Bess &amp; Jobling at June Laptons. Walked to Tynemouth gave us the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; night with Bess in the barracks having taken lodgings there for a few days</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1714,"lock":null}
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1772
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1772,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind in the morning SW changing to SE. Went out to sea with a fine breeze which lasted all day. Very poor sport fishing. Got home in the evening &amp; went up to the barracks for the night</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1715,"lock":null}
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1772
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1772,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind in the morning SW changing to SE. Went out to sea with a fine breeze which lasted all day. Very poor sport fishing. Got home in the evening &amp; went up to the barracks for the night</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1715,"lock":null}
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1773
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1773,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SE. Got up &amp; bathed. BBG &amp; Robert returned from Togston last night. <span class=highlight_yellow>Drank with</span> BBG. I went to Newcastle &amp; drank with D Dixon &amp; came home by steam in the evening</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1716,"lock":null}
20:13:21.647 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.648 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1773
20:13:21.648 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1773,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SE. Got up &amp; bathed. BBG &amp; Robert returned from Togston last night. <span class=highlight_yellow>Drank with</span> BBG. I went to Newcastle &amp; drank with D Dixon &amp; came home by steam in the evening</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1716,"lock":null}
