20:13:21.651 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1781,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. The <span class=highlight_yellow>castlerg</span>, Horse &amp; Foot soldiers marched from Newcastle to Cullercoat Sands for exercise &amp; spent the morning in bathing &amp; answering <span class=highlight_yellow>Meenston</span></p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1724,"lock":null}
20:13:21.651 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1782
20:13:21.651 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1782,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather. Wind S by W &amp; SSW. Went out to sea with the intention of going to Seaham, but could not get further than Souter Point. Brought up at Marsden Rock &amp; dined, went onshore &amp; spent two or three hours &amp; got back in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Macherr's</span> &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":1011,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1725,"lock":null}
