20:13:21.653 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1785,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1728,"lock":null}
20:13:21.653 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1786
20:13:21.653 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1786,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Went to sea &amp; had a most delightful run to Seaham. Got our dinner on board &amp; afterwards spent a couple of hours on shore. Started at 4 o'clock &amp; turning quite calm. We did not get home until 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1729,"lock":null}
20:13:21.653 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
