20:13:21.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1787,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Wind ESE. Turned out fine. BBG left us &amp; went by the steamer to Stockton there to take the Majestic for London. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS at Harrisons &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1730,"lock":null}
20:13:21.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1788
20:13:21.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1788,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind N. Received a letter from Mr Garbull with the Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>first</span> account &amp; bill of <span class=highlight_yellow>Wades</span> at 4 months dated the 11<sup>th</sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Jan</span> for &pound;153.6.3 &amp; paid it into Chapmans. Paid Bradshaw's bill for &pound;39.8. Dined at home. At Harrison's with Bess.</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1731,"lock":null}
20:13:21.654 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
