20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1795,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Premium club bill due &pound;9.10.6 paid. A fine morning &amp; fresh breeze at WNW. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth. Cunningham &amp; I called &amp; drank a glass with Captain Mann. With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1738,"lock":null}
20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
