20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1795,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Premium club bill due &pound;9.10.6 paid. A fine morning &amp; fresh breeze at WNW. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth. Cunningham &amp; I called &amp; drank a glass with Captain Mann. With Bess</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1738,"lock":null}
20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1796
20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1796,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind fresh from the Westward. Went over the water &amp; fished for <span class=highlight_yellow>hornests</span> &amp; was successful. Cunningham dined with me &amp; J H Richardson came &amp; took wine of which we had rather too much. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1739,"lock":null}
20:13:21.658 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
