20:13:21.661 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1800,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy cold morning &amp; blowing hard betwenn ENE &amp; ESE. Dined at home. In the afternoon a severe gale &amp; deluge of rain. Confined to the house all the afternoon. Wrote to WBS. Called at Bess in the evening &amp; got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":1014,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1743,"lock":null}
