20:13:21.674 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1828,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":9,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NE. Wrote to BBG. Dined at home. Took wine with A Hurry &amp; Boswell at the Albian. There winners of the St ledger lottery. With Bess</p>","pageId":1018,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1771,"lock":null}
