20:13:21.674 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1829,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":9,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Began a letter to WBS. Paid boys ways. Jobling &amp; Captain &amp;  Ilderson drank with me. Saw the Doctor &amp; went to Bess</p>","pageId":1018,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1772,"lock":null}
20:13:21.674 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/183
20:13:21.674 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":183,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a few light showers of rain. Mr Walker received the L<font color=#BFBFBF>ord</font> Chancellors orders from Mr Carmichael &amp; served Mrs Falkener with a copy &amp; notice. Entered into an agreement with Mr Digan to grant him a lease when legally authorized of the house in Dublin street &amp; gave him possession upon his paying one year's rent in advance reg:&pound;35 less &pound;2 allowed him for the difference in time between the 30<sup>th</sup> May the day the lease is to be taken from to this day. Dined with Dr Reed</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":173,"lock":null}
20:13:21.674 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.675 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/183
20:13:21.675 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":183,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a few light showers of rain. Mr Walker received the L<font color=#BFBFBF>ord</font> Chancellors orders from Mr Carmichael &amp; served Mrs Falkener with a copy &amp; notice. Entered into an agreement with Mr Digan to grant him a lease when legally authorized of the house in Dublin street &amp; gave him possession upon his paying one year's rent in advance reg:&pound;35 less &pound;2 allowed him for the difference in time between the 30<sup>th</sup> May the day the lease is to be taken from to this day. Dined with Dr Reed</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":173,"lock":null}
20:13:21.675 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1830
20:13:21.675 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1830,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather. With rain. Wind SW. Turned out exceedingly hot. With Ilderton &amp; he, the Captain &amp; Jebbs. Dined with me at 2 o'clock. Canvassed again. Walked to Tynemouth. Finished at Barkers. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":1018,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1773,"lock":null}
