20:13:21.678 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1836,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing fresh from the SW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined with Jobling took whiskey with H Hurry &amp; Boswell at Southerns &amp; attended Cobbetts <span class=highlight_yellow>Return</span> at the theatre at night. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1019,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1779,"lock":null}
20:13:21.678 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1837
20:13:21.678 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1837,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Went across the water to look at a fine Danish vessel of 466 tons, the Preciosa. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 4 o'clock at Mr Metcalfs . Received a letter from WBS. The Hope left Petersburg on the 19 Sept</p>","pageId":1019,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1780,"lock":null}
