20:13:21.683 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1847,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind W. After seeing the yeomanry go to church. Left my card upon the Major &amp; sheriff &amp; returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Received a letter from WBS and answered it. Report of the Hope being waterlogged.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1020,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1790,"lock":null}
20:13:21.683 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1848
20:13:21.683 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1848,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>After rain during the night a most beautiful mild morning. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth again round by the sands. At Harrison's * at night with bess</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1791,"lock":null}
