20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1850,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind SW. Went to Newcastle &amp; Took the court Alnwick. Dined at the Mess &amp; spent a pleasant day only about 12 officers present. Got to bed about 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1793,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1851
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1851,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at 12 o'clock. A beautiful day. Dined with W Forster &amp; afterwards attended the Ball in uniform. Then attended the Duke and Duchess there. Went out to Lamington at night. Mr &amp; Mrs &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Thiss</span></p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1794,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
