20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1851,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at 12 o'clock. A beautiful day. Dined with W Forster &amp; afterwards attended the Ball in uniform. Then attended the Duke and Duchess there. Went out to Lamington at night. Mr &amp; Mrs &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Thiss</span></p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1794,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1852
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1852,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather cool. Wind NW went into Alnwick with Mr Ildeston. Returned to dinner. Mr Hodgson MP came to supper</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1795,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1852
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1852,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather cool. Wind NW went into Alnwick with Mr Ildeston. Returned to dinner. Mr Hodgson MP came to supper</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1795,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1853
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1853,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind NW. Mr Hodgson, R Ilderton &amp; young Fenwick walked to Whillingham &amp; went to Roster to shoot. I was out all the morning. Got only two shots &amp; killed nothing.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1796,"lock":null}
20:13:21.685 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1853
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1853,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind NW. Mr Hodgson, R Ilderton &amp; young Fenwick walked to Whillingham &amp; went to Roster to shoot. I was out all the morning. Got only two shots &amp; killed nothing.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1796,"lock":null}
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1854
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1854,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NW. The Fenwick left for Newcastle. The family went to church. I stopped at home.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1797,"lock":null}
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1854
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1854,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NW. The Fenwick left for Newcastle. The family went to church. I stopped at home.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1797,"lock":null}
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1855
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1855,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr Ilderton drove to <span class=highlight_yellow>toroles</span> &amp; left us at Ildeston Cottage. Went out shooting &amp; had very good sport. Dined at the cottage at 5 o'clock. I slept all night in cots</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1798,"lock":null}
20:13:21.686 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1855
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1855,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr Ilderton drove to <span class=highlight_yellow>toroles</span> &amp; left us at Ildeston Cottage. Went out shooting &amp; had very good sport. Dined at the cottage at 5 o'clock. I slept all night in cots</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1798,"lock":null}
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1856
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1856,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went out at 8 o'clock &amp; shot &lsquo;till 2 o'clock &amp; had pretty fair sport. Dined at the cottage. The coach being full, we were obliged to walk, expecting to meet the carriage on the road, but again disappointed. Did not get home until after 7 o'clock quite tired</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1799,"lock":null}
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1856
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1856,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went out at 8 o'clock &amp; shot &lsquo;till 2 o'clock &amp; had pretty fair sport. Dined at the cottage. The coach being full, we were obliged to walk, expecting to meet the carriage on the road, but again disappointed. Did not get home until after 7 o'clock quite tired</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1799,"lock":null}
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1857
20:13:21.687 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1857,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind from the East. Messrs J Friss &amp; Elisabeth &amp; Bob with young Fenwick left us for Newcastle. Dined at 2 o'clock. Ildeston &amp; I spent a quiet afternoon over a bottle of old port &amp; Burgundy</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1800,"lock":null}
