20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1868
20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1868,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day &amp; cold. Drove Fanny &amp; Bell to church. Mr L:ord preached: Mr Forster came from Alnwick &amp; with Mr R Fenwick dined with us</p>","pageId":1023,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1811,"lock":null}
