20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1868,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day &amp; cold. Drove Fanny &amp; Bell to church. Mr L:ord preached: Mr Forster came from Alnwick &amp; with Mr R Fenwick dined with us</p>","pageId":1023,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1811,"lock":null}
20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1869
20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1869,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning could not go out shooting. Will Forster left us. Dined at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening as usual</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1812,"lock":null}
20:13:21.693 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1869
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1869,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning could not go out shooting. Will Forster left us. Dined at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening as usual</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1812,"lock":null}
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/187
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":187,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Called the first thing upon Mr Carmichael. Attended the master at 11 o'clock at the Four Courts. Damm the law say I. My patience is exhausted, got nothing done this day, for want of an affidavit that there were no other next of kin having but Mr Falkener &amp; ourselves. Dined at Mackens. Suppered at the Steades with Ian Gale</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":177,"lock":null}
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/187
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":187,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Called the first thing upon Mr Carmichael. Attended the master at 11 o'clock at the Four Courts. Damm the law say I. My patience is exhausted, got nothing done this day, for want of an affidavit that there were no other next of kin having but Mr Falkener &amp; ourselves. Dined at Mackens. Suppered at the Steades with Ian Gale</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":177,"lock":null}
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1870
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1870,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Weather completely changed. Showers during the day. Went out shooting &amp; killed a 1 &frac12; brace of pheasants. Captain &amp; Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Pensills</span>, Major Clutterbuck &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Tylie</span> dined with us.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1813,"lock":null}
20:13:21.694 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1870
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1870,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Weather completely changed. Showers during the day. Went out shooting &amp; killed a 1 &frac12; brace of pheasants. Captain &amp; Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Pensills</span>, Major Clutterbuck &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Tylie</span> dined with us.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1813,"lock":null}
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1871
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1871,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. The party left us. Went out shooting &amp; killed 2 braces of birds &amp; a hare. Dined at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening as usual</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1814,"lock":null}
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1871
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1871,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. The party left us. Went out shooting &amp; killed 2 braces of birds &amp; a hare. Dined at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening as usual</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1814,"lock":null}
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1872
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1872,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Dined early with the intention of leaving togston by the 3 o'clock coach but did not, the coachman being drunk &amp; an accident having occurred &amp; also being an hour after I <span class=highlight_yellow>one</span>.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1815,"lock":null}
20:13:21.695 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
