20:13:21.696 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1873,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning but afterwards cleared up. Again dined early &amp; left by the coach at 3 o'clock. Arrived at Shields at &frac12; past 9 o'clock. Called &amp; saw Bess. Letters from Stephenson , WBS etc.</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1816,"lock":null}
20:13:21.696 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1874
20:13:21.696 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1874,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SSE blowing hard, increased towards to a heavy gale with rain, moderate about 11 o'clock. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS &amp; Stephenson. With Bess</p>","pageId":1024,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1817,"lock":null}
