20:13:21.698 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1878
20:13:21.698 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1878,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine frosty morning. Wind WSW. Tom Smith left me. Went over the water &amp; got a parcel for the <span class=highlight_yellow>Hg Wright</span> &amp; paid averages Hope Club, Robert &pound;2.7.2 Mr Clay &pound; 7.7.4 = &pound; 14.14.6.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the Bells and Table. With Bess</p>","pageId":1025,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1821,"lock":null}
20:13:21.698 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
