20:13:21.705 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1890,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Received a letter from WBS. The merchant won't pay the freight. Answered it to deliver the <span class=highlight_yellow>thep</span> &amp; send her down.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the Billiard room. Called at Bess. Attended a meeting at Ilderton's commission. At the Theatre</p>","pageId":1027,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1833,"lock":null}
