20:13:21.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":19,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy day blowing hard from the E to E by S &amp; a heavy sea on the bar. Several ships arrived Dined with Mrs Scott</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":16,"lock":null}
20:13:21.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/190
20:13:21.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":190,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceptionally hot day. Attended the Master again for him to look over draft of report, when he thought it would be better to appoint me sole guardian. I cannot make up mind to take in so much trouble difficulties &amp; anxiety that I feel very unhappy. Cannot stand it much longer. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":701,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":180,"lock":null}
20:13:21.709 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
