20:13:21.710 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1900,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. At the committee room.</p>\r\n<p>Mr Young came into the town in procession which was very poor.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Tibbs with me at the committee room &amp; whist club in the evening. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":1028,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1843,"lock":null}
