20:13:21.711 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1901,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WSW. Attended the committee room. Walked to Cullercoats to canvass there. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening. At night with Bess</p>","pageId":1028,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1844,"lock":null}
