20:13:21.713 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1908
20:13:21.713 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1908,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Polling began at 8 o'clock. Young still kept the lead, our voters not daring to come up intimidated by the threats of the Young party. At the close Young won by.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1851,"lock":null}
