20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1909
20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1909,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went to the hustings at 10 o'clock. Mr Young declared elected. A deal of speaking sparking &amp; angry feeling displayed. Both Young &amp; Ilderton charged slight row.</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1852,"lock":null}
20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
