20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1909,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went to the hustings at 10 o'clock. Mr Young declared elected. A deal of speaking sparking &amp; angry feeling displayed. Both Young &amp; Ilderton charged slight row.</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1852,"lock":null}
20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/191
20:13:21.714 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":191,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another hot summers day. Called at Mr Carmichael's &amp; from the difficult situation in which I am placed, determined upon asking my brother to come to Ireland &amp; going to Carlow tomorrow there to remain until I either see him or have a letter from him in answer to one I wrote this day. Wrote also to Mrs Scott. Dined at Mackens &amp; went to the Lying In Hospital Gardens where there was an immense assembly of company</p>","pageId":701,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":181,"lock":null}
