20:13:21.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1926
20:13:21.722 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1926,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<div class=\"highlights-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n\t<h2>Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1834.html#1834-05-30\">\r\n\t<p>1834-05-30 JRS sold the Hope to Mr Watson for £1005</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1834.html#1834-07-23\">\r\n\t<p>1834-07-23 George Richardson punches H Hurry in the eye!</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1834.html#1834-08-04\">\r\n\t<p>1834-08-04 Bess got the Cholera and dangerously ill</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1834.html#1834-10-12\">\r\n\t<p>1834-10-12 JSR very unwell. Confined for a week</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1834.html#1834-10-12\">\r\n\t<p>1834-10-22 JSR still unwell. Leeches applied</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
