20:13:21.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1934,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Charlton's gig came for me at &frac12; past 8 o'clock. Called at Howdon for him &amp; drove to Burnhopeside to dinner &amp; Charlton left afterwards for Dipton, Mr Fenwick</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1875,"lock":null}
