20:13:21.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1934,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Charlton's gig came for me at &frac12; past 8 o'clock. Called at Howdon for him &amp; drove to Burnhopeside to dinner &amp; Charlton left afterwards for Dipton, Mr Fenwick</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1875,"lock":null}
20:13:21.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1935
20:13:21.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1935,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy morning &amp; continued all day. Wind from the East. Messrs Richmond went to a ball at Lanchester in the evening &amp; I stopped at home with Kit</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1876,"lock":null}
20:13:21.726 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
