20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1935,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy morning &amp; continued all day. Wind from the East. Messrs Richmond went to a ball at Lanchester in the evening &amp; I stopped at home with Kit</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1876,"lock":null}
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1936
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1936,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An incessant rain since yesterday morning &amp; still continues. Wind from the South &amp; East. Left Richmond's after breakfast in his gig for Denton where I dined &amp; then Charlton drove me to Newcastle &amp; we took the <span class=highlight_yellow>omnibus</span> for Shields. At the club. Rope received from Mr Paxton for WBS &pound;30 &amp; gave it to me</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1877,"lock":null}
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1936
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1936,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An incessant rain since yesterday morning &amp; still continues. Wind from the South &amp; East. Left Richmond's after breakfast in his gig for Denton where I dined &amp; then Charlton drove me to Newcastle &amp; we took the <span class=highlight_yellow>omnibus</span> for Shields. At the club. Rope received from Mr Paxton for WBS &pound;30 &amp; gave it to me</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1877,"lock":null}
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1937
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1937,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of heavy rain. Wind SE. H Hurry dined with me. At the billiard room. Tea at H Hurry's. Went to the theatre</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1878,"lock":null}
20:13:21.727 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
