20:13:21.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1937,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of heavy rain. Wind SE. H Hurry dined with me. At the billiard room. Tea at H Hurry's. Went to the theatre</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1878,"lock":null}
20:13:21.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1938
20:13:21.728 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1938,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Went by omnibus to Newcastle. A dull morning. Wind SSE. Took an early dinner at Dixon's. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> at Togston. At the club in the evening. E Charlton stopped all night.</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1879,"lock":null}
