20:13:21.729 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1941
20:13:21.729 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1941,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very dull morning. Looks like more rain. Wind SSW. Walked up to Jarrow with Lowery Richardson &amp; Hurry to see the <span class=highlight_yellow>Hasoey</span>. Dined there &amp; returned to the Albion in the evening where we made a finish.</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1882,"lock":null}
