20:13:21.750 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1986
20:13:21.750 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1986,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. At the ship. Paid several tradesmen's bills. Walked to Tynemouth. The doctor took his dinner with me. At the Pig. Spent the evening with Bess. Hove the ballast clear of the timbers that they <span class=highlight_yellow>flogin</span> may been seen.</p>","pageId":1070,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1927,"lock":null}
20:13:21.750 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
