20:13:21.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1998
20:13:21.756 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1998,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild spring weather. Rather damp. Wind NW. Dined at 5 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. Went to dance &amp; supper at Captain Potts, Wallsend, a large party. Spent a very pleasant night. A splendid supper, stopped rather too late, not getting <font color=#BFBFBF>home </font>before 8 o'clock</p>","pageId":1072,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1939,"lock":null}
