20:13:21.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":200,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, Received a letter from William from Shields. Refusing to come over &amp; assist me out of my difficulties. Much disappointed, determined upon leaving Carlow on Thursday &amp; wrote to Captain Butler to send Emma to me.</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":190,"lock":null}
20:13:21.758 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2000
