20:13:21.760 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2004,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Watson. Did not make a bargain. Determined to lay the ship on shore off the taking her ballast out. Lunched with H Hurry. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Hy</span> Metcalfe &amp; went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>play</span> in the evening. A very good one about  80 people there</p>","pageId":1072,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1945,"lock":null}
