20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/201
20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":201,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Bathed before breakfast with the boys. Saw Mr Justin to inform him of my intention to endeavor to manage the property etc. without interference of chancery. Wrote to William of my determination to return to England. Turned out a very wet day Dined with Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":191,"lock":null}
20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
