20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":201,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Bathed before breakfast with the boys. Saw Mr Justin to inform him of my intention to endeavor to manage the property etc. without interference of chancery. Wrote to William of my determination to return to England. Turned out a very wet day Dined with Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":191,"lock":null}
20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2010
20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2010,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to the ship, parted her from the crake &amp; laid her upon the shore. Walked to the barracks. Dined at home. At 5 o'clock. Met <span class=highlight_yellow>Jare</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Younry</span></p>","pageId":1073,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1951,"lock":null}
