20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2010,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to the ship, parted her from the crake &amp; laid her upon the shore. Walked to the barracks. Dined at home. At 5 o'clock. Met <span class=highlight_yellow>Jare</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Younry</span></p>","pageId":1073,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1951,"lock":null}
20:13:21.763 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2011
