20:13:21.764 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2013
20:13:21.764 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2013,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Saw Mrs Watson who refused to confirm her agreement for the Hope &amp; wished to reduce my price to &pound;1000 which I refused to do. The <span class=highlight_yellow>br</span> drove me round by Whitley, Hartley<span class=highlight_yellow>, the </span><span class=highlight_yellow>avenue head</span> to Preston to dine with W C Wright. Came to the club in the evening</p>","pageId":1073,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1954,"lock":null}
