20:13:21.767 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2018,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and cold NE wind. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; lunched with Downey, a very handsome turn out at Southerns. Bad racing. A good many people there. Finished off at Southerns. A rainy night</p>","pageId":1074,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1959,"lock":null}
