20:13:21.785 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2055,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Mr Ilderton &amp; party drove down over to the Game Keepers cottage at Ilderton. Bob Mark &amp; I amused ourselves fishing in the <span class=highlight_yellow>Jilf</span>. Dined at the cottage &amp; returned to Lamington in the evening</p>","pageId":1077,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1996,"lock":null}
20:13:21.785 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2056
