20:13:21.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2059
20:13:21.786 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2059,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went to Alnwick being Fair day. A good show of women if not of other cattle. Got home to dinner at 6 o'clock. Shot rooks in the evening</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2000,"lock":null}
