20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2062,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton drove us over to Ilderton. They stopped to attend Mr Howey's sale. Robert &amp; I went on in the carriage to Benton beyond Wooler. I walked from there to West Newton &amp; fished down the Glen, beautiful stream but had poor sport, being a bright day &amp; water fine. Suppered at Benton &amp; went by coach at &frac12; past 11 o'clock to the GameKeepers Cottage at Ildeston to sleep. Excessively fatigued</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2002,"lock":null}
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2063
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2063,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Took the coach to Whittingham &amp; walked from thence to Lemmington. Dined with Mr Bussett at Broom park at 5 o'clock. Met the Smiths from Togston. Messrs Clatterbuck, the Morses etc</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2003,"lock":null}
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2063
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2063,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Took the coach to Whittingham &amp; walked from thence to Lemmington. Dined with Mr Bussett at Broom park at 5 o'clock. Met the Smiths from Togston. Messrs Clatterbuck, the Morses etc</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2003,"lock":null}
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2064
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2064,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful morning. Amused ourselves shooting rooks. After lunch Bob Ilderton rode to Alnwick. Heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in the afternoon</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2004,"lock":null}
20:13:21.789 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2064
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2064,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful morning. Amused ourselves shooting rooks. After lunch Bob Ilderton rode to Alnwick. Heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in the afternoon</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2004,"lock":null}
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2065
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2065
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2066
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
20:13:21.790 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2066
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2067
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2067
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2068
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2068
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2069
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
20:13:21.791 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2069
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/207
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":207,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It began very early in the morning to rain &amp; blow hard &amp; it increased to a heavy gale. Nearly all on board sick. Obliged about 12 o'clock to lay to not being able to see land or make the floating light. The weather so thick. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock made the light &amp; got into Liverpool at 3 o'clock after a very stormy passage across of 20 hours and landed very wet. Got Emma to bed, much exhausted from the fatigues &amp; sickness. We stopped at the Angel Inn</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":197,"lock":null}
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/207
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":207,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It began very early in the morning to rain &amp; blow hard &amp; it increased to a heavy gale. Nearly all on board sick. Obliged about 12 o'clock to lay to not being able to see land or make the floating light. The weather so thick. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock made the light &amp; got into Liverpool at 3 o'clock after a very stormy passage across of 20 hours and landed very wet. Got Emma to bed, much exhausted from the fatigues &amp; sickness. We stopped at the Angel Inn</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":197,"lock":null}
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2070
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2070,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather &amp; wind SE. Received a letter from WBS. Answered it with the Kent &amp; Gth account &amp; informing him of the the sale of the Hope. R Ilderton came down &amp; we &amp; H Hurry dined with Mr Tibbs</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2010,"lock":null}
20:13:21.792 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
