20:13:21.793 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2071,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Rob Ilderton left for Newcastle. Dined with Messrs Dobson, Richard, Richardson, Lowing &amp; Hurry at the Albion. An excellent dinner. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2011,"lock":null}
20:13:21.793 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2072
20:13:21.793 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2072,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The glass continues very high, at set fair &amp; fine weather. Wind NE. Mr Young gone from home, consequently his bill not paid. Went to Newcastle by steam. Paid Augur for cleaning carriage 18/-. Dined with Dr Fenwick &amp; returned in the evening. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2012,"lock":null}
