20:13:21.794 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2073,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather, fresh breeze at NE &amp; sea high &amp; rather cool. H Hurry &amp; I walked round by Preston. Dined with him &amp; spent the evening at Tynemouth, the Barracks &amp; the Abbey</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2013,"lock":null}
