20:13:21.794 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2074,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with S H Richardson at 4 o'clock &amp; spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2014,"lock":null}
20:13:21.794 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
