20:13:21.796 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2078,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NE. Met Mr Watson &amp; received &pound;1005 &amp; gave him possession of the Hope. Dined on board the Choise. At Tynemouth. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2018,"lock":null}
20:13:21.796 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2079
20:13:21.796 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2079,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Started for Alnwick. Got there at &frac12; after 2 o'clock &amp; went out to Lemmington with the Ilderton's to dinner</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2019,"lock":null}
20:13:21.796 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
