20:13:21.797 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2080,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind as well as I can judge from the S &amp; W. the family did not attend morning service, it being at Bolton where they have no pew. They went in the afternoon. I did not.</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2020,"lock":null}
20:13:21.797 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2081
20:13:21.797 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2081,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Extraordinarily fine weather. At home all day. Robert &amp; I went out fishing, had poor sport.</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2021,"lock":null}
20:13:21.797 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
