20:13:21.801 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/209
20:13:21.801 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":209,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather  cloudy in the morning, but turned out a fine day. Left Leeds at 6 o'clock for Shields where we arrived at 8 o'clock &amp; got home at 9 o'clock. Poor Emma tormented by the eruption. Dr Grunhow saw her &amp; sent some physic. Mrs Scott from home at Togston. Got some tea &amp; went to bed early</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":199,"lock":null}
