20:13:21.811 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2110,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NE. H Hurry &amp; I went with the doctor &amp; spent the day at sea. Landed at Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2050,"lock":null}
