20:13:21.811 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2110,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NE. H Hurry &amp; I went with the doctor &amp; spent the day at sea. Landed at Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2050,"lock":null}
20:13:21.811 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2111
20:13:21.811 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2111,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Received a letter from WBS which much relieved my mind &amp; made me feel happier than I have done some time, stating the almost certainty of his getting appointed to a situation on the Coal Exchange by the Factors &amp; also giving me leave to <span class=highlight_yellow>dras</span> upon him for the Hope's tradesmen's bills. H Hurry dined with me. At Tynemouth. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1083,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2051,"lock":null}
20:13:21.811 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
