20:13:21.822 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2132
20:13:21.822 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2132,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNE. In the court all the morning. Dined at home. That low scoundrel Geo<font color=#BFBFBF>rge</font> Richmond made a most brutal attack on H Hurry &amp; hit him a tremendous blow on the left eye, but they punished him for it. At Hurry's in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":1085,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2072,"lock":null}
