20:13:21.826 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/214
20:13:21.826 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":214,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from Fanny Smith to take Emma to Togstow which I'm not able to do expecting the Hope. Went to church in the morning. I dined with H Harry, walked to Tynemouth in the evening &amp; on our return found Geo &amp; his wife had arrived. Wrote to Fanny Smith</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":204,"lock":null}
