20:13:21.828 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2144,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind WNW. Charlton &amp; H Hurry went over with me to Sunderland &amp; dined with R Jobling on board his new ship the Duchess of Northumberland 550 tons, bound to New South Wales</p>","pageId":1087,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2084,"lock":null}
