20:13:21.829 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2145,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. the Doctor drove me to Carville Preston etc. dined with him. Saw Mr Platts &amp; agreed to give him a bill at 2 months. At the Golden Fleece. Drank tea with C Cockrill. Called with H Hurry at Mr Websters &amp; the Albion</p>","pageId":1087,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2085,"lock":null}
