20:13:21.829 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2146,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Paid the Harmonies bill into Cr &amp; Co &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with H Hurry &amp; C Cockrill. Spent the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":1087,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2086,"lock":null}
20:13:21.829 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2147
