20:13:21.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":218,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Walked to Tynemouth in the morning &amp; evening. Dined with Mrs Tenley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":208,"lock":null}
20:13:21.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2180
20:13:21.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2180,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been heavy showers during the night &amp; every appearance of more. Wind NE. Sat in the house till 12 o'clock. Dined at 3 o'clock with J Harrison at a house warming he gave at the &quot;King Well&quot;. <span class=highlight_yellow>Stephenson Street</span> a large party &amp; finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2120,"lock":null}
20:13:21.847 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
