20:13:21.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2181
20:13:21.848 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2181,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. Went over the water, being the opening of the Stanhope railroad. When the commissioned loading a ship for the first time &amp; with a new coal from ____. H Hurry dined with me. Rained in torrents the whole of the afternoon &amp; evening. At the Albion</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2121,"lock":null}
