20:13:21.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2182,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW. Walked to Tynemouth. J H Richardson &amp; I dined with H Hurry. At the Albian</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2122,"lock":null}
20:13:21.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2183
20:13:21.849 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2183,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; blowing hard NE. Received a letter from Mr Apedaile begging money <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp; </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Merro</span>. Done too much for them already, been ruined by my actions. Dined at house. Went in the evening to Billy Purvis' theatre. The bespeak of the Tynemouth Bachelors &amp; a good house. At Southerns</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2123,"lock":null}
