20:13:21.875 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2238,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Tynemouth. At Chapmans. Got in bills for &pound;50 on WBS <span class=highlight_yellow>merchant</span> &amp; returned to him. Dined with J Tinley &amp; accompanied him &amp; party to the amateur concert in the evening, which went of successfully well &amp; was crowded being 360 there. Suppered at <span class=highlight_yellow>Tim </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ligs</span> afterwards</p>","pageId":1095,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2178,"lock":null}
