20:13:21.878 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2244
20:13:21.878 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2244,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with cold SE wind. Went with Tom Smith to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked from there to Benton, dined &amp; stayed all night with D Dixon. Received a letter from WBS to send him &pound;60</p>","pageId":1095,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2184,"lock":null}
