20:13:21.879 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2245,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold morning with a little snow. Wind NW. Walked from Benton to Shields. Dined with H Hurry. Attended the weekly amateur practice. A bad account received today from Lloyds of Fallon being washed ashore on the coast of Jutland supposed to be the</p>","pageId":1095,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2185,"lock":null}
