20:13:21.879 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2246,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, rather frosty. Wind NW. Walked out to Tynemouth &amp; saw the hounds. Dined at home. Took wine with h Hurry &amp; spent the evening at JH Richardson who had the Albion Whist Club &amp; supper. Met Bess</p>","pageId":1095,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2186,"lock":null}
