20:13:21.888 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2266
20:13:21.888 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2266,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW. Dined with h Hurry again to help him away with the cold beef. JH Richardson there. Went to Mr Jewson's concert in the evening, which was very well attended &amp; performance good. Suppered with J Jury</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2206,"lock":null}
