20:13:21.889 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2267,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Cherlton &amp; I dined together at the Northumberland Arms at 2 o'clock. At home in the evening</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2207,"lock":null}
