20:13:21.889 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2268,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Extraordinary weather. Mild as a May day. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. H Hurry &amp; J Cunningham dined with me. At the Albion. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Tygack</span> &amp; Dobson an order on WBS for &pound;15.3/- for the Hope</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2208,"lock":null}
20:13:21.889 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2269
20:13:21.889 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2269,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. Wind varying between ENE &amp; SE. Changed on the afternoon to SW. Dined with JW Lowery at Cheston <span class=highlight_yellow>Fields</span> with JH Richardson</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2209,"lock":null}
20:13:21.889 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
