20:13:21.890 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2269,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. Wind varying between ENE &amp; SE. Changed on the afternoon to SW. Dined with JW Lowery at Cheston <span class=highlight_yellow>Fields</span> with JH Richardson</p>","pageId":1096,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2209,"lock":null}
20:13:21.890 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/227
20:13:21.890 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":227,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Cloudy with wind SW Several ships got to sea in the morning. In the afternoon a few light ships got down after a 12 days passage amongst them the Hope, went on board at &frac12; past 4 o'clock, when off the Black Middens &amp; got her papers. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed her for Carr's Walls before 6 o'clock either on my own account or 10/- freight, optimal to give an answer tomorrow.</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":216,"lock":null}
