20:13:21.893 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2276,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind N by W &amp; NNE &amp; so continued during the day with an unpleasant damp mist. I dined with H Hurry. At Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":1097,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2216,"lock":null}
20:13:21.893 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
