20:13:21.894 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2279
20:13:21.894 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2279,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Gale of wind NNE. Sea high. Continued blowing hard all day. With rain. Dined at home. At H Hurry's in the evening</p>","pageId":1097,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2219,"lock":null}
