20:13:21.895 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":228,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold cloudy morning. Wind about NNW. Went to Newcastle &amp; agreed to take 10/- freight. It turned out a very wet day. Dined with J Tinley. Ship went to the spout. Gave Stephenson &pound;40</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":217,"lock":null}
