20:13:21.896 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2280,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fairer weather again. Wind NE &amp; sea much fallen. Wrote to WBS yesterday with Rent account. Turned out a rainy day. JH Richardson, Cockrill &amp; H Hurry dined with me at the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":1097,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2220,"lock":null}
