20:13:21.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2288
20:13:21.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2288,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind about West. Went <span class=highlight_yellow>yub</span> accompanied by Dicks shooting but had poor sport, the birds wild, killed a hare &amp; one bird. Mr &amp; Mrs Atkinson &amp; Mr Berley dined with us</p>","pageId":1097,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2228,"lock":null}
20:13:21.899 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
