20:13:21.902 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2296,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful day. Very hard frost. Wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 4 o'clock and remained in the house</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2236,"lock":null}
