20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2297,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Hard frost. Wind WNW. Had a 2 o'clock dinner with H Hurry &amp; went to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Spent the evening at Southerns</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2237,"lock":null}
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2298
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2298,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. <span class=highlight_yellow>Six</span> Charles Grey came to the George having offered himself for the borough. His Addressed the election in a beautiful &amp; eloquent speech &amp; declined coming forward this, but explained his determination to do so the next election. Dined at the George with his committee &amp; spent a pleasant day. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> Liver Kill</span> too unwell to attend</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2238,"lock":null}
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2298
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2298,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. <span class=highlight_yellow>Six</span> Charles Grey came to the George having offered himself for the borough. His Addressed the election in a beautiful &amp; eloquent speech &amp; declined coming forward this, but explained his determination to do so the next election. Dined at the George with his committee &amp; spent a pleasant day. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> Liver Kill</span> too unwell to attend</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2238,"lock":null}
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2299
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2299,"version":14,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out at 3 o'clock. A dismal &amp; wet morning, blowing hard from the east. Had not light enough to get us underway until about 4 o'clock, when the whole fleet were in motion, fortunately, at last with a fair wind. Being excessively wet &amp; unpleasant I got into bed again &amp; lay till &frac12; past 10 o'clock &amp; then found the ship off Leigh above Southend &amp; still raining hard. Brought up off Greenwich at &frac12; past 3 &amp; o'clock landed with ...</p>","pageId":705,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2239,"lock":null}
20:13:21.903 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2299
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2299,"version":14,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out at 3 o'clock. A dismal &amp; wet morning, blowing hard from the east. Had not light enough to get us underway until about 4 o'clock, when the whole fleet were in motion, fortunately, at last with a fair wind. Being excessively wet &amp; unpleasant I got into bed again &amp; lay till &frac12; past 10 o'clock &amp; then found the ship off Leigh above Southend &amp; still raining hard. Brought up off Greenwich at &frac12; past 3 &amp; o'clock landed with ...</p>","pageId":705,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2239,"lock":null}
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/23
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":23,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning. On going out, found the harbour in dreadful state of confusion &amp; much damage done in consequence of the immense land floods driving the ships adrift. Rode to Newcastle with J Tinley, saw W Chapman. He offered to take my bill at 6 months with another approved name to it, for 1000 or 1200. Refused &amp; dined with J Tinley. Wrote to William. Wind SW. Many ships got to sea.</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":20,"lock":null}
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/23
20:13:21.904 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":23,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning. On going out, found the harbour in dreadful state of confusion &amp; much damage done in consequence of the immense land floods driving the ships adrift. Rode to Newcastle with J Tinley, saw W Chapman. He offered to take my bill at 6 months with another approved name to it, for 1000 or 1200. Refused &amp; dined with J Tinley. Wrote to William. Wind SW. Many ships got to sea.</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":20,"lock":null}
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/230
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":230,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at 4 o'clock this morning Went to the spout. Brought a lot of beef on my way up at 40/- Returned to breakfast &amp; went by steam to Newcastle where I learned  that the act gave them the power of loading any ship under 6 keels before larger vessels. Dined with J Tinley. Mrs Scott got from Toyston</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":219,"lock":null}
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/230
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":230,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at 4 o'clock this morning Went to the spout. Brought a lot of beef on my way up at 40/- Returned to breakfast &amp; went by steam to Newcastle where I learned  that the act gave them the power of loading any ship under 6 keels before larger vessels. Dined with J Tinley. Mrs Scott got from Toyston</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":219,"lock":null}
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2300
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2300,"version":8,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p><span class=highlight_yellow>Called</span> upon Chapmans for &pound;10 for self &amp; gave Stephenson a draft for &pound;26.18.5 being the balance of his account for the last voyage. Paid into Chapmans WBS balance not foe &pound;30.5/-. Paid entrance &amp; expenses up to the end of the year to the whist club &pound;1.13/-</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2240,"lock":null}
20:13:21.905 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
