20:13:21.918 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2326,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":14,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Rather showery. Called at the New Inn. Put my <font color=#222222>portmanteau</font>  &amp; bag into a cab &amp; drove up to Nottingham Place. Spent the evening quietly at home.</p>","pageId":774,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2266,"lock":null}
20:13:21.918 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2327
20:13:21.918 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2327,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... Peggy laying at the wharf at Purfleet. Young White of Wordland near Durham, a 4<sup>th</sup> mate in the company's service also joined us. Blew a cloud or two &amp; turned in.</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2267,"lock":null}
