20:13:21.919 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":233,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2852-image-hope-voyage.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n  <figcaption>The first voyage of 'Hope'</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:21.919 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
