20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":270,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind ESE blowing fresh. Took a walk after breakfast with Captain Lewis &amp; Marsh across the <span class=highlight_yellow>Daffers</span> to the wood from which is a very beautiful  view. Played a few games at billiards with the Captain. Spent the evening as usual at Navarinos</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":254,"lock":null}
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/271
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":271,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning, after heavy showers in the night. With a change of wind to SW a slight shower or two during the morning. The Valorous frigate arrived from the West Indies at Spithead after four years absence. Twice on the pier the only walk today. At Navarinos.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":255,"lock":null}
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
