20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":271,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning, after heavy showers in the night. With a change of wind to SW a slight shower or two during the morning. The Valorous frigate arrived from the West Indies at Spithead after four years absence. Twice on the pier the only walk today. At Navarinos.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":255,"lock":null}
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/272
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":272,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet day. Wind E in the morning &amp; afterwards changed to SW blowing fresh. Walked about the town and pier.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":256,"lock":null}
20:13:21.936 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
