20:13:21.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":274,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning &amp; blowing hard from the SE. Walked into town after breakfast &amp; played at billiards in the afternoon. Turned out fine. Attended the theatre. Mrs Hugh Barclays bespeak, a fair house.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":258,"lock":null}
20:13:21.938 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/275
