20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":304,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind about WNW. Went to Newcastle &amp; saw the Dixons, Smith of Joyston &amp; returned with J Tinley to dinner. Wrote to William of the sailing of the Hope. A few ships got to sea.</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":288,"lock":null}
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/305
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":305,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine &amp; extremely mild day. Wind W by S. At church morning &amp; afternoon. Dined with Mrs Scott. Went in the evening to the Quakers meeting to hear a woman preach; a tolerable discourse.</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":289,"lock":null}
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
