20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":305,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine &amp; extremely mild day. Wind W by S. At church morning &amp; afternoon. Dined with Mrs Scott. Went in the evening to the Quakers meeting to hear a woman preach; a tolerable discourse.</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":289,"lock":null}
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/306
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":306,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant and warm morning. Wind WNW. Went over the water to see Bowlby respecting the money he was to endeavor to get for C Harry from P Laing not received. Dined with Mrs Scott. Wrote to William about a Scotch coal freight for J Fenwith's Fidelity. At a party in the evening at Mrs Mathews. Wind changed in the afternoon to NE</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":290,"lock":null}
20:13:21.952 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
