20:13:21.953 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":307,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine day. Wind NNW. Engaged the whole of the day writing in the office. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening writing.</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":291,"lock":null}
20:13:21.953 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/308
20:13:21.953 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":308,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind NW. Called to see Mrs Ferguson's paintings. Prepared for going to Togston. Dined at home</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":292,"lock":null}
