20:13:21.953 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/309
20:13:21.953 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":309,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind NW. A little swell upon the bar. A few small ships got to sea. Played billiards most of the morning. Dined with Mrs Scott. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":293,"lock":null}
