20:13:21.958 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":320,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SE. At church in the morning. Called upon Mrs Cluttesbuck. Mrs &amp; Miss Watson &amp; Mr Bruce. Returned to Toyston to dinner.</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":303,"lock":null}
