20:13:21.959 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":321,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SE. Out shooting &amp; killed a pheasant &amp; leveret &amp; lost 1 &frac12; of birds. Tom Smith left us early this morning for Newcastle fair. Sent a letter by him to <span class=highlight_yellow>Rev</span> Snowdon</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":304,"lock":null}
