20:13:21.959 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":322,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant autumnal day. Wind ESE. Out shooting. Birds wild. Killed nothing</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":305,"lock":null}
20:13:21.959 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/323
20:13:21.959 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":323,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. More like spring than autumn. Out for two hours shooting. Very hot. Birds exceedingly wild. Killed nothing. Tom got home in the evening</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":306,"lock":null}
20:13:21.959 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
