20:13:21.960 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":323,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. More like spring than autumn. Out for two hours shooting. Very hot. Birds exceedingly wild. Killed nothing. Tom got home in the evening</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":306,"lock":null}
20:13:21.960 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/324
20:13:21.960 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":324,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind north &amp; rather cool. Mrs Dixon, F Smith &amp; F Brown drove down from Brinkburns. After lunch Mrs Dixon &amp; F Brown returned. Received a letter from Mr Vernon &amp; the boys</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":307,"lock":null}
20:13:21.960 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
