20:13:21.963 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":330,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 6 o'clock am. A fine morning. Wind at SE. Breakfasted &amp; rode to Morepeth with Tom Smith, market &amp; fair day there. Left Morpeth by the Shields coach &amp; got home at 4 o'clock. To dinner. Mrs Scott very well. The Hope arrived this afternoon &amp; fixed for Wellington to be loaded on Tuesday. Received a letter from William, the sale with balance now for &pound;73.18/-</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":313,"lock":null}
20:13:21.963 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/331
20:13:21.963 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
20:13:21.963 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/331
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/332
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/332
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/333
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
20:13:21.964 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
