20:13:21.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
20:13:21.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/335
20:13:21.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":335,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day. Very stormy with sleet &amp; hail. Wind in the morning NE &amp; changed to SE. On board the Hope. Tom &amp; Fanny Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith arrived from Togston.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":318,"lock":null}
20:13:21.966 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/335
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":335,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day. Very stormy with sleet &amp; hail. Wind in the morning NE &amp; changed to SE. On board the Hope. Tom &amp; Fanny Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith arrived from Togston.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":318,"lock":null}
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/336
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/336
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
20:13:21.967 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/337
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":337,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant &amp; raw cold day. Wind SSW. The Hope got all her coals today, but being thick weather and poor prospect, did not go to sea. Mrs Matthews &amp; Miss Liddell drank tea with us. Gave Stephenson &pound;8. To my astonishment a writ of arrest was opened against me by Bland, Dunn the tailor partners . Very unhandsome conduct as William had called upon him to settle the account before I left town.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":320,"lock":null}
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/337
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":337,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant &amp; raw cold day. Wind SSW. The Hope got all her coals today, but being thick weather and poor prospect, did not go to sea. Mrs Matthews &amp; Miss Liddell drank tea with us. Gave Stephenson &pound;8. To my astonishment a writ of arrest was opened against me by Bland, Dunn the tailor partners . Very unhandsome conduct as William had called upon him to settle the account before I left town.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":320,"lock":null}
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/338
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":338,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly cold damp unpleasant day. Thick weather &amp; wind SE &amp; SSE. The Smiths left us for Togston. Wrote to William. Dined with Mrs Scott. In the evening at the card club. Won 4/-. The Hope not got out. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":321,"lock":null}
20:13:21.968 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/338
20:13:21.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":338,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly cold damp unpleasant day. Thick weather &amp; wind SE &amp; SSE. The Smiths left us for Togston. Wrote to William. Dined with Mrs Scott. In the evening at the card club. Won 4/-. The Hope not got out. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":321,"lock":null}
20:13:21.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/339
20:13:21.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":339,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp day. A few loaded ships got out [in] the morning tide with a poor prospect. Wind SE blowing fresh all day. Several light ships got down. The Hope still in the harbour. <span class=highlight_yellow>Wellington</span> coals 45/- at Wednesdays market. Only 7 ships there</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":322,"lock":null}
20:13:21.969 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/339
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":339,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp day. A few loaded ships got out [in] the morning tide with a poor prospect. Wind SE blowing fresh all day. Several light ships got down. The Hope still in the harbour. <span class=highlight_yellow>Wellington</span> coals 45/- at Wednesdays market. Only 7 ships there</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":322,"lock":null}
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/34
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":34,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSW. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":31,"lock":null}
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/34
20:13:21.970 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":34,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSW. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":31,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/340
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":340,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather with rain. Wind SE. Mr Mark dined with me on board the Hope. No ships got to sea this day</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":323,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/340
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":340,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather with rain. Wind SE. Mr Mark dined with me on board the Hope. No ships got to sea this day</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":323,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/341
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":341,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain with wind at ESE in the afternoon. It got to E &amp; NE with a deluge of rain. Dined at home. No ships sailed. Received a letter from William of his having paid Bland, the tailor my bill with costs &pound;35.9.10</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":324,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
