20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":341,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain with wind at ESE in the afternoon. It got to E &amp; NE with a deluge of rain. Dined at home. No ships sailed. Received a letter from William of his having paid Bland, the tailor my bill with costs &pound;35.9.10</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":324,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/342
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":342,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Wind NNW. A large fleet of small ships got to sea. The pilot refused to take charge of the Hope there being a heavy sea upon the bar. Dined at J Tinley with a small party.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":325,"lock":null}
20:13:21.971 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/342
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":342,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Wind NNW. A large fleet of small ships got to sea. The pilot refused to take charge of the Hope there being a heavy sea upon the bar. Dined at J Tinley with a small party.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":325,"lock":null}
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/343
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":343,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day with a little rain &amp; wind in the morning. NE afterwards changed to SE &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. The Hope still not able to get to sea. Dined at home. Attended the new whist club for the first time at J Tinleys. Won 20/-</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":326,"lock":null}
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/343
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":343,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day with a little rain &amp; wind in the morning. NE afterwards changed to SE &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. The Hope still not able to get to sea. Dined at home. Attended the new whist club for the first time at J Tinleys. Won 20/-</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":326,"lock":null}
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/344
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":344,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NW &amp; sea down. A very large fleet with the Hope sailed with a fine prospect. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Marks of the 5<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Dined at Mr Mayne. Met Captain Bunbury of the 80<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Mr Hopkins, Mr Mayne &amp; Mr Ferguson.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":327,"lock":null}
20:13:21.972 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/344
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":344,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NW &amp; sea down. A very large fleet with the Hope sailed with a fine prospect. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Marks of the 5<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Dined at Mr Mayne. Met Captain Bunbury of the 80<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Mr Hopkins, Mr Mayne &amp; Mr Ferguson.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":327,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/345
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":345,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW. A few ships went to sea. Engaged all the morning in the office. Wrote to William. Paid Barthewan an advance of &pound;5.5.4. At the whist club in the evening. Paid into Chapman &pound;50 rents on acct of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":328,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/345
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":345,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW. A few ships went to sea. Engaged all the morning in the office. Wrote to William. Paid Barthewan an advance of &pound;5.5.4. At the whist club in the evening. Paid into Chapman &pound;50 rents on acct of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":328,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/346
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":346,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW. Several ships got to sea. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Reaerby</span> the painter a draft for &pound;6.7.6 for painting the Hope. Dined with Captain Bunbury at Tynemouth &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Borrowed &pound;50 of <span class=highlight_yellow>exors</span> &amp; placed to Cr<font color=#BFBFBF>edit</font> of private account at Chapman</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":329,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/346
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":346,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW. Several ships got to sea. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Reaerby</span> the painter a draft for &pound;6.7.6 for painting the Hope. Dined with Captain Bunbury at Tynemouth &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Borrowed &pound;50 of <span class=highlight_yellow>exors</span> &amp; placed to Cr<font color=#BFBFBF>edit</font> of private account at Chapman</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":329,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/347
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":347,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. Took a walk round Cullercoat fields &amp; Tynemouth. Dined at home. Spent the evening with the whist club at Mr Metcalfs</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":330,"lock":null}
20:13:21.973 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
