20:13:21.974 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":347,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. Took a walk round Cullercoat fields &amp; Tynemouth. Dined at home. Spent the evening with the whist club at Mr Metcalfs</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":330,"lock":null}
20:13:21.974 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/348
20:13:21.974 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":348,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW &amp; cold. Went to church with Emma in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":331,"lock":null}
20:13:21.974 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
