20:13:21.978 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":358,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day and wind about W by N. Walked to Tynemouth called at Tibbs upon Mr Ildeston who returned to Shields with me. Dined at home &amp; in the evening met Mr Ildeston at Mr Baskers to take wine. Mr Mark there.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":341,"lock":null}
20:13:21.978 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/359
20:13:21.978 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":359,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. During the morning at home reading. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the whist club. Bad accounts of losses in the Monday morning gale upon the Yorkshire coast.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":342,"lock":null}
20:13:21.978 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
