20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":359,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. During the morning at home reading. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the whist club. Bad accounts of losses in the Monday morning gale upon the Yorkshire coast.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":342,"lock":null}
20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/36
20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":36,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW &amp; rather cold. Dined at home</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":33,"lock":null}
