20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":36,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WNW &amp; rather cold. Dined at home</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":33,"lock":null}
20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/360
20:13:21.979 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":360,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day, but rather cool &amp; wind SW. Dined at Mr Tibbs at Tynemouth. Mr &amp; Mrs Tinley, Miss Hewson, Mr &amp; Mrs L Fenwick, Mr &amp; Mrs I Fenwick, Misses Drury, Captain Bunbury &amp; self the party</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":343,"lock":null}
