20:13:21.986 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":375,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind about W by N. Blowing strong. After breakfast, called at the Barrack &amp; afterwards returned to Shields. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club at R Pearts</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":358,"lock":null}
20:13:21.986 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/376
20:13:21.986 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":376,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp foggy day. Wind W &amp; WNW. Went to church in the morning. Dined at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":359,"lock":null}
20:13:21.986 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
