20:13:21.987 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":376,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp foggy day. Wind W &amp; WNW. Went to church in the morning. Dined at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":359,"lock":null}
20:13:21.987 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/377
20:13:21.987 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":377,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet day. Wind about W or W by S. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it ordering by W Taylors desire the Morning Journal &amp; Morning Herald newspapers. At 5 guineas for the Newsroom. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":360,"lock":null}
20:13:21.987 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
