20:13:21.990 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":384,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine weather day. Excessively cold. Wind SW. Engaged in the morning drawing &amp; on board ship. Dined at home. Took wine with Mark Cunningham &amp; Boswick at the Albion</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":367,"lock":null}
20:13:21.990 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/385
20:13:21.990 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":385,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather thick. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid into Chapmans on my own account &pound;10.11.2</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":368,"lock":null}
20:13:21.990 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/385
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":385,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather thick. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid into Chapmans on my own account &pound;10.11.2</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":368,"lock":null}
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/386
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":386,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind WNW. Engaged in the morning drawing &amp; on board of ship. Sails all on shore at Mr Hearns. Ordered the running rigging to be taken to Mr Sharps, as there's nothing safe on board from the nightly visits the thieves pay. Thus ends the year, a very poor one for ship &amp; owners. I for one can safely say that I have not made one farthing. I only hope the next year will be productive of more good or I know not what will be the consequence. Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the theatre. The <span class=highlight_yellow>bespeak</span> of the Subscriber to the Assemblies. A very fair house, as things <span class=highlight_yellow>are</span>.</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":369,"lock":null}
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/386
20:13:21.991 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":386,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind WNW. Engaged in the morning drawing &amp; on board of ship. Sails all on shore at Mr Hearns. Ordered the running rigging to be taken to Mr Sharps, as there's nothing safe on board from the nightly visits the thieves pay. Thus ends the year, a very poor one for ship &amp; owners. I for one can safely say that I have not made one farthing. I only hope the next year will be productive of more good or I know not what will be the consequence. Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the theatre. The <span class=highlight_yellow>bespeak</span> of the Subscriber to the Assemblies. A very fair house, as things <span class=highlight_yellow>are</span>.</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":369,"lock":null}
