20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":395,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An unpleasant day. Ground very wet &amp; dirty from the snow not <span class=highlight_yellow>laying</span>. Wind variable during the day. Between the E &amp; S. Once or twice it was at SW for a short time. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening. Called at the Mulstream.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":377,"lock":null}
20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/396
20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":396,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant day. Cold with Sleet. Streets excessively dirty. Wind about N &amp; sea high. Paid Barnes &pound;1.5.6. Clark &pound;1.16.6 &amp; Alder shoemaker 10/6. Dined at home in the evening at the Albion whist party, rather a noisy party. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":378,"lock":null}
20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
