20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":396,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant day. Cold with Sleet. Streets excessively dirty. Wind about N &amp; sea high. Paid Barnes &pound;1.5.6. Clark &pound;1.16.6 &amp; Alder shoemaker 10/6. Dined at home in the evening at the Albion whist party, rather a noisy party. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":378,"lock":null}
20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/397
20:13:21.996 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":397,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather but cold. Wind SE &amp; ESE. Sea high. Several light ships got down. Dined at home. In the evening at Tibbs whist club. Paid Reed <span class=highlight_yellow>app</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rentice</span> I Weeks board lodgings 7/-</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":379,"lock":null}
