20:13:21.998 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":40,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind WSW. Dined at home. Engaged Mr Stephenson as master of the Hope, having a very high character from Mr Hogg. Wages &pound;9. per voyage</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":37,"lock":null}
20:13:21.998 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/400
20:13:21.998 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":400,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind E by S. A few ships arrived. At the court <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Taverne</span> the principle part to the morning. Dined with the Liberal club,  Commercial Hotel &amp; spent a pleasant day. A large party.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":382,"lock":null}
20:13:21.998 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/400
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":400,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind E by S. A few ships arrived. At the court <span class=highlight_yellow>for</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Taverne</span> the principle part to the morning. Dined with the Liberal club,  Commercial Hotel &amp; spent a pleasant day. A large party.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":382,"lock":null}
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/401
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":401,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW with a slight frost. Walked to Tynemouth with Mr Boswell * took a warm bath. Dined at home. In the evening joined a party to drink a little punch at the Mulstream. Lots of fun. Got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":383,"lock":null}
