20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":402,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day with a hard frost. Wind variable between SW &amp; NW. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the whist club. Called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":384,"lock":null}
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/403
20:13:21.999 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":403,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day with snow &amp; wind variable between W by S &amp; SE. At night got to west again. Drew &pound;10 out of Chapmans &amp; paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Cluigh</span> for G <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>cloathes</span> &pound;2.14/0. Dined at home. In the evening at the Albion whist club. Called at the Mulstrum but did not stop long.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":385,"lock":null}
