20:13:22.000 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/405
20:13:22.000 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":405,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day with frost &amp; showers of snow. Wind N &amp; NNW. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Mrs Scott downstairs. Went to Stowells Chapel in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":387,"lock":null}
20:13:22.000 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
