20:13:22.001 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":406,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine day. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. Engaged the whole of the morning at home drawing. Dined at home. Suppered &amp; spent a pleasant evening with A Harry &amp; his sister.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":388,"lock":null}
20:13:22.001 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/407
20:13:22.001 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":407,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frosty weather with snow showers. Wind NW, changed in the afternoon to east, with thaw. Dined at home. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":389,"lock":null}
20:13:22.001 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
