20:13:22.006 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":418,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather with a slight frost. Wind NW, changed in the afternoon to SE. Dined at home. Met Ana <span class=highlight_yellow>Yallop</span>. At the whist club in the evening at I Dales. Paid E Reed a weeks lodging 7/-</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":400,"lock":null}
