20:13:22.006 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":418,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather with a slight frost. Wind NW, changed in the afternoon to SE. Dined at home. Met Ana <span class=highlight_yellow>Yallop</span>. At the whist club in the evening at I Dales. Paid E Reed a weeks lodging 7/-</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":400,"lock":null}
20:13:22.006 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/419
20:13:22.006 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":419,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day. Wind W by N. A large fleet of colliers went to sea. Attended church in the morning. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum. A French, Boswell &amp; Nicolson. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jane</span> Muston</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":401,"lock":null}
20:13:22.006 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
