20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":419,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day. Wind W by N. A large fleet of colliers went to sea. Attended church in the morning. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum. A French, Boswell &amp; Nicolson. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jane</span> Muston</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":401,"lock":null}
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/42
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":42,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, but turned out fine. Wind S by W. On board the Hope all the morning got cables upon deck, found them in fair order. Dined with Dr Drury.  Whist club in evening</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":39,"lock":null}
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/42
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":42,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, but turned out fine. Wind S by W. On board the Hope all the morning got cables upon deck, found them in fair order. Dined with Dr Drury.  Whist club in evening</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":39,"lock":null}
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/420
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":420,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day &amp; sharp frost. Wind W by S. Engaged part of the morning drawing. Took a walk round by the ship. Found all <span class=highlight_yellow>right</span>, Stephenson on board waiting for Mr Cleths to survey her for the Premium Club. Dinned with Mr Chapman of <span class=highlight_yellow>Elseneur</span> at the Commercial. A French &amp; W Boswell came and took wine. Went to the theatre, Crooks benefit, a fair house&amp; the last night of performance for the season. Got &pound;5 of Chapman for self.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":402,"lock":null}
20:13:22.007 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/420
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":420,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day &amp; sharp frost. Wind W by S. Engaged part of the morning drawing. Took a walk round by the ship. Found all <span class=highlight_yellow>right</span>, Stephenson on board waiting for Mr Cleths to survey her for the Premium Club. Dinned with Mr Chapman of <span class=highlight_yellow>Elseneur</span> at the Commercial. A French &amp; W Boswell came and took wine. Went to the theatre, Crooks benefit, a fair house&amp; the last night of performance for the season. Got &pound;5 of Chapman for self.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":402,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/421
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":421,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; hard frost. Wind W &amp; W by S. A French &amp; I walked round the town with Mr Chapman of <span class=highlight_yellow>Elseneur</span> to call upon his friends. Dined at 2 o'clock with A Harry. On board the Choise, A French, A Nicholson, <span class=highlight_yellow>Drewing</span>, Cunningham, Mark ____, self &amp; Captain ____ Mr Bradshaw came on board. After dinner we spent a very pleasant day.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":403,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/421
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":421,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; hard frost. Wind W &amp; W by S. A French &amp; I walked round the town with Mr Chapman of <span class=highlight_yellow>Elseneur</span> to call upon his friends. Dined at 2 o'clock with A Harry. On board the Choise, A French, A Nicholson, <span class=highlight_yellow>Drewing</span>, Cunningham, Mark ____, self &amp; Captain ____ Mr Bradshaw came on board. After dinner we spent a very pleasant day.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":403,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/422
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":422,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind West. Passed part of the morning in drawing &amp; writing to William with Robert's account of <span class=highlight_yellow>seats</span>. Attended a meeting of shipowners &amp; masters for the purpose of establishing a asylum for aged &amp; infirm master mariners, an excellent institution &amp; long wasted the meeting most respectfully &amp; numerous attended &amp; then business well conducted &amp; a most liberal feeling persuading every person as the donation &amp; subscriptions best testified. Read a letter from Geo Dunn to know if I intended loading the Hope. Answered in the negative unless <span class=highlight_yellow>fieghted</span> or upheld. Dined at home. Mrs Scott  very unwell, but downstairs. Saw <span class=highlight_yellow>arr</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>&gamma;&alpha;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&pi;</span></p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":404,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/422
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":422,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind West. Passed part of the morning in drawing &amp; writing to William with Robert's account of <span class=highlight_yellow>seats</span>. Attended a meeting of shipowners &amp; masters for the purpose of establishing a asylum for aged &amp; infirm master mariners, an excellent institution &amp; long wasted the meeting most respectfully &amp; numerous attended &amp; then business well conducted &amp; a most liberal feeling persuading every person as the donation &amp; subscriptions best testified. Read a letter from Geo Dunn to know if I intended loading the Hope. Answered in the negative unless <span class=highlight_yellow>fieghted</span> or upheld. Dined at home. Mrs Scott  very unwell, but downstairs. Saw <span class=highlight_yellow>arr</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>&gamma;&alpha;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&pi;</span></p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":404,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/423
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":423,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather rather damp &amp; foggy. Wind from W to N by S. Passed the first of the morning in drawing. Dined at home. Saw <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nn</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>&gamma;&alpha;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&pi;</span>. At the whist club</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":405,"lock":null}
20:13:22.008 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/423
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":423,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather rather damp &amp; foggy. Wind from W to N by S. Passed the first of the morning in drawing. Dined at home. Saw <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nn</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>&gamma;&alpha;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;</span><span class=highlight_yellow>&pi;</span>. At the whist club</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":405,"lock":null}
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/424
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":424,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N. Paid Brown for <span class=highlight_yellow>oakeun</span> &amp; for Hope's buffet &amp; the year &pound;21. Dined at I Fenwicks, Preston Villa, a party of 18</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":406,"lock":null}
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
