20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":424,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N. Paid Brown for <span class=highlight_yellow>oakeun</span> &amp; for Hope's buffet &amp; the year &pound;21. Dined at I Fenwicks, Preston Villa, a party of 18</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":406,"lock":null}
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/425
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
20:13:22.009 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/425
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/426
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/426
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/427
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/427
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/428
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":428,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; wind NW. Mrs Scott in great pain last night. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans for private use. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined in the Commercial, the <span class=highlight_yellow>Limited</span> &amp; Eligible Clubs. Sat very late.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":410,"lock":null}
20:13:22.010 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
