20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":428,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; wind NW. Mrs Scott in great pain last night. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans for private use. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined in the Commercial, the <span class=highlight_yellow>Limited</span> &amp; Eligible Clubs. Sat very late.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":410,"lock":null}
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/429
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":429,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Attended the meeting of the Master Mariners, when the rules were read over &amp; adopted. Walked up to Milburn's Place to see the ship. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":411,"lock":null}
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
