20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":429,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Attended the meeting of the Master Mariners, when the rules were read over &amp; adopted. Walked up to Milburn's Place to see the ship. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":411,"lock":null}
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/43
