20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/43
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":43,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day, Wind West. Brought the Hope down to the Low Light shore to get her ballast out and agreed with a man to repair &amp; refit all the rigging for &pound;10</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":40,"lock":null}
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/430
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":430,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning, but damp having been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind NW. A meeting held of the committees of clubs to demand an explanation of Joe Elder for fixing his ship below the rates of freight determined upon by shipowners. <span class=highlight_yellow>It is</span> not the first time he has been guilty of such dishonest practices. He could not <span class=highlight_yellow>explain</span> himself &amp; unless Mr Bell cancels the charter, which will be known tomorrow, Eldess ships will be turned out of the clubs, the proper way of treating such fellows. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club &amp; afterwards went to a large bridal party at Tom Wrights</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":412,"lock":null}
20:13:22.011 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/430
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":430,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning, but damp having been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind NW. A meeting held of the committees of clubs to demand an explanation of Joe Elder for fixing his ship below the rates of freight determined upon by shipowners. <span class=highlight_yellow>It is</span> not the first time he has been guilty of such dishonest practices. He could not <span class=highlight_yellow>explain</span> himself &amp; unless Mr Bell cancels the charter, which will be known tomorrow, Eldess ships will be turned out of the clubs, the proper way of treating such fellows. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club &amp; afterwards went to a large bridal party at Tom Wrights</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":412,"lock":null}
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/431
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":431,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite mild &amp; spring weather. Wind WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined with the Friendly club at the George Tavern where we had a handsome dinner &amp; spent a pleasant evening. Saw Ann <span class=highlight_yellow>Mallot</span></p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":413,"lock":null}
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/431
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":431,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite mild &amp; spring weather. Wind WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined with the Friendly club at the George Tavern where we had a handsome dinner &amp; spent a pleasant evening. Saw Ann <span class=highlight_yellow>Mallot</span></p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":413,"lock":null}
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/432
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":432,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Called at D Dixons. Found Mrs Dixon about to set off for Shields to see Mrs Scott. Called at G Dunn &amp; Sons &amp; refused to load their coals without being upheld. Afterwards walked down to Shields. Dined at Mrs Reeds with a large party. The bridal party Mr &amp; Mrs Tom Wright there. Attended the whist club at A Metcalf. Paid R Brown the account &pound;4.10/-</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":414,"lock":null}
20:13:22.012 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/432
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":432,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Called at D Dixons. Found Mrs Dixon about to set off for Shields to see Mrs Scott. Called at G Dunn &amp; Sons &amp; refused to load their coals without being upheld. Afterwards walked down to Shields. Dined at Mrs Reeds with a large party. The bridal party Mr &amp; Mrs Tom Wright there. Attended the whist club at A Metcalf. Paid R Brown the account &pound;4.10/-</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":414,"lock":null}
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/433
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":433,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning with the appearance of rain &amp; blowing fresh at WNW. Mrs Scott in a devil of a humour blowing every person up right &amp; left. I think her mind must be affected. Went to church. Took a family dinner with A Harry. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Met Bell Jervis for the first time.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":415,"lock":null}
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/433
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":433,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning with the appearance of rain &amp; blowing fresh at WNW. Mrs Scott in a devil of a humour blowing every person up right &amp; left. I think her mind must be affected. Went to church. Took a family dinner with A Harry. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Met Bell Jervis for the first time.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":415,"lock":null}
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/434
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":434,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calm wind about West. Walked to the ship &amp; ordered the sails &amp; small stones on board. About noon it turned very thick weather &amp; the wind suddenly changed to NE with heavy rain that lasted all night</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":416,"lock":null}
20:13:22.013 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/434
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":434,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calm wind about West. Walked to the ship &amp; ordered the sails &amp; small stones on board. About noon it turned very thick weather &amp; the wind suddenly changed to NE with heavy rain that lasted all night</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":416,"lock":null}
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/435
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":435,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning it having been a great deal of rain &amp; sleet during the night. Wind NNW changeable during the day to ENE &amp; NE. Went down to the ship. The committee on board surveying stores for the Hope club. Dined at J Tinleys with a party of gentlemen. We all afterwards went to the ball. Only 52 there, but a pleasant dancing ball. Ordered a new mainstaysail for the Hope.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":417,"lock":null}
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/435
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":435,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning it having been a great deal of rain &amp; sleet during the night. Wind NNW changeable during the day to ENE &amp; NE. Went down to the ship. The committee on board surveying stores for the Hope club. Dined at J Tinleys with a party of gentlemen. We all afterwards went to the ball. Only 52 there, but a pleasant dancing ball. Ordered a new mainstaysail for the Hope.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":417,"lock":null}
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/436
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":436,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind WNN &amp; looks like more rain. Turned very cold towards afternoon &amp; wind changed to SE &amp; S by E. Went to Newcastle but everything very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. Returned home to dinner.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":418,"lock":null}
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.014 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/436
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":436,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind WNN &amp; looks like more rain. Turned very cold towards afternoon &amp; wind changed to SE &amp; S by E. Went to Newcastle but everything very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. Returned home to dinner.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":418,"lock":null}
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/437
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":437,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind SW. Has been some rain in the night. Received a letter from the committee of the Hope Club ordering us to get a new <span class=highlight_yellow>lamp</span> &amp; next winter a new foresail. Also now four new ballast shovels. Engaged all the morning writing to William &amp; the Galbraiths. Found Mrs Craig in a chaise &amp; went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Walls</span> to dine with Mr J Wright, a large party of 18. Spent a pleasant day &amp; had the best port wine I ever tasted in my life. Got home at 12 o'clock.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":419,"lock":null}
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/437
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":437,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind SW. Has been some rain in the night. Received a letter from the committee of the Hope Club ordering us to get a new <span class=highlight_yellow>lamp</span> &amp; next winter a new foresail. Also now four new ballast shovels. Engaged all the morning writing to William &amp; the Galbraiths. Found Mrs Craig in a chaise &amp; went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Walls</span> to dine with Mr J Wright, a large party of 18. Spent a pleasant day &amp; had the best port wine I ever tasted in my life. Got home at 12 o'clock.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":419,"lock":null}
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/438
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":438,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Mr mark &amp; I took a walk along the Herd sand. Dined at home. Suppered at Mr Bradshower</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":420,"lock":null}
20:13:22.015 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/438
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":438,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Mr mark &amp; I took a walk along the Herd sand. Dined at home. Suppered at Mr Bradshower</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":420,"lock":null}
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/439
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":439,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW At 10 o'clock am wind suddenly changed to SE with thick fog &amp; very raw and cold. Went to Newcastle by coach but could not get anything for the Hope. Called at Mrs Dixon's. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at A Dales. Received a letter from J Young demanding payment of their claims upon W &amp; J Scott which we shall most certainly not accede to, he having agreed to take the <span class=highlight_yellow>comporation</span> with the other creditors.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":421,"lock":null}
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/439
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":439,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW At 10 o'clock am wind suddenly changed to SE with thick fog &amp; very raw and cold. Went to Newcastle by coach but could not get anything for the Hope. Called at Mrs Dixon's. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at A Dales. Received a letter from J Young demanding payment of their claims upon W &amp; J Scott which we shall most certainly not accede to, he having agreed to take the <span class=highlight_yellow>comporation</span> with the other creditors.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":421,"lock":null}
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/44
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":44,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day, Wind SE. On board the Hope in moorings. Got the rigging all down, a fire lighted in the cabin &amp; hold partly scraped &amp; cleared. Dined at the vicars &amp; met a very pleasant party. Received a letter &amp; wrote to William</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":41,"lock":null}
20:13:22.016 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/44
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":44,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day, Wind SE. On board the Hope in moorings. Got the rigging all down, a fire lighted in the cabin &amp; hold partly scraped &amp; cleared. Dined at the vicars &amp; met a very pleasant party. Received a letter &amp; wrote to William</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":41,"lock":null}
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/440
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":440,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind E by N. About 10 o'clock am it began to rain very heavy &amp; continued all the morning. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":422,"lock":null}
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/440
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":440,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind E by N. About 10 o'clock am it began to rain very heavy &amp; continued all the morning. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":422,"lock":null}
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/441
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":441,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh from the WNW &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>lo</span>. Wrote to J Young requesting a few days to communicate with my brother. Walked up to the ship with J Tinley in the morning, who wrote to <span class=highlight_yellow>Netern</span> to send down the deed of release. All letters <span class=highlight_yellow>be</span> relative to our composition. Dined at home. In the evening had an <span class=highlight_yellow>ryotes</span> supper at the Northumberland. <span class=highlight_yellow>Won</span> a bet lost by <span class=highlight_yellow>Locklder</span> &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Holroryd</span>. Sat down 13 &amp; spent a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":423,"lock":null}
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.017 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/441
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":441,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh from the WNW &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>lo</span>. Wrote to J Young requesting a few days to communicate with my brother. Walked up to the ship with J Tinley in the morning, who wrote to <span class=highlight_yellow>Netern</span> to send down the deed of release. All letters <span class=highlight_yellow>be</span> relative to our composition. Dined at home. In the evening had an <span class=highlight_yellow>ryotes</span> supper at the Northumberland. <span class=highlight_yellow>Won</span> a bet lost by <span class=highlight_yellow>Locklder</span> &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Holroryd</span>. Sat down 13 &amp; spent a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":423,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/442
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":442,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW &amp; afterwards changed to East with snow. Walked to Tynemouth. Attended a sale of old furniture at Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lenskerths</span>. Mrs Dixon came down to see Mrs Scott. Dined at J Tinleys. A large party.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":424,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/442
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":442,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW &amp; afterwards changed to East with snow. Walked to Tynemouth. Attended a sale of old furniture at Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lenskerths</span>. Mrs Dixon came down to see Mrs Scott. Dined at J Tinleys. A large party.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":424,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/443
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":443,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A hard frost. Wind E by S. Has been a little snow in the night. Last night the <span class=highlight_yellow>mews</span> room was on fire but was discovered in time to get put out before much damage was done. In a short time it would broken out &amp; spread that the whole building would have been destroyed. The floor rafters and ceiling of <span class=highlight_yellow>mews</span> room partly burnt. Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Dined at J Dales. Met a large party &amp; spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":425,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/443
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":443,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A hard frost. Wind E by S. Has been a little snow in the night. Last night the <span class=highlight_yellow>mews</span> room was on fire but was discovered in time to get put out before much damage was done. In a short time it would broken out &amp; spread that the whole building would have been destroyed. The floor rafters and ceiling of <span class=highlight_yellow>mews</span> room partly burnt. Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Dined at J Dales. Met a large party &amp; spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":425,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/444
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":444,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from E. Received a letter from William with a copy of his answer to J Young. Paid Morton &amp; Thompson for the Hope's bowsprit pump for &pound;25.7/-. Dined with H Dale, Mr Mark &amp; Mr Jackson of the 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. Spent a pleasant evening. Walked to the ship in the morning. Turned out a very wet night. Sleet</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":426,"lock":null}
20:13:22.018 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/444
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":444,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from E. Received a letter from William with a copy of his answer to J Young. Paid Morton &amp; Thompson for the Hope's bowsprit pump for &pound;25.7/-. Dined with H Dale, Mr Mark &amp; Mr Jackson of the 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. Spent a pleasant evening. Walked to the ship in the morning. Turned out a very wet night. Sleet</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":426,"lock":null}
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/445
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":445,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind SSW. Dined at home. In the evening attended a large party at Mr J Fenwicks, Preston Villa, about 120 there, a dinner.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":427,"lock":null}
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/445
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":445,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind SSW. Dined at home. In the evening attended a large party at Mr J Fenwicks, Preston Villa, about 120 there, a dinner.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":427,"lock":null}
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/446
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":446,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold foggy morning. Wind SW. Drove up to Newcastle with Mr Tinley, called upon Mrs Dixon, went to the Quay side, but could not do anything for the Hope. Returned to Shields by steam boat. Dined with J Tinley &amp; went to the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":428,"lock":null}
20:13:22.019 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/446
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":446,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold foggy morning. Wind SW. Drove up to Newcastle with Mr Tinley, called upon Mrs Dixon, went to the Quay side, but could not do anything for the Hope. Returned to Shields by steam boat. Dined with J Tinley &amp; went to the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":428,"lock":null}
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/447
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/447
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/448
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":448,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SE &amp; E by S. Went to Newcastle by steam. Could do nothing for the Hope. Walked up to Westgate Street &amp; the billiard rooms. Returned to Shields to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":430,"lock":null}
20:13:22.020 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/448
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":448,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SE &amp; E by S. Went to Newcastle by steam. Could do nothing for the Hope. Walked up to Westgate Street &amp; the billiard rooms. Returned to Shields to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":430,"lock":null}
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/449
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":449,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Nothing to be done for the Hope. Dined with Dixon Dixon. In the evening went to the theatre. Met the  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ildestons</span> there. A very thin house. The high sheriffs benefit. The Dixons &amp; Tom &amp; Bell Smith went to a ball given by the offices of the dragoon quarter at Newcastle.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":431,"lock":null}
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/449
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":449,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Nothing to be done for the Hope. Dined with Dixon Dixon. In the evening went to the theatre. Met the  <span class=highlight_yellow>Ildestons</span> there. A very thin house. The high sheriffs benefit. The Dixons &amp; Tom &amp; Bell Smith went to a ball given by the offices of the dragoon quarter at Newcastle.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":431,"lock":null}
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/45
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":45,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An extremely cold &amp; frosty day. Wind SSE &amp; every appearance of bad weather At church in the morning - Young King preached. Dined at home. At night blew a gale of wind. A heavy sea on the bar. Wrote to Bessy &amp; Captain Lewis</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":42,"lock":null}
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.021 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/45
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":45,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An extremely cold &amp; frosty day. Wind SSE &amp; every appearance of bad weather At church in the morning - Young King preached. Dined at home. At night blew a gale of wind. A heavy sea on the bar. Wrote to Bessy &amp; Captain Lewis</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":42,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/450
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":450,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind NE. Tom &amp; Bell Smith started for Togston. I returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Went to a small party in the evening at Mr Marks</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":432,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/450
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":450,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind NE. Tom &amp; Bell Smith started for Togston. I returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Went to a small party in the evening at Mr Marks</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":432,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/451
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":451,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NE. Wrote to J Young that we were made to pay him &amp; his father's lie <span class=highlight_yellow>leaedind</span> but no more. Added a postscript to J Tindley's letter to William. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":433,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/451
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":451,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NE. Wrote to J Young that we were made to pay him &amp; his father's lie <span class=highlight_yellow>leaedind</span> but no more. Added a postscript to J Tindley's letter to William. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":433,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/452
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":452,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold. Wind NNE. Walked up to the ship. George <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> employed rigging her with only the <span class=highlight_yellow>apprentice</span> of the little boy Ned Reed. <span class=highlight_yellow>For</span> a very fine young man, only been seven coal voyages &amp; is as good as any man. Dined at home. Saw poor Richard Brown who I much fear has not long to live.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":434,"lock":null}
20:13:22.022 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/452
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":452,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold. Wind NNE. Walked up to the ship. George <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> employed rigging her with only the <span class=highlight_yellow>apprentice</span> of the little boy Ned Reed. <span class=highlight_yellow>For</span> a very fine young man, only been seven coal voyages &amp; is as good as any man. Dined at home. Saw poor Richard Brown who I much fear has not long to live.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":434,"lock":null}
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/453
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":453,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle but evening continues very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. An immense number of people at Newcastle, having been to see the unfortunate woman <span class=highlight_silver>Jane </span><span class=highlight_silver>Jameson</span> hanged for the murder of her mother. Returned home by steam to dinner. Attended the whist club at J Dale's. Met Jane Thompson for the first time at Jenny Maxwells</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":435,"lock":null}
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/453
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":453,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle but evening continues very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. An immense number of people at Newcastle, having been to see the unfortunate woman <span class=highlight_silver>Jane </span><span class=highlight_silver>Jameson</span> hanged for the murder of her mother. Returned home by steam to dinner. Attended the whist club at J Dale's. Met Jane Thompson for the first time at Jenny Maxwells</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":435,"lock":null}
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/454
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":454,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but rather dull. Wind NW. Took physic &amp; could not go to church. Wrote to Mr P Lacing respecting C Harry's claim. At the <span class=highlight_yellow>grange man</span> Sunderland. Dined at home. The newspapers today filled with <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Puls</span> expositions of the measures of <span class=highlight_yellow>ministise</span> for the relief of the Catholics. Took wine in the evening with H Harry &amp; J Lunning have at the Albion. Afterwards called at the Mulstrum &amp; saw Bell Jarvis !!!!</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":436,"lock":null}
20:13:22.023 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/454
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":454,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but rather dull. Wind NW. Took physic &amp; could not go to church. Wrote to Mr P Lacing respecting C Harry's claim. At the <span class=highlight_yellow>grange man</span> Sunderland. Dined at home. The newspapers today filled with <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Puls</span> expositions of the measures of <span class=highlight_yellow>ministise</span> for the relief of the Catholics. Took wine in the evening with H Harry &amp; J Lunning have at the Albion. Afterwards called at the Mulstrum &amp; saw Bell Jarvis !!!!</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":436,"lock":null}
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/455
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":455,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. Brought some beef <span class=highlight_yellow>6.0.6 at 4 o'clock</span>. Dined at Mr Allen's &amp; suppered in the evening at the George with a party. An Oyster supper. Kept it up very late. Paid &pound;1.4/- entrance for Friday C Club. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":437,"lock":null}
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/455
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":455,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. Brought some beef <span class=highlight_yellow>6.0.6 at 4 o'clock</span>. Dined at Mr Allen's &amp; suppered in the evening at the George with a party. An Oyster supper. Kept it up very late. Paid &pound;1.4/- entrance for Friday C Club. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":437,"lock":null}
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/456
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":456,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NE. A little rain during the day. Walked up to the Ship. Dined with a large party at J Tinley &amp; in the evening a party at Mr Barretts</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":438,"lock":null}
20:13:22.024 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
