20:13:22.027 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":46,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy cold day with a heavy fall of snow. Busy with the rigging at the ropery. A heavy sea upon the bar, Wind SE by S. Dined at home. Wrote to Messrs Lees &amp; Co</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":43,"lock":null}
20:13:22.027 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/460
20:13:22.027 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":460,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind NW. Went to Newcastle by steamer. Ordered the Hope's coal down. Returned home to dinner. At the whist club in the evening at Allens. J Tinley received a letter from H Dale stating that he had C Young &amp; Sons orders to proceed against us for their debts.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":442,"lock":null}
20:13:22.027 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
