20:13:22.035 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":478,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold winter's morning. Wind NE having been a good deal of snow during the night. Wind changed to NW with heavy showers of hail &amp; snow during the day&amp; night. Dined at home. In the evening at a party at Mr Mathews</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":460,"lock":null}
20:13:22.035 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/479
20:13:22.035 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":479,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather with showers of snow &amp; wind NNW. Although a heavy swell upon the bar &amp; occasionally breaking, several ships got to sea. Dined at home. In the evening at the Jarvis's with Bell.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":461,"lock":null}
20:13:22.035 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
