20:13:22.095 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":6,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined at home with Mrs Scott a very quiet day. Damp unpleasant weather. H Hurry &amp; J Elder surveyed the Hope &amp; valued at from &pound;1000 to &pound;1100. Wind SW. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":3,"lock":null}
