20:13:22.101 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/61
20:13:22.101 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":61,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW. Engaged on board ship. Dined at J Tinly &amp; went to the assembly in the evening which was numerously attended</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":58,"lock":null}
20:13:22.101 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
