20:13:22.120 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":647,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Clear weather but blowing very fresh from WSW. Obliged to reef &amp; double reef the topsails &amp; slow the trysails. Could make no way against both wind &amp; current. Lat: by obs 58.2 N</p>","pageId":764,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":609,"lock":null}
