20:13:22.131 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":670,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out before 8 o'clock. The gale increased &amp; blowing so hard that we cannot get underway. In the middle of the night it was tremendous &amp; we ...</p>","pageId":770,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":632,"lock":null}
