20:13:22.135 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/68
20:13:22.135 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":68,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold. Wind N by W. Went to the county Court in the morning with Mrs Dixon &amp; Bill Smith. Heard judge Bailey deliver his charges to The grand jury &amp; returned to Shields by steam. Dined with J Tindley. Mrs Scott much better &amp; downstairs</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":65,"lock":null}
