20:13:22.150 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":709,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but cool. Wind N by W &amp; a sea upon the bar. Heavy rain during the day. Dined at home. Drank tea &amp; played a rubber at I Craig's</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":667,"lock":null}
20:13:22.150 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/71
20:13:22.150 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":71,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather changed. Wind NW. A shower of snow in the morning &amp; afterwards turned over a wet day. A few ships got to sea. Dined at home A letter from William</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":68,"lock":null}
