20:13:22.152 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/715
20:13:22.152 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":715,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having had rain during the night. Wind W by N <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp; cots</span>. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening with Ann. Took supper &amp; a glass of punch with Allen</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":673,"lock":null}
