20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":715,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having had rain during the night. Wind W by N <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp; cots</span>. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening with Ann. Took supper &amp; a glass of punch with Allen</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":673,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/716
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":716,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW by N. Walked with Mark to the New Quay &amp; afterwards with Mrs Tinley up Preston Lane. Dined at J Tinley. He treated us with turtle soup, spent a pleasant day. Present the vicar, William &amp; H Metcalf, J Fenwick, J Dale &amp; myself</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":674,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
