20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":716,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW by N. Walked with Mark to the New Quay &amp; afterwards with Mrs Tinley up Preston Lane. Dined at J Tinley. He treated us with turtle soup, spent a pleasant day. Present the vicar, William &amp; H Metcalf, J Fenwick, J Dale &amp; myself</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":674,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/717
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":717,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, cool. Wind NW. Dined at home. Walked with captain Webb to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Miss Marr's &amp; saw Emma G. At night blew hard with heavy rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":675,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/717
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":717,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, cool. Wind NW. Dined at home. Walked with captain Webb to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Miss Marr's &amp; saw Emma G. At night blew hard with heavy rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":675,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/718
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":718,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning. Exceptional wet &amp; heavy sleet showers. Wind about N. Got breakfast early &amp; took the steam boat to Newcastle &amp; at 10 o'clock got into the Express coach &amp; went to Durham. When we arrived a little after 12 o'clock Richmond had sent his man and gig for me but by some mistake the man supposing I had not come, returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>Burn</span><span class=highlight_yellow>hopeside</span> without me at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. I therefor started &amp; walked out to dinner.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":676,"lock":null}
20:13:22.153 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/718
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":718,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning. Exceptional wet &amp; heavy sleet showers. Wind about N. Got breakfast early &amp; took the steam boat to Newcastle &amp; at 10 o'clock got into the Express coach &amp; went to Durham. When we arrived a little after 12 o'clock Richmond had sent his man and gig for me but by some mistake the man supposing I had not come, returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>Burn</span><span class=highlight_yellow>hopeside</span> without me at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. I therefor started &amp; walked out to dinner.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":676,"lock":null}
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/719
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":719,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day &amp; frosty. Richardson &amp; I out shooting all the morning. The birds very wild &amp; we only got two braces. <span class=highlight_yellow>Kit</span> rode a pony, not being able to walk much. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jo</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span> out this morning exercising the hounds, preparing to begin the season tomorrow.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":677,"lock":null}
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
