20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/72
20:13:22.154 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":72,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind WNW. Went to Newcastle. Put the Hope upon Willington List. Dined at home &amp; at party in the evening at Mrs Richmond's. Wrote to William. Got cooks new hearth on board</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":69,"lock":null}
