20:13:22.163 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":74,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day very mild wind NNW. Dined on board the Hope. Had A French &amp; A Nicholson to dinner. A letter from Mrs Y</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":71,"lock":null}
20:13:22.163 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
