20:13:22.175 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":763,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS. Mrs Scott very unwell. Dined with Boswell on board the William Shand. Mark, H Harry, Richardson &amp; myself there. Spent a very pleasant day.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":717,"lock":null}
