20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":782,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day &amp; frosty. Wind WNW. On board the Hope all the morning. The people busy unrigging. Mr Allen &amp; I dined on board. Took wine and spent the evening at J Tinley's. Mr Temple there.</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":736,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/783
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":783,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonable morning &amp; a hard frost. Wind SW. On board the Hope all the morning, where I dined. Hauled her upon Platty ways to get upained in the safe port etc. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; went to the theatre at half price, it being the Officers <span class=highlight_yellow>bespeak</span>.</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":737,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/783
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":783,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonable morning &amp; a hard frost. Wind SW. On board the Hope all the morning, where I dined. Hauled her upon Platty ways to get upained in the safe port etc. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; went to the theatre at half price, it being the Officers <span class=highlight_yellow>bespeak</span>.</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":737,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/784
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":784,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold frosty morning. Wind WSW. On board the Hope. One man at work replacing the after <span class=highlight_yellow>raft</span><span class=highlight_yellow>p</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rts</span>. Paid Walker block maker &pound;8.13/- for making new mainmast in 1828 outfit. H harry &amp; I walked up to Tynemouth &amp; had some whiskey toddy with J Cunningham &amp; afterwards attended the whist club.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":738,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
