20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":784,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold frosty morning. Wind WSW. On board the Hope. One man at work replacing the after <span class=highlight_yellow>raft</span><span class=highlight_yellow>p</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rts</span>. Paid Walker block maker &pound;8.13/- for making new mainmast in 1828 outfit. H harry &amp; I walked up to Tynemouth &amp; had some whiskey toddy with J Cunningham &amp; afterwards attended the whist club.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":738,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/785
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":785,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind SW. On board the Hope. The carpenter still employed at the <span class=highlight_yellow>raftport</span>. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon down to see Mrs Scott.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":739,"lock":null}
20:13:22.185 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.186 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/785
20:13:22.186 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":785,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind SW. On board the Hope. The carpenter still employed at the <span class=highlight_yellow>raftport</span>. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon down to see Mrs Scott.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":739,"lock":null}
20:13:22.186 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/786
20:13:22.186 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":786,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather &amp; wind  SW. Been blowing a gale all night. On board the Hope. At &frac12; past 12 o'clock went by steam to Newcastle. Met Dixon there &amp; walked with him out to Benton to dine &amp; stay all night.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":740,"lock":null}
20:13:22.186 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/786
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":786,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather &amp; wind  SW. Been blowing a gale all night. On board the Hope. At &frac12; past 12 o'clock went by steam to Newcastle. Met Dixon there &amp; walked with him out to Benton to dine &amp; stay all night.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":740,"lock":null}
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/787
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":787,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SW. Dixon &amp; Bessy went to church. I walked down to Walker &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Carr, there being no steam boats. I proceeded &amp; walked to Shields, afterwards to Tynemouth &amp; back &amp; dined with J Tinley. With Bell <span class=highlight_yellow>Wait</span></p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":741,"lock":null}
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/787
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":787,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SW. Dixon &amp; Bessy went to church. I walked down to Walker &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Carr, there being no steam boats. I proceeded &amp; walked to Shields, afterwards to Tynemouth &amp; back &amp; dined with J Tinley. With Bell <span class=highlight_yellow>Wait</span></p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":741,"lock":null}
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/788
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":788,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind SW. On board the Hope. H Harry with me. Examined her stern inside &amp; all appeared sound &amp; good. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":742,"lock":null}
20:13:22.187 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/788
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":788,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind SW. On board the Hope. H Harry with me. Examined her stern inside &amp; all appeared sound &amp; good. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":742,"lock":null}
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/789
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":789,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tyneside &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home. With Bell Jarvis in the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":743,"lock":null}
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
