20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/79
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":79,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Went to Newcastle. Mr Proctor could give me no information about the Ariel. Walked home to dinner. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":76,"lock":null}
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
