20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":79,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Went to Newcastle. Mr Proctor could give me no information about the Ariel. Walked home to dinner. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":76,"lock":null}
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/790
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":790,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. On board the Hope. The after <span class=highlight_yellow>raftport</span> nearly finished. Dined with H Harry. With Bell Jarvis in the evening</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":744,"lock":null}
20:13:22.188 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
