20:13:22.198 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/810
20:13:22.198 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":810,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning having been a frost in the night. Wind NW. Went to church in the morning. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Walked with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lens</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Kills</span> &amp; J Tinley to Tynemouth Lodge &amp; afterwards to Tynemouth with J T<font color=#BFBFBF>inley</font>. Dined with him. Mark came in after dinner.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":762,"lock":null}
20:13:22.198 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.199 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/810
20:13:22.199 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":810,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning having been a frost in the night. Wind NW. Went to church in the morning. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Walked with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lens</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Kills</span> &amp; J Tinley to Tynemouth Lodge &amp; afterwards to Tynemouth with J T<font color=#BFBFBF>inley</font>. Dined with him. Mark came in after dinner.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":762,"lock":null}
20:13:22.199 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/811
20:13:22.199 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":811,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather. Frost gone. Wind WNW. Walked up to the Point with H Harry, H Nicholson &amp; J Elder &amp; dined with Mr Sadler. In the evening went up to Newcastle to see Duncan. Had an oyster supper afterwards &amp; got home at about 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":763,"lock":null}
20:13:22.199 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
