20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":813,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; rather damp after a frosty night. Wind W by S. Dined at home. At the billiard table in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":765,"lock":null}
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/814
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":814,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; fresh weather. Wind about north, been blowing hard all night, sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS. Took a walk with a party to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":766,"lock":null}
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/814
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":814,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; fresh weather. Wind about north, been blowing hard all night, sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS. Took a walk with a party to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":766,"lock":null}
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/815
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":815,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The country covered with snow Which has been very heavy during the night. Wind north. Dined at home. H Harry, Nicholson, H French &amp; I drank wine together at the George &amp; afterwards went to the theatre to see West of the 80<sup>th</sup> regiment perform Fredrick in Lover's Vows. He got on tolerably well for a first attempt.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":767,"lock":null}
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.200 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/815
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":815,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The country covered with snow Which has been very heavy during the night. Wind north. Dined at home. H Harry, Nicholson, H French &amp; I drank wine together at the George &amp; afterwards went to the theatre to see West of the 80<sup>th</sup> regiment perform Fredrick in Lover's Vows. He got on tolerably well for a first attempt.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":767,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/816
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":816,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Thawing after a slight frost during the night. Very sloppy &amp; unpleasant. Walked to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Craigs</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":768,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/816
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":816,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Thawing after a slight frost during the night. Very sloppy &amp; unpleasant. Walked to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Craigs</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":768,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/817
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":817,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has been a hard frost &amp; blowing a gale at north all night &amp; still continues with a very high sea. Went to church in the morning. Dined at 2 o'clock with H Harry. Mr Sadler there. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":769,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/817
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":817,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has been a hard frost &amp; blowing a gale at north all night &amp; still continues with a very high sea. Went to church in the morning. Dined at 2 o'clock with H Harry. Mr Sadler there. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":769,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/818
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":818,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been a slight frost in the night with a little snow. Wind NNW. Mrs Dixon brought Emma home. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":770,"lock":null}
20:13:22.201 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/818
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":818,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been a slight frost in the night with a little snow. Wind NNW. Mrs Dixon brought Emma home. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":770,"lock":null}
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/819
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":819,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Last night very stormy. A gale from the NE with heavy showers of sleet &amp; hail.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter in the name of the Bank, but evidently written by that little puppy F Chapman without consulting his partners, desiring me to pay the balance of my account with them of some &pound;106. Called &amp; saw Spence who seemed ignorant of such a letter having been written. Told him what I thought of such conduct. I having ample security in their hands.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the Duke of York with Mr Hewson, Nicholson, Cunningham &amp; Wheatley. Received of newsroom &pound;3.10/- for WBD</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":771,"lock":null}
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/819
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":819,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Last night very stormy. A gale from the NE with heavy showers of sleet &amp; hail.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter in the name of the Bank, but evidently written by that little puppy F Chapman without consulting his partners, desiring me to pay the balance of my account with them of some &pound;106. Called &amp; saw Spence who seemed ignorant of such a letter having been written. Told him what I thought of such conduct. I having ample security in their hands.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the Duke of York with Mr Hewson, Nicholson, Cunningham &amp; Wheatley. Received of newsroom &pound;3.10/- for WBD</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":771,"lock":null}
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/82
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":82,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SSW. The surveyors of the British &amp; Hope clubs on board They thought we ought to get a new mainstay sail &amp; that we ought also to have a new towline. Bound two boys E Read for 6 years at &pound;45 &amp; G Floss for 3 years at 30. Dined on board &amp; went to a party at W C Wrights in the evening. Paid Gibson butchers &pound;8.7/ &amp; Hall &pound;3.13/- &amp; self cash &pound;5</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":79,"lock":null}
20:13:22.202 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/82
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":82,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SSW. The surveyors of the British &amp; Hope clubs on board They thought we ought to get a new mainstay sail &amp; that we ought also to have a new towline. Bound two boys E Read for 6 years at &pound;45 &amp; G Floss for 3 years at 30. Dined on board &amp; went to a party at W C Wrights in the evening. Paid Gibson butchers &pound;8.7/ &amp; Hall &pound;3.13/- &amp; self cash &pound;5</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":79,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/820
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":820,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine dry winters morning. Rather frosty &amp; blowing fresh at NE. Dined at home. H Harry, Mr Hewson, Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York. A stormy night, a hurricane with snow.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":772,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/820
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":820,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine dry winters morning. Rather frosty &amp; blowing fresh at NE. Dined at home. H Harry, Mr Hewson, Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York. A stormy night, a hurricane with snow.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":772,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/821
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/821
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/822
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
20:13:22.203 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/822
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/823
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/823
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/824
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
20:13:22.204 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
