20:13:22.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":825,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. The frost continued very keen throughout the day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Things very dull. Could get nothing for the Hope. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. In the evening Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":777,"lock":null}
20:13:22.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/826
20:13:22.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":826,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; very intense frost. Been a little snow in the night. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tynemouth with Captain Webb. Dined at home. At the Commercial with Brown &amp; Newton</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":778,"lock":null}
20:13:22.205 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/826
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":826,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; very intense frost. Been a little snow in the night. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tynemouth with Captain Webb. Dined at home. At the Commercial with Brown &amp; Newton</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":778,"lock":null}
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/827
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":827,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very severe frost. Wind fresh at ESE. A large fleet of light ships coming in. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy snow storm, turned in the evening to a thaw with sleet &amp; rain very wet &amp; sloppy. Spent the evening at J Tinley's. A ship got upon the Heard Sand at night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":779,"lock":null}
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/827
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":827,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very severe frost. Wind fresh at ESE. A large fleet of light ships coming in. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy snow storm, turned in the evening to a thaw with sleet &amp; rain very wet &amp; sloppy. Spent the evening at J Tinley's. A ship got upon the Heard Sand at night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":779,"lock":null}
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/828
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
20:13:22.206 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/828
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/829
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":829,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fresh weather &amp; been blowing very hard all night from the SE. One ship has got upon the Heard Sand, another upon the rocks &amp; two riding off the Bar. One having cut away her masts &amp; the other with main mast gone. Both these ships &amp; the one on the Heard Sand got into the harbour. Walked to Tynemouth with Nicholson &amp; Cunningham. Dined at home. In the evening H harry, Nicholson &amp; I went to the Duke of York where we found Mr Heweson</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":781,"lock":null}
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/829
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":829,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fresh weather &amp; been blowing very hard all night from the SE. One ship has got upon the Heard Sand, another upon the rocks &amp; two riding off the Bar. One having cut away her masts &amp; the other with main mast gone. Both these ships &amp; the one on the Heard Sand got into the harbour. Walked to Tynemouth with Nicholson &amp; Cunningham. Dined at home. In the evening H harry, Nicholson &amp; I went to the Duke of York where we found Mr Heweson</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":781,"lock":null}
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/83
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":83,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but blowing very fresh from WNW. Dined at J Tenleys</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":80,"lock":null}
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
