20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/830
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":830,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Still blowing fresh from S by E. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening at Drury's</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":782,"lock":null}
20:13:22.207 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/830
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":830,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Still blowing fresh from S by E. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening at Drury's</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":782,"lock":null}
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/831
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":831,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant raw damp morning. Wind SSE</p>\r\n<p>A serious accident has befallen Mrs Scott. This morning having fallen off the bed &amp; broken her thigh. It is only a simple fracture &amp; having got it set immediately, she is suffering as little pain as could possibly be expected. Wrote to Mrs Dixon to come down immediately. Sent a messenger off to Togston. Dined at J Tinleys. Met Mr Mark there. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":783,"lock":null}
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/831
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":831,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant raw damp morning. Wind SSE</p>\r\n<p>A serious accident has befallen Mrs Scott. This morning having fallen off the bed &amp; broken her thigh. It is only a simple fracture &amp; having got it set immediately, she is suffering as little pain as could possibly be expected. Wrote to Mrs Dixon to come down immediately. Sent a messenger off to Togston. Dined at J Tinleys. Met Mr Mark there. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":783,"lock":null}
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/832
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":832,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; the rocks to see the wreck. Mrs Smith &amp; Fanny arrived in the afternoon. Dined at 4 o'clock. Mrs Scott not so well this evening. Called at Messes Marsh &amp; saw Emma, she having had a cold.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":784,"lock":null}
20:13:22.208 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/832
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":832,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; the rocks to see the wreck. Mrs Smith &amp; Fanny arrived in the afternoon. Dined at 4 o'clock. Mrs Scott not so well this evening. Called at Messes Marsh &amp; saw Emma, she having had a cold.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":784,"lock":null}
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/833
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":833,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind about west. Mrs Scott has had a bad night &amp; is very sick and ill. Walked with D Dixon round by the rocks to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards to Benton by the river &amp; Wellington. Dined there &amp; staid all night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":785,"lock":null}
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/833
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":833,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind about west. Mrs Scott has had a bad night &amp; is very sick and ill. Walked with D Dixon round by the rocks to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards to Benton by the river &amp; Wellington. Dined there &amp; staid all night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":785,"lock":null}
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/834
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":834,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. Left Benton after breakfast &amp;  walked down to Shields. Mrs Scott considered a little better. Dined at home at 3 o'clock. Spent the evening at the billiard room</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":786,"lock":null}
20:13:22.209 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/834
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":834,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. Left Benton after breakfast &amp;  walked down to Shields. Mrs Scott considered a little better. Dined at home at 3 o'clock. Spent the evening at the billiard room</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":786,"lock":null}
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/835
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":835,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning &amp; a sharp frost. Wind NW. On board the new ship &quot;William Green&quot; built by Mr Smith at St Peters of 600 tons as from a vessel as fine a vessel as was ever built, to sail this evening. Walked to Tynemouth. Mrs Dixon down to see Mrs Scott. Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the whist club.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":787,"lock":null}
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/835
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":835,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning &amp; a sharp frost. Wind NW. On board the new ship &quot;William Green&quot; built by Mr Smith at St Peters of 600 tons as from a vessel as fine a vessel as was ever built, to sail this evening. Walked to Tynemouth. Mrs Dixon down to see Mrs Scott. Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the whist club.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":787,"lock":null}
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/836
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":836,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning &amp; a very intense frost. Wind about west. Walked with H Nicholson to the Ridges at High Cherton. Had a little scaling, soon tired. Walked round by Tynemouth. Returned to dinner at 3 o'clock. In the evening walked again to Tynemouth &amp; took wine, played a rubber &amp; suppered with Mr Brown &amp; a party at the Star &amp; Garter. Not my favourite. Got home at 1 o'clock. Frost again &amp; a very wet night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":788,"lock":null}
20:13:22.210 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/836
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":836,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning &amp; a very intense frost. Wind about west. Walked with H Nicholson to the Ridges at High Cherton. Had a little scaling, soon tired. Walked round by Tynemouth. Returned to dinner at 3 o'clock. In the evening walked again to Tynemouth &amp; took wine, played a rubber &amp; suppered with Mr Brown &amp; a party at the Star &amp; Garter. Not my favourite. Got home at 1 o'clock. Frost again &amp; a very wet night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":788,"lock":null}
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/837
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":837,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind NE. Went to the newsroom, read the papers. Dined at home at 9 o'clock. Spent the afternoon at the billiard room. Wind suddenly changed to SE. Blowing fresh. Attended the whist club at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":789,"lock":null}
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/837
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":837,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind NE. Went to the newsroom, read the papers. Dined at home at 9 o'clock. Spent the afternoon at the billiard room. Wind suddenly changed to SE. Blowing fresh. Attended the whist club at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":789,"lock":null}
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/838
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":838,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winter's morning. Frosty with snow. Wind SW. Prevented attending church in the morning. The Smiths coming down so late to breakfast. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley&amp; C Milner. Attended afternoon service &amp; afterwards dined at the castle with west of the 80<sup>th</sup>. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":790,"lock":null}
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.211 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/838
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":838,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winter's morning. Frosty with snow. Wind SW. Prevented attending church in the morning. The Smiths coming down so late to breakfast. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley&amp; C Milner. Attended afternoon service &amp; afterwards dined at the castle with west of the 80<sup>th</sup>. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":790,"lock":null}
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/839
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":839,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold winters day, Wind fresh at about East with Showers of snow. Attended the sale Of the Glattons stores upon the Low Lights Quay. Brought a Capstan for &pound;3.1. and 23 faths of 1 3/16 mock chain quite new at 17/6 a cwt. Played a few pools at billiards W Peast   H Nickolson and all at the Duke of York in the evening.</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":791,"lock":null}
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/839
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":839,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold winters day, Wind fresh at about East with Showers of snow. Attended the sale Of the Glattons stores upon the Low Lights Quay. Brought a Capstan for &pound;3.1. and 23 faths of 1 3/16 mock chain quite new at 17/6 a cwt. Played a few pools at billiards W Peast   H Nickolson and all at the Duke of York in the evening.</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":791,"lock":null}
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/84
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":84,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2840-image-map-whitley-park.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n  <figcaption>Whitley Park</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
