20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":84,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2840-image-map-whitley-park.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n  <figcaption>Whitley Park</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/840
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":840,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of winter weather, very cold. Been blowing a gale all night with snow showers A heavy sea upon the bar. Wind E.S.E Dined at home. At 3 o'clock at the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening called and sat an hour or two with Mark, he having had a severe loin attack</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":792,"lock":null}
20:13:22.212 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/840
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":840,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of winter weather, very cold. Been blowing a gale all night with snow showers A heavy sea upon the bar. Wind E.S.E Dined at home. At 3 o'clock at the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening called and sat an hour or two with Mark, he having had a severe loin attack</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":792,"lock":null}
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/841
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":841,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still very cold and frosty and A good deal of snow on the ground Wind about East blowing fresh. Received from Robert and paid into Chapmans &pound;86 rents. Gave Mrs Scott a draft for her quarter annuity &pound;75. Mrs Dixon down I returned with her in the carriage to Barton. Dined &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":793,"lock":null}
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/841
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":841,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still very cold and frosty and A good deal of snow on the ground Wind about East blowing fresh. Received from Robert and paid into Chapmans &pound;86 rents. Gave Mrs Scott a draft for her quarter annuity &pound;75. Mrs Dixon down I returned with her in the carriage to Barton. Dined &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":793,"lock":null}
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/842
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":842,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning (wind NW), Frosty with a show of showers. After Breakfast Dixon &amp; I had the beagles out &amp; started above base which We left them running &amp; walked Into Newcastle &amp; not being able to get anything for the Hope, I got into a gig &amp; came down to Shields Dined with the whist club at the Commercial, spent a pleasant day In the evening at the Card club and Afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":794,"lock":null}
20:13:22.213 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
