20:13:22.214 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":842,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning (wind NW), Frosty with a show of showers. After Breakfast Dixon &amp; I had the beagles out &amp; started above base which We left them running &amp; walked Into Newcastle &amp; not being able to get anything for the Hope, I got into a gig &amp; came down to Shields Dined with the whist club at the Commercial, spent a pleasant day In the evening at the Card club and Afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":794,"lock":null}
20:13:22.214 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/843
20:13:22.214 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":843,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuum of Winter weather with snow showers Wind East S E blowing fresh. Stayed at home at 2 o'clock at the billiard room after dinner. After tea walked upto Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening with Capt French at the Castle. Played a few rubbers at whist &amp; lost</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":795,"lock":null}
