20:13:22.214 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":844,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S.W. &amp; keen frost. Walked to Cullercoats Dined at home. In the evening the whist Club. Tea at Mr N Finwicks<u> </u></p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":796,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/845
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/845
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/846
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":846,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The thaw continues &amp; the  snow has disappeared. Blowing a gale of wind at WNW. Went by Dunn's coach to Newcastle Fixed the Hope for the Bursaton Walls to be loaded on Monday. Gave Stephenson orders to lay her the shore line. Dined at home at 3 then took wine with I Craig &amp; afterwards spent the evening At Tynemouth Castle with Captain French of The 80<sup>th</sup>. A large Hulk sailed today. Ann Maxwell delivered of a fine boy</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":798,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/846
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":846,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The thaw continues &amp; the  snow has disappeared. Blowing a gale of wind at WNW. Went by Dunn's coach to Newcastle Fixed the Hope for the Bursaton Walls to be loaded on Monday. Gave Stephenson orders to lay her the shore line. Dined at home at 3 then took wine with I Craig &amp; afterwards spent the evening At Tynemouth Castle with Captain French of The 80<sup>th</sup>. A large Hulk sailed today. Ann Maxwell delivered of a fine boy</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":798,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/847
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":847,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning and Mild weather.  Wind SW. A great deal Of ice in the river. Walked up to the Ship. &amp; dine at the annual dinner of the Great Premium Club. Reduced my insurance in at to &pound;500 &amp; paid &pound;500 into the eligibles. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":799,"lock":null}
20:13:22.215 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.216 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/847
20:13:22.216 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":847,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning and Mild weather.  Wind SW. A great deal Of ice in the river. Walked up to the Ship. &amp; dine at the annual dinner of the Great Premium Club. Reduced my insurance in at to &pound;500 &amp; paid &pound;500 into the eligibles. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":799,"lock":null}
20:13:22.216 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/848
20:13:22.216 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":848,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day and frosty The Hope upon the shore to see Ivo Karl. The people busy rigging. Dinner at home. Spent the evening At J Teschays. My birthday</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":800,"lock":null}
20:13:22.216 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
