20:13:22.218 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":852,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. Wind SW. Went to church Mr Mark &amp;  the vicar dest the duty. Dined at home at 1 o'Clock. H Harry, H French Nicholson &amp; I walked to Tynemouth round the castle &amp; took wine at the Star &amp; Garter In the evening at the <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>st</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rum</span></p>","pageId":798,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":804,"lock":null}
