20:13:22.222 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":860,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of severe frost. &amp; NW wind. Payed 5/- for the Hope's foy boat. Having a cold &amp; Pain in my side, took physician &amp; remained in the house. Dined at home At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":812,"lock":null}
20:13:22.222 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/861
20:13:22.222 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":861,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull weather morning Having been a great deal of snow during the night but now a thaw Wind SE. Several light vessels off the harbour. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":813,"lock":null}
20:13:22.222 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
