20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":861,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull weather morning Having been a great deal of snow during the night but now a thaw Wind SE. Several light vessels off the harbour. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":813,"lock":null}
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/862
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":862,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by N Went to South Shields &amp; saw Salmon who was not persuaded to give in the money, but promised to send it over tomorrow. Dined at home. In the afternoon at the billiard room &amp; spent the evening at home</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":814,"lock":null}
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
