20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":862,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by N Went to South Shields &amp; saw Salmon who was not persuaded to give in the money, but promised to send it over tomorrow. Dined at home. In the afternoon at the billiard room &amp; spent the evening at home</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":814,"lock":null}
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/863
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":863,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by S.  Received a note from T Young demanding the return upon the note. Called upon him, not at home. Dined at home. In the evening at the Whist Club. Received a letter from Salmon enclosing a draft for &pound;88.9.3 Dated 11<sup>th</sup> March for Mrs Ghireson's Estate</p>","pageId":801,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":815,"lock":null}
20:13:22.223 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
