20:13:22.224 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":863,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by S.  Received a note from T Young demanding the return upon the note. Called upon him, not at home. Dined at home. In the evening at the Whist Club. Received a letter from Salmon enclosing a draft for &pound;88.9.3 Dated 11<sup>th</sup> March for Mrs Ghireson's Estate</p>","pageId":801,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":815,"lock":null}
20:13:22.224 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/864
20:13:22.224 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":864,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spicy morning. Very mild wind NSW. Saw I Young &amp; told him I could not pay him this just at present. Walked out to Billy Hill to see the Hassiers, no sport. Dined at home. At the billiard room In the afternoon.  Suppered with H Harry</p>","pageId":801,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":816,"lock":null}
20:13:22.224 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
