20:13:22.225 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":867,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning Wind SSW. Took physic &amp; stayed in the house all the morning. Mrs Dixon &amp; Tom Smith down to see Mrs Scott On board the Brodnick with R Peach &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":819,"lock":null}
20:13:22.225 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/868
20:13:22.225 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":868,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful spring day, quite warm weather. Went up to Newcastle by stream. The Courts so crowded could not get in. Dined &amp; stayed all night with D Dixon Tom Smith &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Hnoises</span> there</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":820,"lock":null}
