20:13:22.226 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":87,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cold &amp; frosty. Walked to Newcastle everything very dull, little or nothing doing. Returned in the steam boat. Dined at home. Wind NNW</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":83,"lock":null}
