20:13:22.238 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":894,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, quite seasonal weather. Wind NW Took a long walk with Mrs Marg Carf &amp; Emma G (round Cullercoats &amp; Tynmouth) Dined at home. Attended the whist club. In the evening at Dr Drawings. Paid I Elden &pound;1.10. on <span class=highlight_yellow>averafer</span></p>","pageId":808,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":846,"lock":null}
