20:13:22.238 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/895
20:13:22.238 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":895,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most extraordinary weather uncommonly fine &amp; warm. Wind West. Went to church in the morning Dined at &frac12; push 1 o'clock walked to Tynemouth with A Nicholson &amp; W French &amp; the same party in the evening has <span class=highlight_yellow>castins</span> &amp; ale at the Duke or York</p>","pageId":808,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":847,"lock":null}
