20:13:22.241 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":9,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Returned to Shields from Newcastle by steam. A miserable wet cold &amp; boisterous day. Wind SE. Dined with J Tenley. By my own invitation, to inform him what passed with Dixon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":6,"lock":null}
