20:13:22.243 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/903
20:13:22.243 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":903,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another frosty morning blowing fresh at NW Dined at home</p>","pageId":809,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":855,"lock":null}
20:13:22.243 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
