20:13:22.243 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":904,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; blowing fresh from the WNW. Saw Brown about his continuancy in the George. He is to give us an address by Thursday Took the steam boat &amp; went to Newcastle Could not get anything for the Hope Lunched with A Weyhtos &amp; at 3 o'clock called in Westgate Street. I found Mrs Dixon just arrived from Brenbuch &amp; Joys Cow Dined &amp; stayed all night with them</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":856,"lock":null}
20:13:22.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/905
20:13:22.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":905,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather. Wind SW. WBS came up to Newcastle. We lunched in Westgate Street &amp; afterward returned to Shields by steam. Dined at home. In the evening A Harry &amp; I at the Duke</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":857,"lock":null}
20:13:22.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
