20:13:22.244 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":907,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning after a great deal of rain. Wind SE. Walked with A Henry to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Took another walk in the afternoon with A Harry down by Dr Drury's garden. In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":859,"lock":null}
