20:13:22.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/908
20:13:22.245 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":908,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning. Wind WNW Walk with J Tinley to Newcastle. WBS &amp; Mary Carf went up in Dunn's coach Torrents of rain the whole day after our arrival. Dined &amp; stayed all night at A Dixon</p>","pageId":811,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":860,"lock":null}
