20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/92
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":92,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A sloop laden with grain got upon the rocks, crew saved by the life boat. A great many light ships arrived. Dined at home</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":88,"lock":null}
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
