20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":92,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A sloop laden with grain got upon the rocks, crew saved by the life boat. A great many light ships arrived. Dined at home</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":88,"lock":null}
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/920
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":920,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning &amp; continued raining all day. Wind SW. Dined with R Pearch on board the Brondenick &amp; spent a pleasant day</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":872,"lock":null}
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/920
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":920,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning &amp; continued raining all day. Wind SW. Dined with R Pearch on board the Brondenick &amp; spent a pleasant day</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":872,"lock":null}
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/921
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":921,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from WBS of his arrival in London &amp; also one from I Smith to say he will dine &amp; stay all night with me on the 1<sup>st</sup> May. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Saw Mr &amp; Mrs Ildegton, he very lame with the gout. Spent the evening at Allens, got home at &frac12; past 2 o'clock</p>\r\n<p>x</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":873,"lock":null}
20:13:22.251 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/921
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":921,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from WBS of his arrival in London &amp; also one from I Smith to say he will dine &amp; stay all night with me on the 1<sup>st</sup> May. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Saw Mr &amp; Mrs Ildegton, he very lame with the gout. Spent the evening at Allens, got home at &frac12; past 2 o'clock</p>\r\n<p>x</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":873,"lock":null}
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/922
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":922,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Received a note from In Carr of Walkers, that he could not see me to dinner today a fixed upon &amp; immediately me for next Tuesday. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Bulman cargo club &pound;1.12. Entrance on policy 1830. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":874,"lock":null}
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/922
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":922,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Received a note from In Carr of Walkers, that he could not see me to dinner today a fixed upon &amp; immediately me for next Tuesday. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Bulman cargo club &pound;1.12. Entrance on policy 1830. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":874,"lock":null}
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/923
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":923,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning with rain. Wind SE. Walked with Captain Webb to Tynmouth &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton at the Star &amp; Garter. Dined at house &amp; attended the whist club in the evening at the A Fenwicks. Rained very heavy  all the afternoon with the wind changed to N by W</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":875,"lock":null}
20:13:22.252 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/923
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":923,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning with rain. Wind SE. Walked with Captain Webb to Tynmouth &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton at the Star &amp; Garter. Dined at house &amp; attended the whist club in the evening at the A Fenwicks. Rained very heavy  all the afternoon with the wind changed to N by W</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":875,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/924
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":924,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again &amp; glafs risen considerably since yesterday evening about 1 &frac12;  inch &amp; up to fair. Wind NNW. Attended morning wives. Dined with I Tealeg, Mrs Cumliff &amp; keifs of the These. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon; At the S <span class=highlight_yellow>Cellegator</span> off several ships went to sea, bound foreign, the Broderweck, 3 Brothers, Dalsymple, Hannah, Equity les. Spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Tealegs</span> A heavy rain at night.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":876,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/924
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":924,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again &amp; glafs risen considerably since yesterday evening about 1 &frac12;  inch &amp; up to fair. Wind NNW. Attended morning wives. Dined with I Tealeg, Mrs Cumliff &amp; keifs of the These. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon; At the S <span class=highlight_yellow>Cellegator</span> off several ships went to sea, bound foreign, the Broderweck, 3 Brothers, Dalsymple, Hannah, Equity les. Spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Tealegs</span> A heavy rain at night.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":876,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/925
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":925,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Teymouth; called at Libb's where I met Mrs Ildeston, he returned to Shields with <span class=highlight_yellow>bum</span>. Invited by him to go &amp; stay at <span class=highlight_yellow>Lnasoington</span> with Captain Webb. Dined at home. Jebbs &amp; Webb took wine with over at the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":877,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/925
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":925,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Teymouth; called at Libb's where I met Mrs Ildeston, he returned to Shields with <span class=highlight_yellow>bum</span>. Invited by him to go &amp; stay at <span class=highlight_yellow>Lnasoington</span> with Captain Webb. Dined at home. Jebbs &amp; Webb took wine with over at the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":877,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/926
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":926,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW.  Walked up to Sadlers at Lokiltsy Point and took lunch &amp; he &amp; I afterwards got onboard a steam boat &amp; went up to Walker where we dined with I Carr &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Returned to Shields in evening in a gig. Wind changed to SE</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":878,"lock":null}
20:13:22.253 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/926
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":926,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW.  Walked up to Sadlers at Lokiltsy Point and took lunch &amp; he &amp; I afterwards got onboard a steam boat &amp; went up to Walker where we dined with I Carr &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Returned to Shields in evening in a gig. Wind changed to SE</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":878,"lock":null}
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/927
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":927,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SE. Attended <span class=highlight_yellow>Kiefs</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>onttes</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>sah</span>. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Anus</span> with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascoerson</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>onffstong</span>. Took tea with the latter &amp; had a walk in the evening with</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":879,"lock":null}
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/927
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":927,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SE. Attended <span class=highlight_yellow>Kiefs</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>onttes</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>sah</span>. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Anus</span> with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascoerson</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>onffstong</span>. Took tea with the latter &amp; had a walk in the evening with</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":879,"lock":null}
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/928
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":928,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Took a walk to Tynemouth with <span class=highlight_yellow>Lt H</span><span class=highlight_yellow>arry</span>. Dined at home. Onboard the John Dunn in the evening with I <span class=highlight_yellow>Wesglot</span> &amp; afterwards at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":880,"lock":null}
20:13:22.254 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/928
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":928,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Took a walk to Tynemouth with <span class=highlight_yellow>Lt H</span><span class=highlight_yellow>arry</span>. Dined at home. Onboard the John Dunn in the evening with I <span class=highlight_yellow>Wesglot</span> &amp; afterwards at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":880,"lock":null}
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/929
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":929,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Went by Steamer to Newcastle could get nothing for the Hope. Dined with D Dixon, a party Tom Smith, Mr Busqter; they all went to the theater to see Liston, I looked in but did not remain long, the house very full for his benefit. Got into a gig &amp; returned to Shields</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":881,"lock":null}
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/929
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":929,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Went by Steamer to Newcastle could get nothing for the Hope. Dined with D Dixon, a party Tom Smith, Mr Busqter; they all went to the theater to see Liston, I looked in but did not remain long, the house very full for his benefit. Got into a gig &amp; returned to Shields</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":881,"lock":null}
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/93
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":93,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day but rather cool. Wind NNE. Dined at home. Engaged to an evening party ay Mrs Heddells but sent an apology in consequence of Mrs Deghton's death</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":89,"lock":null}
20:13:22.255 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/93
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":93,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day but rather cool. Wind NNE. Dined at home. Engaged to an evening party ay Mrs Heddells but sent an apology in consequence of Mrs Deghton's death</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":89,"lock":null}
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/930
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":930,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning much like rain. Wind WSW Turned out a most beautiful day. Went with H Harry by steam to Newcastle. Could not fix the Hope, but almost determined to talk 11 Gr Kent to Dublin. Returned home to dinner. Tour Seventh A Harry &amp; Emma G: dined with me. Mark came in to wine. In the evening we went to whist club at Allens</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":882,"lock":null}
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/930
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":930,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning much like rain. Wind WSW Turned out a most beautiful day. Went with H Harry by steam to Newcastle. Could not fix the Hope, but almost determined to talk 11 Gr Kent to Dublin. Returned home to dinner. Tour Seventh A Harry &amp; Emma G: dined with me. Mark came in to wine. In the evening we went to whist club at Allens</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":882,"lock":null}
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/931
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":931,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind West. Tom Smith &amp; I went to Church. Afterwards called at Mrs Marr's who would not let Emma go up to Newcastle to see Bell Smith. The King by Lodges paper a little better back still in a very precarious start. Dined at home. Pscous to which I Smith left. Walk to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; took wine &amp; tea with Libbs</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":883,"lock":null}
20:13:22.256 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/931
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":931,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind West. Tom Smith &amp; I went to Church. Afterwards called at Mrs Marr's who would not let Emma go up to Newcastle to see Bell Smith. The King by Lodges paper a little better back still in a very precarious start. Dined at home. Pscous to which I Smith left. Walk to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; took wine &amp; tea with Libbs</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":883,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/932
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":932,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind about West. By Steam to Newcastle but did not find the Hope to load coal for Dublin as intended as they could not load her before they did of much works. Returned to Dinner on board the Choice in the afternoon. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":884,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/932
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":932,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind about West. By Steam to Newcastle but did not find the Hope to load coal for Dublin as intended as they could not load her before they did of much works. Returned to Dinner on board the Choice in the afternoon. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":884,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/933
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":933,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather with a West wind. Turned out at 6 o'clock &amp; took a long walk round by Cullercoat Sands &amp; before breakfast. And afterwards Webb, Mark &amp; I took a walk along the hard sand where I made a sketch of Tynmouth Castle be. Returned home to dinner. In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":885,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/933
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":933,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather with a West wind. Turned out at 6 o'clock &amp; took a long walk round by Cullercoat Sands &amp; before breakfast. And afterwards Webb, Mark &amp; I took a walk along the hard sand where I made a sketch of Tynmouth Castle be. Returned home to dinner. In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":885,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/934
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":934,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Glorious weather. Wind very variable between SE &amp; W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Gave up the Dublin charter &amp; returned home to dinner. A Harry took a bottle of port with us &amp; I gave him an order to fix the Hope for anchorage &amp; Hull dealers at &pound;4.7.6 At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":886,"lock":null}
20:13:22.257 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/934
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":934,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Glorious weather. Wind very variable between SE &amp; W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Gave up the Dublin charter &amp; returned home to dinner. A Harry took a bottle of port with us &amp; I gave him an order to fix the Hope for anchorage &amp; Hull dealers at &pound;4.7.6 At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":886,"lock":null}
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/935
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":935,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind East &amp; SE. Walked beyond Marsden Rocks with Webb, Gosling RNW To see <span class=highlight_yellow>exfrenements</span> laid for saving shipwrecked men, my means of a rope ladder &amp; air jacket. Returned home to dinner. Webb &amp; Gosling dinned with us. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening at Webb </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":887,"lock":null}
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/935
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":935,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind East &amp; SE. Walked beyond Marsden Rocks with Webb, Gosling RNW To see <span class=highlight_yellow>exfrenements</span> laid for saving shipwrecked men, my means of a rope ladder &amp; air jacket. Returned home to dinner. Webb &amp; Gosling dinned with us. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening at Webb </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":887,"lock":null}
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/936
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
20:13:22.258 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/936
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/937
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/937
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/938
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":938,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind East blowing fresh &amp; heavy sea. Lower ladder off its put back left Shields </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":890,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/938
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":938,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind East blowing fresh &amp; heavy sea. Lower ladder off its put back left Shields </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":890,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/939
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":939,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>at &frac12; past 8 o'clock. Got the Alnwick coach at Newcastle at 10 o'clock and reached Alnwick at 3. Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderstow there in the carriage &amp; took me out to Leamington to dinner</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":891,"lock":null}
20:13:22.259 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/939
20:13:22.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":939,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>at &frac12; past 8 o'clock. Got the Alnwick coach at Newcastle at 10 o'clock and reached Alnwick at 3. Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderstow there in the carriage &amp; took me out to Leamington to dinner</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":891,"lock":null}
20:13:22.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/94
20:13:22.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":94,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning with showers of rain &amp; sleet. Wind E by N. Dined at home. In the afternoon attended Mrs Deighton's funeral at Tynemouth</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":90,"lock":null}
20:13:22.260 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/94
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":94,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning with showers of rain &amp; sleet. Wind E by N. Dined at home. In the afternoon attended Mrs Deighton's funeral at Tynemouth</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":90,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/940
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":940,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing fresh from the NE &amp; cold. Robert &amp; Tom I Ldestow &amp; I started after breakfast to fish in the Alm, but had bad sport &amp; river busy sheet &amp; cold weather</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":892,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/940
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":940,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing fresh from the NE &amp; cold. Robert &amp; Tom I Ldestow &amp; I started after breakfast to fish in the Alm, but had bad sport &amp; river busy sheet &amp; cold weather</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":892,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/941
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":941,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fairer and warmer weather. Robert Ilderstow &amp; I had an early breakfast &amp; rode over the river till below Hedghey, where we fished until it began to rain when we took shelter at a mill &amp; then walked up to Rosea an estate of the Ildestonn's.  Had tea &amp; eggs &amp; rode home in the evening, when we found Mrs Crosby &amp; Mrs Strothard had arrived from Newcastle on a visit. Had better sport today, brought home a few good trout</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":893,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/941
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":941,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fairer and warmer weather. Robert Ilderstow &amp; I had an early breakfast &amp; rode over the river till below Hedghey, where we fished until it began to rain when we took shelter at a mill &amp; then walked up to Rosea an estate of the Ildestonn's.  Had tea &amp; eggs &amp; rode home in the evening, when we found Mrs Crosby &amp; Mrs Strothard had arrived from Newcastle on a visit. Had better sport today, brought home a few good trout</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":893,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/942
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":942,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again. Wind about SW. After breakfast we went to fish in the Ala Had fair sport &amp; got home to dinner. Spent a quiet evening</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":894,"lock":null}
20:13:22.261 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/942
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":942,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again. Wind about SW. After breakfast we went to fish in the Ala Had fair sport &amp; got home to dinner. Spent a quiet evening</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":894,"lock":null}
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/943
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":943,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind much the same. Again went &amp; fished in the Alm. Not such good sport. Returned to dinner found Mrs Forston of Alnwick there, who fed  with us. Got a letter from WBS.</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":895,"lock":null}
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/943
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":943,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind much the same. Again went &amp; fished in the Alm. Not such good sport. Returned to dinner found Mrs Forston of Alnwick there, who fed  with us. Got a letter from WBS.</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":895,"lock":null}
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/944
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":944,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up in the morning at 5 o'clock &amp; after having some bread &amp; milk, started on horseback to fish in Breamish, starting from the Powburn &amp; leaving off at Ingram, caught a dog trout but very small. Got home to dinner before 5 o'clock very tired</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":896,"lock":null}
20:13:22.262 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/944
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":944,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up in the morning at 5 o'clock &amp; after having some bread &amp; milk, started on horseback to fish in Breamish, starting from the Powburn &amp; leaving off at Ingram, caught a dog trout but very small. Got home to dinner before 5 o'clock very tired</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":896,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/945
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":945,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind somewhere from the W. After breakfast, accompanied Jane of the family in the carriage to Bottom Church. Mr Manestry did the service. Mrs I Winton not well. Dined at home. Wrote to A Harry to ask if he had fixed the Hope</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":897,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/945
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":945,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind somewhere from the W. After breakfast, accompanied Jane of the family in the carriage to Bottom Church. Mr Manestry did the service. Mrs I Winton not well. Dined at home. Wrote to A Harry to ask if he had fixed the Hope</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":897,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/946
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":946,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind from the S &amp; W. Engaged all the morning fishing in the Aln &amp; had good sport. Returned home to dinner</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":898,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/946
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":946,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind from the S &amp; W. Engaged all the morning fishing in the Aln &amp; had good sport. Returned home to dinner</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":898,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/947
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":947,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind the same. Robert Ilderton &amp; I rose early &amp; rode over to the Till about 8 miles off where we spent the day in fishing &amp; had most excellent sport. I tickled &frac12; day of lays trout. Returned to Lemmington to supper</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":899,"lock":null}
20:13:22.263 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
