20:13:22.264 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":948,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Amused ourselves this morning in shooting rooks. Rode over to Broom Park to call upon Mr Burrell, not at home.</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":900,"lock":null}
20:13:22.264 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/949
20:13:22.264 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":949,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day but rather cooler wind SE. Again <span class=highlight_yellow>binoculars</span> in shooting rooks. Bob Alderton &amp; I rode over to Broom Park to dinner. Met there Tom JW &amp; Mrs Dixon. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":901,"lock":null}
