20:13:22.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":95,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day but rather cool. Wind E. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at home</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":91,"lock":null}
20:13:22.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/950
20:13:22.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":950,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather cool. Wind SE. shooting rooks. In the moor. After lunch went out to fish &amp; got down at &frac12; paid 8.6- killed two dozen good trout</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":902,"lock":null}
20:13:22.265 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
