20:13:22.266 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":951,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather and warmer. The whole of the moors answered ours <span class=highlight_yellow>lpes</span> in shooting rooks, killed about 70. Young <span class=highlight_yellow>Clensed</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Fiawick</span> came from school to stop until Monday chat. Ilterton's birthday, made a jug of punch in the evening to drink his health</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":903,"lock":null}
