20:13:22.268 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/958
20:13:22.268 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":958,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but still rather cool &amp; wind about SE. Left Lemmington after having spent a very pleasant time. Rode Bob Ildercoade home onto Alnwick &amp; got them onto place, left at 1/s past 10 o'clock. The day got cloudy &amp; cold &amp; before we left Morpeth it began to rain. ...</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":910,"lock":null}
20:13:22.268 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
