20:13:22.269 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":959,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... &amp; continued showering all day. Got upon Dunns coach at 4 o'clock &amp; arrived at home a little after 5 o'clock to dinner. Received a letter from <span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ss</span>. That my friend A Harry &amp; A Nicholson the latter the first time since his parried <span class=highlight_yellow>extect</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>es</span> captain his ship the Tenacity having foundered in the North Sea &amp; he &amp; the crew taken aboard on <span class=highlight_yellow>gallcot</span> that <span class=highlight_yellow>Cuekerly</span> hove in sights before dark. Spent the evening together with Mr Com <span class=highlight_yellow>Hewesion</span> at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":911,"lock":null}
