20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":96,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <img src=\"images/img2841-image-map-commercial-hotel.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\"\r\n  <figcaption>Commercial Hotel</figcaption>\r\n</figure>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/960
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":960,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind about West. Icy cold having flown to the locns suffering some pain. Got Robert to sub the park with <span class=highlight_yellow>opadildoc</span>, took a <span class=highlight_yellow>scidlily</span> &amp; did not go to church. Wrote a long letter to ABP Emma G: came over to see us. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked up to North Sheilds to take wine</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":912,"lock":null}
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/960
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":960,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind about West. Icy cold having flown to the locns suffering some pain. Got Robert to sub the park with <span class=highlight_yellow>opadildoc</span>, took a <span class=highlight_yellow>scidlily</span> &amp; did not go to church. Wrote a long letter to ABP Emma G: came over to see us. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked up to North Sheilds to take wine</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":912,"lock":null}
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/961
20:13:22.270 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":961,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NSW Blowing hard. Sent my letter off to WBS. Gave a draft on estate then 4 on after  for &pound;50 for ABS. Crew also from &pound;10.10s + &pound;16.3.8 = 27.3.8 for av wages ...</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":913,"lock":null}
