20:13:22.274 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":969,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, cloudy &amp; appearance of rain. Wind NW Which we had during the morning, but it cleared up &amp; after dinner we had fine weather. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Drank tea at home &amp; in the evening at the Duke</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":921,"lock":null}
20:13:22.274 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/97
20:13:22.274 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":97,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but still cold &amp; wind SSE. Dined at home &amp; took wine &amp; with W C. Wright &amp; H French at the Commercial</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":92,"lock":null}
20:13:22.274 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
