20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":97,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but still cold &amp; wind SSE. Dined at home &amp; took wine &amp; with W C. Wright &amp; H French at the Commercial</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":92,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/970
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":970,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning. Wind N by W Changed to NNE. At the billiard room all the morning . Dined at home. Spent an hour or two with Mark in the afternoon &amp; the evening with Mr Simpson at the bank</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":922,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
