20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":970,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning. Wind N by W Changed to NNE. At the billiard room all the morning . Dined at home. Spent an hour or two with Mark in the afternoon &amp; the evening with Mr Simpson at the bank</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":922,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/971
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":971,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull hazy morning Came fresh at NNS. Walked to Tynemouth Dined at home. Suppered with A Harry</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":923,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/971
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":971,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull hazy morning Came fresh at NNS. Walked to Tynemouth Dined at home. Suppered with A Harry</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":923,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/972
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":972,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant morning Blowing fresh from the north with rain Which continued in torrents &amp; without ceasing the whole day &amp; a gale of wind. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":924,"lock":null}
20:13:22.275 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/972
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":972,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant morning Blowing fresh from the north with rain Which continued in torrents &amp; without ceasing the whole day &amp; a gale of wind. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":924,"lock":null}
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/973
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":973,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing a gale at about N by E It has never ceased raining since yesterday morning. Still coming down in torrents. I fear it will do great harm to the country. Turned out fair about the middle of the day, but still very cold &amp; stormy Dined at home. At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":925,"lock":null}
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/973
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":973,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing a gale at about N by E It has never ceased raining since yesterday morning. Still coming down in torrents. I fear it will do great harm to the country. Turned out fair about the middle of the day, but still very cold &amp; stormy Dined at home. At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":925,"lock":null}
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/974
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":974,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather after a great deal of rain in the night but still blowing hard at NE &amp; cold Received a letter &amp; notes from ABS. Took a walk around by Cullercoat Fields &amp; Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon at the house on my return. Dined at home &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth. Finished at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":926,"lock":null}
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/974
20:13:22.276 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":974,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather after a great deal of rain in the night but still blowing hard at NE &amp; cold Received a letter &amp; notes from ABS. Took a walk around by Cullercoat Fields &amp; Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon at the house on my return. Dined at home &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth. Finished at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":926,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/975
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":975,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another wet morning Wind West. Walked to Tynemouth after breakfast &amp; saw the soldiers parading. Returned by the fields. Dined at home. Wrote to Fanny Smith that Emma would meet his at Morpeth on Thursday next. Paid monthly money for the Hope to do which I drew on Chapmans for &pound;20. Turned out a wet evening &amp; at bed time it was a deluge</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":927,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/975
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":975,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another wet morning Wind West. Walked to Tynemouth after breakfast &amp; saw the soldiers parading. Returned by the fields. Dined at home. Wrote to Fanny Smith that Emma would meet his at Morpeth on Thursday next. Paid monthly money for the Hope to do which I drew on Chapmans for &pound;20. Turned out a wet evening &amp; at bed time it was a deluge</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":927,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/976
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":976,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still showering. Wind NW. Paid Ned's mother yesterday a quarter wages &pound;1.13.9 &amp; lent Mary Carfs &pound;2. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him the last search account. Joined a party at Roddames &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":928,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/976
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":976,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still showering. Wind NW. Paid Ned's mother yesterday a quarter wages &pound;1.13.9 &amp; lent Mary Carfs &pound;2. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him the last search account. Joined a party at Roddames &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":928,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/977
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":977,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cloudy with the appearance of showers wind NNW.  Walked  to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went to church in the afternoon. Drank tea with A Harry, again walked to Tynemouth to hear the band. A great many people there. Returned &amp; had a glass of whisky toddy with A Harry</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":929,"lock":null}
20:13:22.277 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/977
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":977,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cloudy with the appearance of showers wind NNW.  Walked  to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went to church in the afternoon. Drank tea with A Harry, again walked to Tynemouth to hear the band. A great many people there. Returned &amp; had a glass of whisky toddy with A Harry</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":929,"lock":null}
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/978
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":978,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with a cold NE wind. Went over to South Shields to see Salmon. He was not at home. Dined at home &amp; afterwards A harry Ltd French &amp; I went up to the Point &amp; took wine with Sadler</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":930,"lock":null}
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
