20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":978,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with a cold NE wind. Went over to South Shields to see Salmon. He was not at home. Dined at home &amp; afterwards A harry Ltd French &amp; I went up to the Point &amp; took wine with Sadler</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":930,"lock":null}
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/979
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":979,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning wind NE  with showers. H Harry, French &amp; I went up to Newcastle in a steam boat. Walked out to the race course. Very little company there. The running very good. Dined at the Stand &amp;  got to Shields again in a gig by the country road at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":931,"lock":null}
20:13:22.278 [main] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
